window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":5601,"title":"Chapter 5601 All Living Beings Are Chess Pieces","paragraphs":["Chapter 5601 All Living Beings Are Chess Pieces","He had great confidence in the first sword recorded in the Starry Sky Chronicles!","....","No matter how formidable Broly was, as long as this sword emerged, it would annihilate everything.","Turning this void into a portrayal of the Starry Sky.","Space and time would be compressed into a painting.","This sword was his greatest reliance!","“Are you ready?” Jian Wushuang held the sword with one hand, slowly closing his eyes, sensing the power coming from the Starry Sky.","The battle between the two was about to come to an end.","In the chaotic region far away from the Western Sea.","Moluo and others stood here, but the direction of the Western Sea was now a scorched earth, turning into a battlefield ruin.","The powerful figures of the Earth Realm Divine Temple’s headquarters had long sensed the intense aura of the battle, but no one came to watch or intervene.","Bai Yi’s avatar sat on the throne, still holding a token in his hand.","When Jian Wushuang and Broly had just started their confrontation, he received the message. Before he could go, Zhen Ling personally intercepted him.","At this moment, a subtle scene unfolded before their eyes.","Bai Yi sat on the throne, while Zhen Ling, like an aged old man, stood at the entrance of the hall, gazing into the distance.","“Lord Zhen Ling, are you really giving up on Broly?” Bai Yi still felt somewhat reluctant, and there was a hint of unwillingness in his tone.","After all, he was a formidable practitioner of the Transformation Dao, and now he had grown to this extent.","Zhen Ling didn’t respond; he merely shook his head, which, in itself, conveyed an attitude.","Evidently, Bai Yi was unaware of the true situation.","The reality of Mie Sheng, perhaps even the Four Great Temple Masters were unaware of it.","“So, it’s you who wants to destroy the Qishen Temple!” Zhen Ling muttered to himself.","Initially, he had speculated and repeatedly examined the timeline, but he couldn’t identify the person responsible.","He had initially thought it was Jian Wushuang, then doubted it, and when he took action against Hu Qing, he discovered the clues, starting with Jiang Shang.","Ultimately, it attracted Mie Sheng, and only then did he understand everything.","It wasn’t someone else intending to destroy the Qishen Temple; it was Mie Sheng himself who wanted to destroy it.","Since he had set this calamity in motion initially, why create the Qishen Temple and bring him into existence?","He, too, was just a pawn!","“You shouldn’t have trusted him!” Zhen Ling gritted his teeth, inwardly screaming.","He had limited information about Mie Sheng, but he could still discern that the opponent was far from ordinary.","Initially, he was the second strongest in the Moro Temporal River, a Half-Step Seven Tribulations realm powerhouse.","The Moro Temporal River was a moderately sized temporal river, and having a Seven Tribulations realm powerhouse appearing in numerous eras was already remarkable.","The emergence of the Qishen had led many to believe that the Moro Temporal River would expand and become a dazzling temporal river in the Starry Sky.","In the end, everything collapsed.","Behind all of this, there was likely the scheming of Mie Sheng.","Although it’s unclear what promises Mie Sheng made to Qishen in the beginning, it is evident now that Qishen had placed trust in him.","Moreover, the individuals taken away by Mie Sheng were quite delicate.","Among the three great True Monarchs that evolved from the Dao of Devouring abandoned by Qishen, two were still alive, or, from another perspective, they were all still alive.","Shan Jun, Gu Jun, and Mo Jun.","Initially, the true form of Shan Jun was disintegrated, giving rise not only to Shan Jun but also to the four Demon Lords.","Zhen Ling knew about two of them, both taken away by Mie Sheng.","And there was Jiang Shang!","The extraordinary cultivator who appeared in the Qishen Temple.","From the moment Jiang Shang appeared, he had been cautious.","She did not show up earlier or later, but chose this particular moment.","Since Jiang Shang was involved in the chessboard, Broly was very likely to be associated with Mie Sheng.","In the Four Great Secret Realms, it was impossible to produce experts at the realm of Tribulation. The practitioners in the secret realms all had their flaws, and this was an unchangeable fact.","Unless Mie Sheng intervened to modify their Origin Sources.","Jiang Shang and Broly had not been modified by him.","This was clearly a move made by Mie Sheng.","Even if Jian Wushuang didn’t take action, Mie Sheng would personally eliminate Broly.","But now that Jian Wushuang had taken action, it could reduce some unnecessary gossip.","In the past, he didn’t care about such things.","But times had changed. Mie Sheng’s appearance was both righteous and wicked.","It not only posed a threat to the current Qishen Temple but probably also to his position.","In case something unexpected happened, and he got kicked out, what would he do?","At that time, things might become difficult to explain.","Fortunately, he had foresight and established the Elder Palace, firmly holding the Inheritors in his grasp.","In the present Four Great Temples, he no longer believed in them.","Mie Sheng collaborated with Qishen back then. If Bai Yi and the others were to learn about this, rebellion might be inevitable, and they might turn to Mie Sheng.","Now, he had to wait, wait for Mie Sheng to make a move!","The fear was that after the other party left, there would be no movement, and he would be at a disadvantage.","If something unexpected happened, he could always escape.","Leading the Qishen Temple to other temporal rivers (also known as rivers of time and space).","Zhen Ling repeatedly investigated the Four Great Secret Realms and the entire interior of the Qishen Temple.","Zhen Ling was never at ease!","On the battlefield of the Western Sea, a peak showdown was about to unfold.","Jian Wushuang faced off against Broly.","Now, Jian Wushuang had once again reached the peak state, his strength comparable to that of a supreme-peak expert. The sword in his hand could easily slay a supreme-peak opponent.","Broly had also reached his perfect form, fully unleashing all the potential within him, and his transformation reached its peak.","His combat power had even reached the terrifying peak of the supreme-peak.","Comparable to ancient practitioners like Wu Zuo who had cultivated for countless years.","Swish!","Jian Wushuang’s figure began to flicker, his speed surpassing imagination.","Although his figure seemed to be stationary, his aura had already reached the deepest part of the void.","“Starry Sky Chronicles!” Jian Wushuang roared angrily. The Jueyun Sword was held horizontally in front of him, and in the next moment, he directly plunged towards Broly.","“The First Sword Move!”","The Sword Qi was vast and majestic, suddenly slanting!","Countless thoughts trembled, space changed, time froze.","Broly clenched his fists, placed them at his waist, and with a sudden tap of his toe, he directly shattered the condensed space beneath his feet. He advanced towards Jian Wushuang, unrelenting.","In his hands, numerous waves of energy continuously surged towards Jian Wushuang.","However, the power condensed from these auras was slowed down, too sluggish for Jian Wushuang.","Numerous large circular energies were frozen in the void, like suspended suns and moons.","At the tip of the Jueyun Sword, a burst of Starry Sky Intent erupted, and the space began to distort amidst the tremors.","Time came to a complete standstill, freezing Broly’s body in place.","His understanding of time was limited; he could only grasp certain mysteries through the Starry Sky First Sword. All he could do was immobilize Broly in the void; freezing his consciousness remained beyond his reach.","Thus, Broly could sense his own slowing speed, yet his consciousness and thoughts continued to race.","After being frozen, he once again erupted with a powerful aura, attempting to shatter the confinement.","His physical body was frozen, but his consciousness persisted.","Breaking free from his physical form, his divine body, accompanied by the Origin Source, shot out together!","This scene startled Jian Wushuang.","In the frozen void, two versions of Broly appeared.","One was a dimmed physical body, already abandoned by Broly. He had made a decisive choice; if he didn’t abandon it, facing this sword strike would mean certain death."]},{"number":5602,"title":"Chapter 5602: Death Comes","paragraphs":["Chapter 5602: Death Comes","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, even now, without a physical body, it was impossible to stop him relying solely on the divine body.","“Slash!”","Jian Wushuang once again exerted all his strength, changing direction and charging towards Broly’s divine body.","The towering divine body was not bound by the constraints of time.","Broly also understood that without the support of a physical body, he was currently very fragile and needed to break the restrictions of this place as soon as possible.","Although only the divine body remained, the power of each punch still possessed the supreme-peak strength. With each punch, the void continued to shatter.","In front of Broly, the frozen void seemed like a series of mirrors.","Jian Wushuang’s eye sockets contracted. At this rate, he couldn’t attack Broly at all. Moreover, the strength consumed by this sword move was too great, and he couldn’t afford to drag on with his opponent.","“Broly, can you only hide?” Jian Wushuang, in desperation, could only try to provoke the other verbally, angrily shouting, “You’re not worthy of being a cultivator, nor a qualified warrior. Have you forgotten Bukun’s teachings?”","“Show me your full strength and face me in a direct battle!”","In a head-on confrontation, he was invincible!","This sword strike was invincible.","Broly’s eyes turned from white to blood-red, and the white arcs on his body turned blood-colored.","His aura surged once again!","This aura made Jian Wushuang feel somewhat familiar and fearful. He had considerable knowledge of Tribulation realm experts and had faced several Six Tribulation realm superpowers such as Fuego.","That aura, he was too familiar with it.","Broly could still erupt, which he hadn’t anticipated. This time, the aura could rival that of a Tribulation realm.","The sword was drawn, and he couldn’t care less. Even if Qishen bowed to Broly at this moment, he would charge forward and cut him down.","This was the only chance.","Whenever there was only one chance left, he would always ask himself deep down: If this were his last opportunity in life, how would he unleash strength beyond himself to defeat the opponent?","If he couldn’t succeed, it would be his downfall.","So, he had to win.","The Jueyun Sword froze the void and time.","Now, in this void, only he and Broly’s divine body could move.","Broly transformed again after entering another realm. Gone was the previous ferocity, replaced by a hint of composure.","Facing his strongest strike, Broly didn’t dodge but confronted it head-on.","This played right into his hands.","The Jueyun Sword instantly descended, transforming into a size of billions of miles, facing Broly directly.","There was no chance for him to dodge now. Jian Wushuang seemed to have seen what Broly would look like after his fall through time.","However, at this moment, in the headquarters of the Earth Realm Divine Temple, Zhen Ling suddenly sensed something amiss. Shouting in alarm, he hurriedly rushed towards Jian Wushuang’s direction.","Zhen Ling freely traversed the Four Great Secret Realms, needing only a breath to reach Jian Wushuang’s location.","But for peak-level experts, even a breath was somewhat slow.","The first strike!","Success!","Jian Wushuang was overjoyed.","This time, with a complete execution, he gained profound insights. The first strike could be considered truly perfected to a state of perfection.","The space within a million miles in all directions transformed into a painting, leaving only him as a vibrant life.","Broly’s presence could no longer be sensed.","In the painting, Broly, with his red hair and shimmering red arcs, extended one hand, pinching Jian Wushuang’s Jueyun Sword with two fingers.","“How arrogant!” Jian Wushuang looked at the scene, disdainful in his heart.","Attempting to block him with just two fingers? That was underestimating the power of the Starry Sky too much!","Lowering his head to admire his masterpiece, Jian Wushuang felt satisfied.","However, his Jueyun Sword also fell into the painting this time, turning into an inanimate object.","But it wasn’t a big deal; he could retrieve it using the power of Life.","It wasn’t difficult.","Just as he was about to separate the painting and prepare to take it, the space captured in the painting began to tremble.","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang scanned the surroundings in surprise.","The next moment, his chest burst open, and a giant hand appeared before him.","Before he could react, trying to mobilize the power of Life to replenish himself, Death had already arrived, firmly suppressing his Life force within the Origin Source.","That frenzied power of Death continued to devour his Life power.","Jian Wushuang stared wide-eyed with his mouth agape.","Life was constantly slipping away.","It was Broly!","Or rather, it was Mie Sheng.","Mie Sheng controlled Broly, suddenly shattering his Starry Sky Chronicles, seizing the opportunity to launch a sneak attack, and piercing through his chest in one strike.","The Candle Dragon Armor shattered completely, turning into fragments.","Without the intact Beast God Origin Source, the Beast God Weapon could easily be shattered by a Tribulation realm expert.","Resisting the supreme-peak was easy, but he was facing Mie Sheng!","A super being capable of directly confronting Zhen Ling.","He found himself unable to communicate with Zhen Ling.","This time, it was his turn to be completely desperate.","The force of Death, in a relentless manner, devoured his Life.","In a trance, he also came to understand.","No wonder he had evolved from the power of All Things into the power of Life; there was indeed a relative strength.","Now, he had become someone else’s stepping stone.","Space combined with time could form a temporal structure.","Life combined with Death could also form reincarnation.","This wasn’t a simple cycle; like Hu Qing mastering the essence of Zen, what he practiced was true reincarnation.","Now, he had taken a step to comprehend the true essence of reincarnation.","It was a complete cycle.","On par with the level of time and space.","It was a power surpassing the realm of Tribulation.","A shortcut!","A path to step into a higher level.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang realized it.","However, he found that the force of Death, although it could suppress him, did not contain a power as formidable as Mie Sheng’s true form.","It was relative, an interaction.","If the Death power of the Six Tribulation realm eroded the power of Life, it would probably be like drawing water with a bamboo basket—futile. The opponent was just a mass of Death power at the supreme-peak level.","He still had hope.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang summoned the last strand of Thought power and traveled to his own Origin Source Sea, condensing it into an incarnation.","At this moment, his Origin Source Sea was churning with waves.","When his incarnation appeared, it coincidentally faced the mass of Death power.","The incarnation formed by the condensation of Life force had the same appearance as his main body, but emitted a green aura.","Upon discovering Jian Wushuang’s incarnation, the Death power twisted and transformed into a figure resembling Jian Wushuang, only in black.","“Hehe, you can’t stop me!” the black Jian Wushuang sneered.","Jian Wushuang directly made a move. This place was his Origin Source Sea; could he be threatened by an outsider?","“Just with your scraps, you still dare to attempt devouring me?!” Jian Wushuang shouted angrily and directly attacked.","The two engaged in a simple battle, using their pure strength, without resorting to the desperate and secret techniques used by the main bodies."]},{"number":5603,"title":"Chapter 5603: The Tenacity of Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 5603: The Tenacity of Life","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The purest Death and the purest Life.","This time, Jian Wushuang grew stronger as he fought, fueled by the fear of death and the desire for life.","The power of Death was different.","“Have you heard that it’s better to be alive than to die a good death?” Jian Wushuang attacked with words even in his leisure.","Though Death is frightening and brings fear, the resilience of the power of Life cannot be fully realized until facing death.","Now, facing death head-on, the power of Life erupted completely.","“Get out of here!” Jian","Wushuang smashed the force of Death with a punch, then swiftly appeared behind the opponent. Another knee strike shattered the condensed silhouette of the Death power completely.","With a satisfied breath, Jian Wushuang turned around and found that the black aura had instantly transformed into his own likeness.","“Everyone eventually dies, and some people need a little help!”","This was his retort.","Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow and sneered, “I don’t need your help because my helper has already arrived!”","Outside.","The powerful aura of Zhen Ling suddenly descended.","“Mie Sheng, you’ve crossed the line!”","An invisible giant hand directly reached through Jian Wushuang, pulling the power of Death out of his body.","Inside the Origin Source Sea, Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief. As the power of Death was pulled away, a small black snake fell into the sea, unnoticed.","Jian Wushuang’s avatar directly reciprocated, and the injuries on his body completely healed.","However, the Candle Dragon Inner Armor was gone, reduced to some fragments. It was uncertain whether it could be repaired.","Having just unleashed the Starry Sky Chronicles, he was now at his weakest. Although he had no injuries, he couldn’t mobilize the power of the Starry Sky, unable to reach his strongest state. Currently, he could only muster the combat power of a tier 5 Emperor.","Without the power of the Starry Sky, this might be his limit. He could only rely on the divine body to contend with a tier 6 Emperor.","Nie Yuan truly gave him a valuable treasure.","Zhen Ling glanced at Jian Wushuang and completely shattered the power of Death in his hand.","“Take this person and leave quickly!” Zhen Ling had never been this angry.","Due to Mie Sheng, the disturbance within the Qishen Temple had become severe.","Moreover, the power within Jian Wushuang’s body was contrary to Mie Sheng’s, perhaps part of a deliberate plan.","Mie Sheng’s true form had not completely descended; instead, the power of Death power left within Broly’s body was causing mischief.","Whoosh!","A dark figure emerged from Broly’s Origin Source—it was Mie Sheng.","“You’ve discovered all of this!” Mie Sheng revealed a hint of a smile, then waved his hand, covering Broly with a black halo.","Broly’s divine body and flesh recombined, but he had now fallen into a deep slumber.","Zhen Ling stood in front of Jian Wushuang, silently observing without uttering a word.","However, Jian Wushuang felt somewhat unwilling and spoke, “My Lord, we can’t let them go!”","Instead, it would be better to eliminate Broly and the pseudo-body of Mie Sheng. Letting them go like this would be a pity.","“Little guy, Broly alone scared you off!” Mie Sheng cast an unfriendly glance.","The transformation of Broly indeed startled Jian Wushuang. Jiang Shang was already formidable enough; they couldn’t afford to let another major enemy escape.","Zhen Ling shook his head and said, “Before I change my mind, leave quickly!”","It wasn’t that Zhen Ling was merciful, but he couldn’t act first.","A strong will deep within him suppressed him—the fragment of memory, a massive shard from the original Qishen.","Without integrating that shard, it could already interfere with his consciousness. If it were to merge, the Qishen Temple might already be under Mie Sheng’s control.","Mie Sheng also saw the conflict within Zhen Ling and reminded, “You are the True Spirit of Qishen Temple, and more importantly, a part of Qishen. Don’t forget that!”","This was a flaw that emerged in his and Qishen’s initial planning.","Unexpectedly, with the appearance of Zhen Ling, an independent consciousness emerged.","Otherwise, the plan would have been even smoother than it is now.","It was precisely because of this independent consciousness that Zhen Ling came to genuinely detest the path of devouring and abhor Jian Wushuang.","With Mie Sheng carrying Broly, they swiftly left through the opened passage by Zhen Ling.","The passage eventually closed up again.","Mie Sheng, now outside the Qishen Temple, appeared at the pinnacle of a universe.","Beneath his feet lay a circular universe, and standing on a colossal celestial body, Mie Sheng’s avatar cursed in anger.","Because this place was not the Original Universe, not even within the same spacetime continuum as the Qishen Temple.","Just as they appeared, a group of strange-armored foreign warriors approached in their direction.","This spacetime was far more formidable than the one where the Original Universe existed, even several times more powerful than the Moro Spacetime in the past.","“Wait, fellow Daoist!” Mie Sheng’s avatar and his follower instantly elevated their strength to the Tribulation realm, intending to have a proper conversation with this group of strong individuals.","The leader, a poisonous scorpion woman in purple armor, swayed her tail. She belonged to the Scorpion Clan.","Upon realizing Mie Sheng’s Tribulation realm cultivation, there was no trace of fear; instead, there was a hint of amusement.","“At the Tribulation realm, daring to intrude into my Scorpion Clan’s Nest Universe. You have quite the audacity!”","These patrolling powerhouses were all Emperors.","However, this didn’t mean there were no Tribulation realm powerhouses presiding in this place.","When Mie Sheng was just discovered, a formidable figure, surpassing the Five Tribulation realm, began to descend.","A colossal illusion shrouded the crowd.","“Subordinates pay respects to the General!”","...","After seeing off Mie Sheng, Zhen Ling’s expression relaxed a bit.","The recent disturbance wasn’t solely due to the interference of the memory fragments in his body; instead, it was the backlash brought by him opening a passage to other dimensions.","This was also an experiment, a chance to test his skills against both Broly and Mie Sheng.","Maintaining the connection for the two individuals shouldn’t pose any problem.","However, it wasn’t enough.","Sending away Qishen Temple together with them was utterly impossible. Yet, he could send away a few trustworthy Inheritors from within the Qishen Temple. That was still achievable.","For example, the current Jian Wushuang.","“Jian Wushuang, have you ever thought about leaving this place?”","Jian Wushuang was startled by Zhen Ling’s sudden words, fearing that Zhen Ling no longer wanted him. In haste, he bowed, expressing his loyalty.","“Enough, I didn’t mean that. You’ve seen that Mie Sheng came for you, and Qishen Temple is no longer important,” Zhen Ling revealed the truth.","Jian Wushuang could sense it; after all, it was the Great Dao of Reincarnation, a Dao comparable to the dimension of time and space.","If Mie Sheng succeeded, Qishen Temple would indeed lose its significance.","At that time, no one knew what level of power Mie Sheng would attain.","After taking a breath, Jian Wushuang respectfully said, “It’s entirely up to you, My Lord!”","“After you have completed the Dao Merge, I will grant you an opportunity, and then you will leave Qishen Temple for a while,” Zhen Ling said slowly with hands behind his back.","Currently, Jian Wushuang’s strength, though having the ability to protect himself in other dimensions, was still too weak.","At least, he needed to leave after successfully merging with the Dao."]},{"number":5604,"title":"Chapter 5604 Return to the Heavenly Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 5604 Return to the Heavenly Realm","....","Jian Wushuang understood in his heart. After merging with the Dao, even though the Zhen Ling calculated to keep him inside, he still wanted to go out and explore.","Now, it seemed to align with his intentions.","With a plan in mind, Jian Wushuang was puzzled once again, “My Lord, if I go out, won’t I run into Mie Sheng?”","Mie Sheng was currently in the Original Universe.","Even if he were to enter the temporal river, he might not escape the grasp of Mie Sheng.","Unless he left this temporal river.","“I will send you to other temporal rivers, ones that are relatively powerful. There, you won’t need to worry about anything. Strive to join some powerful forces; the stronger, the better. With your talent, there shouldn’t be a problem. Consider it an exploration for the Qishen Temple!”","Having understood Mie Sheng’s layout, Zhen Ling dared not plunder trial practitioners from the outside world anymore. In case he cultivated a few more pawns, he would end up losing both the wife and the soldiers.","Jian Wushuang nodded upon hearing this. There was no problem with that.","Heading to a stronger timeline might bring good luck. Perhaps, he could even reach the timeline of Teacher Xuan Yi.","“Work hard. The help Qishen Temple can provide is not much anymore. In the future, you’ll need to rely on your own efforts.” After encouraging Jian Wushuang with a few words, Zhen Ling left.","He left Jian Wushuang alone.","The last sentence from Zhen Ling was quite modest.","The treasures of the Qishen Temple were surely more than just this.","He had only obtained the Origin Source of All Things.","Swish!","Moluo, realizing the silence, rushed over immediately. Seeing Jian Wushuang alive, he breathed a sigh of relief.","“Young Master!” Moluo respectfully stood by the side.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and instructed, “Prepare the flying artifact, go to the nearest teleportation array, and return to the Heavenly Realm!”","The Earth Realm was satisfactory.","There probably wasn’t much worth lingering over in the future.","Returning to the Heavenly Realm early for Dao Merge was the key.","With the Origin Source, he could elevate the power of Life to new heights, and even break through the black hole realm in one go.","The two of them made a high-profile entrance into the Earth Realm, only to leave quietly in the end.","The outside world also left a seed for Jian Wushuang.","A mighty temporal river!","The vast Starry Sky.","Concealing too many secrets, he needed to explore each one, find Teacher Xuan Yi, and unravel the unsolved mysteries.","Before embarking on a new journey, he needed many preparations.","Back in the Heavenly Realm, without any hesitation, he headed straight for the Elder Palace.","The last time he left the Elder Palace, he was driven away by Wu Zuo, but this time, Wu Zuo and the three Palace Masters personally welcomed him.","And because of his recent relationship with Wu Zuo, Wu Zuo stood at the forefront.","Although only a few days had passed since they last met, the other party acted as if they hadn’t seen each other for many years, excitedly welcoming Jian Wushuang’s return.","The three Palace Masters even lowered their posture to the utmost.","Even Chang Feng Sword God had a smile on his face. Remember, Jian Wushuang had killed his younger brother.","Forgot about it in just a few days?","But thinking about it, since the plan of that time had been fully revealed, Chang Feng Sword God would hate Wu Zuo if he hated anyone. He wouldn’t hold any grudge against Jian Wushuang.","And he didn’t believe Jian Wushuang could kill Tie San.","Probably it was Wu Zuo making a move in secret.","Now, he found himself in an unusually passive position.","Among the three Palace Masters, Qingniu remained as neutral as always. If others gained, he didn’t lose, and if others lost, he still didn’t lose.","Forever standing in a neutral position.","Palace Master Lu Hua’s bet paid off this time, and he was the most pleased.","The first day of his return was inevitably filled with socializing.","In the Elder Palace, some familiar faces came to congratulate.","Qiuhuang, the old man with sheep horns, and those ancient tier 5 Emperors of the Original Universe were among them.","But now, they were no longer as simple as tier 5 Emperors.","Following Wan Yan, Dongsheng, and several other tier 5 Emperors, they also entered the three bridges guarded by Divine General Moyin and reaped substantial rewards.","Many of them advanced to become tier 6 Emperors.","Wan Yan and Dongsheng, who were the first to enter, had already advanced to tier 6 Emperors early on.","However, each of these individuals admired Jian Wushuang, a Dao Lord who could kill Tie San.","As for the battles between the Human Realm and the Earth Realm, they had long been sealed off, and they were completely unaware of them.","They were still at the level of Jian Wushuang slaying tier 6 Emperors.","If they knew that Jian Wushuang could now even kill supreme-peak, they would be astonished.","“Everyone, I feel a bit sorry for you. The Origin Source of All Things in the Beiwang Tower...” Jian Wushuang, for once, did not feign ignorance and brought up this matter.","The Beiwang Tower was originally a sacred place for all cultivators, but now it had to be stopped.","After hearing this, Dongsheng was the first to stand up and said, “Wushuang, don’t say that. The strong are respected, and this is what you deserve. Moreover, you personally took risks and completely eradicated the headquarters of that Shadow Sect. With such great merits and your strength, all of this is rightfully yours, there’s nothing to apologize for.”","“Dongsheng is right. Wushuang, we support you!” Wan Yan also chimed in.","Other elders who had a good relationship with Jian Wushuang also spoke up.","In fact, he didn’t need to devour all of the Origin Source of All Things; half would be enough. However, the remaining half would be useless.","The Beiwang Tower had to be stopped.","Seeing these people being so sincere, Jian Wushuang waved his hand and said, “Everyone, I am willing to take out one-third of the Origin Source of All Things as a reward for you all!”","Since he was already playing along, he might as well be generous for once.","He ate meat and also let these people have some soup.","Upon hearing this, the crowd naturally didn’t show any pretense and were delighted one after another.","One-third of the Origin Source of All Things was quite substantial.","Distributed among everyone, it was even more than what they would gain from conquering a dozen levels of the Beiwang Tower.","Jian Wushuang stood up directly and said, “Let’s distribute it now!”","This time, he was so selfless, but there were also some personal motives in his heart.","After the Dao Merge, he was about to leave.","To leave the universe that nurtured him, to leave the Qishen Temple.","In the current outside world, apart from the suppressed True Monarch, there was also Mie Sheng.","He didn’t know if the Original Universe could survive.","According to his speculation, the passage to the Great Yan Domain was in the Great Si Region. If Mie Sheng followed the passage into the Divine Power Universe, his hometown world would probably be in trouble.","Even if Mie Sheng didn’t bother to do that, once the True Monarch broke free from the suppression, he would likely devour the Original Universe recklessly, and then everything would be finished.","In the future, it would rely on these people to protect the Original Universe.","Now, giving them some benefits to reward them was no big deal.","Speaking of the matter at hand, Jian Wushuang led the crowd directly to the Beiwang Tower.","“There won’t be many opportunities like this in the future. If any of you still lack confidence in breaking through, you can try it now!” Jian Wushuang wasn’t in a hurry; a few more years wouldn’t make much difference.","Upon hearing this, some of the people were itching to try and entered the Beiwang Tower one after another.","Even for those without attempts left, Jian Wushuang generously granted them chances to challenge, allowing them to enter freely.","Since the Origin Source of All Things belonged to him, the three Palace Masters naturally had no objections.","The elder who guarded this place looked at the spirited Jian Wushuang and sighed inwardly."]},{"number":5605,"title":"Chapter 5605: Challenging the Beiwang Tower Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 5605: Challenging the Beiwang Tower Again","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Once an ordinary trial participant, as commonplace as one could be, he ascended to the pinnacle from the very bottom.","Thinking back to the time he first entered the Qishen Temple, he was merely a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal. Looking back now, he had become an unparalleled Dao Lord.","Compared to other Dao Lords with extraordinary talents, his advancement might not have been exceptionally swift, but the improvement in his combat prowess undoubtedly placed him among the forefront.","Now, his true strength allowed him to cut through the supreme-peak with a single sword strike.","When Shang entered the Qishen Temple, he was already a tier 5 Ultimate Emperor.","Once Jian Wushuang completes his Dao Merge, he will truly become the foremost Inheritor, indisputably the first in terms of both potential and strength.","Familiar figures entered the Beiwang Tower one after another.","Most of the Inheritors here were powerful beings of tier 4 Emperor and above.","Many of those tier 5 Emperors who entered the Qishen Temple initially had also gone to the Grave God Mountain and returned promptly.","The resources in the Grave God Mountain were ultimately limited, and it was impossible to leave so many Inheritors there simultaneously.","Survival of the fittest!","Swish!","Wu Zuo’s figure walked out from the Beiwang Tower, a hint of a smile on his face.","75th floor, passed!","“Congratulations, Brother Wu Zuo!” Jian Wushuang nodded.","However, Wu Zuo remained unperturbed, saying loudly, “I’m still quite far behind compared to you. I’ve only broken through to the 5th layer; your record is still untouched by anyone till now!”","“I just got lucky,” Jian Wushuang modestly replied.","Now, as he faced Dao Merge, he gradually became more stable.","The sharpness of the past was now replaced by restraint.","This was also a manifestation of accumulating strength.","“Aren’t you going to give it a try?” Wu Zuo curiously asked.","He knew that Jian Wushuang’s strength was not as simple as it seemed. When he slew Tie San, Jian Wushuang already possessed the combat power of a top-level tier 6 Emperor.","Now, after so many years have passed, his power is likely at the peak of tier 6.","In Beiwang Tower, one could reach the 60th floor.","“No need to rush, let them have their fun first!” Jian Wushuang paid no attention.","For others, challenging the Beiwang Tower might still be beneficial, but for him, it was of no use anymore. The Origin Source of All Things belonged to him.","His need for the Origin Source of All Things was not as great now. After becoming an Emperor, the condensed Origin Source of All Things under his control was probably no weaker than the entire universe.","More importantly, he wielded the power of Life, even more formidable than the Origin Source of All Things.","Swish, swish!","The rankings in Beiwang Tower kept changing.","As it was the last opening of the Beiwang Tower, everyone exerted themselves. Many successfully broke through.","A familiar acquaintance of Jian Wushuang even broke through three consecutive levels, refreshing his own record and the record of a tier 5 Emperor.","“Ji Chaoyang!”","The proud young man encountered on the Original Planet had now become a powerful tier 5 Ultimate Emperor. Although he had not achieved a perfect Ultimate Dao, he had successfully merged the Dao when reaching the eighth layer, making him an Ultimate Emperor on the same level as Shang. His future achievements would at least make him a supreme-peak powerhouse.","Moreover, he had obtained the inheritance of the Divine General on the Grave God Mountain and was now a candidate Divine General.","“Haha, my son has the qualifications of a supreme-peak!” A middle-aged man who bore a striking resemblance to Ji Zhaoyang, the Emperor of the Ji Family Dynasty in the Original Universe, was elated and boastful about Ji Zhaoyang’s performance in the Beiwang Tower, surrounded by a few close friends.","This man was the Emperor of the Ji Family Dynasty in the original universe, originally just a tier 4 Emperor, but now he had reached the peak of the tier 5.","“Ji Laosan, you’ve raised a good son!”","Many people came forward to congratulate him.","There were also those who sighed in a corner.","Jian Wushuang immediately spotted the tier 5 peak Emperor who was sighing.","The father of the God-Emperor Mo Long?","Back in the Original Planet, Jian Wushuang faced the strongest opponent, Mo Long. At that time, Mo Long’s strength and treasures were absolutely beyond imagination.","Unfortunately, he fell in the battle against the Devouring Demon during the siege.","Otherwise, he would now be at least a tier 4 Emperor, or even a tier 5 Emperor.","Struggles and opportunities!","Both could lead to downfall; no one could be blamed for it.","Jian Wushuang also approached and congratulated Ji Zhaoyang. Their relationship was quite good.","“Brother Wushuang!” Ji Zhaoyang was also excited.","As a tier 5 Emperor, he had reached the 57th level, possessing top-notch tier 6 combat power.","Jian Wushuang patted his shoulder and said, “Step into the tier 6 as soon as possible, and in the future, we’ll have a chance to explore the secret realms together!”","“Yeah, when the time comes, bring Hu Qing with us!” Ji Zhaoyang just spoke, but then remembered something, and the joy on his face faded.","Hu Qing had been sent to the Grave God Mountain by Zhen Ling and was still in deep sleep. It wasn’t easy for him to wake up due to the severe injuries he suffered before.","After all, resisting the Master of the Azure Dragon Temple was already quite commendable. To survive was considered fortunate. The revival would take some time, and it remained uncertain whether Zhen Ling had any lingering resentment towards Hu Qing.","Ji Chaoyang’s father was delighted to see his son having a good relationship with the current influential figure, Jian Wushuang.","Currently, Jian Wushuang held the power of the Origin Source of All Things and was willing to give one-third of it to these old fellows. Of course, it was necessary to curry favor.","Jian Wushuang nodded and replied, “Sure!”","As for the Origin Source of All Things, it would naturally be evenly distributed.","Since the aim was to win people over, fairness was crucial.","Otherwise, it might have a counterproductive effect.","In the days that followed, millions of Inheritors and native Emperors traversed all the realms, reaching their peak. Some individuals even challenged repeatedly, completely squeezing out their own potential.","Everyone tacitly waited for Jian Wushuang.","One reason was for Jian Wushuang to distribute the Origin Source, and the other was to see him challenge once again.","When the rumors spread that Jian Wushuang had beheaded Tie San, they all assumed it was WU Zuo’s behind-the-scenes manipulation. Now, it was the best opportunity for verification.","The situation was most awkward for Chang Feng.","Regardless of whether Jian Wushuang could successfully challenge, he felt extremely embarrassed. If Jian Wushuang succeeded, it meant he had indeed killed Tie San with his own hands. If he failed, those Emperors who boasted about Jian Wushuang would also criticize Tie San for being too weak.","“Give me a moment!” Jian Wushuang’s aura suddenly surged, his robe fluttering like a divine being.","This was his last time challenging the Beiwang Tower.","During his first attempt, he comprehended the power of Life. He attached great importance to the Beiwang Tower, and perhaps, this time, there might be some surprises.","“Wish you great achievements again, Brother Wushuang!”","Everyone watched as Jian Wushuang entered the teleportation array of the Beiwang Tower, eagerly awaiting.","Dongsheng even conjured a massive scoreboard out of thin air, taking out 100 cubic units of universe crystals, and declared, “Everyone, I bet that Brother Wushuang will break through ten floors again!”","When he spoke, some were initially puzzled, but fortunately, Wanyan cooperated well and immediately joined in.","“Then I bet that Brother Wushuang won’t surpass ten floors!” After speaking, he also took out 100 cubic units of universe crystals."]},{"number":5606,"title":"Chapter 5606: Break!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5606: Break!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This scene was watched with envy by the onlookers; those were universe crystals!","Ordinary tier 6 Emperors couldn’t produce them, only the supreme-peak had such capability.","Among the inheritors, only some tier 6 Emperors could afford to play with them.","Seeing this, Wu Zuo directly took out 1,000 cubic units of universe crystals, attracting countless envious gazes.","“I’ll join the fun with you guys!”","The three Palace Masters also joined the fray.","Some powerful tier 6 Emperors didn’t hesitate either, successively taking out universe crystals to join the game!","After all, such an opportunity came once in a millennium.","“Haha, is there anyone else willing to bet? Now, if you bet that he could beat over 10 floors, the payout is doubled!” Dongsheng was quite cheerful.","Having bet so many universe crystals, he was well-prepared.","He had privately asked Jian Wushuang if he could surpass 10 floors.","Jian Wushuang had already penetrated through more than 50 floors. Adding ten more layers meant reaching over 60 layers, attaining supreme-peak strength.","In the eyes of many, this was simply impossible.","Except for Dongsheng and the other tier 6 peak Emperors, as well as the supreme-peak.","On the other hand, for the slightly weaker tier 5 Emperors, betting pools were opened.","The whole atmosphere was lively with these movements.","In contrast to the outside world, within Beiwang Tower, it was as quiet as death.","The black-robed figure holding six sharp knives couldn’t move, frozen once again.","This time, Jian Wushuang carefully observed the star of All Things and casually killed the opponent’s soul with a swing of his sword.","Swoosh!","55th floor, 56th floor, 57th floor...","Except for the first, all passed in the blink of an eye.","Just a sword strike was enough to deal with the opponent.","“How is this possible?”","In a few breaths, Jian Wushuang had already stepped into the 60th floor.","This represented the strength of the supreme-peak.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang, under normal circumstances, could unleash the power of entering the supreme-peak, temporarily reaching the pinnacle with the help of the power of the Starry Sky.","In just the usual state, Jian Wushuang could reach the 63rd floor.","Outside.","From noisy to silent.","Everyone held their breath.","One more floor, and those Emperors who bet that Jian Wushuang couldn’t break through more than 10 floors would face bankruptcy.","Ding!","The number next to Jian Wushuang’s name changed again.","Passed through the 64th floor!","Even the strongest power of Jian Wushuang under normal circumstances could barely reach this level.","But this wasn’t the end.","Clasping his fists, he used his Thopught power to activate the mysterious Starry Sky.","A vast force instantly descended, elevating his aura to the utmost.","This was improved based on Broly’s Transformation Dao.","It also contained the ancient secret technique.","He created the Starry Sky Chronicles; it couldn’t be all about the sword, right!","So, using this move, he enhanced himself through the power within the Starry Sky Chronicles.","Although brief, it could multiply his strength several times.","In the pale blue expanse of the Starry Sky, an immense power surrounded Jian Wushuang. Even the superficial forces around his body could generate arcs capable of shattering the void.","Now, Jian Wushuang was no longer just the peak-level.","If he unleashed the One Thought Universe, he could probably temporarily reach the peak of the supreme-peak.","“You still have a trump card!” The guardian was on the verge of collapse.","The first time he encountered Jian Wushuang, he was trampled upon, thinking he could reclaim it later. However, Jian Wushuang did not give him a chance at all.","After such a long time, he finally awaited Jian Wushuang’s return to Beiwang Tower, only to be continuously suppressed as soon as he entered.","Moreover, this time, Jian Wushuang’s cultivation realm remained unchanged; he was still a Dao Lord.","“Annihilate!” Jian Wushuang pointed, and a burst of extreme light directly ended the opponent’s life.","Only six sharp knives fell to the ground.","The space changed once again.","Maintaining this peak state probably lasted only the time it takes for an incense stick to burn.","This time was enough for him to reach the 70th floor.","The onlookers outside were already stunned.","“Is this a Dao Lord?” Dongsheng himself found it unbelievable. Although he knew Jian Wushuang could reach the 60th floor, he did not expect Jian Wushuang to be so abnormal, breaking through to the 70th floor in one go.","He regretted not betting on whether Jian Wushuang could break through 15 more floors.","The three Palace Masters were also amazed.","A Dao Lord who could rival the supreme-peak.","This was true transcending.","Crossing a major realm.","In ancient times, there was no mention of such a peerless figure.","If Emperor Jueyun within the supreme-peak was an insurmountable mountain, then Jian Wushuang was a towering peak in the eyes of Dao Lords.","Now, the most extraordinary Dao Lord on the Grave God Mountain could match a tier 5 Emperor at best, but Jian Wushuang could rival the supreme-peak and even possess the combat power of the supreme-peak.","Tie Jian felt a chill in his heart.","Fortunately, he was more pragmatic.","Not to mention how strong Jian Wushuang would be after integrating with the Dao, he might be able to kill him now.","Among the three Palace Masters, the only one who could be compared to Jian Wushuang was Qingniu.","Although Palace Master Lu Hua’s strength was decent, reaching the 70th floor might be a challenge.","If someone could stably surpass Jian Wushuang, it would be Wu Zuo.","“Keep going!” Ji Chaoyang was so excited, unable to resist reminding, “Wushuang, keep going!”","71st floor!","This time, it wasn’t as easy.","Jian Wushuang’s aura kept decreasing, and the peak state was almost at its limit.","Until absolutely necessary, he didn’t want to unleash that sword move.","“I thought your power was inexhaustible!” The black-robed guardian, wielding six sharp knives flawlessly, directly suppressed Jian Wushuang.","Although taunting, he had to admit that this Dao Lord was the most remarkable he had ever seen, even more extraordinary than the former Emperor Jueyun.","After all, the Emperor had mastery over the origin of space.","If Jian Wushuang had obtained recognition from the Origin Source of Time in advance, it would indeed be incredible. However, as a Dao Lord, achieving this level, no one could guarantee he wouldn’t become the next Emperor Jueyun.","Perhaps, the next time Jian Wushuang comes, he might continue advancing.","Sooner or later, he would be the one who conquers 99 floors.","“Break!” Jian Wushuang roared, pulling out the Jueyun Sword, shattering the six sharp knives with one stroke and dispersing the opponent.","He was also panting heavily.","Considering his strength, he could reach the 73rd or even 74th floor.","But maintaining this peak state took too little time. After each floor, there was a brief pause, wasting a lot of energy.","The 71st floor was somewhat challenging.","Even a bit forced.","But on the 72nd floor, Jian Wushuang had absolute confidence; one sword would be enough.","A fresh move, conquering all!","With this sword strike, he had never lost.","During the encounter with Broly, if Mie Sheng hadn’t intervened, he would have cut down Broly long ago.","Whew!","Before the space of the 73rd floor arrived, Jian Wushuang chose to concede.","It was time to leave.","Having used that sword move, he had no more tricks up his sleeve.","As for the One Thought Universe, it was still useful in the earlier levels, but its assistance diminished in the later stages.","After Jian Wushuang left, the guardian’s face revealed astonishment. The sword move he used on the 72nd floor... He had no strength to counterattack and was completely overwhelmed."]},{"number":5607,"title":"Chapter 5607 Invincible Dao Lord","paragraphs":["Chapter 5607 Invincible Dao Lord","Even at the 75th floor, he probably couldn’t directly resist that sword strike.","....","After all, the first sword move in the Starry Sky Chronicles was capable of killing powerhouses like Broly.","At that time, Broly was already comparable to Wu Zuo.","Passing through 72 floors was, of course, no problem.","Upon returning to the grand hall, countless gazes turned towards him, filled with astonishment and disbelief.","From now on, no one dared to question Jian Wushuang.","If a time limit were added, countless epochs later, or perhaps in another era, people would still remember the name Jian Wushuang.","The Invincible Dao Lord!","The Origin Source of All Things was divided into millions of parts, and he made sure everyone got a share.","Although it seemed insufficient for some powerful beings, for the tier 4 and tier 5 Emperors, it was a tremendous opportunity.","While feeling grateful to Jian Wushuang, they also strove towards him.","Before entering seclusion, Jian Wushuang had extensive conversations with the old powerhouses like Dongsheng, discussing the current situation in the Original Universe, urging them to remain vigilant.","He knew a lot but could say very little, merely mentioning the threat posed by that Mo Jun or Demon Lord.","In case the opponent managed to lift the restrictions prematurely, and Qishen Temple had no one at the Tribulation realm, it would be awkward, with only the option to watch Mo Jun slaughter and devour.","However, according to Zhen Ling, among the three Great True Monarchs...","Shan Jun was disintegrated, while Mo Jun was suppressed.","Their strengths were greatly diminished, with the most powerful being Gu Jun, who was suppressed deep in the First Prison.","His strength remained intact, at least possessing the power of a Six Tribulation realm.","Even if Mo Jun were to break free from the restrictions, having a strength of Three Tribulation would be considered good.","Even so, within the Qishen Temple, there was no one who could be considered a match now.","Zhen Ling couldn’t leave at all, and the avatar that went out was too weak.","Zhuang Zhong, who had allied with Zhen Ling, was only at the One Tribulation realm, and his strength was simply inadequate.","They had to rely on the Inheritors.","In addition to the overt threats, there was also Mie Sheng.","The opponent came for the Life power within him.","The collision of Death and Life, the planning of countless epochs, all for him.","He had to be more cautious.","Returning to the familiar cave mansion, it felt empty.","Jian Wushuang casually sat cross-legged on the mat, beginning to inventory the treasures at his disposal.","There were many treasures that could quickly enhance his strength, and he needed to make use of all that he could.","The stronger he became, the more assurance he had.","“Universe crystals, 300,000 cubic units!” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Before him appeared a towering mountain, entirely composed of universe crystals.","Originally, he had intended to devour these universe crystals, but with the Origin Source of All Things, it was faster to devour the Origin Source itself. These universe crystals were hard to come by, and he could use them later when he became the Emperor.","Two-thirds of the Origin Source of All Things.","A majestic Origin Source, the Origin Source of the Divine Master of All Things from the past.","The Origin Source of a Six Tribulation realm powerhouse!","Now it belonged to him.","He was already very close to the realm of the black hole, and devouring this Origin Sources was enough to break through.","Reaching out with a single hand, he gently touched the Origin Source of All Things. His spiritual awareness expanded greatly, and the vastness of all things entered directly into his body.","In just an instant, his body expanded by a circle.","This Origin Source was too pure.","Jian Wushuang found it a bit difficult to devour and quickly stopped.","Swish!","He directly moved the Origin Source of All Things into his own Origin Source Sea. Devouring the Origin Source took a very long time, and he couldn’t afford to waste that time.","A clone could handle the devouring.","He had more important things to do.","The chess manual, the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, and the inheritance of the First True King could wait for him to cultivate after reaching the Emperor realm; there was no hurry for that.","Currently, he needed to comprehend the power brought by the Starry Sky Chronicles.","The power of the Starry Sky.","This wasn’t the power of the Extreme Dao but rather the power of the Sword Dao.","Starry Sky Sword Dao.","This could be considered Nie Yuan’s inheritance.","Or rather, it was the Starry Sky inheritance Nie Yuan obtained and passed on to him.","Unfortunately, Nie Yuan’s strength and potential were too weak. That one sword move directly caused Nie Yuan to die from breathlessness.","If he had Nie Yuan’s strength, he probably wouldn’t have met such a fate.","Even now, although he could use that one sword move, the backlash it brought required him to rest for an hour and replenish his Life power.","This was only possible because he had mastered the power of Life. Without it, he might have suffered the same fate as Nie Yuan, dying directly from breathlessness.","He hadn’t truly mastered the power of the Starry Sky; he only borrowed it, or even stole it.","Naturally, there would be repercussions.","Moreover, the power of the Starry Sky inherently carried the Origin Source of Time and Space, making it difficult for him to bear.","Let alone combining the two.","“The First Sword Move!” Jian Wushuang’s thoughts manifested in swordsmanship. With one swing, his entire person wilted.","Puff!","This time, he was directly backlash-injured, unable to mobilize his Thought power.","“No, the difference in realms is still too vast. I should wait until I reach the black hole realm to give it another try!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","His current realm was indeed too low.","The power of the Starry Sky was utterly incomprehensible to him.","Creating a simple sword move relied only on a small amount of power.","Even the use of the Starry Sky’s power to enhance himself was rough.","It was time to set aside the Sword Dao.","Otherwise, no matter how he played, he would end up smashing it in his own hands.","It would be better to first study how to use the power of the Starry Sky within himself and then specialize it in the Dao of the Sword.","He had mixed things up before.","Initially, he applied the power of the Starry Sky to the Sword Dao, then called it into his own body.","He used his Thought power.","A weak force of the Starry sSky appeared at his fingertips. At a glance, its boundaries were indiscernible.","His eyes, now able to scrutinize even space, and his thoughts could sense time, but they couldn’t penetrate this strand of Starry Sky power.","Although it was just a strand, condensed into a small group.","Yet, Jian Wushuang saw a vast universe within it.","Upon closer inspection, the universe continuously dispersed.","It wasn’t until he felt groggy that he stopped.","Unfathomable!","He could only see one universe.","Who would have thought that with just this bit of Starry Sky power, it contained a universe, and perhaps even more than one universe?","The mystery of the Starry Sky was indeed beyond Jian Wushuang’s imagination.","In the following time, he remained immersed in it.","Mastery of the Dao was not something achieved overnight; he needed ample preparation.","He gained enlightenment from the Starry Sky, perhaps the opportunity for Dao mastery lay within the celestial expanse.","Anything was possible.","Inside the cave mansion, everything remained unchanged for eternity!","Outside the cave mansion, however, changes occurred day by day.","The number of trial participants gradually decreased, and the count of inheritors began to stabilize.","With the number unchanged, the resources of the Grave God Mountain remained constant.","For the Inheritors, this was considered good news.","However, for Zhen Ling, it was a colossal piece of bad news.","In the temporal river beyond the Original Universe, at some unknown time, a grand hall identical to the Qishen Temple appeared.","This hall stood tall in the temporal river, creating more commotion than even the Qishen Temple.","It directly opened its doors to the formidable beings along the entire temporal river.","Clearly, it was created by Mie Sheng."]},{"number":5608,"title":"Chapter 5608 Temple of World Annihilation","paragraphs":["Chapter 5608 Temple of World Annihilation","“The Temple of World Annihilation!”","....","Upon discovering it, Zhen Ling immediately issued a stern order: any Emperor entering Mie Sheng’s temple was to be executed without mercy.","The Temple of World Annihilation and the Qishen Temple were archenemies, engaged in a life-and-death struggle.","Though the Inheritors knew little about it, they didn’t perceive it as a bad thing.","Especially Shang, he was even more excited. He headed straight to the temporal river, challenging the Temple of World Annihilation.","In just a single era, the powerful figures emerging from the Temple of World Annihilation were no weaker than the Inheritors cultivated by the Qishen Temple.","Numerous Ultimate Emperors appeared.","It was a momentum opposing the Qishen Temple emerged and was unstoppable.","Yet, all of this had nothing to do with Jian Wushuang.","He remained in seclusion, and the tales about him in the outside world remained unchanged.","Many even believed that he had already successfully integrated with the Dao.","Jian Wushuang himself wanted to as well!","However, when he comprehended the power of the Starry Sky, he inadvertently let an era slip by.","There were no traces of time’s passage, yet a long period had elapsed.","The Four Great Secret Realms were completely unified, with no resistance whatsoever.","Now, most of the Inheritors had entered the Original Universe.","Although the Qishen Temple no longer absorbed trial participants, those Inheritors venturing into the Original Universe, and even into other universes, opened wide the gates, establishing themselves as founders.","These Inheritors were considered the first generation disciples.","The second generation disciples were the powerful individuals nurtured by these Inheritors.","This was something tacitly approved by Zhen Ling.","The emergence of the Temple of World Annihilation disrupted the Qishen Temple’s plans, forcing them to make temporary adjustments.","The results were quite satisfactory.","The river of time had entered an era of great eruption.","The first era could be considered as the universe’s initial exploration.","The second era marked the appearance of Qishen Temple, a brief yet splendid period.","The third era unfolded as a time of conflict between two temples.","Both sides invested vast resources, fully unlocking the potential of the temporal river.","The days of the tier 5 emperors, once the era of the strong, had already passed.","Now, venturing through the river of time, if you weren’t a tier 6 Emperor, you would hesitate to claim strength.","It could already be foreseen that extraordinary strong individuals would emerge in the future of this temporal river.","A single era’s time was not enough.","In the first era, many supreme-peak experts appeared, but there was still no sign of reaching the Tribulation realm.","Originally, everyone had high hopes for Shang; after all, he was the first Ultimate Emperor. However, an entire era passed without any movement.","He had been continuously seeking a confrontation with the Temple of World Annihilation at the supreme-peak, but there was no indication of a breakthrough.","Nevertheless, his strength was terrifyingly formidable and had subtly become the top figure in the temporal river.","This temporal river also gained a reputation, though not in the name of strength, but in connection with the two temples.","The ‘Mie-Qi Temporal Space’!","When this name surfaced, Zhen Ling was on the verge of directly declaring war on the Temple of World Annihilation, but the more he thought about it, the more fearful he became.","The initial prophecy was too accurate.","To truly annihilate the Qishen Temple!","In comparison to the outside world, Jian Wushuang’s accumulation was also extremely vast.","In the power of the Starry Sky, he gazed down upon it, feeling remarkably at ease.","Now, utilizing the power of the Starry Sky, he had already created two pinnacle secret techniques.","Starry Sky Chronicles, a Sword Dao imbued with the power of the Starry Sky.","Eternal Ancient Transformation, a Transformation Dao imbued with the power of the Starry Sky.","In the past, when reaching the peak state, he could only maintain it for an incense stick’s worth of time. Now, he could sustain it for a whole hour.","This was only the first transformation of the Eternal Ancient Transformation; after becoming the Emperor, he would continue down this path.","As for the Starry Sky Chronicles, he hadn’t delved into it much, only perfecting the first sword move.","The backlash time it brought him gradually shortened.","He could even compensate for the backlash with the power of Life, but the cost was that within an hour, he couldn’t unleash the second sword move.","However, this was still a tremendous success.","This way, after casting the first sword of the Starry Sky Chronicles, he could still maintain the peak state.","He wouldn’t experience a drastic drop in his realm as he did in the past after casting the first sword move.","In this epoch, he reaped a lot.","His spatial realm reached the black hole realm.","The coveted black hole realm was finally attained.","Moreover, the Origin Source of All Things still had more than half remaining. After the Dao Merge, he could go and compete for the peak of the black hole realm.","He hadn’t yet achieved integration with the Dao, and yet already pondering how to reach the Tribulation realm.","Complete mastery of space, the pinnacle secret technique.","At this point, he could be considered to have made preliminary progress.","After the Dao Merge, relying on the power of the Starry Sky, he could refine the pinnacle secret technique to perfection.","Crossing into the universe realm of space was the simplest.","It was also his greatest reliance for increasing strength.","Once mastering universe space, his mere thought might indeed transform the universe illusion into a real universe.","Combine that with the power of Life!","Jian Wushuang had already started yearning. If the universe he created with his Thought power could give birth to life, wouldn’t that mean he could open up a universe?","However, there was a troublesome point.","Having the power of Life but lacking the Origin Source was unacceptable.","He couldn’t possibly use the power of All Things to evolve the Origin Source of All Things!","That would only weaken his strength.","“Skysight Heavenly Chessboard!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes lit up as he thought of something.","He had plenty of Origin Sources, all in the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","If he integrated the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard into the One Thought Universe, combined with his power of Life, wouldn’t he be able to resurrect the pieces on the board?","If it happened that way, Jian Wushuang could already imagine a scene in the future when he fought against others, with a group of powerful beings emerging from the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","Swallowing his saliva, he stopped daydreaming. Everything was happening quickly; let his strength prove it all!","The Dao Merge was right in front of him.","Time to embark!","Heading west!","Whoosh!","Directly tearing through the fabric of space, he appeared above the Yuanyang Lake. With a sweep of his Thought power, Jian Wushuang furrowed his brow.","“Where are the people?” Jian Wushuang wondered.","He noticed that the formidable experts of the entire Elder Palace were at least 99 percent fewer. Moreover, they were all unfamiliar faces.","Just as he was puzzled, a figure appeared in front of him.","The person was none other than Wu Zuo, but only one of Wu Zuo’s avatars.","Now that the temporal river was caught in the opposition of the Qishen Temple and the Temple of World Annihilation were in opposition, frequent conflicts occurred, and his main body needed to stay outside to oversee matters.","Currently, the struggle between the two factions extended across the universe.","“Wushuang, I thought you were going to directly perform the Dao Merge this time!” Wu Zuo chuckled.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and replied, “Before merging with Dao, I need to make a trip to the Mahayana Spirit Mountain in the Western Region.”","“True, I’ll transmit your message to the ancestral master of the Mahayana Spirit Mountain so that they can come directly!” Wu Zuo spoke with the same domineering tone, seeking help from others but making them come over directly.","Although Jian Wushuang was somewhat uncomfortable with this approach, he was still grateful.","However, this time, he intended to go in person.","Given the gravity of the situation, he couldn’t act recklessly. He politely declined Wu Zuo’s kindness and inquired about the current situation.","The number of experts in the Elder Palace had sharply decreased, and it seemed that the current powerful figures in the Elder Palace were all native emperors.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s confusion, Wu Zuo recounted the significant and minor events that had occurred in this era."]},{"number":5609,"title":"Chapter 5609 Westbound","paragraphs":["Chapter 5609 Westbound","“The Temple of World Annihilation!” Jian Wushuang’s pupils contracted, his voice trembling.","....","He could be absolutely certain that this was definitely orchestrated by Mie Sheng.","The external world was indeed in chaos now.","Fortunately, the opponent stood in the open, and Jian Wushuang could finally breathe a sigh of relief.","As long as the opponent was in the open, he had nothing to fear.","He feared that the opponent would remain concealed, making it impossible for him to venture out.","Even so, he would not leave the Qishen Temple.","What if Mie Sheng was waiting for him? What would he do?","He dared not take the risk and decided to follow the orders of Zhen Ling.","“Wu Zuo, I will leave first. Perhaps, for a long time to come, I won’t return to the Elder Palace. Take care of yourself!” Jian Wushuang clasped his fists.","The other had helped him a lot, and he remembered the favor.","It seemed that Wu Zuo had not become the Palace Master yet; he was still the Hall Master of the Law Enforcement Hall. However, in the current chaos outside, the position of the Hall Master of the Law Enforcement Hall was probably not much weaker than that of the Palace Master.","After successfully merging the Dao, he would go to the Grave God Mountain. It was estimated that he would leave this temporal river. Meeting again might really not be easy.","Wu Zuo seemed to have realized this too. He also clasped his fists, but this time, he didn’t say much. He sincerely said, “Take care!”","Then Jian Wushuang tiptoed, vanished in an instant in the void, and headed towards the central hall.","Wu Zuo, standing in the same place, watched Jian Wushuang’s departing figure. After a while, he left as well.","During Jian Wushuang’s flight, he did not encounter the old man with goat horns. It seemed that there was no chance for a farewell at his door.","It was Qiuhuang’s avatar that had been guarding the central hall all along.","Seeing Jian Wushuang, the originally dozing avatar immediately became alert.","“Jian Wushuang!” Qiuhuang smiled and said, “You, kid, finally came out of seclusion!”","Jian Wushuang descended slowly, revealing a smile, and walked towards Qiuhuang at a leisurely pace.","When the two met, it was as if it were their first encounter in Qiuhuang City.","Casually sitting on a set of steps, he looked up at Qiuhuang without a care in the world.","The other had already reached tier 6, reportedly doing well in the outside world. Instead of going to the Human Realm, the avatar had gone to the Earth Realm.","After chatting for a while, Jian Wushuang stood up, preparing to leave.","Before entering the teleportation array, QiuHuang hesitated and finally called out to Jian Wushuang.","“Elder Yang has fallen!”","This news dated back half a epoch.","At that time, the struggle for the universe was at its peak, and Yang Sanmu, a Divine Craftsman and a peak-level tier 6 Emperor, was transferred from the rear to the front line.","It was his voluntary choice, but unfortunately, he encountered a supreme-peak expert.","Upon hearing this news, Jian Wushuang was first stunned, then slowly turned his head. His eyes happened to meet the hilt of his Jueyun Sword. It was the peerless divine sword that the old Yanghorn had obtained at great cost from the hands of the Vermilion Bird Temple Master.","“Who did it?” Jian Wushuang stood still, leaning against Qiuhuang. His facial expression couldn’t be seen, but his tone had dropped sharply to freezing point.","Qiuhuang’s voice also sounded somewhat hoarse. After all, they had been brothers for many years, and he was also saddened.","“It was Broly, the top powerhouse of the Temple of World Annihilation!”","Crack!","Jian Wushuang’s footsteps were crisp as he walked directly onto the teleportation array, leaving behind a brief sentence.","“I will avenge him!”","The statement was decisive and ordinary.","However, as the teleportation array activated, Jian Wushuang’s expression turned fierce within the colorful channel. He turned around, gazing at Qiuhuang’s position and roared, “I will definitely avenge him!”","Such is karma!","Back then, he casually let someone kill Broly’s father, and now Broly effortlessly killed Yang Sanmu.","Those who kill will be killed.","No one to blame.","It’s just that when it happens to someone, that’s when the anger arises.","A common occurrence in the mortal realm!","At this level, things don’t change.","Perhaps, they are all still just mortals.","Since understanding the power of the Starry Sky, sometimes he would wonder if the universe he lived in was also a convergence of forces?","Maybe, maybe not.","A month later, on the pale yellow continent in the western region, a figure flew steadily.","Upon entering the western region, Jian Wushuang did not bother using teleportation arrays but chose to fly slowly.","In the Heavenly Realm, many powerful beings had been transferred elsewhere.","Perhaps those powerhouses had volunteered.","Everyone aspires to a larger world.","Zhen Ling might have made a promise that any native emperor leaving the Qishen Temple could receive assistance in restoring their Origin Source. However, they had to make a solemn vow not to betray the Qishen Temple.","This requirement was not unreasonable, prompting countless individuals to rush to the outside world.","Once reaching the Emperor cultivation realm, they could leave.","Even the weakest would not contribute much to the situation outside.","Now, most of the strong beings in the Heavenly Realm were merely avatars holding their ground.","The true selves had all ventured out.","Being able to repair the Origin Source was a tremendous opportunity, and everyone wished to seize it.","So much so that as Jian Wushuang soared through the skies, he didn’t encounter a single Emperor.","All were just avatars.","In the past, even if the Heavenly Realm were peaceful, there would likely be a few arrogant demonic Emperors. Now, it seemed that these individuals had all gone to the temporal river.","It was like a bird whose wings were suddenly healed after being broken, and it was released from its cage.","Jian Wushuang felt the same way now.","He also wanted to go out and explore.","To the west, the Mahayana Spirit Mountain!","It was right in front of him.","On the majestic golden mountain, faint Buddhist chants echoed, and golden light shimmered.","As Jian Wushuang approached the mountain gate, he stopped.","After all, he was seeking help, and it wouldn’t do to be disrespectful.","“I am Jian Wushuang, coming to pay my respects to the mountain!” Jian Wushuang clasped his fists, his face filled with goodwill.","The guardians of the mountain gate were only two young novices, but in the external world, this was the greatest benevolence.","One of the novices, spotless and pure, took a step forward to Jian Wushuang. With hands joined together and a slight bow, he spoke, “Kind sir, please wait a moment!”","“Thank you!” Jian Wushuang clasped his hands together, returning the courtesy.","On the Mahayana Spirit Mountain.","In a quaint backyard, several bodhi trees outlined the appearance of an ordinary worldly setting. A powerful spiritual practitioner residing in this place sat cross-legged under one of the bodhi trees, immersed in deep meditation.","As Jian Wushuang arrived, the bodhi prayer beads in the practitioner’s hand suddenly came to a halt.","Meanwhile, a voice echoed from outside.","“Elder Miaoyi, the Master requests your presence!”","The bald woman sitting in meditation under the bodhi tree was none other than Gong Miaoyi.","Since her release by the Elder Palace, she had come to the Mahayana Spirit Mountain and chosen to immerse herself in the Buddhist teachings, paying no attention to the outside world.","Jian Wushuang had become her inner demon, to the extent that even after an entire era, she had not completely eradicated him.","Now, with Jian Wushuang’s arrival and the Mountain Master of the Mahayana Spirit Mountain summoning her, today might be the best opportunity to bring closure.","Compared to her past ruthlessness, Gong Miaoyi had transcended the ordinary and truly detached herself from worldly grievances.","Although sensing Jian Wushuang’s aura still made her somewhat uncomfortable, she could approach it with equanimity.","After the fall of Nie Yuan, not to mention Jian Wushuang’s presence, merely hearing his name would drive her into a frenzy, wanting desperately to kill Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":5610,"title":"Chapter 5610: Qianxing Buddha","paragraphs":["Chapter 5610: Qianxing Buddha","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Deep within the Spirit Mountain.","Buddha fruits stood in abundance, each occupant an Emperor, with the weakest among them being at the peak-level tier 4.","In the Mahayana Spirit Mountain, only those who achieved the supreme-peak were entitled to be called Buddha Lords.","Currently, the Spirit Mountain boasted three Buddha Lords.","In other words, there were three supreme-peak experts, solidifying their dominance over the Western Region.","In the Northern Region, no faction possessed three supreme-peak experts simultaneously.","The Western Region, compared to the Northern Region, was significantly more powerful.","In the Spirit Mountain Hall, atop the main seat, Qianxing Buddha Lord, adorned in a robe of a thousand stars, with a benevolent expression, was explaining the profound mysteries of the three thousand Buddhas to the Buddhas below.","The arrival of Jian Wushuang caused a slight upward twitch of his eyebrows.","Most of the formidable figures from the Four Great Secret Realms had ventured into the external temporal river, leaving none of the supreme-peak experts of the Mahayana Spirit Mountain to emerge.","All things have their destined causes.","This was the last sentence Qianxing Buddha Lord spoke to the assembly, and it was also directed at those strong-willed individuals anxious to enter the temporal river.","Now that the causes and effects had arrived, the Mahayana Spirit Mountain was about to relocate into the temporal river.","Jian Wushuang was one of those causes.","“Pu Shi, go and welcome our distinguished guest. I’ll be waiting for you under the Guti Tree!” Qianxing Buddha said, and his figure faintly disappeared.","At the same time, Qianxing Buddha also informed Gong Miaoyi.","The implication was clear.","Upon receiving the order, Pu Shi Bodhisattva descended calmly towards the foot of the Spirit Mountain.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang remained patiently waiting.","This visit was twofold: to resolve the karmic calamity and to acquire the Heart of the Beast God.","Once the karmic calamity was lifted, Jian Wushuang could directly merge with the Dao.","Obtaining the Heart of the Beast God would not only enhance his Beast God Weapon to its perfect form but also become one of his strongest treasures after becoming an Emperor.","In the early days of Dao Lord, he relied on the Beast God Weapon to dominate the four corners.","It could be said that without the Beast God Weapon, he wouldn’t be where he is today.","The Beast God Weapon not only elevated his divine body but also enhanced his comprehension of space.","And he possessed his own domain, though not as vast as the One Thought Universe with a single thought, it consumed very little, and he could instantly form a small-scale Beast God Domain, unleashing the power of madness, enhancing his combat strength in close-quarters battles.","This extraordinary treasure must be obtained.","Of course, he wouldn’t resort to robbery; it would be best if it could be negotiated.","He had quite a few treasures on him right now, including one-third of the Origin Source of All Things, enough to exchange for the Beast God Heart.","Although the individual Heart of the Beast God was the strongest component of the Beast God Candle Dragon, its power, no matter how formidable, was still inferior to the Universe Treasure.","At most, it could rival top-tier Eternal Treasures.","If possible, he was willing to offer ten top-tier Eternal Treasures for the exchange.","“Kind sir, my Buddha Lord invites you!” The arriving Pu Shi Bodhisattva was very polite, bowing slightly to welcome Jian Wushuang.","Pu Shi was indeed a genuine tier 6 Emperor.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang also slightly returned the gesture of respect and followed behind, entering the Mahayana Spirit Mountain.","After stepping in, the sound of Buddhist chants brought a sense of liberation to his soul, making him quite comfortable.","This Spirit Mountain was truly extraordinary.","No wonder resolving karmic calamities required the Buddhist path.","Following Pu Shi Bodhisattva, Jian Wushuang felt that the latter’s pace was neither fast nor slow. As a guest, he didn’t want to say much, so he took the opportunity to inquire about the matters concerning the Spirit Mountain.","According to Jian Wushuang’s knowledge, Mahayana Spirit Mountain, like many other ancient sites, was a Dao Arena of a Universe Master from ancient times.","However, the Universe Master’s universe had already perished, and the mountain was then placed within the Four Great Secret Realms.","Subsequent inheritances, as universally mentioned, involved cultivating one’s body and spirit within the Four Great Secret Realms, with countless epochs passing without much commotion.","Few powerful beings emerged into the world, and they remained low-key.","Jian Wushuang nodded, recalling that Gong Miaoyi was also in this place. He inquired about Gong Miaoyi from Pu Shi, who paused upon hearing her name and replied, “Miaoyi Shanshi is a guest of our master, who arrived at the Spirit Mountain for cultivation a millennium ago.”","“How is she now?” Jian Wushuang pursued.","Pu Shi answered cautiously, “All is well.”","“That’s good,” Jian Wushuang said indifferently. “Since we have some friendship, I won’t disturb her during her cultivation.”","Originally, he intended to meet her, especially after inheriting her father’s legacy. However, upon arriving, he felt a bit guilty towards Gong Miaoyi, deciding it would be better not to meet her in person and instead send some treasures through someone else.","The two walked along the spacious Arhat Avenue and entered deeper into the mountain.","The Guti Tree was a long-standing tree on the Spirit Mountain, where only three Buddhas were qualified to cultivate.","Very few people usually came to this place.","It was rumored that this Guti Tree could allow one to cultivate a second primordial spirit, but it remained just a rumor; no one had truly achieved it to date.","However, the information about this tree was tightly controlled by the three Buddha Lords, and very little was known about it in the outside world.","Jian Wushuang didn’t expect that he would be invited to this place, giving him some confidence. It seemed that this time would go smoothly.","“In the presence of the venerable, Jian Wushuang pays respects to Qianxing Buddha Lord!” The other party, a Dao Lord at the supreme-peak, naturally deserved the courtesy of a junior.","Jian Wushuang joined his hands and bowed, showing great respect.","Qianxing Buddha, with smiling eyes, calmly spoke, “A virtuous person is not constrained, please have a seat!”","With a slight gesture, a cushion flies to the opposite side of the Lord of a Thousand Stars.","Jian Wushuang approached slowly and sat cross-legged.","“Friend Wushuang, truly extraordinary!” Qianxing Buddha personally poured tea for Jian Wushuang and continued, “I’ve only heard about it before, but seeing it today, it seems your strength surpasses the rumors!”","Jian Wushuang lifts the teacup, took a sip, and modestly said, “Buddha Lord, your praise is too generous!”","His current strength was indeed a level higher than before, but he maintained a humble attitude.","After some courtesy, Jian Wushuang got straight to the point and discussed the purpose of his visit.","The two purposes were quite simple.","To lift the karmic calamity and obtain the Heart of the Beast God.","Quanxing Buddha set down his teacup, hands tucked into his kasaya, and said, “I am aware of the virtuous one’s karmic calamity, which is not difficult for me. However, the virtuous one will have to undergo significant torment, and I wonder...”","“No problem!” Jian Wushuang interrupted.","Torment was something he had encountered before; he truly didn’t mind.","“Very well, since it’s the case, once the virtuous one’s karmic calamity is lifted, the Heart of the Beast God will be presented as well!” Quanxing Buddha generously agreed.","Jian Wushuang was also delighted; he didn’t expect things to go so smoothly. He was afraid of making the situation unpleasant, considering he was seeking someone else’s help.","“I have two treasures here. They are of little use to me, but they are exceptional for the Buddhist path,” Jian Wushuang said, taking out two wooden boxes from his sleeve.","These treasures were purchased at a great cost from the temple. Passing by the temple headquarters, he happened to encounter Guangmu Tianzun, who gave some guidance. As a result, he acquired these two priceless items."]},{"number":5611,"title":"Chapter 5611: Seeing Gong Miaoyi Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 5611: Seeing Gong Miaoyi Again","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It took a whopping 100,000 universe crystals.","Even Mahayana Spirit Mountain, with its ancient heritage, likely had very few cosmos crystals stored on the mountain.","Even with 100,000, there was nowhere to buy such treasures.","One item was the Bodhi bracelet, an essential item for the Buddhist sect, almost everyone had one.","But the one in Jian Wushuang’s hands was extraordinary.","It was obtained in ancient times when a Divine Master under the command of Qishen went to other temporal rivers and killed a demon monk.","The demonic aura within had long been cleared, leaving only the power of Buddhism, its might comparable to Universe Treasures.","Another item was prepared specifically for Qianxing Buddha, a relic formed from the remains of a Universe Master after their transcendence.","This item was of immeasurable help to Qianxing.","Now that Zhen Ling could help them restore their Origin Source, and with the Origin Source complete, they naturally wanted to advance further and reach the realm of Tribulation.","This relic could help Qianxing shorten that process.","In the Buddhist sect, no one would refuse a relic!","Despite Qianxing’s repeated reluctance, he eventually accepted it into his embrace.","Both sides exchanged smiles.","Meanwhile, Gong Miaoyi was also brought to the Guti Tree by someone.","As soon as that aura appeared, Jian Wushuang’s expression froze.","For a moment, he didn’t understand what the other party meant. He came to lift the karmic calamity, invited Gong Miaoyi to come over, so wasn’t he intentionally causing trouble?","However, since the other party had invited him, he naturally didn’t dare to be neglectful.","When Jian Wushuang noticed that Gong Miaoyi’s expression wasn’t pleasant, he felt awkward. Standing up, he could only politely greet her, “Daoist Miaoyi, how have you been lately?”","“Thanks to your blessings, everything is fine!” Gong Miaoyi only showed a slight smile, giving a perfunctory response.","At this moment, Qianxing stood up and took on the role of peacemaker. After he spoke, Jian Wushuang understood why Gong Miaoyi had come.","As it turned out, when the karmic calamity needed to be resolved, one had to enter the ancient formation inside Mahayana Spirit Mountain. And to preside over the formation, they needed someone familiar with Jian Wushuang’s karmic ties – Gong Miaoyi was the perfect candidate.","Realizing this, Jian Wushuang remained composed. He followed Qianxing towards the large formation inside the Spirit Mountain.","On the way, he walked side by side with Gong Miaoyi, and they did not exchange words because both harbored secrets.","In Jian Wushuang’s heart, there was a sense of unease.","This time, he felt like someone was plotting against him.","How could it be so coincidental?","He came to Mahayana Spirit Mountain to resolve his karmic calamity, but Gong Miaoyi had entered the mountain in advance.","Could there be someone manipulating things behind the scenes?","Naturally, he was worried about Mie Sheng.","Jian Wushuang communicated directly with Zhen Ling through the close-range board provided by Qishen Temple, but there was no response from the other side, causing a momentary disturbance in his heart.","“No, I need to steady myself first!” Jian Wushuang forcibly suppressed his concerns.","It was the time to resolve his karmic calamity, and if he panicked, he might not need anyone else’s schemes; he would ruin himself.","“We’re here!” Qianxing Buddha stopped and pointed to a cave, saying, “Inside is the core of the formation. Daoist Miaoyi, you only need to preside over the formation outside the cave!”","Upon hearing this, Gong Miaoyi didn’t linger; she went straight to the cave, sat cross-legged at the entrance, and several flags appeared in front of her – the central part of the formation.","Although Jian Wushuang had some doubts in his heart, he still entered with determination.","However, before going in, he directly displayed the ancient transformation, reaching the peak of his strength.","If he were to make a move now, probably no one in Mahayana Spirit Mountain would survive.","Before entering, he first smiled friendly at Qianxing and then looked at Gong Miaoyi, saying, “I feel guilty about Nie Yuan’s death. Since I have inherited your father’s swordsmanship, I will vindicate him in the future.”","After hearing this, there was a noticeable change in Gong Miaoyi’s expression, but she did not respond to what Jian Wushuang had just said.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t surprised, and he directly walked into the cave.","After he entered the cave, Qianxing Buddha revealed a subtly imperceptible smile, and a Thought power transmitted the message that Jian Wushuang had entered the formation through the Buddhist beads in his hand.","However, it is unknown who received this message.","As for Jian Wushuang, once inside the cave, it was pitch black all around, and nothing could be seen.","As he walked forward, he felt increasingly uneasy.","He forgot to inform Zhen Ling when he came.","Perhaps he was too careless, thinking that after his strength underwent another transformation, these Four Great Secret Realms could no longer threaten his existence.","Or maybe before entering this place, he should have asked Qianxing what abilities the formation inside possessed to eliminate his karmic calamity.","Now he was confused and could only keep walking forward.","“Light!”","As Jian Wushuang walked, he saw a light in front of him. His heart moved, as if he had grasped something. In the dark space around him, seeing a spot of light naturally meant catching hope.","“Go!”","He quickened his pace, wanting to reach the source of the light as soon as possible.","However fast he walked, the light remained in place, and he couldn’t reach it at all.","“Something’s wrong!” Jian Wushuang shook his head. The light was not in the spatial realm here.","His spatial realm had already reached the level of a black hole, and his vision was naturally penetrating. Just a moment of panic caused him to forget.","This made him stop, close his eyes, no longer relying on his physical eyes, but using the Origin Source of Space to comprehend the spatial characteristics of this place.","In the segmented ninth-dimensional space, surrounded by celestial bodies, Jian Wushuang appeared as a black hole.","“Turns out it’s here!” A faint smile graced Jian Wushuang’s face as he took a step and directly reached the source of light.","The surrounding darkness instantly vanished, swallowed by the light.","Jian Wushuang emerged from the mountain cave!","He looked around, surprised by the outside world’s gaze.","“Why are you out again?” Gong Miaoyi exclaimed in surprise!","Qianxing Buddha, who had been waiting on the side, was equally astonished and spoke, “Kind sir, how did you return so quickly!”","Jian Wushuang was even more surprised. How come the location of the light source was the entrance he came from?","He had entered the cave mansion for almost a day, and after all the twists and turns, he unexpectedly came out again.","“No!” Jian Wushuang suddenly shook his head.","He couldn’t sense the killing intent brought about by causality in his body anymore.","The karma killing calamity had been lifted!","He actually lifted the karma killing calamity just like that!","This seemed too simple.","Qianxing Buddha walked over, his face filled with joy, and congratulated, “Congratulations, Daoist Wushuang, the karma killing calamity has been lifted!”","“Is it that easy?” Gong Miaoyi, sitting cross-legged at the entrance of the cave, was somewhat puzzled.","Jian Wushuang also found it unbelievable, but now it had indeed come to an end.","With the karma killing calamity gone, he felt incredibly relaxed and could proceed with the Dao fusion.","In joy, Jian Wushuang let go of everything.","He was about to integrate the Dao and soon become an Emperor!","The road to the peak was getting closer and closer.","With the karma killing calamity lifted, he had no reason to stay here. After obtaining the Beast God Heart, Jian Wushuang directly took the teleportation array inside the Mahayana Spirit Mountain and headed to the central region of the Heavenly Realm, the headquarters of the Divine Temple."]},{"number":5612,"title":"Chapter 5612: Changes","paragraphs":["Chapter 5612: Changes","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The next target, Grave God Mountain!","Depart!","But when he arrived at the headquarters of the Divine Temple, he found many Emperors gathered there. Their expressions were extremely solemn, and Guangmu Tianzun personally led the team.","“Brother Guangmu, where are you all heading?” Jian Wushuang noticed that these emperor powerhouses were all Inheritors, with no indigenous Emperors among them.","Most of these Inheritors were at the tier 4 level, with a few at tier 5, and only one at the tier 6.","Clearly, these Inheritors were rising talents.","When Guangmu Tianzun saw Jian Wushuang with a solemn expression, he sighed and said, “Mo Jun has appeared, joining forces with the Temple of World Annihilation. They are launching a major attack on the universe controlled by the Qishen Temple. The external war is escalating, and our manpower is somewhat insufficient. We can only let these Inheritors go first!”","Mo Jun has appeared!","Jian Wushuang’s face trembled, exclaiming, “How can this happen so quickly? Wasn’t it supposed to take several epochs?”","“That was just a speculation. It’s also possible that the powerhouses of the Temple of World Annihilation took action secretly and released Mo Jun ahead of schedule!” Guangmu Tianzun replied.","Before they could say much, a majestic voice descended.","It was Zhen Ling!","The avatar of Zhen Ling descended, taking these Inheritors away from the Qishen Temple.","Seeing Jian Wushuang also present and the karmic calamity already resolved, Zhen Ling spoke, “Jian Wushuang, seize the time to integrate the Dao. This time, Mie Sheng has come for you!”","After saying this, Zhen Ling and the group disappeared through the teleportation array.","Leaving Jian Wushuang alone in the original place.","He hadn’t expected the war to come so soon.","For a moment, he didn’t know where to go.","After a brief consideration, Jian Wushuang was about to head to the God’s Tomb Secret Realm to prepare for the Dao Merge on Grave God Mountain.","However, suddenly, everything darkened in front of him, and his figure seemed to disappear.","Everything turned into darkness.","Countless memories flooded into his mind.","Had he integrated the Dao?","No!","He was currently in the midst of the Dao Merge!","“What is this?” Jian Wushuang was completely at a loss.","He had been in the Heavenly Realm just a moment ago, and the next moment, he was in a secret chamber, integrating the Dao.","And his Spatial Origin Source had actually reached the pinnacle of the black hole realm, currently devouring the Sword Dao and Extreme Dao Sea.","A massive cosmic diagram was expanding.","He was about to succeed in the Dao Merge.","A vast force surged into his body, a power surpassing the supreme-peak.","“Dao Merge!”","Jian Wushuang acted uncontrollably.","Although he didn’t know exactly what was happening, he was constantly paying attention to the method of Dao Merge.","The black hole swallowed the Sword Dao and integrated with the Extreme Dao.","Finally, it ascended to the cosmic space.","In one step, he reached the perfect state of the supreme-peak.","Just one step away from the Tribulation realm.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t even had a chance to be happy when everything in front of him turned black again.","This time, he didn’t know how long he had been asleep. When he woke up, he felt exhausted and in pain all over his body.","The Dao Merge had failed.","The cosmic space shattered, and within his Origin Source Sea, several rounds of scorching dark light balls rose, continuously destroying his Origin Source.","This time, Jian Wushuang found that he could control his body.","“What’s going on?” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened. A sudden merging and an abrupt failure.","He clearly didn’t do anything!","Why did the Dao Merge fail?","He was unwilling!","If the Dao Merge failed, it meant that for the rest of his life, he would be unable to move a step and could only stay in this place.","Not only that, his power would be constrained, and he would have to endure the backlash of suppressing the Origin Source Sea, or else he would fall.","Although the Dao Merge failed, he had mastered the cosmic space.","Cosmic secret techniques, after merging the dao, naturally reached the Mahayana realm.","Perfect supreme-peak.","But there was no vitality!","“Vitality!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered as he suddenly thought of something.","Since leaving Mahayana Spirit Mountain, it seemed like he had never felt the power of Life.","The problem must lie in Mahayana Spirit Mountain.","Dragging his weary body, Jian Wushuang stood up directly.","He wanted to see where he was now.","The heavy black stone door swung open as he pushed it, and a beam of light hit his face.","The outside world’s glaring light became apparent—it was a secluded valley.","But it was no ordinary valley.","Looking at the distant river in the sky, Jian Wushuang found himself within the temporal river.","This place wasn’t the Qishen Temple, nor the Original Universe; it was the temporal river.","Boom!!!","Kill, kill, kill!!!","The once quiet valley was instantly obliterated. Overwhelming murderous intent descended, rocks shattered, and countless massive dust clouds rose, shrouding the sky like an apocalyptic scene.","“It’s people from the Temple of World Annihilation, run!”","Several Emperors flew out from the mountain caves, each brandishing their treasures, ready to face the impending battle.","Gigantic halls, treasures beyond measure, shifted from the void.","Countless powerful beings arrived in an instant.","Jian Wushuang’s heart stirred, but he couldn’t care less. He unsheathed his sword directly.","“Wushuang, why haven’t you left yet!” The speaker was familiar to Jian Wushuang, Emperor Dongsheng.","At this moment, Dongsheng had become a supreme-peak powerhouse.","Leading several tier 6 Emperors, he confronted the flying palaces. Seeing Jian Wushuang, he angrily shouted, “Hurry, don’t let Mie Sheng find you. Otherwise, this temporal river will truly be finished!”","Mie Sheng!","“Do you know Mie Sheng?” Jian Wushuang asked in surprise.","Shouldn’t this information be concealed?","It seemed that the situation had reached the brink of collapse, or rather, the Qishen Temple had already collapsed, and they were merely resisting desperately.","“This must be a dream!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","He couldn’t believe it, nor did he want to.","In the previous moment, he had just left Mahayana Spirit Mountain. How did he suddenly find himself in the temporal river, and why did his merging with the Dao fail?","“Dongsheng, where is Zhen Ling? Where did Shang, Hu Qing, and the others go?” Jian Wushuang, though skeptical of the reality of this world, couldn’t resist inquiring about the current state of the temporal river.","Dongsheng’s eyes were filled with passion, his lips trembling, “They’re all dead. They died for the Original Universe, for you. You must survive!”","After saying this, a hand knife directly slashed at Jian Wushuang’s neck, and he once again blacked out and fainted.","Meanwhile, in the Temple of World Annihilation, the robust and domineering Broly sat on the throne.","“Report!”","“Jian Wushuang has been found, in the Infinite Valley!”","“Move out!”","Originally, only a small team of Temple of World Annihilation’s powerhouses appeared above the Infinite Valley.","Now, the terrifying Broly personally took action, leading countless troops, sweeping towards the valley once again.","At this moment in the temporal river, living beings were in misery, and countless universes were completely desolate.","Shan Jun had merged with the Four Devouring Demons, restoring the power of the ancient True Lord.","Mo Jun had long broken free from the restrictions, beginning to devour numerous universes to compensate for his lost strength.","The most powerful Gu Jun had yet to join the battle.","Just these three True Monarch made it impossible for the Qishen Temple to resist.","Not to mention Mie Sheng.","This temporal river was ultimately heading towards destruction."]},{"number":5613,"title":"Chapter 5613 Future World","paragraphs":["Chapter 5613 Future World","At some unknown moment, Jian Wushuang felt a pain in his neck and woke up.","....","At that moment, he was lying on a soft bed.","“You’re awake!” A somewhat familiar voice made Jian Wushuang struggle to open his eyes.","With some disbelief at the person before him, he overcame his body’s fatigue and sat up directly, staring at the woman in front of him, saying, “How can it be you?”","“Have you forgotten your promise back then?” The woman said and then disappeared.","Promise!","Yes!","He seemed to have made a promise to an ordinary woman on Demon Sound Mountain.","Jian Wushuang just remembered, but the other party had already disappeared.","Phew!","Now he fully understood.","This place is definitely not real, or perhaps it is real.","It’s just different from what happened in his original time and space.","“I should be on Mahayana Spirit Mountain now!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes were determined.","As for the current time and space, it should be in the future.","In the future, he failed in the Dao Merge.","He embarked on the road of no return.","The Temple of World Annihilation really carried out the act of world annihilation.","“Senior Wushuang!” a shout made Jian Wushuang open his eyes again.","This time, Jian Wushuang was not surprised. Seeing the young man with dark skin and a lean body in front of him, he calmly said, “Xin Jiu!”","It was the wandering cultivator he encountered in the Human Realm. Just as he saw at that time, Xin Jiu’s potential was enormous, and now he had become a supreme-peak powerhouse.","“Where are we going?” Jian Wushuang quickly immersed himself in this new world, not dwelling on past matters.","Living in the present, he didn’t understand why he found himself in a future time, but regardless of where he was, he was determined to step onto the boundless path.","He had to traverse the path of the strong.","Xin Jiuduan lifted a bowl of water, handed it to Jian Wushuang, and said, “The Infinite Valley has been destroyed. We are heading to the Demon Sound Mountain now. It is still intact, and Divine General Moyin will be alive. We can resist for a while there.”","“Good!” Jian Wushuang nodded, stabilized his breath after taking a sip of water.","After briefly familiarizing himself with his body, he realized that his current strength was hundreds of times more powerful than before merging with the Dao, but he couldn’t sustain prolonged battles at the moment, or he would fall.","“Xin Jiu, I need to ask you, how did Qishen Temple perish?” Jian Wushuang voiced the doubts in his heart.","He needed to understand why Qishen Temple in the future timeline suddenly collapsed.","Xin Jiu lowered his head, furrowing his brows, reluctant to bring it up.","“Speak, I can handle it!” Jian Wushuang’s absorbed memories were fragmented, and he had no recollection of the destruction of Qishen Temple in the future timeline.","“It was Lord Zhen Ling!” Xin Jiu’s eyes held back tears, struggling to say, “Lord Zhen Ling, with his own hands, destroyed Qishen Temple!”","“Before the collapse of Qishen Temple, Lord Zhen Ling moved everyone to the temporal river!”","Jian Wushuang was completely stunned!","The water bowl in his hand fell, making a crisp sound, and only then did Jian Wushuang regain his composure.","Zhen Ling destroyed Qishen Temple.","This was truly unexpected.","If the future timeline deviated from his original timeline, it shouldn’t be Zhen Ling destroying Qishen Temple!","Could it be?","Jian Wushuang suddenly thought of something.","Mie Sheng, in the beginning, had the freedom to come and go at Qishen Temple, perhaps understanding it even more than Zhen Ling.","The other’s identity was mysterious, likely connected to the Qishen of the past.","Behind all this, it was probably the Qishen of the past who set up this chessboard.","In the future timeline, Zhen Ling, for the grand plan of Qishen, chose to abandon Qishen Temple.","After realizing this, Jian Wushuang took a slow, deep breath.","The arrival of Qishen Temple brought him endless opportunities and countless illusions.","Now it was time to break through all of this.","“Xin Jiu, I’m sorry!” The determination in Jian Wushuang’s eyes intensified, and his aura suddenly reached its peak.","In the future, the Eternal Ancient Transformation was even stronger!","Now, he probably could rival the Tribulation realm.","With just one punch, he knocked out Xin Jiu, a formidable supreme-peak expert.","The revelation of his aura attracted many people rushing in.","“Wushuang, what are you doing!” The first to rush in was Ji Chaoyang. As an Ultimate Emperor, he was considered the leader this time, and his strength was extremely powerful, already a perfect supreme-peak expert, not inferior to the Divine General Moyin.","Jian Wushuang walked forward slowly, his voice cold and stern, “Doing what I must do!”","“What nonsense are you talking about? Mie Sheng has suppressed his strength to supreme-peak to devour you. Going alone means certain death. As long as you’re alive, we still have a chance!” Ji Chaoyang shouted in anger.","Jian Wushuang raised his hand, exerting a slight force, and said, “I’ve long lost the power of Life. You don’t need to worry about me being devoured!”","For some unknown reason, when he arrived in the future timeline, he unexpectedly lost the power of Life.","Ji Chaoyang was also startled. Although he knew little about Mie Sheng, he understood that the other party came for the Life power inside Jian Wushuang.","Now Jian Wushuang indeed had no Life power.","They had been guarding Jian Wushuang, knowing well that they could have killed him, but no one dared to make that move. Moreover, they had lost hope long ago.","Mie Sheng had nearly destroyed the entire river of time and space. They protected Jian Wushuang only to prevent Mie Sheng from devouring him.","“During this time, thank you all. Please allow me a dignified farewell!” Jian Wushuang slightly bowed to the approaching crowd.","In reality, there was no need for them to protect him. They could have simply killed him, but that would have infuriated Mie Sheng.","However, they chose to guard him.","Initially, the one-third of the Origin Source of All Things was not wasted at all.","At least, it led these people to choose to protect him.","They guarded the Original Universe, guarding the current temporal river.","“Jian Wushuang!”","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang rushed out of the flying hall and entered the river of time and space.","He was heading back to the Infinite Valley.","A great battle was still raging there.","Boom!","Jian Wushuang spared no effort, unleashing his full power, transforming into a stream of light flying towards the Infinite Valley.","Since the Dao Merge had failed, and the Life power was gone, he felt like a discarded chess piece, with nothing worth reminiscing about.","Better to die in battle.","“The future world is truly desolate!” Everywhere Jian Wushuang passed, many temporal secrets turned into ashes.","Just after flying for a quarter of an hour, he felt the power in his body gradually decreasing, and the backlash made him suffer immensely.","Qianxing Buddha’s words were right from the start; it was indeed a tremendous torment.","Watching his hometown perish and enduring the torment of the failed the Dao Merge.","He was a very strong-willed person.","A person who would go to any lengths to become stronger. The difficulties he faced in refining his physical body back then were unimaginable, and he never retreated.","Now, facing the failure of the Dao Merge, how could he accept it?","Infinite Valley!","Dongsheng, along with a few tier 6 Emperors, resisted hundreds of tier 6 Emperors and dozens of supreme-peak experts, including Ultimate Emperors.","“Haha, they managed to escape. Today, my death wasn’t in vain!” Dongsheng laughed wildly, shaking his finger. At the tip of his finger burst forth the last glimmer of the Origin Source within him."]},{"number":5614,"title":"Chapter 5614 No Regrets","paragraphs":["Chapter 5614 No Regrets","“Die!”","....","Dongsheng’s face twisted with ferocity as he chose to exchange lives with the supreme-peak warrior he engaged in combat with.","The other tier 6 Emperors did the same.","They embraced death generously!","These once-mighty warriors, now for the sake of their homeland and the temporal river, each chose to meet their demise.","Jian Wushuang, millions of miles away, felt the fall of each blazing star, and a sense of desolation settled in his heart.","The future’s misery, to a large extent, was because of his power of Life.","Of course, Zhen Ling also played a part.","The Qishen Temple brought them hope, only to personally destroy that hope.","Originally, this temporal river should have led to prosperity.","It was the aspiration of countless people from the beginning.","The conflict between the two temples not only influenced the course of this temporal river but also destroyed it.","“How dare you!”","Jian Wushuang erupted again, a stream of light instantly descended onto the battlefield.","His robe fluttered, but there was not a hint of color on Jian Wushuang’s face.","Once glorious, now in utter ruin.","“Jian Wushuang?”","A leading supreme-peak warrior walked out from the crowd, overjoyed to see Jian Wushuang returning once again.","“Capture Jian Wushuang alive and reward a million universe crystals!”","Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow and sneered, “Is my life only worth a million universe crystals?”","In an instant!","Memories surged in his mind.","After his failed attempt at merging with the Dao, he never made a move again. Day after day, he languished in frustration, his entire being rendered useless.","This was the first time he took action since his failure in the Dao Merge.","It seemed like many had forgotten the extent of his past strength.","“One Thought...”","Jian Wushuang, hands forming a seal, his Thought power now weak. Only with the aid of a secret technique could he unleash the power of the One Thought Universe.","“Universe!”","Whoosh!","This time, it was a genuine universe.","An elliptical universe, like a bubble, centered around Jian Wushuang, instantly covering the entire Infinite Valley.","“This is the One Thought Universe. Be cautious, everyone!” The leader warned, clearly familiar with Jian Wushuang.","They were all formidable beings in the temporal river, having pledged allegiance to the Temple of World Annihilation.","They knew Jian Wushuang well.","The One Thought Universe was also one of Jian Wushuang’s most proficient pinnacle techniques.","How could they not know?","“You all will die!”","Jian Wushuang endured the backlash from the Origin Source, and instantly made a move.","The One Thought Universe, combined with his Eternal Ancient Transformation, unleashed a power comparable to the Tribulation realm.","At this moment, he might not be as formidable as the legendary Emperor Jueyun, but the difference wasn’t significant.","Even if a Tribulation realm powerhouse descended, he was confident to face him.","However, no Tribulation realm powerhouses appeared from either temple.","Although two of the three True Monarchs personally took action, they did not intervene again after the fall of the Qishen Temple.","Whether they made a pact with Zhen Ling or for some other reason, it remained unknown.","As for Mie Sheng, as mentioned by Ji Chaoyang, he sacrificed his realm to devour Jian Wushuang and now stood at the supreme-peak, unmatched in terms of combat strength.","Slaughter!!!","Hundreds of tier 6 Emperors, forming an array on the periphery, sought to restrain Jian Wushuang.","All engaged in the battle were supreme-peak experts, dozens of them besieging Jian Wushuang.","In the eyes of these people, today, Jian Wushuang was undoubtedly going to be captured alive.","“Tsk tsk, it seems you all really forgot!”","Jian Wushuang teleported in an instant, directly escaping the encirclement.","His figure appeared on the outskirts, throwing a punch that instantly shattered the array formed by hundreds of tier 6 Emperors.","All the tier 6 Emperors fell.","It was just one punch.","“You!”","Before those supreme-peak experts could react, Jian Wushuang, like a ghost, struck again.","This time, his strength was even stronger.","The future Beast God Armor was now complete, and its eruptive power was a thousand times greater than before.","Just the enhancement of the divine body alone made Jian Wushuang marvel.","Unfortunately, after failing in the Dao Merge, he became too disheartened and never upgraded his divine body.","The current basic divine body was still 50,000-fold, like before the Dao Merge.","Combined with the amplification of the Beast God Armor, it had already reached 80,000-fold.","So, he didn’t need to draw his sword; he could instantly kill those supreme-peak experts.","In just a breath, blood-red raindrops began to fall from the sky.","Emperor’s Fall!","Bathed in the blood-red rain, Jian Wushuang was extremely excited.","Having completely merged with his future self, he felt relieved.","After suppressing for such a long time, he finally had an outburst.","“Jian Wushuang!”","A roar came from afar.","The next moment, Jian Wushuang saw the newcomers.","A dense crowd, tens of thousands in number.","The weakest were tier 6 Emperors.","Among them were over a hundred supreme-peak experts alone.","Jian Wushuang forgot to ask how much time had passed since he tried the Dao Merge.","Why were tier 6 Emperors so worthless, and why were supreme-peak experts so undervalued?","Not a single one from the Tribulation realm, which didn’t make sense!","“Broly!”","In the heart of numerous grand halls, a robust figure sat on a towering throne – it was none other than Broly.","At this moment, Broly had already reached the pinnacle of supreme-peak, the undisputed top expert of the Temple of World Annihilation.","As for his future, it remained uncertain, but in the timeline he currently occupied, Brolly was the one who had slain the old man with goat horns.","It seemed revenge would be sought in the future.","The two exchanged a glance, no words exchanged.","Instantly, they moved!","The supreme-peak expert of the Temple of World Annihilation.","A transcendent master of the Transformation Dao.","At the pinnacle of supreme-peak.","Jian Wushuang, however, remained calm. His thoughts mirrored his adversary’s – revenge was on the horizon.","Clang!","The Jueyun Sword!","“Power of the Starry Sky, long time no see!” A faint smile appeared on Jian Wushuang’s face.","After the failure of the Dao Merge, he feared that using this sword might lead to instant demise.","But there was nothing to regret.","After all, this was the future.","If he died, so be it.","If he truly perished, he would reappear at the Mahayana Spirit Mountain.","He would expend all the power he had in this life and all the opportunities in the future to exchange for a successful Dao Merge.","“Starry Sky Chronicles!”","The Jueyun Sword erupted, a slash cutting directly towards Broly.","Whether in the past or the future, Jian Wushuang had full confidence in this sword strike.","Because it had never let him down.","Broly, the top expert of the Temple of World Annihilation!","“Perish!” Jian Wushuang roared.","The Jueyun Sword completely cleaved Brolly into two halves. Starting from the blade, the surrounding space instantly solidified, revealing a vast starry sky atlas.","It was a scene of countless people!","Broly, cleaved in two, and tens of thousands frozen in place.","Oh, right!","There was Jian Wushuang too.","The sword, released from his hand, was frozen within the Starry Sky Chronicles before it even reached the ground.","This scene would be preserved indefinitely until the extinction of the Starry Sky.","The cruelty of the future!","The opportunities of the past!","Everything was relative.","Whew!","Jian Wushuang once again saw the light, but this time, he returned to the present.","“I knew it... is this the karmic killing calamity?” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but sigh, having experienced the brutality of the future world – the consequence of not cultivating diligently.","Sometimes, it wasn’t that he wanted to move forward; it was someone pushing him forward from behind.","To fall behind even slightly was a tribulation!","This karmic killing calamity was truly extraordinary.","After a long pause, he was still not entirely recovered from the experience."]},{"number":5615,"title":"Chapter 5615: Heart Demon","paragraphs":["Chapter 5615: Heart Demon","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The past, present, and future.","The details of which need not be elaborated, for his existence spanned only a few epochs, not yet reaching the point of dimmed eyes and forgotten past.","In the present, he was acutely aware, understanding the purpose he must pursue.","However, the future was a different story. The uncontrollable future filled him with despair.","The failure of the Dao Merge, the destruction of the Qishen Temple, and the impending annihilation of the entire temporal river.","The dreadfulness of Mie Sheng surpassed his imagination.","“I cannot fail!” Jian Wushuang’s expression was serious, the determination in his eyes as pure as his swordsmanship.","His future self had fallen, but his present self would not allow his future to become a pitiful sight.","He not only needed to succeed in the Dao Merge but also to slay anyone standing in his way.","Mie Sheng, a half-step into the realm of the Seven Tribulation realm!","Even Mie Sheng will not stop him.","Once he succeeded in the Dao Merge, he would choose to leave the Qishen Temple, departing from this spacetime.","At least, the current Zhen Ling could be trusted.","In the future, Zhen Ling would bring about the downfall of the Qishen Temple, perhaps due to some unforeseen circumstances.","Otherwise, with the nature of Zhen Ling, even if there was a certain connection between the Qishen and Mie Sheng, Zhen Ling would not surrender without a fight.","Because the birth of Zhen Ling and the inherited will were as unyielding as steel.","In the eyes of Zhen Ling, Qishen was a god, forsaking his own Dao for the sake of the Moro Spacetime, ultimately falling like a hero.","Certainly not a villain.","However, the truth revealed that the initial Qishen was probably, in fact, a villain, willing to destroy the entire Moro timeline for the sake of surviving a little longer.","Regardless of the circumstances, seizing the moment while Zhen Ling has not yet betrayed, Jian Wushuang needed to act quickly.","Bathed in radiance, Jian Wushuang entered a vast void.","This was a peculiar place within the temporal river.","“Moro Temporal River?” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly, his voice trembling, and his hands shaking.","This time, he saw the ancient Moro Temporal River.","It was a wide and majestic river.","Within the river flowed countless powerful beings and numerous universes.","As he carefully observed, a strange laughter interrupted Jian Wushuang.","“Hehe...”","Jian Wushuang turned to look, and a twisted and changing evil spirit was staring at him.","Countless ugly faces had two eyes each, staring fixedly at him.","“It’s you!”","Jian Wushuang looked at the grotesque evil spirit in surprise.","The evil spirit, with numerous lips torn apart, collectively emitted a hoarse voice, “Do you know me?”","“Heart Demon1!”","Jian Wushuang’s heart sank; indeed, he had been schemed against.","The Five Demon Lords: Shan Jun, Blood Demon, Ten-Thousand Demon, Heart Demon, and Wind Demon.","He had encountered two of the first three, and the remaining two, he hadn’t paid much attention to, only knowing that they were taken away by Mie Sheng.","Unexpectedly, the Heart Demon was now within him.","“Are you Mie Sheng or Heart Demon?” Jian Wushuang asked directly, without any ambiguity.","The probability was high that the other party was manipulated by Mie Sheng, just like Broly.","But what surprised Jian Wushuang was that this time, Heart Demon seemed to be stunned, as if it didn’t recognize Mie Sheng at all.","Splash!","Heart Demon transformed from the evil spirit in Jian Wushuang’s heart into a red-haired man, with an exceptionally beautiful face and flowing red hair.","“Mie Sheng? What’s that?”","Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief; not knowing Mie Sheng was a good thing.","Without Mie Sheng’s manipulation, even if the opponent was one of the Five Demons, he was not afraid.","“He is an extraordinary existence, too bad you don’t know him!”","Since the other party had no connection to Mie Sheng, Jian Wushuang could ease up and engage in conversation.","Why did this great Demon Lord choose to reside within him, and why did they completely merge with the karma calamity?","When did they set their sights on him?","The demonic voice, after hearing this, sneered arrogantly, “You, a little brat, understand what’s remarkable?”","“Do you know who my true self is?” The demonic voice seemed a bit arrogant, which didn’t quite match his name.","According to common sense, shouldn’t the demonic voice be his own greatest fear?","Why does the other party seem a bit foolish?","Jian Wushuang deliberately showed a curious expression and asked, “Oh! I really don’t know. Can you enlighten me on what is so remarkable?”","“The remarkable existence is right in front of you!” The demonic voice pinched his nose and continued, “Have you encountered Shan Jun or the Blood Demon? Do you know what sets me apart from those fools?”","“I don’t know!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","He increasingly felt that this guy must be crazy.","The demonic voice gloated, “Those fools only understand raw power, but they don’t know that the most powerful force in this world is the power of the Heart. The Heart power of the sixth level is even stronger than the cosmic space!”","“Really?” Jian Wushuang exclaimed, “Since that’s the case, why did you choose to reside in my body?”","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s confusion, a satisfied expression appeared on the demonic voice’s face.","“That’s the Heart power. You are my best host. I set my eyes on you when you entered the Qishen Temple. Only you can nurture my strongest intellect. Speaking of which, I have to thank you!” The demonic voice laughed maniacally.","When Jian Wushuang entered the Qishen Temple, he was targeted by the demonic voice. The karma calamity was actually quite ordinary, just a small tribulation for the universe and all things.","But with the addition of the demonic voice, this tribulation became formidable.","Moreover, the power of the current karma calamity had surpassed the scope of the Emperor and resembled more of a tribulation at the supreme-peak!","“So that’s how it is!” Jian Wushuang nodded. No wonder the stronger he became, the stronger the karma-killing calamity within his body became.","It turned out the demonic voice was behind it all.","Now that he knew the answer, he felt quite relaxed because, for him, this tribulation was not a bad thing.","Upon entering this spatial realm, his state of mind suddenly ascended. It was the power left behind by the Heart Demon. Drawing from this power, his Heart power subtly began to loosen.","The sixth level of the Heart power.","Complete Dao Heart!","This was an opportunity that one could hardly come across, let alone seek.","“What’s your plan for me next?” Jian Wushuang asked tentatively.","Although the strength of the Heart Demon was considerable, comparable to Shan Jun, it fell short when dealing with him in his current state.","If a direct confrontation were to occur, the Heart Demon wouldn’t stand a chance.","“What should I do? Of course, I’ll kill you!” The complexion of the Heart Demon changed, and he gathered immense Heart power in his hands, captivating the soul.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed. With the means to counteract, he covered his chest with his palm, trembling as he said, “How could you possibly...”","“How... could you be so weak!” Jian Wushuang instantly restored to his peak, straightening his body.","The methods of the Heart Demon were utterly incapable of threatening him.","This time, it was the Heart Demon who was shocked.","He stared at Jian Wushuang in terror, unable to believe it. “How is this possible?”","In his eyes, Jian Wushuang’s Heart power was only at the fifth level, far from achieving the complete Dao Heart. How could he withstand the power of the Heart Demon?"]},{"number":5616,"title":"Chapter 5616: Perfected Dao Heart","paragraphs":["Chapter 5616: Perfected Dao Heart","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“What’s impossible? Your power has no effect on me.” Jian Wushuang’s face twisted into a sinister smile. He continued, “Moreover, my Dao Heart is now complete. Petty tricks are still just petty tricks in the end!”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang teleported, grabbing the Heart Demon by the neck. The force of devouring erupted instantly, engulfing the entirety of the Heart Demon’s form into the palm of his hand.","“Reveal your true face!” Jian Wushuang was devouring the power of the Heart Demon, not its actual form.","He didn’t want this thing to enter his body again.","The withered husk transformed in an instant into a frail old man. Wrinkles covered his face in a maze of lines. The old man stared at Jian Wushuang with terror, his voice trembling, “How do you possess the power of Death?”","“Power of Death?” Jian Wushuang was taken aback. How did the other party know he had the power of Death?","The Heart Demon residing within him didn’t mean they shared a connection, able to comprehend the universe together.","The events happening outside, the Heart Demon shouldn’t know anything about them.","Otherwise, it wouldn’t be ignorant of Mie Sheng.","But now, the other party unexpectedly knew about the power of Death.","Why was that?","Jian Wushuang didn’t immediately strike. With a grasp of the void, he directly suppressed the Heart Demon in a transparent bottle. Holding the bottle with his fingers, he threatened, “How do you know about the power of Death? If you dare to deceive again, I’ll crush you!”","The current Heart Demon was like a crawling creature, controlled firmly by the power of All Things that Jian Wushuang possessed.","“Your Origin Source contains the power of Death. Your threats are futile. It won’t be long before you perish!” The Heart Demon laughed manically. “No one can threaten me. I’m the one who threatens others!”","Jian Wushuang disdainfully listened to the grating laughter of his opponent, then directly swallowed the small bottle and gulped it down.","Since the Heart Demon liked to bewitch people’s hearts, let him stay within Jian Wushuang’s body for a while!","Originally, he intended to bring the Heart Demon into his own Origin Source space, but fearing the Heart Demon’s methods, in case any unforeseen circumstances arose, it would be a loss he couldn’t afford.","Moreover, the identity of his opponent was not simple. Since Mie Sheng took away the other Demon Lords, it was likely that they had significant value. Jian Wushuang couldn’t let the Heart Demon go.","Let the Heart Demon stay within him forever!","Now, he even distrusted Zhen Ling.","Inside his physical body, no one could save the Heart Demon.","With his powerful physical strength, he wasn’t afraid of any underhanded methods the Heart Demon might use.","As for the power of Death mentioned by his opponent, he would have to study it.","The failure of the future Dao Merge had always been thought to be his own problem. Now it seemed that someone was meddling in it.","Otherwise, no matter how hard he tried, he might end up on the same path as before.","To the point where he didn’t even dare to attempt the merging of the Dao.","The Heart Demon had already been dealt with, but there was no change in the surroundings. Jian Wushuang looked back at the temporal river.","“With no Heart Demon, only the karma calamity remains. Where are you hiding?” Jian Wushuang looked down at the river of time, wanting to actively search.","The reason the karma calamity had grown to this extent was largely due to the Heart Demon.","Without the Heart Demon, the threat posed by the karma calamity should be minimal!","How could he feel that something significant was about to happen, something that would pose a threat to him?","“What is it exactly?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes darted around, his entire body on high alert, not daring to be careless.","Honestly, the threat of the Heart Demon to him was minimal. If it were an ordinary Dao Lord, they might have little resistance against the Heart Demon, but for him, the opponent was like a crawling insect, easily crushed.","The only existence stronger than the Heart Demon, perhaps, was the tribulation that had been gestating.","Hum!","Jian Wushuang immediately retreated, and the ground where he had just stood began to collapse and crumble, reminiscent of when he had unleashed the One Thought Universe.","He had thought it was the tribulation attacking him, but it turned out that the flow of the temporal river was experiencing a disturbance.","The temporal river was unexpectedly collapsing and shrinking, causing time to flow backward.","The collapsing area grew larger, constantly engulfing its surroundings, soon reaching Jian Wushuang.","“No!” Jian Wushuang tried to break free but found that no matter how hard he struggled, it was futile. His body was being dragged into the vortex of the collapsing temporal space.","Falling into the temporal vortex, it was a chaotic space even more terrifying than a black hole.","It contained both time and space, and even beings in the calamity realm would find it challenging to survive once they entered.","After Jian Wushuang entered, he discovered a faint light protecting him.","With this light, he traversed the vortex, and there were many shattered temporal fragments around him, each containing a specific point in time.","The light enveloping his body gradually dimmed, but Jian Wushuang clenched his teeth and disregarded it. He directly flew towards the nearest temporal fragment and plunged into it headfirst.","Boom!","At first, there was darkness, followed by a deafening roar in the ears.","The vision gradually expanded, and Jian Wushuang found himself in a wilderness, surrounded by grass over a foot tall.","In the sky, thunder roared, and a fierce wind and rain followed.","Splash!","An barrier instantly enveloped his entire body. Jian Wushuang discovered that his strength was still there, and he sighed in relief.","But he was somewhat puzzled. Where exactly was this place?","This fragment of space-time was likely from some period in the Moro Spacetime.","Without finding a way out, he would be trapped here forever.","“I need to find someone to inquire about the situation first!” Jian Wushuang quickly made up his mind.","He had read many books about the Moro Spacetime in the Qishen Temple and roughly understood some important periods in the Moro Spacetime.","Mainly divided into Ancient Desolation, Higher Heavens, Human Race, Chaotic Star Domain, and Qishen Era.","It wasn’t until the destruction of the Moro Spacetime that the Qishen Era came to an end.","The first four eras combined were not as long as the Qishen Era.","The Qishen Era marked the end of disorder, constructing its own Qishen Era.","There was a hint of excitement in Jian Wushuang’s heart. Perhaps this time, he had the chance to see Qishen.","What would that meeting be like?","Although he knew that the Qishen was likely a cunning figure who faked his own demise.","He still wanted to meet this legendary figure.","While he was standing still in a daze, a wild beast the size of several meters was gradually approaching Jian Wushuang, its fangs stained with blood, raindrops clinging to its fur.","Clearly, it was a bloodthirsty creature.","“Howl!” It appeared and pounced from a few miles away.","The strength of this wild beast was not weak; according to the power classification of the Moro Spacetime, it was already a pre-natal beast.","But in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, it was just an ordinary demonic beast.","With a casual display of power, without deliberately controlling it, he directly blasted the nearby mountains and a vast forest into powder.","The once lush land instantly turned into charred remains.","“Did I use too much force?” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Then, with a leap, he instantly left the spot, opening his mind to search for traces of the Human Race."]},{"number":5617,"title":"Chapter 5617 Shuttle Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 5617 Shuttle Time","In the future, his spatial realm reached the cosmic level, and with his Thought power, it encompassed the entire universe. The mesmerizing power of that magnitude captivated him.","....","It was nearing the end of this lifetime.","Once he attained the Dao Merge, he could swiftly step into the cosmic spatial realm.","At present, his mental force could cover the expanse of a high-level Domain.","Swoosh!","Jian Wushuang abruptly halted, then changed direction, flying towards the south.","“Such a vast range, yet there are only a few hundred people. What era is this exactly?”","The entire scope of a high-level Domain, occupied by merely a hundred individuals, and they seemed to be elderly cultivators practicing ancient Qi cultivation techniques.","The rest of the auras emanated from wild beasts.","This continent, vast beyond comparison, was a land formed from a famous temporal secret realm in the Moro Spacetime of ancient times, perhaps a land that gained prominence in comparison to the entire universe.","Logically, a continent like this should have long been occupied by the human race!","Could it be that the scriptures he read initially were inaccurate, or was the era he entered too ancient, with humanity yet to rise?","The strength of those wild beasts was commendable, each displaying the prowess of transcendent beings, with even some reaching the level of Yan Immortals.","In the ancient Moro Spacetime, the classification of strength was far from as detailed as it is today, and the realms were rough and varied.","In simple terms, there were Immortals and mortals, which coincided with the Four Great Secret Realms.","Earthly Immortals, Heavenly Immortals, and Emperors.","Mortal realms consisted of Postnatal, Prenatal, Myriad Forms, Nascent Soul, and Mahayana.","He had indeed spent tens of thousands of years crawling through and experiencing these realms back then.","In the later stages of the Moro Spacetime, some extraordinary geniuses, defying the heavens, could reach the Mahayana realm in just a hundred years.","With numerous treasures and powerful mentors, they indeed avoided many detours.","For instance, when Jian Wushuang encountered a state of confusion in closed-door cultivation, others had powerful mentors to directly help them understand.","Although his master was not weak, Xuan Yi mainly assisted him through teachings, with little guidance to dispel confusion.","After all, they couldn’t let him progress smoothly.","Those geniuses who reached the Mahayana realm in a hundred years couldn’t reach his current state.","It’s not that those geniuses couldn’t become Dao Lords, but most of them stopped at the Emperor realm. To become a Tribulation realm cultivator, one needed to endure some hardships.","Now Jian Wushuang’s cultivation level was much stronger than an Emperor.","Within the supreme-peak, there were few individuals who could match his strength.","“Arrived!” Lost in thought, his figure had already approached the vicinity of human cultivators.","Boom!!!","Kill!!!","As soon as he arrived, he heard the resounding shouts of battle in the sky.","It turned out that these human cultivators had encountered a powerful wild beast, already at the later stages of the Nascent Soul realm.","Among these cultivators, only one had reached the Nascent Soul realm, and it seemed like they were still in the early stages.","The Nascent Soul realm was a significant cultivation level; some Nascent Soul experts could effortlessly obliterate countless Nascent Soul entities with a wave of their hand.","There was a considerable gap in strength.","Just like the current situation.","Jian Wushuang held the board on his thumb, and in a careless moment, the board fell off. Just as he was about to pick it up, the human cultivators couldn’t hold on any longer.","He couldn’t bother with the board; he rushed over immediately to save lives.","This time, he deliberately suppressed his aura, but even when he casually made a move, it still caused a significant commotion, shaking the heavens and the earth.","The savage beast at the realm of Nascent Soul directly turned into debris, disappearing instantly on the spot.","Jian Wushuang had already reached among the crowd, saving a baby from a cradle. If he had been a moment slower, the infant would have perished.","“Savior!” The oldest among the group of human cultivators knelt directly in front of Jian Wushuang.","Seeing the elder kneel, the others followed suit.","Jian Wushuang held the infant in one hand and had his other hand behind his back, portraying the demeanor of an extraordinary outsider. He carried a mysterious divine sword on his back, adding to the enigma.","However, he knew, based on the timeline, the ages of these people were probably even older than the Qishen Temple.","“Please rise! I’m just in seclusion here, and I only intervened after being disturbed by this beast. No need to thank me!” Jian Wushuang’s voice was steady, carrying the air of a seasoned master.","The leading elder, trembling, stood up and immediately introduced himself. “Junior Chirou pays respects to the senior. I wonder if this place is the senior’s Dao Arena, and we’ve caused you much trouble!”","Jian Wushuang, however, paid no mind and instead looked down at the baby in his arms. He discovered that the child possessed innate potential, with ancient marks on the forehead, and inquired, “I see some unusual marks on the baby’s forehead. Is it the totem of your tribe?”","In this era, he had a clearer understanding. It was probably the end of the era of the Higher Heavens.","Those born in the Higher Heavens era would have tribal totems.","“Yes, this baby in the senior’s hands is my grandson, just born not long ago!” the elder respectfully replied.","Inwardly moved, their tribe had survived in this area for millions of years without producing a Mahayana cultivator. The seemingly young man before them was probably a Mahayana cultivator. If he took the grandson as his disciple, their tribe might finally have a Mahayana cultivator, qualifying them to leave this wilderness and enter the sacred grounds of the human realm.","It would change the fate of their tribe.","“Just born, and the totem is already manifesting. Your grandson has excellent talent!” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Although he had limited knowledge of the Moro Spacetime, he understood the basics.","The totem on the infant’s forehead manifested so early; in the future, it would likely become a Nascent Soul realm cultivator.","There was hope for the Mahayana realm.","Certainly, encountering him would make it easy to reach the Mahayana realm.","With a single point, the power of All Things entered the infant’s brow.","Following the power of All Things, there was a thread of thought force entering the baby’s body.","After the thought force entered the infant’s body, a massive bloodline power instantly numbed the hand of Jian Wushuang.","“Not simple!” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","The future of this infant was extraordinary; he couldn’t even probe into it.","This power of All Things could be considered a kind of good fortune!","The old man looked on with envy; he could sense a powerful force injected into his grandson, and joy filled his heart.","Just as he was about to follow Jian Wushuang’s lead and continue speaking, Jian Wushuang interrupted.","“I have important matters to attend to, so I won’t disturb you any longer!” Jian Wushuang said and stood up to leave.","The Human Race’s sacred ground.","Where did he want to go?","Before leaving, Jian Wushuang remembered that the jade plaque had fallen. He wanted to go back and search for it. At this moment, a sudden inspiration struck him, and he thought of something.","It was the jade plaque of Qishen. He brought it into this spacetime, which meant there were now two identical jade plaques.","If that was the case, the plaque in his hand would probably disappear.","However, the plaque had not disappeared, and Qishen had not yet appeared."]},{"number":5618,"title":"Chapter 5618: The Era of High Heavens","paragraphs":["Chapter 5618: The Era of High Heavens","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Forget it!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, then turned to the old man Chirou and said, “I have left a token nearby. If you are destined to find it, let the outstanding talents among the younger generation seek me out!”","Afterward, he left, leaving a seal on the jade tablet before departing.","The fate of this jade tablet would eventually fall into the hands of the Qishen Temple. Even if he didn’t give it to them, it would eventually end up in the possession of the Qishen Temple, as it was originally something belonging to them, and that couldn’t be changed.","After Jian Wushuang broke the seal and left, the group of human cultivators, except for the infant that Jian Wushuang had held, all went madly searching for the token.","This was a great opportunity!","“This is interesting!” Jian Wushuang continuously flew towards the human sacred land recorded in the script, finding it more and more intriguing.","He had accidentally entered the Moro Spacetime’s Higher Heaven Era.","It seemed that Qishen was born in this era, and after three eras, he established his own era.","Maybe he could even encounter Qishen.","From the records, the early days of Qishen were quite ordinary. During the glorious era of humanity, the Qishen was just an Earth Immortal. In the Chaotic Star Era, Qishen gradually became prominent.","According to the records, in the Higher Heavens Era, it was because a human cultivator became a Boundary Realm cultivator that it marked the end. Afterward, with the strength of one person, the Qishen led humanity to the peak of its era.","In this era, humanity wasn’t the only dominant force.","Although it was called the Human Era, the strong of humanity at the time didn’t see it that way. It was just a name given by later generations.","Even though humanity had cultivators and perfected the methods of cultivation, the overall strength of humanity was far from matching the other races in the temporal river.","Having one peak expert was simply not enough.","At this moment in time, the formidable expert in the Tribulation realm was likely about to appear.","The only uncertainty lay in whether it would be within the human territory of this continent.","His current position was approximately the distance of an entire universe away from the sacred land of the human race.","In order to reach it faster, Jian Wushuang directly unleashed the Eternal Ancient Transformation technique, elevating his strength to its peak.","Now, the closer he got to the sacred land, the faster his strength increased.","Whether this was a good or bad phenomenon, he had not heard of it before.","As a result, his power had already overflowed, surpassing the pinnacle of conventional strength.","In his normal state, he possessed top-notch peak combat power.","After employing the Eternal Ancient Transformation, his peak state now achieved perfect combat power, surpassing his expectations after initially merging with the Dao.","Could it be that he would become an invincible Emperor right after merging with the Dao?","At this moment, he dared not claim to be an invincible Emperor, only acknowledging that he had few rivals.","The emergence of the power of the Starry Sky had indeed surpassed his understanding, but as long as there were no adverse effects, he could accept it.","In merely ten days, he traversed the span of an entire universe and arrived at the sacred land of the human race.","“Tenglong Continent!”","One of the sacred lands within the human territory.","It was a sacred land on this continent, not the human territory along the entire temporal river, but the difference was not significant.","Most of the life forms currently gestating in the universe were Special Life Forms without any distinct groups.","In the peak era of the human race, they embarked on a great migration, venturing into cosmic existence.","Now, the humans reside within temporal secret realms.","This explains why those Special Life Forms always claimed the universe as their homeland, asserting it was not the territory of the human race.","Upon entering the Tenglong Continent, humans were ubiquitous, and the absence of wild beasts made this land exceptionally pleasing.","Arriving here, Jian Wushuang felt no urgency to press forward.","Since he hadn’t found a way to leave, he decided to explore the mortal world and live here for a while.","In a small country in the eastern region, far from Zhongzhou, Jian Wushuang assumed the guise of an ordinary person and began a mundane life.","In the Higher Heavens era, the human race’s cultivation methods were incomplete, and Jian Wushuang saw no need to borrow from them.","He could only wait patiently.","Although the time carried by this fragment of space was short, the spatial expanse was considerable.","This ancient continent was much larger than the Original Universe.","As time rushed by, Jian Wushuang wondered if he could endure until the emergence of Qishen.","In the end, within a mere million years, he vanished from this place.","When he reappeared, it was once again within the whirlpool of spacetime.","Only now, he was dressed in the attire of an ancient cultivator, and the jade tablet was nowhere to be seen.","It seemed that everything was real.","Over the course of a million years, he had traversed the Tenglong Continent, leaving behind numerous opportunities in the sacred land of the human race.","Although these opportunities were only useful for mortals, they could still change some aspects of the human race’s history, accelerating their ascent to the pinnacle of tribes.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang frowned as he remained in the temporal vortex.","Was he supposed to experience the Moro Spacefime before being allowed to leave?","Swish!","Jian Wushuang teleported once again, entering a massive fragment of time and space.","Just like the previous time, after the darkness dissipated, he saw the current timeline.","The village was desolate!","Wild grass grew everywhere, and faint smoke rose from thatched houses.","It was a mortal village.","There was not a trace of vitality nearby.","This time, it was the era of the Chaotic Star Domain.","The human race had undergone a major migration, venturing into the cosmos.","He was in a vast universe where, although most of it was still mundane, there were already quite a few cultivators.","In this world, there were already Emperors.","This was merely a medium-sized Domain.","Jian Wushuang’s sudden appearance startled the ox in the neighboring barn, causing it to bellow in distress.","A cowherd child jumped and ran over. Seeing Jian Wushuang’s attire, the child raised an eyebrow in surprise.","For these ordinary people, they had never seen mortals dressed so neatly.","Unfortunately, Jian Wushuang was not an ordinary mortal.","He smiled at the child and was about to leave to meet the Emperor.","Back in the Tenglong Continent, he had encountered several Emperors, but they were too weak.","He hadn’t seen the powerhouse who led the human race to its peak, so he had no interaction with those individuals. He merely observed them from the shadows and left afterward.","This time, he sensed more than one Emperor.","In the entire Universal Sect, there were at least hundreds of Emperors.","And their strength was formidable.","In the era of the Chaotic Star, the Qishen Temple had already risen, providing him with the perfect opportunity to inquire about Qishen’s affairs.","Just as he was preparing to leave, Jian Wushuang stopped in his tracks.","He looked at the dark-skinned child and the more he looked, the more familiar he seemed. He felt like he had seen this child somewhere!","“Is your last name Bai?” Jian Wushuang asked cautiously.","The child, not afraid at all, replied playfully, “Why should I tell you!”","Swish!","Jian Wushuang simply flipped his palm, and a string of candied haws appeared. He asked again, “What’s your name?”","“Bai Goudan!” The child, unbothered by dirty hands, grabbed the candied haws directly instead of using a sign like Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":5619,"title":"Chapter 5619: Chaotic Star Era","paragraphs":["Chapter 5619: Chaotic Star Era","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Hahaha” Jian Wushuang chuckled heartily as he ruffled the child’s head.","This child must be an ancestor of Bai Junwang or perhaps even Bai Junwang’s father. The resemblance to Bai Junwang’s face was uncanny.","Upon hearing the laughter inside the house, thinking someone had come to visit, people walked out only to find the child standing alone outside the cattle shed, holding a lump of cow dung and licking it!","“Goudan, have you gone mad?” The woman who came out, grabbing Goudan’s ear, walked towards the house, scolding, “You idiot, haven’t you eaten enough? Eating cow dung, when your second uncle comes later, he might think I can’t support you!”","After scolding, the woman was still somewhat dissatisfied. She kicked Goudan’s buttocks a couple of times, saying, “When your second uncle comes this time, be prepared to go to the city and become a disciple of Qixuanmen. Show some promise; do you hear me?”","Jian Wushuang, soaring into the clouds, couldn’t help but maintain a smile.","This feeling was too strange.","Now he understood why his Teacher Xuan Yi said he was waiting for him in the future.","Xuan Yi probably used similar means to enter their timeline.","This also indicated that their timeline would also shatter in the future.","Or perhaps Xuan Yi had other methods to enter a specific time period, selecting disciples from a certain point in the past.","He, however, was a bit different; he wanted to delve into the future from the timelines of the past.","To see what Qishen was really planning.","Revival was not that simple; it was incredibly complex.","What kind of power was needed exactly?","He needed to be prepared.","His aura leaked out; this time, he didn’t need to actively search.","As long as he emanated an Emperor’s aura, it would attract powerful Emperor-level beings to come personally.","On a green cliff peak, Jian Wushuang stopped in his tracks.","In the pale blue sky, a sudden aurora appeared, and in an instant, a dignified man with a high crown materialized.","“May I inquire about your esteemed name and why you appear in my Dao Arena?” The man, exuding an air of arrogance, looked down from a high vantage point.","Jian Wushuang slowly raised his hand, a mere grasp in the empty space, and effortlessly seized the arrogantly postured man.","“I ask a question, you answer. Dare to conceal, and I will make your death unbearable!” The threatening tone resonated as Jian Wushuang exerted his dominance.","The formidable Emperor was so frightened that he didn’t dare to breathe loudly.","Because Jian Wushuang suppressed every bit of his aura.","This arrogant man was merely a tier 3 Emperor, and his Origin Source Dao was still weak, seemingly only a fourth-grade Origin Source Dao.","Such a character was not even worth mentioning in the Qishen Temple’s Four Great Secret Realms, let alone in the current Original Universe, where there were plenty of beings of much higher stature.","“Senior, spare my life, and I’ll speak!” The arrogant man immediately begged for mercy.","The gap between the two was too vast.","Even his master, in all likelihood, did not possess such overwhelming oppressive force.","“What’s your name, and who is your master?”","“Junior’s name is Wu Tong! My master is Daoist Zhuhuo, a good friend of the Desolate Emperor!”","Jian Wushuang grinned sinisterly, “Are you trying to threaten me?”","As he spoke, he exerted more force, causing Wu Tong’s face to turn red and purple.","“Junior dare not, I’m just speaking the truth!”","“Considering your resemblance to someone I knew, I’ll spare your life!” Jian Wushuang threw Wutong aside.","“Wu Tong, Wu Zuo!”","He was genuinely afraid that the other person had some connection with Wu Zuo.","After all, he was an Emperor, and with an extraordinary background, their descendants were likely to shine brightly in the era of Qishen.","He was particularly intrigued by the Desolate Emperor mentioned by the other party.","Qishen Temple, the Desolate Divine Master among the three Divine Masters.","This Divine Master had once saved the Great Desolate Wilderness.","He remembered it vividly.","Now, still just an Emperor, he could go and inquire about the matters of the Moro Spacetime and incidentally learn more about the Qishen.","The desolate aura was intense; he could clearly feel it. This time, he concealed his own aura and began moving towards the direction of the Desolation.","Concealing his aura, no one in this universe could detect him.","In this era, few could discover him.","In the current era, there were probably only a handful of Human Realm’s transcendent experts, and their strengths were relatively weak.","In just an hour’s time, he arrived in the domain where Desolation was located.","It wasn’t that close in distance, but flying in the Original Universe was much faster than in the temporal river, without any resistance.","Because the space in the Original Universe was purer, without the heaviness of the temporal river, and time was condensed within the space.","It was extremely difficult to destroy and even flying became unbelievably slow.","Up close, Jian Wushuang could immediately discern the strength of the Desolation Emperor, ‘Huang’, a complete-stage expert at the supreme-peak level.","According to the records in the books, during the late Chaotic Star Era, Huang reached the Tribulation realm, and then followed Qishen into a new era.","In the early days of Qishen, the gap between the three Divine Masters and Qishen wasn’t significant, but as time passed, the disparity became more apparent.","When Qishen reached the Seven Tribulation realm, the three Divine Masters were only at the Five Tribulation realm.","Only one person had the smallest gap with Qishen, and that was Mie Sheng.","Jian Wushuang really wanted to find that old guy and take the opportunity to settle the score and let off some steam.","Moreover, he wanted to remind the other person to definitely help someone named Jian Wushuang in the future.","Unfortunately, he couldn’t find Mie Sheng at all.","Perhaps the guy had changed his name.","In case he found Mie Sheng and realized he was at the Tribulation realm and couldn’t defeat him, that would be troublesome too.","Well, it’s better to go find Huang and have a chat first!","Just as he arrived, Jian Wushuang felt a violent force in conflict.","“Hmm?”","Jian Wushuang looked in the direction and saw on a massive arena, Huang was battling a savage beast.","The strength of that savage beast was formidable, even stronger than the Eight-Armed Beast Emperor who fought Broly.","Despite possessing the power of supreme-peak, it was unfortunate to encounter Huang.","Constantly being trampled upon.","Jian Wushuang became interested and decided to fly over directly.","Huang, fully engrossed in the battle, didn’t notice Jian Wushuang’s arrival. However, some Emperors watching around noticed him.","“You!”","“Who are you?”","Several Emperors around instantly intercepted Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang put his index finger to his lips, indicating these people not to disturb Huang who was still in battle.","Under his threat, these people surprisingly obediently chose to keep quiet, standing in place and watching Jian Wushuang.","At the same time, numerous clearly visible short swords floated around his neck.","If they dared to make a sound, Jian Wushuang didn’t mind killing a few Emperors in advance for some excitement.","In the arena, Huang, like an ancient wild man, barefoot with disheveled hair, wielded a stone axe.","Every strike would inevitably injure the savage beast.","“The seventeenth strike!” Huang angrily shouted.","With another swing, the savage beast howled, completely silent thereafter.","A savage beast comparable to the complete-stage supreme-peak fell, appearing so insignificant under Huang’s simple and unadorned stone axe."]},{"number":5620,"title":"Chapter 5620 Desolate Emperor, Huang","paragraphs":["Chapter 5620 Desolate Emperor, Huang","Huang walked to the corpse of the desolate beast, pulled the giant axe embedded in its body with one hand, wiped it off, and then hung the axe at his waist.","....","At that moment, he noticed someone watching him.","And it was a powerful stranger he didn’t recognize, like a black hole!","“Who is it!”","Huang turned to Jian Wushuang, his eyes moving. The person in front of him concealed his aura very cleverly. It wasn’t until he was in front of him that Huang noticed.","Upon closer inspection, he found that the restrained aura was like a black hole, swallowing all the power within.","“Huang!”","Jian Wushuang saw the other person very surprised. The appearance and the axe in his hand were unexpectedly familiar.","That axe, he knew it too well.","Scenes from the Starry Sky emerged in his mind, thinking of the wild giant man born on the barbaric planet.","He also thought of the owner of the stone axe when they parted.","“Dong Jun!” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself. The Starry Sky humanoid, supposed to be a dream, appeared in the Moro Spacetime.","The stone axe in the hands of Emperor Huang, he was more than familiar with it, absolutely no mistake, it was the one from Dong Jun’s hands.","How could it appear here?","When Huang heard Jian Wushuang silently mention Dong Jun, his expression froze, surprised. “You know Senior Dong Jun?”","“I do, he’s an old acquaintance!” Jian Wushuang nodded and then asked, “How do you know Dong Jun, and how did you get this giant axe?”","The Emperors who were frozen in place, seeing Jian Wushuang and Emperor Huang actually knew each other, all breathed a sigh of relief.","In their view, Jian Wushuang’s strength was extremely powerful. If he were to make a move against them, it would probably take their lives in an instant.","Huang held the giant axe in his hand, looked up at the sky, and then looked at Jian Wushuang, saying, “Are you a person from the Higher Heavens?”","Higher Heavens!","Since the Higher Heavens shattered, the era of the Higher Heavens had also come to an end.","The stone axe in Huang’s hand came from the Higher Heavens.","It wouldn’t be an exaggeration to say that it was a gift from the Higher Heavens.","The shattering of the Higher Heavens was a calamity for the world, but for cultivators, it was also an opportunity.","Because within the Higher Heavens, countless treasures and innumerable legacies are hidden.","These legacies and treasures are scattered throughout the temporal river, forming starry secrets.","That’s what is now known as the Chaotic Star Domain.","The stone axe in Huang’s hand was obtained from the Chaotic Star Domain.","In addition to this stone axe, he also acquired a severed arm.","The arm tightly gripped the stone axe.","Understanding why Huang obtained the stone axe, Jian Wushuang had even greater doubts in his heart.","To the extent that he didn’t even bother to inquire about the matters of the Qishen Temple.","This stone axe comes from the Higher Heavens, probably a treasure trove left from the previous era, or a hidden treasure that descended from the Starry Sky.","If it’s really as he deduced, then Dong Jun and the once-existing star are much older than the ancient Moro Spacetime.","Looking at the runes on the stone axe, they are definitely cosmic-level runes.","This also indicates that the star he once visited, which gave birth to such powerful life as the Universe Master, has now perished.","Jian Wushuang didn’t expect that, unconsciously, he had traveled to an even more ancient era.","However, at that time, his understanding of time and space was limited.","Moreover, when he left that star, there wasn’t even a Yan Immortal above him.","He never thought that the star could proliferate to such an extent.","“Can I take a look?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Huang was generous and directly handed over the stone axe.","Taking the stone axe, Jian Wushuang’s Thought force penetrated it, and the power of the Starry Sky instantly burst out from his hand.","After enduring the power of the Starry Sky, the might of the stone axe became billions of times stronger than before.","The force shattered the array that sealed the arena.","Huang was astonished that Jian Wushuang could fully unleash the power of the stone axe, and his body was repeatedly pushed back by the shock.","“Senior!” Huang knelt directly.","Jian Wushuang’s temples fluttered, and the stone axe emitted a buzzing sound, as if rejoicing at returning to its original owner.","In reality, he was not the original owner. The first generation owner of this stone axe was the one who opened up the heavens and earth.","He couldn’t be considered the second generation owner either; he simply repaired it and gave it to Dong Jun.","Unexpectedly, this little guy could nurture this stone axe into such a powerful treasure.","Dong Jun’s strength was at least that of a powerhouse beyond the Three Tribulation realm.","Only those who mastered the universe, becoming the Universe Master, could nurture a Universe Treasure.","Ordinary Tribulation realm cultivators couldn’t achieve this.","If Dong Jun was so powerful, then what about his cheap disciple?","“Fu Zhu!” The first generation patriarch of the Human Clan.","Dong Jun could become the Universe Master, and Fu Zhu’s strength probably wouldn’t be too weak.","But he should have fallen by now.","For a moment, Jian Wushuang’s confidence surged. It was possible that his disciple might be the Universe Master, and even his descendants might be Universe Masters.","“Besides this stone axe, what else have you obtained?” Jian Wushuang asked curiously. He was increasingly eager to know what was nurtured within the Higher Heavens.","Huang carefully took the stone axe and answered respectfully, “In the beginning, I was merely fortunate to enter a rift in the fabric of time. Subsequently, I found myself on a partially shattered planet, where there was only a severed arm and a stone axe!”","After speaking, Huang directly took out the severed arm, and the power emanating from it was extremely formidable.","Jian Wushuang gazed deeply at this severed arm, becoming more and more familiar with it.","This severed arm was just a simple physical body without an embedded divine body. However, the density of the flesh was very similar to his own.","It was undoubtedly a Nine Refinement physical body.","Jian Wushuang reached out his hand and gently caressed it. As he touched it, his brows furrowed.","From the arm, he sensed a familiar power.","It was the power of the fusion between physical body and divine body, along with the familiar aura of the Origin Source.","This was damn well his own arm.","Jian Wushuang directly took several steps back, then stared at the patterns on his palm, and examined the lines on his hand.","The patterns above were exactly the same as the ones on his palm.","How could this be explained?","An arm, for him, was nothing.","But the arm was obviously chopped off by the stone axe, which explained a lot.","In the past, it seemed like he had a major battle with Dong Jun, resulting in the severed arm. The stone axe was left behind.","However, such speculation wasn’t entirely accurate.","After leaving the Starry Sky, he never returned. That didn’t make sense!","Could it be that his future self would go to the Starry Sky again, engage in a battle with Dong Jun, and have his arm chopped off by the opponent?","Either that or this arm wasn’t his.","However, the aura of the Origin Source would not deceive him.","The aura of the Origin Source was too similar to his own.","The power of Life!","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang suddenly understood.","It was highly likely that his conflict with Dong Jun wasn’t a duel with him but with Mie Sheng."]},{"number":5621,"title":"Chapter 5621 Dong Jun","paragraphs":["Chapter 5621 Dong Jun","....","The opponent’s Origin Source was very similar to his own, albeit completely opposite.","However, being able to wield the power of Death, their early Origin Source must have been similar.","It was also the Extreme Dao.","If that was the case, then it all made sense.","Mie Sheng hailed from the ancient Moro Spacetime, during the era of Moro’s divine age. It was possible that Dong Jun was still alive, having clashed with Mie Sheng later on.","If this was true, then the current Dong Jun had probably fallen.","While the future Mie Sheng was still alive.","In the later stages of the Chaotic Star Era, Mie Sheng’s strength was probably formidable, at least reaching the Five Tribulation realm!","Jian Wushuang muttered to himself, leaving Emperor Huang unsure of how to respond.","“Senior?” Huang cautiously called.","Jian Wushuang snapped back to reality, revealing a smile and said, “I am not a being from the Higher Heavens. Just like you, I have received the bestowal of the Higher Heavens!”","The other person had clarified his doubts, and he had nothing to hide, after all, they were predecessors.","Speaking or not made no difference. These people lived in this not-too-big, not-too-small fragment of spacetime and would soon disappear, fundamentally insufficient to alter history.","After chatting with Emperor Huang for a while, they mainly discussed the Chaotic Star Domain.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang inquired about the existence of someone called ‘Qi’.","However, Emperor Huang didn’t recognize the name.","This puzzled Jian Wushuang.","Logically speaking, at this point, Qishen should be a prominent figure. How could Emperor Huang not have heard of him?","Could it be that the true fate of Qishen didn’t include the character ‘Qi’?","If that were the case, he considered himself unlucky.","He also casually asked about some formidable beings in the human race’s Tribulation realm. After not finding any particularly special existence, he breathed a sigh of relief.","He had no reason to stay now. This spacetime was too vast, the more he delved, the less he saw any clues, only fragments of information.","Just as he was preparing to leave, Emperor Huang stopped him.","“Senior, is there truly life in the Chaotic Star Domain?” This was Emperor Huang’s biggest doubt.","Because once he had seen a moving old man among the Higher Heavens, but the figure did not possess the power of Life; instead, it represented Death.","Jian Wushuang was caught off guard by this question. He truly did not know, but he remained calm and responded with a counter-question.","“Why do you think so?”","This time, Huang didn’t hold back and revealed what he had witnessed before the fragmentation of the heavens.","Death!","The mark on Jian Wushuang’s forehead kept flashing.","Mie Sheng!","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang finally uttered a word and then left directly.","The origin of Mie Sheng is likely related to the Higher Heavens.","The mysterious individual who battled with Dong Jun was probably also Mie Sheng.","This elderly man of annihilation did not belong to this era at all.","He was a monstrous being that transcended from the most ancient times.","At least, he was a powerful figure from the same era as Dong Jun.","Swish!","He directly tore through the fabric of the universe, entering the temporal river.","His Thought power spread, instantly sensing the nearby cracks.","The spatial dimensions of this fragment of time were not extensive!","It only encompassed several universes.","Far from the vast continent he visited the first time.","However, in terms of space, it was considerably larger because the intervals between each universe were immense; in between, it could probably hold tens of thousands of universes.","Traveling in this chaotic void was not as fast.","“Mie Sheng!”","A bold idea emerged in Jian Wushuang’s mind: what if he killed Mie Sheng in advance, would there be fewer troubles in the future?","“No!” Jian Wushuang shook his head again.","Mie Sheng also did not belong here, and he couldn’t find the time period when Mie Sheng was born.","Even if he found Mie Sheng now, the opponent’s strength would likely be much greater than his.","In that case, he had to abandon this idea and embark on a long-term plan.","Laying the groundwork for the future.","Thinking about this, Jian Wushuang began deliberately searching for records of strong individuals in the Qishen Temple, constantly accelerating their progress on the path of cultivation.","First and foremost was the Bai Junwang, who had some connection with Jian Wushuang.","Even though in the future, Bai Junwang would meet a tragic end, even in the era before the Qishen, he was nothing more than a minor character, unable to create much of a ripple.","But with his assistance, Bai Junwang’s strength would likely surpass what was foreseen in the future.","Perhaps it would bring him a surprise.","In addition to Bai Junwang, Jian Wushuang infiltrated this universe, continuously searching and discovering that at least six Universe Masters would be born in the future of this universe.","This was excluding the Desolate Divine Master, Huang.","These Six Tribulation realm experts, born relatively early, caught up with the peak era of the Qishen, and their strength was formidable, making them the most elite under the Qishen’s command.","Each one was a Universe Master in the Four Tribulation realm.","However, at the moment, they were still only Earth Immortals.","That is, Yan Immortals, in the process of exploring the Great Dao.","With Jian Wushuang’s qualifications, he was competent enough to guide these individuals.","At the very least, he needed to make them understand that not cultivating to perfection before the Dao Merge was worse than garbage.","Since they had grasped the Ultimate Dao, they must cultivate to perfection.","Every realm must be cultivated to the extreme. Only in this way could they lay a solid foundation for the future and become the pinnacle experts among the Universe Masters.","In a certain universe’s secret realm.","Seven disciples under Jian Wushuang were currently besieging a Heavenly Immortal level wild beast together.","The strength of this wild beast had already reached the Nine Revolutions level.","All seven disciples were Earth Immortals.","It was incredibly difficult to surround and kill a desolate beast with the combat power of a Nine Revolutions Heavenly Immortal.","But if it were easy, they wouldn’t have joined forces to besiege it.","Jian Wushuang snorted at the sight of their embarrassed state.","With a stern shout, he said, “Just a Nine Revolutions Heavenly Immortal, and you all are in such a sorry state. How can you become peak powerhouses in the future? Stand up for me!”","Back when he was just a Yan Immortal, he could single-handedly slay a Nine Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal.","He was invincible as a Dao Lord.","Considering the capabilities of these guys, he genuinely couldn’t fathom how they could become Universe Masters.","Six of them were already destined to become Universe Masters, with their futures recorded.","There was one whose talent surpassed the other six, but there was no record of their future. It was likely that they might meet an untimely end.","However, Jian Wushuang hadn’t given up on them. Perhaps he could reverse history.","Boom!","Upon hearing his rebuke, the disciples unleashed their full potential and attacked once again.","Only then did Jian Wushuang show a satisfied smile.","It was time for these little guys to break through.","Over the past million years, he had taught them everything he could. After becoming Heavenly Immortals, walking the path to ultimate mastery required their individual efforts.","A force of pulling came from the sky.","Jian Wushuang knew it was time to leave.","At this moment, the seven formed a formation, completely suppressing the desolate beast.","“Master, we did it!” The disciples came excitedly.","However, seeing Jian Wushuang’s expression, which wasn’t too pleasant and often contorted.","They sensed the reverse flow of space and time – Jian Wushuang could leave at any moment."]},{"number":5622,"title":"Chapter 5622: Planning for the Future","paragraphs":["Chapter 5622: Planning for the Future","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Master!”","These disciples, unaware of the reason, hurriedly approached.","Jian Wushuang, however, intercepted them, barely revealing a trace of relief. He said, “You are all excellent, and I am pleased. But I am heavily injured and have no way out. Remember to cultivate well!”","“Who did this?” the disciples inquired one after another.","In the million years, Jian Wushuang was both a master and a fatherly figure to them.","Upon hearing that their master was injured, they all wanted to know who could inflict such harm on their revered teacher.","“Silly children, don’t ask too much. The truth will be revealed in the future. No need to seek revenge for me!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head. Even though he said that, he still took out a mustard seed, tremblingly handing it over. “This is a treasure I’m leaving for you. Cultivate diligently, but never mention that you were my disciples.”","These treasures were all collected by him in this universe’s secret realm, enough for these seven individuals to cultivate to the tier 5 of Emperor.","To become stronger, they would need to venture into the temporal river and explore it on their own.","Jian Wushuang’s figure began to slowly disappear, eventually returning to the temporal vortex.","The seven disciples wept, not even a trace of their master’s physical body left, only a grave mound created for Jian Wushuang.","And above, it was inscribed with the name ‘Wushuang Mound’!","The future of these seven, indeed, altered some aspects of Qishen Era history but did not affect Mie Sheng.","Because the strongest among them only reached the peak of the Five Tribulation realm.","However, Jian Wushuang had been in the temporal vortex all along and never confirmed it with the Qishen Temple.","Changing things was incredibly difficult.","After Jian Wushuang left that fragment of spacetime, he entered another vast fragment.","Another cycle.","And this time, Jian Wushuang arrived in the most ancient era of the Moro Spacetime.","The Ancient Desolation Era.","An era without human tribes.","An era dominated by primordial beasts.","In the fragment he was in, there was even a prehistoric Beast God.","Feeling that aura, Jian Wushuang was so scared that he dared not breathe.","He transformed his physical body into the appearance of a wild beast of the wasteland. From a distant location, he began to practice, drawing inspiration from the innate Beast God.","However, this wasteland creature was not a Candle Dragon. Otherwise, upon sensing the Candle Dragon aura on him, he might not have been spared.","After millions of years, Jian Wushuang disappeared once again.","This time, he had gained experience and could deduce the era based on the surface of the temporal fragments.","He then proceeded to the period when the Higher Heavens descended.","He felt that the appearance of the human race was closely related to the Higher Heavens Era.","During the Higher Heavens Era, only the human race could obtain the totems of the Higher Heavens. After the Higher Heavens collapsed, the Chaotic Star Domains that resulted were also due to the human race.","With the rise of the human race, the Chaotic Star Domains emerged.","Most of the treasures in those domains were seized by the human race.","After a prosperous era, the wasteland creatures were unable to contend for treasures against the human race.","Even countless Original Universes formed by the innate were occupied by the human race.","On a fluctuating divine mountain, Jian Wushuang stood with hands behind his back, gazing at the divine light of the Higher Heavens in the sky.","In the previous moment, it was still the Ancient Desolation Era.","In the next moment, it was the era of the Higher Heavens.","From this moment, the human race began to be born from All Things.","At the moment of the appearance of the human race, Jian Wushuang clearly felt a powerful force of souls descending upon the continent.","“It is indeed related to the Higher Heavens!”","Jian Wushuang stared at the radiant light of the Higher Heavens, his brows slightly furrowed. A sense of eagerness surged within him, wanting to go in and see what was going on.","This Higher Heavens, and the human race in the Starry Sky, must be connected.","Perhaps all the secrets lay within.","Boom!","Under the radiance, Jian Wushuang saw the totems leaking from the Higher Heavens.","Under the dazzling brilliance of the light, a tremendous terror lurked.","The secrets of Moro Spacetime.","Jian Wushuang’s brow flickered, and in the next moment, he unexpectedly ascended to the summit.","The power of the Starry Sky on his body suddenly erupted.","His physical body expanded twofold.","He couldn’t handle this power.","“Phew!” Jian Wushuang instantly slumped.","This probing made him more convinced that the Higher Heavens comes from the Starry Sky.","And Mie Sheng is a figure from the same era as Dong Jun, a powerhouse in the Starry Sky.","“The secret of the Starry Sky is not the only one!” Jian Wushuang struggled to get up.","For him, the Starry Sky is indeed not the only one.","Perhaps by breaking free from the Starry Sky, he could defeat Mie Sheng.","The fact that the opponent came from the Starry Sky indicates that Mie Sheng understood the Starry Sky better than him.","And he also knew about his power of Life, which was part of the chessboard set up from the beginning.","Rumble!","Through the light of the Higher Heavens, two forces confronted each other.","In the Higher Heavens, on a dilapidated wooden boat, Mie Sheng held a soul lamp and traversed the Higher Heavens.","Jian Wushuang slowly raised his palm, and as soon as it touched the Higher Heavens, he also felt the power of Death.","Mie Sheng was up there.","It’s just that his strength is even more formidable than he had imagined.","In the realm of Higher Heavens, Mie Sheng perhaps held a might even greater than the future Qishen.","“It seems that his strength diminishes every time he crosses a temporal space!” Jian Wushuang concluded within himself.","Mie Sheng in Higher Heavens was likely an existence surpassing the Seven Tribulation realm. After the destruction of Higher Heavens, Mie Sheng arrived in the Moro Spacetime with only half the strength of the Seven Tribulation realm.","Now, in the spacetime beyond their Original Universe, Mie Sheng’s power might further decrease.","However, Zhen Ling was unaware of this.","In the future world, in order to devour him, Mie Sheng chose to cut through realms and descended to the supreme-peak.","Perhaps it wasn’t that the other party willingly cut through realms, but that Mie Sheng, like him, entered the future.","Mie Sheng had traversed time and space multiple times, yet he hadn’t reached the point of complete mastery of time and space. Hence, each time, he would fall to a lower cultivation realm.","When he arrived in the future spacetime, he was only left with the strength of the supreme-peak level.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang was decisive enough to choose to die in the future world directly.","Mie Sheng had no choice but to return to the current main spacetime.","No wonder the Heart Demon did not recognize Mie Sheng; it turned out Mie Sheng didn’t take the Heart Demon seriously and chose to take action personally.","After understanding everything, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel a sense of fear.","In his past and present, as well as in the future, everything was orchestrated by Mie Sheng.","So, his arrival here was probably closely related to Mie Sheng.","In Mie Sheng’s eyes, his schemes were probably like children playing house.","“I almost fell into your calculations again!” Jian Wushuang looked up at the radiance emanating from the Higher Heavens.","If he lingered here, he would probably eventually face Mie Sheng directly, and then there would be no escape.","Fortunately, luck was on his side. The fragments from the third entry into the Moro Spacetime did not encounter Mie Sheng.","This time was the closest, but unfortunately, Mie Sheng couldn’t come out right now.","Now, it was the early period of the Higher Heavens Era, and Mie Sheng couldn’t descend.","After Jian Wushuang figured it out, he couldn’t help but laugh. “Mie Sheng, no matter how you calculate, you can’t surpass the will of the heavens. In the future world, I will eventually defeat you!”","The first time he entered the future world, it was a future specially designed by Mie Sheng.","That was an inaccurate future, and he wouldn’t be affected by it.","Everything was still under his control.","If he were to fail, he wouldn’t let Mie Sheng succeed even in death."]},{"number":5623,"title":"Chapter 5623: Mie Sheng’s Scheme","paragraphs":["Chapter 5623: Mie Sheng’s Scheme","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Higher Heavens, as if hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, the power of Death erupted from Mie Sheng, eager to shatter the Higher Heavens and seize Jian Wushuang at once.","“Getting impatient, aren’t we?” Jian Wushuang shook his head and laughed heartily.","Boom!","However, he didn’t anticipate the complete fury of Mie Sheng in the Higher Heavens.","Waves of Death’s power descended, coalescing into numerous embodiments of Mie Sheng.","“Jian Wushuang!!!”","These black phantoms each possessed supreme-peak strength.","Initially startled, Jian Wushuang quickly realized that these black phantoms were all manifestations of Death’s power. Despite their supreme-peak strength, they couldn’t last, posing no real threat to him.","“Mie Sheng, your plan is perfect, but you overlooked one thing!” Jian Wushuang stood on the mountain peak, overlooking countless black phantoms fusing together, while their aura continued to grow stronger.","Yet, Jian Wushuang remained completely unfazed.","Even when fused, Mie Sheng was still just Mie Sheng.","After borrowing the power of the Starry Sky from the Higher Heavens, Jian Wushuang could instantly reach the Tribulation realm.","Here, Jian Wushuang was unyielding against Mie Sheng.","The fused Mie Sheng’s expression changed, surprised as he asked, “Where did I go wrong?”","“You should know I’ve been to the Starry Sky, but you’d never guess my true identity amidst the Starry Sky!” Jian Wushuang looked down with a cold smile.","Mie Sheng squinted his eyes and sneered, “Oh? Is that so!”","“Even if you have a connection with Dong Jun, I don’t care, because Dong Jun is already dead!”","“Dong Jun?” Jian Wushuang raised his head, confirming his earlier speculation that Dong Jun had indeed fallen to Mie Sheng.","Mie Sheng continued, “You do know about Dong Jun. Besides him, I doubt anyone could keep you so composed. Now, understand this: in the Higher Heavens, I stand alone. No one can save you!”","“You actually managed to kill Dong Jun!” Jian Wushuang feigned astonishment.","He actually knew very little about the Starry Sky human tribe because, at the time, the tribe was too weak, and he didn’t bother to pay any attention to them.","So, taking the opportunity to probe Mie Sheng, he wanted to understand more about how the Starry Sky human tribe within the Higher Heavens had perished or what their strength was like.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s astonishment, Mie Sheng sneered, “Do you really think Dong Jun is powerful? Compared to the Starry Sky, he’s nothing more than a worm. I am the true ruler of the Starry Sky, the chosen one of the human tribe!”","“Humph, I don’t believe it!” Jian Wushuang’s expression slightly darkened, and he continued, “With Dong Jun’s strength being so formidable, how could he lose to someone at the Six Tribulation realm like you?”","Upon hearing this, Mie Sheng couldn’t help but burst into laughter.","“Yes, indeed, the Six Tribulation realm is not Dong Jun’s match. Even Qishen is not Dong Jun’s opponent. But I’m at the Nine Tribulation realm, whether you believe it or not!” Mie Sheng raised a finger, pointing at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang didn’t dodge or evade, calmly dissolving the aura with just a glance, and sarcastically said, “If you’re at the Nine Tribulation realm, do you still need to devour the power of Life? Haven’t you long since mastered the control of time and freely traveled through it?”","His words shattered Mie Sheng’s lie.","There was no need to pretend in front of him.","Exposed, Mie Sheng’s face drastically changed, angrily shouting, “Kid, you dare to deceive me!”","He now realized that Jian Wushuang had already uncovered his previous schemes.","Without hesitation, Mie Sheng directly took action, condensing the body of Death, transforming into black mist that instantly corroded the heavens and earth, causing the entire space to lose the power of All Things.","Utter and complete Death—a desolate scene unfolded.","Jian Wushuang remained unmoved.","“Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","Under the Higher Heavens, he was invincible.","Because under the Higher Heavens, there was an immense force of the Starry Sky, continuously descending into Jian Wushuang’s body, allowing him to instantly reach the strength of the Tribulation realm.","This scene stunned Mie Sheng; he hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to harness the power of the Higher Heavens and become so powerful.","His true form within the Higher Heavens was equally formidable.","This was a unique power of life forms from the Starry Sky, yet Jian Wushuang somehow mastered it and to such a powerful extent.","“What cultivation realm do you occupy in the Starry Sky?” Mie Sheng couldn’t help but ask.","Jian Wushuang, however, remained silent and directly attacked.","He didn’t want to say more to Mie Sheng; otherwise, he might be manipulated by the opponent.","Immediately, he exerted full force. Facing the embodiment of Death, his power of Life erupted fiercely. The Life power mastered at the Tribulation realm directly dispersed the aura of Death.","Mie Sheng’s consciousness also instantly collapsed.","In the moment of his defeat, Jian Wushuang seized the remaining consciousness of Mie Sheng.","“Still want to escape?” Holding the shattered consciousness of the opponent, Jian Wushuang directly sealed it in the temporal river of the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","After Mie Sheng’s consciousness entered the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, his expression changed drastically, and he exclaimed incredulously, “How do you have a Temporal Treasure?”","“I can’t tell you that!” Jian Wushuang said, and he directly suppressed Mie Sheng’s remaining consciousness at the bottom of the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard’s temporal river.","In the Origin Source Sea within his body, Jian Wushuang also seized the Death power left by Mie Sheng.","“Hmph, now you’ve lost both the wife and the soldiers!”","With the consciousness of Mie Sheng and the power of Death, he could create Mie Sheng’s avatar. Mie Sheng could devour him, and he could also devour Mie Sheng.","This presented a great opportunity for him, but obtaining it was exceedingly difficult.","Now that Mie Sheng had fallen into the trap he personally set, Jian Wushuang only needed an avatar to devour Mie Sheng’s avatar, allowing him to grasp the cycle of reincarnation ahead of time.","However, he had to wait until he reached the cultivation realm of Emperor to achieve this.","The complete cycle of reincarnation contained a formidable power, not inferior to the power of the temporal river.","If Jian Wushuang could reach the Nine Tribulation realm in the future, he would be able to master two types of abilities: time and space, and reincarnation.","The combination of the two would result in the cycle of time and space, a power much stronger than time alone.","Thinking about this, Jian Wushuang felt a surge of excitement.","“Tsk tsk, Mie Sheng, I won’t give you another chance!” Jian Wushuang decided to leave.","When he reached the temporal vortex, he would no longer explore those fragments, insisting on moving forward.","However, the current fragment was not completely consumed, so he still needed to wait here.","In the Higher Heavens, Mie Sheng, with a stern expression, stared at Jian Wushuang below.","“How could he know!”","As Jian Wushuang had said, once he mastered the power of reincarnation first, Mie Sheng’s chances would be slim. But now, despite using all available methods, Mie Sheng couldn’t defeat Jian Wushuang.","“Master, it seems I’m destined to lose in this life!” Mie Sheng slowly closed his eyes, and the figure of his master appeared in his mind.","That was the true Lord of Death.","A colorful and vibrant corpse – that was Mie Sheng’s master.","This corpse had entered the Starry Sky at an unknown time and had completely disappeared at some point."]},{"number":5624,"title":"Chapter 5624 Leave","paragraphs":["Chapter 5624 Leave","After years of sitting in solitude, Jian Wushuang’s figure began to dissipate. Before leaving, he couldn’t resist taunting Mie Sheng.","....","His intention was to provoke anger in the other.","He wasn’t afraid of the other party reacting impulsively; he feared the silence, as if the other was scheming something sinister without uttering a word.","As his figure vanished, Mie Sheng within the Higher Heavens also disappeared, returning to the temporal river outside the Original Universe.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang didn’t return to the temporal vortex. Instead, he directly left the space-time whirlpool.","It turned out that the existence of the temporal vortex was tied to Mie Sheng’s consciousness. With Mie Sheng’s consciousness gone, Jian Wushuang appeared directly in the cave of the Mahayana Spirit Mountain.","Unable to help it, all the tactics he could employ were used. Jian Wushuang now understood Mie Sheng’s strategy.","Attempting to make him encounter the real Mie Sheng through luck.","It was almost an unrealistic expectation.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang wasn’t a fool. If things got tough, he could simply avoid the fragmented space and use his Thought power to burst out of the time vortex.","Initially, Jian Wushuang didn’t realize it was Mie Sheng’s plan. He thought he couldn’t leave, that’s all.","After leaving the time vortex and returning to the cave of the Mahayana Spirit Mountain, he discovered that the light here was abundant, devoid of darkness.","Exquisite murals adorned the walls on both sides.","After leaving the time vortex and returning to the cave of the Mahayana Spirit Mountain, he discovered that the light here was abundant, devoid of darkness.","Exquisite murals adorned the walls on both sides.","A few steps ahead lay the exit.","“Phew!”","Jian Wushuang heaved a sigh of relief. Finally back in the real world, he had experienced too much in these days.","With a stride, he instantly left the cave and arrived at the entrance.","Gong Miaoyi and Qianxing Buddha were waiting for him outside.","“Thanks to both of you!” After emerging, Jian Wushuang respectfully bowed to the two.","Gong Miaoyi didn’t say much, stepping aside.","Qianxing Buddha clasped his hands together and spoke, “Virtuous one, this fleeting dream may have been fraught with countless hardships. Let us discuss further beneath the Guti Tree, where preparations have been made with comfortable cushions to help you calm your mind.”","“Thank you, Lord Qianxing Buddha!” Jian Wushuang clasped his hands together once again, expressing his gratitude.","Although his Dao Heart was already complete, and external objects were unnecessary to restore his state of mind, he couldn’t bring himself to refuse the sincere offer.","Glancing at Gong Miaoyi, Jian Wushuang tentatively asked, “Together?”","“No,” Miaoyi shook her head.","Seeing her firm refusal, Jian Wushuang didn’t insist, but he still handed over a mustard seed containing Nie Yuan’s Sword Dao legacy and some treasures as compensation.","Consider it a form of reparation!","Originally, he had treated her as a pawn. In hindsight, if Miaoyi hadn’t encountered him, perhaps nothing would have happened.","With earnestly inheriting her mother’s legacy and obtaining the Bloodfall Crystal, she would likely fear no enemy.","It was all fate!","After sighing, Jian Wushuang followed Qianxing Buddha.","He hadn’t obtained the Heart of the Beast God yet, but he was already eyeing the Heart of the Guti Tree.","The second Nascent Soul.","Also known as the second life.","The cost for Dao Lords to cultivate the second Nascent Soul wasn’t too great. It didn’t require the entire Heart of the Guti Tree. However, when advancing to the Emperor realm, one would likely need the entire Heart of the Guti Tree to cultivate the second Nascent Soul.","He wondered how the other party would react when he made this request later.","He was willing to give up everything, even his dignity.","The second Nascent Soul was originally a term used for the mortal realm. Now, it should be more appropriately called the second Origin Source.","Jian Wushuang originally had two Origin Sources, and cultivating another one would make it three.","For the third Origin Source, he had already planned to use his Life Origin Source and then devour Mie Sheng’s avatar to become the Origin Source of Reincarnation.","Perfect.","He had already started calculating how many valuable treasures he had left in his possession, planning to discuss it with Qianxing Buddha later.","Not long after sitting down, someone delivered the Beast God Heart to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was not particularly surprised by this; considering the bleak future he faced, even obtaining the Beast God Heart didn’t faze him.","Taking the Beast God Heart, Jian Wushuang casually pulled out an exquisite eternal treasure, a scepter, from his mustard seed.","“Grandmaster Pu Shi, please accept this little trinket, and I apologize for any inconvenience caused this time!” Jian Wushuang was extremely polite, almost on the verge of directly stuffing it into the mustard seed of the other party.","Grandmaster Pu Shi had never encountered such a situation, vehemently trying to decline, but his eyes were constantly glancing at Qianxing Buddha.","Qianxing Buddha cleared his throat and calmly said, “Since it’s a kind gesture from a benefactor, Grandmaster Pu Shi, please accept it!”","“Amitabha, many thanks for the kind gesture, benefactor!” Grandmaster Pu Shi accepted the scepter, genuinely pleased.","This was truly an exquisite Eternal Treasure!","Even tier 6 Emperors rarely possessed such items.","After Grandmaster Pu Shi left, only the two of them remained, sitting and drinking tea.","Jian Wushuang had been contemplating for a long time, but he just couldn’t bring himself to say it.","Unexpectedly, Qianxing Buddha took the initiative to bring it up.","“Benefactor Wushuang, what do you think of this ancient tree?” Qianxing Buddha kicked his feet, looking up at the Guti Tree.","For a moment, Jian Wushuang didn’t quite understand, but he followed along, saying, “This ancient Guti Tree is indeed extraordinary. Not only can it calm the mind, but it is also said that the heart of the ancient teak inside can enable Emperors to cultivate a second Origin Source!”","“Haha, the rumors are a bit exaggerated. If it were an ordinary Emperor, they might be able to cultivate a second Origin Source. However, at my level, there is no hope anymore. So, this Guti Tree is useless for me!” Qianxing Buddha said with a tinge of regret, continuing, “In my youth, I wasn’t qualified to cultivate a second Origin Source. But when I became qualified, it was already in my twilight years!”","This time, Jian Wushuang was able to discern that when Qianxing Buddha wanted to cultivate a second Origin Source in the past, he lacked the qualifications.","Once qualified, and with a realm too high to rely on the Guti Heart for cultivating the second Origin Source, Jian Wushuang found himself in a position where he needed to seize the opportunity.","Having discerned the thoughts of the other party, he flashed a knowing smile and directly opened up, saying, “This time, Lord Qianxing Buddha has shown great kindness to me. Whatever you need, just speak!”","“Virtuous Wushuang, your words are too heavy. Removing the killing calamity is a trivial matter, and as for the Heart of the Beast God, it no longer belongs to our mountain. Moreover, Virtous One, you’ve already provided compensation; how could I dare to ask for more!” Qianxin Buddha hurriedly declined.","This time, Jian Wushuang frowned; he couldn’t quite understand what this old monk was really after.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s confusion, Qianxing paused for a moment and spoke, “This time, there is indeed a small matter that Virtuos Wushuang can help with. If this matter succeeds, anything that you find appealing in Mahayana Spirit Mountain can be taken!”","These words were exceptionally domineering, as if he held an unassailable authority.","Mahayana Spirit Mountain was not exclusively under the control of Qianxing alone.","“Well, this seems too easy for me. Just tell me what you need help with!” Jian Wushuang smiled and patiently waited for Qianxing Buddha’s request.","After taking a sip of tea, Qianxing Buddha lowered his voice and said, “Convey a message to Lord Zhen Ling for me!”","“A message?” Jian Wushuang tilted his head slightly, looking at Qianxing in surprise.","Knowing about Zhen Ling was not unexpected. In recent years, Zhen Ling had become deeply ingrained in people’s hearts.","“Yes, just deliver a sentence!”"]},{"number":5625,"title":"Chapter 5625: Guti Tree Heart","paragraphs":["Chapter 5625: Guti Tree Heart","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang, although surprised, didn’t consider it a significant matter.","He directly agreed!","“Then, I thank Master Jian Wushuang. Please deliver this mustard seed to Lord Zhen Ling!” Qianxing slightly bowed, then took out a mustard seed and handed it to Jian Wushuang.","As Jian Wushuang received it, a strand of his Thought power delved in, only to find that even he couldn’t unlock it, which surprised him. But thinking about it, Mahayana Spirit Mountain was an ancient and renowned peak, and the treasures handed down through its lineage were naturally extraordinary.","It seemed that Qianxing intended to make some kind of deal with Zhen Ling using Mahayana Spirit Mountain.","Unfortunately!","The other party didn’t understand Zhen Ling’s temperament.","For Zhen Ling, the entire Qishen Temple was his own; where was the room for any transactions?","“Lord Qianxing, I heard that this Guti Tree can nurture a second Origin Source. Is it true or false?” Jian Wushuang revealed a smile, simultaneously laying his cards on the table.","He wanted the heart of this Guti Tree.","But not too much; he was just a Dao Lord now, and one-third was enough.","He could pay for it as long as the other party agreed.","The other party had hinted at it before; there was no reason not to agree.","Qianxing wasn’t a fool. He immediately understood, took a sip of tea, then smiled at Jian Wushuang.","He was waiting for Jian Wushuang to state his price.","Clatter!","Jian Wushuang directly took out treasures worth more than 100,000 cubic units of universe crystals, of various kinds.","In fact, he had many more cubic universe crystals, but those might be needed when merging the Dao, so he didn’t bring them out.","The value of these treasures alone exceeded 100,000 cubic units of universe crystals.","Most importantly, there was his power of Life.","That was priceless.","Jian Wushuang gathered a trace of green light at his fingertips, and a surge of profound Life power instantly erupted, rejuvenating the ancient Guti Tree.","“I only need one-third of the Guti Heart, and once obtained, I will repair the backlash caused by the lack of Guti Heart. Outsiders will never notice!” Jian Wushuang confidently assured.","Qianxing Buddha’s eyes gleamed with envy, undoubtedly attracted by those treasures.","The Mahayana Spirit Mountain refrained from emerging this time solely to await Jian Wushuang.","It was not because someone informed the Qianxing Buddha in advance, but rather this calamity had long been foreseen.","Assisting Jian Wushuang was already a significant gain, establishing a karmic connection with the future Jian Wushuang.","Now, obtaining so many treasures was truly a double benefit.","As for the Guti Tree, Qianxing Buddha didn’t pay much attention to it.","Regardless of whether it was for the Mahayana Spirit Mountain or other reasons, they would all go out.","Restoring the Origin Source would allow them to go even further, a dream for every supreme-peak.","With the opportunity now right in front of them, how could they not seize it?","“No problem!” Qianxing Buddha directly agreed.","Jian Wushuang didn’t expect the other party to be so generous.","According to his understanding, shouldn’t the Guti Tree be the foremost treasure of the Mahayana Spirit Mountain?","Just a casual remark, and the foremost treasure was given away.","Although the Guti Tree’s heart would recover, the required time was incredibly long.","“In that case, thank you, Qianxing Buddha!” Jian Wushuang stood up directly.","With the deal settled, there was nothing more to discuss.","Great favors need no words; there would be plenty of opportunities in the future.","Qianxing Buddha also stood up, casually making a cut on the Guti Tree, revealing a complete Guti Heart before them.","When Jian Wushuang saw the Guti Heart, his eyes twitched.","The power contained in that heart was exceptionally formidable.","Even stronger than his own perfected Dao Heart.","No wonder it’s considered the top treasure.","Swoosh!","Through the spatial rift, Qianxing Buddha directly took out a third of the Guti Tree’s heart and handed it to Jian Wushuang.","In the next moment, the radiance of the Guti Tree dimmed significantly.","However, Jian Wushuang possessed the power of life, which could help the Guti Tree recover.","Consider this as a form of gratitude!","After taking out a third of the Guti Tree’s heart, the opening disappeared.","If it were ordinary people or cultivators unfamiliar with spatial knowledge, they might think the Guti Tree had been moved aside.","But in reality, Qianxing Buddha only pierced through a certain layer of space through the nine layers, extracting the heart from the intact Guti Tree.","It’s similar to how an Emperor would go and kill an ordinary person.","Being able to take out the opponent’s heart without harming their body.","This is the power of space.","Ordinary people can only see the essence of space.","Yet, they can penetrate through that essence to grasp the core.","After obtaining the Guti Tree’s heart, Jian Wushuang’s journey to the west this time came to a successful conclusion.","Before leaving, he infused a clump of life force into the Guti Tree. After bidding farewell to Qianxing Buddha, he completely left Mahayana Spirit Mountain.","This time, he did not choose to use the teleportation array.","Instead, he unleashed his full strength, relying solely on flying to reach the headquarters of the Qishen Temple.","His current speed was much faster than before.","Under normal circumstances, it could rival the top of the supreme-peak.","When using the ancient transformation, he could even reach the perfection of the supreme-peak.","Space black holes, perfected Dao Heart.","Once felt at the pinnacle, Jian Wushuang now, looking back, felt that he had no limits at all, only continuous transcendence.","At present, he had only one opportunity left.","That opportunity was the Dao Merge.","To harmonize with Dao in the most perfect manner.","Boom!!!","His aura continuously surged as he flew over a massive lake, creating countless waves.","Now, not only was his Dao Heart complete, but his aura had also reached its most perfect state.","Jian Wushuang, who originally planned to harmonize with Dao on the spot, felt that it was somewhat inappropriate.","With his current strength, going to the Grave God Mountain was a breeze.","First, he would go to the temple, take the super teleportation array to reach the God’s Tomb Realm, and in just about a day, he would arrive at the Grave God Mountain.","For him, it could hardly be considered a trial.","Most of the Special LIfe Forms that lived in the God’s Tomb Realm had been moved to the Original Universe to engage in external battles.","Few powerful beings remained in the Four Great Secret Realms.","To the extent that after Jian Wushuang left the Mahayana Spirit Mountain, he hadn’t encountered a supreme-peak powerhouse.","The headquarters of the temple!","Or more precisely, the White Tiger Temple.","Among the Four Great Temples, the White Tiger Temple, once a powerful force, was now somewhat desolate.","Because the pressure had shifted to the Azure Dragon Temple.","External battles and killings were all under the jurisdiction of the Azure Dragon Temple.","Internally, it was the White Tiger Temple.","Now that the internal threats were gone, the White Tiger Temple naturally became desolate.","However, as the Master of the White Tiger Temple, Bai Yi felt a bit sentimental.","He had dominated the Four Great Secret Realms for an entire era.","Now that he was free, he felt somewhat uneasy.","When Jian Wushuang arrived, he directly saw the venerable Bai Yi. It was somewhat surprising even in the grand hall.","Once upon a time, meeting this busy figure was extremely difficult.","Even if they met, it was only through an avatar.","Now, the true form was sitting in the grand hall, leisurely drinking.","It was somewhat similar to the past Long Yi.","The Four Great Secret Realms had all become a backyard.","When Bai Yi felt the immensely powerful aura of Jian Wushuang, he was also momentarily stunned.","Now that the Heavenly Realm was incredibly peaceful, he hadn’t paid attention to the auras of the powerful beings within the Heavenly Realm. Seeing Jian Wushuang now, there was a shock in his heart."]},{"number":5626,"title":"Chapter 5626: To the God’s Tomb","paragraphs":["Chapter 5626: To the God’s Tomb","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After discovering that it was Jian Wushuang, his brows furrowed slightly.","Jian Wushuang, with an extremely restrained demeanor and an absolutely outwardly released aura, turned out to be so powerful.","“Jian Wushuang, have you integrated with the Dao?” Bai Yi couldn’t be certain.","Because even he couldn’t fathom Jian Wushuang at this moment.","Standing outside the teleportation array, Jian Wushuang looked up towards the outside, penetrating it with a single glance.","Seeing Bai Yi above the main hall, he revealed a slight smile. After that, with a flicker, he entered the White Tiger Temple. Standing inside the hall, Jian Wushuang remained neither humble nor arrogant, and said with a faint smile, “I haven’t integrated with the Dao yet. If I had known the Temple Master was here, I would have visited earlier!”","“Within just one epoch, you’ve reached my position. Truly worthy of being the invincible Dao Lord!” Bai Yi looked at Jian Wushuang with some emotion.","Thinking back to the first time he saw Jian Wushuang, although he was also a Dao Lord, at that time, Jian Wushuang, at his strongest, was only comparable to a tier 2 Emperor.","Now, the aura emitted was only slightly weaker than his own Origin Source.","The strength of the Four Temple Masters varied, but even the weakest among them was stronger than a Divine General.","All of them were beings capable of matching the level of a Tribulation realm cultivator.","In Jian Wushuang’s current peak state, he had already reached the complete-stage of supreme-peak.","Indeed, he was only a tiny bit weaker than them.","“Temple Master, you flatter me. My achievements are nothing more than good fortune!” Jian Wushuang remained as modest as ever.","However, Bai Yi shook his head and said, “Your accomplishments are by no means just luck; it’s the strength of your formidable Dao Heart!”","With his intricately structured Seven Orifices Linglong Heart, Bai Yi could see at a glance that Jian Wushuang’s state of mind was like a majestic lake, without a ripple.","Undoubtedly, his Dao Heart was perfect.","“Is your visit this time to go to the Tomb God Mountain?” Bai Yi asked tentatively.","Jian Wushuang smiled and nodded, responding, “Indeed, I am heading to the Grave God Mountain. Speaking of which, I have never been there before!”","Always hearing about the formidable nature of Grave God Mountain, this was his first visit, even though he had little left to improve upon. Still, there was some anticipation.","That anticipation stemmed from becoming an Emperor.","On one hand, he looked forward to how strong he would become after becoming an Emperor. On the other hand, it was because, after combining his paths, he anticipated the transformation he would undergo on the Grave God Mountain as an Emperor.","Those with mediocre aptitude, like Dao Lords, could cultivate at an astonishing speed after combining their paths.","So, what kind of situation would he encounter after combining his paths?","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s response, Bai Yi nodded affirmatively and said, “It’s time to take a look. That place is the true holy land for cultivation!”","“Come, I will personally activate the teleportation array for you and directly transport you to the God’s Tomb!” Bai Yi stood up directly, leading Jian Wushuang to the outside of the teleportation array.","Jian Wushuang did not expect the other party to be so courteous and quickly expressed his gratitude before entering the teleportation array.","This was also a result of his formidable strength.","Even the puppet Bai Yi took notice of him.","The future of the Qishen Temple might indeed rely on Jian Wushuang.","Now, chaos reigned in the outside world, and the arrival of the Temple of World Annihilation caused a greater commotion than the Qishen Temple.","In terms of treasures, the Temple of World Annihilation was no weaker than the Qishen Temple.","Now, even in a single era, Jian Wushuang could contend evenly with the Inheritors of the Qishen Temple.","The future of the Qishen Temple was bound to enter a period of decline.","This was because the number of Inheritors in the Qishen Temple was decreasing.","On the other hand, the strength of the Temple of Annihilation was increasing.","However, Zhen Ling was worried about Mie Sheng’s calculations, and Mie Sheng was equally concerned about Zhen Ling’s calculations.","Now, although there were fewer Yan Immortals left in the Qishen Temple, they could still maintain the selection process for an era.","The pace only slowed down, and it was no longer as grand as it used to be.","In general, they still had some successes.","Now, at times, they could even gain the upper hand.","From the memories of the future, Jian Wushuang also learned about the rise of the Temple of World Annihilation.","Not only did they cultivate elite Inheritors, but they also recruited some ordinary Emperors, without any discrimination.","Although the strength of ordinary Emperors was not impressive, the Temple of World Annihilation possessed a unique treasure, a treasure that not even the Moro Temporal River had.","Holy Water!","For an ordinary tier 2 Emperor, just a drop of Holy Water could mutate their Origin Source. However, the price was a space of eternal stagnation, with no room for progress.","The body would also undergo changes.","This method was similar to the self-sacrifice ceremony that Jian Wushuang was familiar with.","It was created by Shen Ling and seemed to be a means by which Frolasa, following some method from the inheritance memories, produced a way to enhance the body.","The Temple of World Annihilation, using the self-sacrifice ceremony, cultivated a large number of powerful individuals.","The self-sacrifice ceremony of a tier 1 Emperor could turn them into a tier 4 Emperor.","A tier 2 Emperor could become a tier 5 Emperor.","In the Original Universe, there was no need for such methods to produce powerful individuals who could become tier 3 Emperors.","In the vastness of the temporal river, regardless of the Original Universe, a tier 3 Emperor was a formidable figure.","With just some inheritances, the potential of these tier 3 Emperors could be developed.","Only by relying on elite Emperors could one persistently contend against the Qishen Temple.","So, those Emperors who underwent the sacrifice ritual were the weakest, unable to elevate themselves and could only opt for consuming the Holy Water.","But it was their voluntary choice.","In the face of power, they yearned for it immensely, without the need for coercion or threats.","Unfortunately, Jian Wushuang couldn’t go out.","If it weren’t for Mie Sheng targeting him, he would have liked to venture out and confront the formidable opponents in the temporal river.","The current temporal river was different from the past.","Many supreme-peaks had emerged.","Moreover, within the Temple of World Annihilation, there were also numerous Ultimate Emperors.","Swish!","In the moment the teleportation array activated, Jian Wushuang instantly descended into the God’s Tomb Secret Realm.","Vast, murky, and a sense of silence made Jian Wushuang feel like he had entered a continent left behind from a primeval era.","Perhaps it truly was a continent left behind from the Moro Spacetime of barbarism.","With one step, Jian Wushuang felt a familiar sensation coursing through his body.","That aura, Jian Wushuang had sensed it in the Moro Spacetime.","It should be the power from the Higher Heavens Era.","This indicated that within the God’s Tomb, there were treasures from the Higher Heavens.","Jian Wushuang was not surprised by this.","Qishen must have obtained treasures from the Higher Heavens to become a semi-Eight Tribulation realm powerhouse.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t have been able to firmly suppress Mie Sheng.","They only chose to cooperate with Mie Sheng right before their downfall.","Continuously teleporting, countless thoughts also surged in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","Soon, billions of miles away, he saw the towering God’s Tomb Mountain.","On the spiral-shaped mountain, there was a vast sea or, one might say, a river.","There was also a forest of towering giant trees.","They intertwined on the God’s Tomb Mountain, and one mountain contained all the scenes of a world.","Truly magical.","Jian Wushuang’s aura began to converge, the powerful aura all entering the black hole, and then he returned to a calm state, just like an ordinary Emperor.","Swish!","When he appeared again, Jian Wushuang was already on a massive warship."]},{"number":5627,"title":"Chapter 5627 Inheritors!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5627 Inheritors!","Above the bow of the ship still hung the grand flag of the Vermilion Bird Temple.","....","“Jian Wushuang!” A woman clad in crimson battle armor exclaimed upon seeing the sudden appearance of a powerful figure on the deck.","Hearing her call his name, Jian Wushuang turned to look and, recognizing a familiar face, smiled faintly. “Zhu Qi!”","This large ship was designated for the selected inheritors of the Vermilion Bird Temple.","Only by boarding this warship could they traverse through spacetime and enter the Grave God Mountain.","Despite the Grave God Mountain being seemingly close, even someone like Jian Wushuang couldn’t fly there directly.","Only by riding the corresponding treasure could one enter the Grave God Mountain.","This was because the spacetime of the Grave God Mountain and the God’s Tomb did not align.","They appeared to be together only to the naked eye.","Jian Wushuang was fortunate to encounter a warship carrying recently selected inheritors on their way to the Grave God Mountain.","Surprisingly, the familiar figure commanding this warship was Zhu Qi.","It was Zhu Qi who had once delivered him to the Demon Sound Mountain.","It seemed there was still some unresolved relationship between him and Shan Jun.","“What a coincidence, Envoy Zhu Qi!” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","In the blink of an eye, he had far surpassed Zhu Qi.","Those Envoys of the Four Temples were nothing more than ordinary puppets left over from refining the Four Temple Masters.","Although they possessed Seven Orifices Linglong Heart, their combat power was far inferior, merely at the level of a tier 5 Emperor.","Now, Jian Wushuang could easily tear them apart with a casual strike.","“How come you’re here?” Zhu Qi stood up and walked directly to Jian Wushuang, questioning him.","As she approached, Jian Wushuang could clearly see symmetric cracks on her face, and he couldn’t help but be surprised by Shan Jun’s taste.","However, since she asked, he answered honestly.","Upon hearing that Jian Wushuang was also heading to the Grave God Mountain, Zhu Qi wasn’t surprised. Instead, she inquired about Shan Jun’s situation.","Once the words left her mouth, she regretted them a bit.","She felt that Jian Wushuang’s aura was quite weak, only at the level of an ordinary Emperor. Asking seemed equivalent to not asking at all.","After all, she had always been in the Vermilion Bird Temple of the Original Realm, and her knowledge about Jian Wushuang was limited. She had only heard that he was an invincible Dao Lord.","On the deck, thousands of Inheritors noticed the sudden appearance of a stranger. Judging by the looks, he seemed to be acquainted with the Envoy from the Vermilion Bird Temple. They were all curious.","These youngsters included Dao Lords and Grand Yan Immortals.","Curiosity about the present situation led them to gaze over.","When they heard the name Jian Wushuang, they were momentarily stunned.","Then someone exclaimed, “Invincible Dao Lord, Jian Wushuang?”","Even though they had undergone trials in the Black Tortoise Temple’s grand world, some of their predecessors had long entered the Qishen Temple, holding respectable positions. In the past, they might not have been able to enter the Black Tortoise Temple.","However, with the emergence of the Temple of World Annihilation, the Black Tortoise Temple changed its usual practice.","Not only did it provide numerous puppets to aid the Azure Dragon Temple’s conquest, but it also incorporated many of these puppets into the ranks of the outstanding talents.","Among these individuals, there were those who had witnessed the magnificence of Jian Wushuang.","They passed down the word to their juniors, saying that when entering the Grave God Mountain in the future, they shouldn’t aim to surpass Jian Wushuang. As long as they could reach the realm achieved by Jian Wushuang after their Dao Merge, it would be sufficient.","Jian Wushuang possessed supreme-peak strength. If these young ones could all become supreme-peak figures in the future, it would indeed be commendable.","The difficulty of the Tribulation Realm was immense. It had been an entire epoch, and despite the countless resources poured down by the Qishen Temple, not a single Tribulation Realm expert had emerged.","It was easy to imagine the level of difficulty involved.","Hence, until now, reaching the supreme-peak was considered the pinnacle.","The external world was no different.","The supreme-peak represented super-strong individuals, rarely falling. The Temple of World Annihilation had few supreme-peak experts, and throughout the long conflict, they had yet to see the fall of a supreme-peak figure. The most casualties were among Dao Lords and ordinary Emperors.","Each conquest in the universe started from the bottom, gradually escalating to battles among super Emperors.","In a typical cosmic conquest, when a tier 6 Emperor participated in the battle, it was considered a massive event, prompting discussions even within the Qishen Temple.","Not to mention the supreme-peak.","Therefore, for a considerable period, the supreme-peak would stand atop the temporal river, unless a large number of formidable beings from the Tribulation realm appeared.","But currently, that seemed unlikely.","As the Temple of World Annihilation descended, Mie Sheng had never appeared. Similar to Zhen Ling, to sustain the operation of the Temple of World Annihilation, one had to embody myriad forms.","Now, consider Jian Wushuang at this moment.","Upon hearing Zhu Qi’s inquiry, a tremor crossed his countenance, and his face flushed for a moment.","His current strength indeed allowed him to retrieve Shan Jun, who was originally suppressed in the Second Prison. However, Shan Jun was no more; he had been taken away by Mie Sheng.","“I apologize for the matter concerning Shan Jun!” Jian Wushuang clasped his hands in apology.","If it had happened a bit earlier, perhaps he would have succeeded.","Yet, even if he had succeeded, he couldn’t prevent Mie Sheng from taking someone away.","He could only wait until he finished the Dao Merge and then find a solution.","He had indeed accumulated quite a bit of karma now.","Although without the karma of killing and calamity, he was free from the consequences, it still needed to be repaid.","Zhu Qi’s eyes flickered, suppressing the sorrow within.","She shook her head, pretending to be composed, “It’s okay, it’s not your fault. You probably haven’t merged with the Dao yet!”","Sensing Jian Wushuang’s awkwardness, Zhu Qi quickly changed the topic.","She knew that Shan Jun valued Jian Wushuang, so she also had a favorable impression of him.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang felt even more uncomfortable. It seemed that he was indeed too useless.","But it was true.","He couldn’t protect anyone.","“This time, heading to the Grave God Mountain is preparation for merging with the Dao!” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","Zhu Qi nodded, encouragingly saying, “With your strength, merging the Dao shouldn’t be difficult. Moreover, your Dao Heart is exceptionally strong now. You will definitely succeed. Don’t let down those who can’t return!”","Those who can’t return!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes also welled up with tears.","Yes!","He couldn’t let down those who couldn’t return.","Those who had once helped him all hoped for him to become incredibly powerful, and he couldn’t disappoint them.","“I will,” Jian Wushuang nodded solemnly.","There was a glimmer in Zhu Qi’s eyes. Her own strength was too weak to save Lord Shan Jun, so she could only place her hopes on Jian Wushuang.","After saying these words, without further ado, she left the deck.","She also informed Jian Wushuang that it would take an hour to traverse time and reach the Grave God Mountain.","Just an hour. Jian Wushuang naturally wasn’t in a hurry, standing on the deck’s bow, staring at the turbid void. Meanwhile, his body within the Origin Source continued its constant cultivation.","Although he had achieved perfection in all aspects now, it didn’t mean he could stop practicing.","He dared not halt his deep study of the Dao Merge, not for even a moment.","The failures in the future allowed no room for any room for error.","Failure was not an option!","As he silently cultivated, several Inheritors who had not yet been to the Grave God Mountain gathered around.","However, they all felt that Jian Wushuang’s aura was extraordinary. Even though he had restrained it somewhat, there was still a trace of the Emperor’s presence."]},{"number":5628,"title":"Chapter 5628 Ji Wushuang","paragraphs":["Chapter 5628 Ji Wushuang","The Dao Lords who could rival the Emperor were indeed formidable in their eyes.","....","The current trial participants, having undergone earlier cultivation in the Black Tortoise Temple, had decent strength.","Among them were several Ultimate Dao Lords who could already match the strength of a tier 2 Emperor.","The title of Invincible Dao Lord held by Jian Wushuang naturally caught their interest.","Even though they knew there was a high probability of not being a match, they still wanted to see how formidable the Invincible Dao Lord truly was, to the extent that their ancestors claimed reaching the strength of Jian Wushuang Dao Lord after combining paths.","“You are Jian Wushuang!”","A crisp female voice rang out. Jian Wushuang turned slowly, his long hair obscuring his side profile. Upon discovering a few youngsters, Jian Wushuang responded indifferently, “What’s the matter?”","The woman who spoke stepped forward, determination in her eyes. She said, “Junior from the Ji Family Dynasty, Ji Wushuang, wishes to seek guidance from the senior!”","“Ji Family Dynasty?” Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow and asked, “What’s your relationship with Ji Chaoyang?”","Ji Wushuang’s face brightened, hastily answering, “He is my uncle!”","“Your Ji Family can produce two Ultimate Dao experts; that’s truly good fortune!” Jian Wushuang praised.","Ji Chaoyang was probably already a tier 6 Emperor, and reaching the supreme-peak was not difficult.","Now, another niece appeared, already an Ultimate Dao Lord, comparable in strength to an ordinary tier 2 Emperor. In the future, her achievements might not be inferior to her uncle’s.","Moreover, their names were somewhat similar, and the other party was quite young, not even a full epoch, indicating an intentional choice of the name Ji Wushuang.","Ji Wushuang! What a great name!","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s praise, Ji Wushuang also displayed a proud expression.","Before the Qishen Temple emerged, the Ji Family Dynasty already had a tier 4 Emperor overseeing, and there was also an ancestor, a tier 5 Emperor, wandering in the river of spacetime.","Now, the Ji Family not only produced Ji Chaoyang, an ultimate tier 6 Emperor, but also two ordinary tier 6 Emperors and dozens of tier 5 Emperors.","If it were in the past, they could have dominated a certain universe. However, at present, various family forces were in an explosive period, making it less obvious.","In the vast expanse of the primal universe, Jian Wushuang held a position among the top ten superpowers.","Ji Wushuang, the proud daughter of the Ji family, naturally felt an overwhelming sense of pride.","“I and your Imperial Uncle can be considered old friends. Since you, the younger generation, have spoken up, I’ll spar with you!” Jian Wushuang turned around, wearing a smile.","Not lacking in cultivation time, these youngsters stared at him with fervent eyes. How could he not know? He decided to showcase some strength to dampen their spirits.","Upon hearing this, Ji Wushuang was extremely excited, releasing her entire aura, creating ripples in the air.","“Be careful, Uncle Master Wushuang. The power of my move is not to be underestimated!” Ji Wushuang was adept at building relationships and immediately established a niece-uncle bond between them.","Jian Wushuang didn’t mind, considering the hierarchy, it was appropriate to call him Uncle Master indeed.","However, given his current strength, if he were to visit the Ji Family, even addressing him as a brother wouldn’t be an exaggeration for that patriarch.","“Come at me!” Jian Wushuang’s aura remained unchanged, merely lifting one finger.","In an instant, the aura on his finger surged.","The onlookers all stepped back, marveling at the immense power emanating from that finger.","However, a mysterious figure in black, with a covered face, stood at the top of the battlefield, arms crossed, observing everything below. When he saw the aura erupting from Jian Wushuang’s finger, his eye sockets contracted, genuinely surprised.","“That power can actually rival mine!” The black-robed figure, known as ‘Extreme Shadow’, was the strongest Dao Lord among the trial participants.","On the surface, he could match a tier 2 peak Emperor, but his true strength could rival a tier 3 peak Emperor.","However, among these challengers, no one could make him exert his full strength.","He was extremely confident in his own abilities. In the Black Tortoise Temple, he was the first, and now, as a Dao Lord heading to the Grave God Mountain, he still considered himself the best, believing that no one could surpass him.","Comparable to a tier 3 peak Emperor, his current Ultimate Dao had only reached the eighth level.","There was still significant room for improvement.","In the future, reaching the level of a fourth or even tier 5 Emperor was not a problem.","He had always heard about how powerful the Ultimate Dao Lords in the Grave God Mountain were, and the fighting spirit within him had already risen to its peak.","This time, unexpectedly, he encountered Jian Wushuang, who was renowned as the Invincible Dao Lord. Originally, he was prepared to make a move, but the disciples of the Ji Family took the initiative.","He came from a background of wandering cultivators and had always looked down on the disciples of aristocratic families.","He believed they were wasting resources.","From a young age, they had countless resources, yet they were not as good as a wandering cultivator. Indeed, it was a waste of resources.","However, this was a matter of birth, and he couldn’t blame others.","On the deck.","Feeling the powerful aura of Jian Wushuang, Ji Wushuang felt no fear and took the initiative.","“Ice Frost!”","A chill swept in, and countless ice blades instantly surrounded Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang glanced around and became somewhat interested.","“Not bad!”","Countless ice blades continuously attacked, and each one could kill an Emperor.","This unique skill was excellent, probably a peak technique.","Ji Wushuang’s Ultimate Dao was the Dao of Ice.","When he displayed it, his entire person turned icy cold, with an emotionless expression, yet his eyes carried a hint of chill.","“Ice Domain!”","Realizing that Jian Wushuang could perfectly evade the ice blades and was even faster than them, Ji Wushuang directly used her strongest technique, the Ice Domain.","In this domain, the surrounding space was covered with a layer of frost.","Jian Wushuang’s speed actually slowed down.","The Domain of ice was particularly effective in suppressing speed.","In her heart, Ji Wushuang felt a surge of joy and once again launched a besiege of ice blades against Jian Wushuang.","The Inheritors watching also revealed expressions of delight.","“She’s about to win. Jian Wushuang’s speed has slowed down, and no one can withstand the ice blades. Even if they manage to block, they will be heavily injured!”","“The title of Invincible Dao Lord might be taken down!”","Some descendants of families who admired Ji Wushuang cheered for her.","However, a few ultimate Dao Lords realized that things were not so simple.","Because Jian Wushuang had been evading all along and did not confront the ice blades head-on, it probably wasn’t because he was afraid.","Facing the ice blades this time, Jian Wushuang didn’t dodge anymore.","Indeed, this Domain could suppress his speed, but as long as he leaked a bit of aura, he could instantly break through the Domain.","It’s just that there was no need to be so serious when dealing with the younger generation.","As the ice blades approached, he didn’t dodge but pointed a finger directly at them, colliding head-on with the ice blades.","Just when many people thought Jian Wushuang was in trouble, they discovered that when the ice blades touched Jian Wushuang’s fingertips, they began to merge.","That was the Ultimate Dao’s ice blades, and Jian Wushuang actually unraveled them like this.","Ji Wushuang was also shocked and quickly mobilized more ice blades to attack.","However, Jian Wushuang remained motionless, his finger technique astonishing. In just a moment, he unraveled all the ice blades."]},{"number":5629,"title":"Chapter 5629: If You Want It, Just Take It!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5629: If You Want It, Just Take It!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the end, Jian Wushuang pointed his finger, piercing through space in the Domain of ice and marking a pinnacle.","With this point as the core, it instantly swept through all surrounding spaces, continuously swallowing the power of the ice Domain into a small black hole formed by the pinnacle.","Inside the cabin, Zhu Qi opened her eyes at this moment. Originally, she had not paid much attention, considering it as just a struggle among juniors.","However, she did not expect Jian Wushuang to have utilized the power of the black hole to this extent.","This was a complete spatial black hole, and it seemed to have been broken through for a long time.","Mastering the spatial black hole required reaching the tier 6 Emperor among the Inheritors.","It seemed that the title of Invincible Dao Lord was not just empty words, and it was even more powerful than they had imagined.","On the deck, these Inheritors did not know what method Jian Wushuang had used, but seeing Jian Wushuang easily break Ji Wushuang’s ultimate technique, they couldn’t help but look at him in shock.","“He broke it just like that?”","“That’s the ultimate Domain that can suppress the Domains of tier 2 Emperor level experts!” someone exclaimed.","Standing on the deck, the shadow was also extremely shocked. Even if he wanted to break through this domain, he would need to use some means. Unexpectedly, Jian Wushuang achieved it so easily.","This intensified the determination in his heart.","Ji Wushuang, floating in midair, restrained her breath. After landing on the deck, there was no sense of loss on her face. Instead, there was a joyful expression. Walking to Jian Wushuang, she said warmly, “Senior Brother Wushuang, I’ve lost. I didn’t expect Senior Brother’s strength to be so powerful. You effortlessly broke my domain with just a finger!”","“Ji Wushuang, remember, the foundation of a Domain is not your Ultimate Dao, but your comprehension of space. The stronger your spatial realm, the more powerful your domain will be!” Jian Wushuang liked her character and kindly reminded her of some deviations in her cultivation.","Even if he didn’t remind her, someone would guide her after going to the Grave God Mountain.","Ji Wushuang nodded obediently.","Later, she became familiar with Jian Wushuang and talked about their experiences in the Original Realm. She introduced Jian Wushuang to her friends, many of whom had ancestors related to Jian Wushuang.","For example, the descendants of Wanyan and the newly accepted disciples of Zhen Wuyang.","The disciple of Zhen Wuyang was also from the Great Si Region, but his age did not exceed one epoch, so Jian Wushuang naturally did not know him.","However, they could be considered fellow townsfolk, both hailing from the Great Si Region.","Although he was a Dao Lord following the path of the Myriad Daos, his strength was not weaker than those Ultimate Dao Lords. When introduced to him, Jian Wushuang nodded at the young fellow.","This made the young fellow very excited.","The two prides of the Great Si Region.","One was Zhen Wuyang, needless to say, and the other was Jian Wushuang.","Although Jian Wushuang had never left, there were numerous rumors about him in the outside world.","A peerless Dao Lord a epoch ago.","Now his strength was unfathomable.","Such a legendary figure not only appeared now, but could also make others remember him. It was a great honor.","Jian Wushuang had no airs and, unlike some old folks who liked to emphasize seniority, casually chatted with these juniors.","He was just a Dao Lord. For him, if there was some connection with their ancestors, it didn’t matter if they were considered peers.","After achieving a perfect Dao Heart, Jian Wushuang had no distracting thoughts, only the pursuit of constant strength.","He cared little about reputation.","Whew!","A figure descended from the sky, directly dispersing the crowd. Several powerful Dao Lords close to Jian Wushuang were pulled away by that person.","Those Dao Lords were unexpectedly powerless to resist.","The opponent’s strength clearly surpassed everyone by a large margin.","“The Invincible Dao Lord?” The newcomer was none other than Ji Ying, known as the ‘Extreme Shadow’. He said indifferently, “How about returning this title to someone more suitable?”","Jian Wushuang revealed a faint smile and said calmly, “If you want it, take it!”","“No, there has to be a witness!” Ji Ying looked around and said, “For example, defeating you in front of them!”","“You don’t need to be in such a hurry; I will merge with the Dao soon!” Jian Wushuang stood calmly in place and said, “At that time, this title will be returned to someone more suitable!”","The tone of Ji Ying turned cold, and he sternly said, “What if I insist on taking it now?”","“Come and get it, then!” Jian Wushuang saw through the opponent’s intentions at a glance, acknowledging their strength that rivaled a tier 3 Emperor.","Among the first batch of Inheritors, only the Ultimate Light Dao expert could reach this level.","It seemed that the opponent was indeed formidable.","No sooner said than done, Ji Ying had already made a move.","“Myriad Me!”","A furious shout echoed.","The Inheritors around instantly retreated.","Ji Wushuang’s face changed drastically, hastily warning, “Senior, be careful. This person practices the Ultimate Shadow Dao, capable of manifesting countless forms, and each shadow clone is as powerful as the original!”","The Shadow Dao was already special, let alone the Ultimate Shadow Dao.","This move, Myriad Me, was somewhat similar to Wanyan’s Myriad Shadows Technique.","Each shadow clone possessed the combat power of a peak-level tier 3 Emperor, enough to contend with a tier 4 Emperor.","Right from the start, Ji Ying exerted his full strength.","It was Ji Ying’s complete eruption.","This surprised everyone, as they hadn’t expected the first person among the trial participants to hold back.","However, Jian Wushuang remained unfazed.","Myriad Me?","Or, to put it bluntly, a downgraded version of Wanying. This move posed no threat to him whatsoever.","Through the space, he could locate the true body of the opponent.","However, there was no need to directly attack his true body; that would be a bit too much bullying.","Since he was a formidable practitioner of the Shadow Dao, his physical body could easily split into thousands, or rather, millions.","Swish!","Swish!","Jian Wushuang merely exhaled, and countless avatars instantly surrounded the tens of thousands of Ji Ying clones.","“How is this possible?” Ji Ying revealed astonishment.","Ji Wushuang, standing below, was also surprised. She had heard from her uncle, Ji Chaoyang, that Jian Wushuang’s Origin Path was the Ultimate Dao of the Sword.","Looking at the immensely powerful divine sword behind Jian Wushuang’s back, it was evident that he was dedicated to the Ultimate Sword Dao. So, why would he also cultivate the Dao of Shadows?","Soon, everyone noticed something unusual.","The Myriad Me clones of Ji Ying were genuine shadow avatars.","However, Jian Wushuang was different. Each of his avatars possessed a physical body and an Origin Source, with a life force not weaker than his main body.","For them, these innumerable Jian Wushuangs were no different from his main body.","Jian Wushuang’s main body stood in place, raising his head to look at the Ji Ying clones in the sky. He directly spoke to his true body, “Do you still want to make a move?”","This sentence directly startled Ji Ying.","“Do you know the location of my true body?” Ji Ying stared at Jian Wushuang in astonishment, his pupils dilating to the maximum.","He was surprised by Jian Wushuang’s avatars, but he was even more surprised that Jian Wushuang could see through his true body."]},{"number":5630,"title":"Chapter 5630: Undercurrent","paragraphs":["Chapter 5630: Undercurrent","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","His spatial realm had already reached the level of star, concealed within the space and blended with his shadow clone. Unless one was a tier 6 Emperor, it was impossible to detect his true body.","“Could it be that he is a tier 6 Emperor?” Ji Ying found it somewhat unbelievable.","Even if he entered the Grave God Mountain and cultivated for countless years, he wouldn’t have the confidence to possess the combat power of a tier 6 Emperor when facing Dao Lords.","The fact that Dao Lords could possess the combat power of a tier 6 Emperor was simply beyond belief.","No wonder he was the Invincible Dao Lord.","At this moment, Ji Ying admitted defeat in his heart.","Although they hadn’t fought yet, he already knew he couldn’t defeat Jian Wushuang.","The difference was too great.","However, he did not give up.","Rare opportunities shouldn’t be let slip through one’s fingers.","Buzz!","The myriad shadows condensed into his true form, instantly transforming into the towering figure of Ji Ying himself.","At that moment, Ji Ying’s combat power completely reached the level of a tier 4 Emperor.","This was his limit.","He had never been pushed to this extent by anyone before.","Observing this, Jian Wushuang also retracted his clones.","In the next moment, he unexpectedly drew the Jueyun Sword!","This scene left everyone stunned.","Was it necessary to go to this extent?","Directly drawing the sword.","That was the Jueyun Sword, containing power comparable to a Tribulation Realm. Just pulling it out made these little guys collectively hold their breaths, afraid to even exhale.","In the cargo hold, Zhu Qi also stood up. However, she wasn’t surprised that Jian Wushuang could draw the Jueyun Sword; rather, it was because in the current external world, a super-Special Life Form had appeared.","Around the Grave God Mountain, logically speaking, there shouldn’t be any Special Life Forms. If there were, they would be special beings bound by gods and demons who had completely surrendered to the Grave God Mountain.","However, the one appearing now was not bound by the shackles of gods and demons.","He appeared behind the warship before it traversed through spacetime.","The unique and powerful divine body of this Special Life Form exuded a strong oppressive force.","Jian Wushuang drew his sword precisely because of this Special Life Form.","Although he didn’t intentionally scan the surroundings with his Thought power, it still covered the range of an entire large world around him. When the opponent appeared, he sensed that something was wrong.","Subsequently, after sensing a force of Death within the opponent’s body, he became vigilant.","However, the strength of that Special Life Form was only average. If it was targeting him with the power of Mie Sheng, it wouldn’t be formidable enough.","It was merely at the pinnacle of the supreme-peak.","Such a strength of a Special Life Form posed no threat to him.","In normal circumstances, he only needed one sword strike to instantly kill the opponent.","“Hmm?”","The Special Life Form with open arms discovered, to his astonishment, that on this warship carrying thousands of Inheritors, there was not only one Emperor but more. He was momentarily stunned.","“No, he’s a Dao Lord!” Then, this Special Life Form remembered something and suddenly felt intense fear.","Having the aura of an Emperor but not being one – there was only one person who fit this description, the legendary Invincible Dao Lord, ‘Jian Wushuang’.","If he really encountered this Invincible Dao Lord, this time, he might have to return in failure.","He was here on a mission to intercept Inheritors, and encountering Jian Wushuang on his first attempt was just his bad luck.","According to intelligence, Jian Wushuang possessed the battle power of the supreme-peak. He was no match at all, but he still had some confidence in escaping.","Because of his divine body, he surpassed by 60,000-fold.","Even at the pinnacle of the supreme-peak, they couldn’t kill him.","On the warship, Zhu Qi transmitted directly to the Grave God Mountain.","The sudden appearance of a Special Life Form at the supreme-peak level, and right behind the warship, was definitely suspicious.","She dared not joke about a whole ship of Inheritors.","Now, the number of Inheritors was dwindling, and there could be no more mistakes.","The plea for help was directly transmitted to the Grave God Mountain, and Zhen Ling’s avatar there naturally became aware of it.","However, upon discovering Jian Wushuang on the warship, Hu Qing, who was preparing to rescue the ship, was intercepted.","At the foot of the Grave God Mountain, Hu Qing, who was stopped, felt a bit puzzled. However, upon hearing about Jian Wushuang, he understood the situation.","However, in his clear eyes, the clarity was gone.","On the deck of the warship,","After Zhu Qi’s call for help, he quickly rushed towards Jian Wushuang, intending to warn them.","On the deck, apart from Jian Wushuang, no one noticed the Special Life Form, thinking that Jian Wushuang was about to show off in front of them, deliberately drawing the Jueyun Sword.","Before Zhu Qi could reach them, he loudly exclaimed, “Enemy attack! Everyone, enter the cabin for shelter!”","Upon hearing Zhu Qi’s voice, everyone turned their heads to look at him.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang pulled out the Jueyun Sword, and with a sword swing, he slashed towards the sky.","Ji Ying, standing in the air, felt like his Origin Source was shattered, and his flesh and divine body were trembling.","That one sword move pierced through his body without any hindrance.","Even his Eternal Treasure armor failed to resist it.","Just when he thought he had fallen, Ji Ying realized he seemed not to be dead.","But that terrifying sword had indeed pierced through his body!","Just as he was astonished, the people, prompted by Zhu Qi’s reminder, soared into the air, turning their gaze towards the void behind the warship.","This was the first time they had been so close to a supreme-peak powerhouse among these Special Life Forms.","Just the towering figure alone made them tremble incessantly.","The sword wielded by Jian Wushuang seemed so insignificant.","At this moment, Zhu Qi was on the verge of madness. These little fellows not only ignored advice but also stared at the supreme-peak being as if nothing was wrong.","After Jian Wushuang unleashed that sword move, he sheathed the Jueyun Sword, walked behind Zhu Qi, patted her shoulder, and said, “Don’t be afraid; he will fall soon!”","“We are still some distance away from the God’s Tomb. Even if the super experts on the God’s Tomb Mountain rush over, it will take time. During this period, the warship can’t withstand the opponent!” Zhu Qi despairingly shook her head.","She knew that the Special Life Form would fall, as there existed a powerful entity on the God’s Tomb Mountain capable of slaying the opponent.","But it would take time.","The little ones in the sky were all scared, but some with sharp eyes noticed the sword strike that Jian Wushuang had previously unleashed with precision.","Ji Ying, now realizing, also turned his head to look back.","Only then did they understand that Jian Wushuang drawing his sword wasn’t directed at Ji Ying but at that terrifying Special Life Form.","The tiny sword shadow moved slowly, but they observed it carefully.","However, for that supreme-peak Special Life Form, this sword move was too fast; he had no way to dodge.","Although this sword move wasn’t the first sword move in the Starry Sky Chronicles, it carried the true essence of time.","For onlookers, it seemed slow, but for the supreme-level Special Life Form, it was terrifyingly fast, utterly unstoppable.","“Senior Martial Uncle, your sword shadow is too slow!” Ji Wushuang stared at the small sword shadow, trembling as she spoke, “This is a super expert among the Emperors; it’s too frightening!”","Jian Wushuang raised his head and said to the little guys, “Let the sword shadow fly a bit longer!”","Zhu Qi also noticed something was amiss. It had been a breath, and the supreme-level Special Life Form had not yet made a move against them."]},{"number":5631,"title":"Chapter 5631 Arriving at Grave God Mountain","paragraphs":["Chapter 5631 Arriving at Grave God Mountain","Could it really be just a coincidence?","....","She soared into the air, gazing at that Special Life Form at the supreme-peak level.","However, she found the figure moving slowly, attempting to evade the Sword Intent.","But his speed was too slow.","Much slower than the Sword Intent.","Swish!","In the perspective of that Special Life Form, in just a moment, the Sword Intent had already reached before it.","As it approached, the sword shadows transformed into a world of swords.","Instantly enveloping the towering Special Life Form, the Sword Intent filled the heavens and earth.","Then came the complete eruption.","Like cutting through a Special Life Form as if slicing vegetables, in an instant, it shattered the opponent’s divine body, which was over 60,000-fold.","The divine body shattered, and the Special Life Form fell!","With just one sword move, he killed the top expert at the supreme-peak.","This scene left Zhu Qi stunned in the sky.","Jian Wushuang had actually reached such a level of strength.","And he hadn’t even merged with the Dao.","A Dao Lord, slaying a supreme-peak expert.","Among those Inheritors, some were descendants of prominent families who had encountered supreme-peak experts before.","“The aura of this Special Life Form is even more powerful than our family’s supreme-peak ancestor!” exclaimed one descendant of a family in fear.","But in the next moment, that terrifying supreme-peak Special Life Form had already fallen, its body turned into countless powder.","The power of the divine body was quietly absorbed by Jian Wushuang.","He had already gathered numerous treasures from the divine bodies.","These treasures were, in fact, plundered from the formidable beings possessing divine bodies.","For instance, the shell of the Turtle Spirit Island’s lord.","And the flesh of the Eight-Armed Beast Emperor.","As well as the Special Life Form’s divine body, currently at the supreme-peak level.","All of them had been absorbed into his body.","Once he ascended to the position of Emperor, he could indulge himself in a feast.","Amidst the astonishment of the onlookers, Jian Wushuang stepped into the ship’s hold.","The threat had been eliminated.","However, the small beings were incredibly excited.","“Can a Dao Lord be this strong?”","“A single sword strike, slaying the supreme-peak!”","Ji Wushuang’s eyes were also shining with excitement.","From this moment, the towering figure in front of her was no longer that Imperial Uncle Ji Chaoyang, but Jian Wushuang.","Perhaps, at this moment, the image of him had been etched in everyone’s hearts.","The appearance of Jian Wushuang drawing his sword.","Just as they were about to return to the deck to get a closer look at Jian Wushuang, they realized he was nowhere to be found.","Zhu Qi understood Jian Wushuang’s intention and prohibited them from entering the hold to disturb him.","Many felt a bit disappointed. They envied Jian Wushuang’s prowess, harboring endless doubts.","One of the doubts that puzzled everyone was the Dao Lord slaying the supreme-peak.","The stronger he became, the less they dared to inquire in his presence. Investigating such matters was a challenge even for equals, let alone provoking Jian Wushuang.","However, these small beings were too weak, so their questions could be considered innocent.","“Ji Ying, it’s all because of you, stirring trouble with Senior Jian Wushuang!” someone blamed Ji Ying.","Ji Ying now desires to converse with Jian Wushuang more than ever.","Upon witnessing that particular sword strike, he understood that there was no hope in this lifetime.","It wasn’t that he could never surpass Jian Wushuang throughout his entire life, but rather, when he was a Dao Lord, he could never reach the level of Jian Wushuang.","The Ultimate Dao Lord, even if cultivated to the extreme, could at most match a tier 5 peak-level Emperor.","To match a tier 6 Emperor was almost impossible.","Not to mention matching the supreme-peak, let alone slaying it.","Hearing others’ ridicule, Ji Ying remained unperturbed. Instead, he stood at the bow of the ship, gaze fixed on the distance, while pondering the essence of that last sword.","Although they practiced different Origin Sources, the power contained in that sword shadow was immense. Just absorbing a trace of it would be immensely beneficial.","Originally, when they were nearing the Grave God Mountain, these little fellows were quite excited. Now, witnessing Jian Wushuang take action and slay the supreme-peak, their excitement heightened, and they chattered incessantly on the deck.","Zhu Qi concealed a smile in her eyes and quietly left.","Looking through the white curtains, Zhu Qi found solace in observing Jian Wushuang inside the cabin.","It was trust in Jian Wushuang and affection for Shan Jun.","She believed that Jian Wushuang would, one day, liberate Shan Jun from the Second Prison.","Even the Four Great Temple Masters were unaware of the connection between Mie Sheng and Qishen Temple.","Zhu Qi was even more in the dark.","Therefore, apart from Zhen Ling and Jian Wushuang, no one knew Shan Jun had been taken away by Mie Sheng.","Perhaps the prisoners in the Second Prison were aware, but they couldn’t come out!","It was the Black Tortoise Temple Master and Yun Zhong who noticed that something was amiss.","The Blood Demon and the Ten-Thousand Demon suddenly disappeared.","They simply believed it was the work of Zhen Ling.","For this reason, Yun Zhong pleaded with Zhen Ling for a long time. In the end, unable to endure further, Zhen Ling gave him some benefits and sent Yun Zhong away.","But the Master of Black Tortoise was not easy to deceive.","For the Black Tortoise Temple, the existence of Ten-Thousand Demon was crucial.","Ten-Thousand Demon possessed profound knowledge of All Things, especially in the art of puppetry, where he stood as a peerless master, slightly weaker only than the Black Tortoise Temple Master.","The sudden disappearance of such an important figure made the Black Tortoise Temple Master naturally suspect the involvement of Zhen Ling.","However, upon closer inspection, things seemed amiss.","He didn’t rush to confront Zhen Ling.","Instead, it was Zhen Ling who took the initiative to explain and reveal the events involving Mie Sheng.","The scene at that time was exceptionally eerie.","The Black Tortoise Temple Master’s eyes betrayed a mix of astonishment and horror.","Because the prophecy had come true.","This meant that the temporal river of destruction was the one unfolding before their eyes.","A transcendent figure appeared, and everyone would be buried alongside.","This included the Qishen Temple.","Hence, the Black Tortoise Temple Master, in the aftermath, acted generously, deploying numerous puppets to aid the Azure Dragon Temple in conquering the Temple of World Annihilation.","For Mie Sheng to break through the Qishen Temple, there were only two ways.","One was to become a Seven Tribulation realm powerhouse.","This was undoubtedly impossible.","If it were possible, he would have achieved it long ago.","At present, Mie Sheng was probably a wandering Tribulation Realm powerhouse.","Although he possessed the combat power of a half-step Seven Tribulation realm, he couldn’t advance further.","After all, it had been such a long time.","Based on Jian Wushuang’s observations of Mie Sheng in the Moro Spacetime, it was inferred that the original Mie Sheng was a wandering Tribulation Realm powerhouse.","However, the Mie Sheng in Higher Heavens was, even as a wandering powerhouse, at least an Eight Tribulation realm powerhouse.","After all, having the combat power of a half-step Seven Tribulation realm was achievable outside the Higher Heavens.","The opponent’s background was unfathomable.","If not becoming a Seven Tribulations realm powerhouse could break the Qishen Temple, there was only one path left.","It was to cultivate numerous Inheritors and confront the Qishen Temple on equal ground.","Despite the countless inheritors of the Temple of World Annihilation, they were still unable to trap the Qishen Temple.","It just hadn’t proven effective yet.","Mie Sheng, this time, incarnated as the Temple of World Annihilation, clearly made ample preparations.","There were probably more treasures in the Higher Heavens than in the Qishen Temple.","As long as he could trap the Qishen Temple or wait for the emergence of Gu Jun and Mo Jun, Mie Sheng could still stabilize the Qishen Temple.","That’s why he incarnated as the Temple of World Annihilation.","This coincided with the memories Jian Wushuang obtained in the future world.","The reappearance of Mie Sheng was only a supreme-peak, equivalent to his strength.","It was to devour him.","Therefore, Jian Wushuang dared not go out now. Even if he had merged with the Dao, he couldn’t go out.","No one knew what kind of schemes Mie Sheng had laid outside, waiting for him.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t take that risk."]},{"number":5632,"title":"Chapter 5632 The First Inheritor","paragraphs":["Chapter 5632 The First Inheritor","In a future defeat, he found himself unable to take the gamble.","....","Losing meant losing the entire temporal river.","Instead, he became consumed by Mie Sheng, becoming a superpower with control over reincarnation.","He couldn’t help but desire to consume the other, to wield the power of reincarnation himself.","However, it was all too difficult.","Beside Mie Sheng was the true form of Qishen, and now even the Qishen Temple felt unstable for him.","He dared not venture out. At least, after integrating with Dao, he would assess his own capabilities before making any plans.","In the past, he had no intention of leaving after the Dao Merge.","But now, with the method to nurture a second Nascent Soul, he could boldly attempt it.","Nurture a second Nascent Soul and then devour that thread of the power of Death. Experience the power of reincarnation first before deciding.","As his thoughts swirled, the warship had already docked in the vastness of the Grave God Mountain.","They were welcomed by the guardians of the mountain.","As for the other Inheritors, let them go or cultivate; there was no time to bother with these little fellows.","On the Grave God Mountain, they shared a common master—Zhen Ling.","After the guardians took charge of the group, the little fellows still hoped to wait for Jian Wushuang to come out.","However, the guardians directly took control and departed from the port.","After the departure of the group, a familiar figure of Jian Wushuang faintly appeared. It was the awakened Hu Qing.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang also walked out of the cargo hold.","The two locked eyes.","One on the ship, one on the shore.","When Jian Wushuang sensed Hu Qing’s aura, he felt a headache. If Hu Qing didn’t come, it would have been fine.","Even if they met and had a battle, it would be fine. The awkward part was now.","Without saying a word, they just waited for each other.","The incident with Jiang Shang was probably a significant blow to Hu Qing.","Just as Jian Wushuang was carefully considering how to shift the blame onto Zhen Ling, Hu Qing burst into laughter.","Seeing Jian Wushuang coming ashore, Hu Qing walked over with a smile and took the initiative to speak, “Brother Wushuang, you’ve finally arrived. Since awakening, I’ve wanted to find you, but Lord Zhen Ling asked me to wait here. It’s been an entire era of waiting!”","Just as Jian Wushuang was puzzled, Hu Qing continued, “I’ve heard about Jiang Shang’s matter from Lord Zhen Ling!”","“Hu Qing, about this matter, you have to listen to me!” Jian Wushuang’s expression darkened as he spoke.","He forgot all the words he had just thought of and was momentarily unsure of how to pass the blame to Zhen Ling.","Hu Qing sighed and said, “I already know everything!”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang felt a chill in his heart.","He had indeed overlooked this aspect of the situation.","After Hu Qing woke up, Zhen Ling must have shifted all the blame onto him.","Jian Wushuang secretly cursed Zhen Ling in his heart.","However, what Hu Qing said next left him stunned.","“Thanks to Brother Wushuang in the Human Realm, otherwise, I’m afraid that person, Mie Sheng, would have taken away my disciple!” Hu Qing’s eyes revealed a hint of determination.","Evidently, he was already aware of the situation regarding Mie Sheng.","Jian Wushuang was astonished, “You know about Mie Sheng?”","“Yeah!”","Hu Qing nodded and said, “It’s this person who controlled my little disciple, Jiang Shang. Otherwise, Lord Zhen Ling wouldn’t have taken action against her!”","As Hu Qing spoke, he also showed a sense of guilt.","The matter with Jiang Shang was related to him, and as her master, he had failed to take care of his disciple properly!","Now that his disciple had left and a formidable enemy, a major demon, had emerged, threatening the lives along the entire temporal river, Jian Wushuang felt compelled to resist the Qishen Temple’s impending doom.","If not for Zhen Ling forbidding him to leave, he would have long gone to confront the Temple of World Annihilation and protect the lifeline of the temporal river.","As Jian Wushuang listened to Hu Qing’s words, he sensed that something was amiss and quickly interrupted her, waving his hand. “Hold on, let me handle this alone!”","He had no idea how Jiang Shang and Mie Sheng became connected, but it was likely that Zhen Ling was deceiving Hu Qing.","Currently, he was unaware that he was the one who had sacrificed Jiang Shang’s brother in the past.","This time, he misunderstood Zhen Ling, who had portrayed him as a hero for saving Hu Qing in the Human Realm, which was indeed true.","However, the details of his involvement in Jiang Shang’s situation were kept hidden.","The fact that he went to the Human Realm to rescue Hu Qing was disclosed, but the act of slaying Jiang Shang was not mentioned.","Jiang Shang’s departure was also portrayed as her choice, following Mie Sheng willingly.","After clarifying things with Hu Qing, Jian Wushuang patted his shoulder reassuringly, saying, “Life is long, especially for beings like us. Encountering a few scoundrels is normal. I suggest you stay here and wait. Once I achieve enlightenment, I will go out and teach Jiang Shang a lesson. I’ll tell her to respect her teacher and follow the right path.”","He spoke with conviction.","Hu Qing’s eyes welled up with tears of gratitude, yet Jian Wushuang hesitated to harm his disciple, even after he was manipulated and betrayed.","Since the Qishen Temple made the first move against Jiang Shang, Hu Qing believed that she chose to leave to avoid causing trouble.","“Let her be; she has her own thoughts,” Hu Qing sighed, shaking his head.","However, the next moment, determination flashed in Hu Qing’s eyes as he continued, “But that guy named Mie Sheng, I will surely defeat him!”","Jian Wushuang wiped the sweat from his forehead, encouraging him, “You will definitely succeed!”","After this lengthy conversation, Hu Qing realized they were at the harbor.","He quickly pulled Jian Wushuang towards his residence, taking the opportunity to show him around the ordinary areas of the Grave God Mountain.","The Grave God Mountain had 88 levels, and Hu Qing’s abode was currently situated on the 60th level.","As they reached this level, looking down, all they could see was mist and clouds, obscuring the view below.","“To ascend to this place, one must at least be comparable to the Tribulation Realm!” Hu Qing said calmly.","However, Jian Wushuang, standing aside, seemed as if his eyeballs were about to fall out.","To be comparable to the Tribulation Realm on the 60th floor.","Doesn’t that mean Hu Qing already possesses Tribulation Realm strength?","The last time it was only at the supreme-peak.","This time, it’s approaching the Tribulation Realm.","The speed is just too fast!","“At which level is Shang?” Jian Wushuang inquired.","Pointing downward, Hu Qing replied, “He’s on the 58th floor!”","58th floor, that’s also the strength of someone at the Tribulation Realm or even comparable to it.","On the Grave God Mountain, there are 88 floors, divided by cultivation realm.","In terms of actual combat strength, the difference is probably not too significant.","“Brother Wushuang, let’s discuss inside!” Hu Qing raised his hand, inviting Jian Wushuang into the cave mansion.","The structure of the cave mansion was simple and clear.","However, the materials used inside were quite valuable, even better than the cave mansion on Yuanyang Island.","But in terms of luxury, it couldn’t compare to the cave mansion on Yuanyang Island.","In the cave mansion where Hu Qing resided, everything necessary was there, and it happened to be just enough for him alone, without any excess.","Unlike Yuanyang Island, where they crammed the cave mansion with so many treasures that taking them out could establish a sect.","After entering the cave mansion, the two of them sipped on tea and reminisced about the past.","Both sighed deeply.","Over a millennium ago, both of them were Grand Yan Immortals.","Back then, Jian Wushuang was only a Three Revolutions Grand Yan Immortal, while Hu Qing was at Six Revolutions.","To this day, they both remember their first enemy.","Luo Hao!","And that figure who brought them despair, God-Emperor Mo Long who oppressed them both."]},{"number":5633,"title":"Chapter 5633 Glory Days","paragraphs":["Chapter 5633 Glory Days","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, all these individuals have now fallen.","The Dao Lords on the Original Planet Jiu Yuan, the weakest among them are probably tier 5 Emperors now.","It’s been nearly an epoch since Si Tian perished, who was once a peak tier 5 Emperor.","Not to mention Wan Xing, who had a potential greater than Si Tian.","Emperor Wan Xing, who followed the Myriad Dao, though progressing slowly, never halted.","He now advanced into the ranks of tier 6 Emperors, with formidable strength.","Having left the Qishen Temple, he was said to have conquered an entire Original Universe in the temporal river, renaming it the ‘Wan Xing Universe’.","While not in complete control of the universe, he wielded significant authority over it.","Had had become a dominant force.","“How time flies!” Jian Wushuang rose slowly, looking up at the murals on the cave walls, sighing, “Do you remember the joy of seeing the Innate Treasure for the first time?”","Hu Qing also stood up, then conjured a blood-colored tower, saying, “How can I ever forget it?”","This was the Innate Treasure of the God-Emperor Mo Long from the past.","Moreover, it was a peak Innate Treasure.","This was a treasure used by Emperors back then.","But now, among the inheritors, Emperors use Eternal Treasures.","Some even possess Universe Treasures.","Jian Wushuang was not clear about this, but Hu Qing, who has spent an entire epoch on the Grave God Mountain, knew it well.","Now, on the Grave God Mountain, the first Inheritor was Hu Qing himself.","The second Inheritor was Shang!","The third Inheritor was an unfamiliar Ultimate Emperor, to the extent that Hu Qing has rarely seen them and they seldom move within the Four Great Secret Realms, always cultivating on the Grave God Mountain.","On the Grave God Mountain, only those who could reach the 50th floor were qualified for permanent residence.","Currently, only ten individuals obtained this qualification.","Whoosh!","Hu Qing directly illuminated the rankings on the stone wall.","First: Hui Qing, 60th floor!","Second: Shang, 58th floor!","Third: Gu Qianluo, 54th floor!","Fourth: Emperor of Light and Shadow, 52nd floor!","Fifth: Tongtian Buddha, 51st floor!","Among these top five, almost all were from the first batch of inheritors.","The fact that Tongtian Buddha could rank fifth surprised Jian Wushuang!","The remaining five individuals all reached the 50thfloor.","They had just ascended recently.","Hu Qing and Shang’s rankings were far ahead.","If it weren’t for Broly’s judgment of the Qishen Temple in the beginning, Jian Wushuang’s ranking might also be in the top five.","Shang’s progress speed remained steady, as usual.","He was also a popular figure in the Qishen Temple, now ascending to the Tribulation Realm.","Almost everyone expected Shang to step into the Tribulation Realm ahead of others.","Because Shang’s spatial realm had long reached the Cosmic Realm and was likely already perfected.","As for the peak secret technique, it was just a hair’s breadth away from perfection.","Once everything was perfected, he could directly reach the 60th floor and become a Tribulation Realm cultivator.","Although Hu Qing’s strength and realm were powerful, his cultivation time was still too short. To become a Tribulation Realm cultivator, one couldn’t just keep cultivating in this place; significant opportunities were also needed.","However, such opportunities were scarce within the Qishen Temple, to the point of almost non-existence.","In the beginning, when Hu Qing integrated with the Dao, it not only triggered the Three Kings Court but also became the catalyst for entering the Calamity Realm.","Such opportunities should exist within the Qishen Temple, but they are scarce.","To become the gateway to the Tribulation Realm, one must look beyond the temple’s confines.","Jian Wushuang, maintaining a focused and concentrated demeanor, felt that the Qishen Temple had aided him during his time as an Emperor, but achieving the Tribulation Realm might require venturing beyond this place.","Having glimpsed a corner of the Moro Temporal River, Jian Wushuang harbored a deep yearning for its formidable power.","That was the true abode of the mighty, unlike the artificially created realms such as the Qishen Temple.","Now, within the temporal river of the Original Universe, named the ‘Mie-Qi’, turmoil had begun.","The first to erupt was the Emperor.","When the number of Emperors reached a certain level, the Tribulation Realm would inevitably emerge, ushering in a new era.","The division of eras in the Mie-Qi was somewhat similar to the Moro Temporal River of the past.","From utter nothingness to the arrival of the Qishen Temple, and then to the emergence of the Temple of World Annihilation.","This progression significantly elevated the foundation by countless levels.","Compared to the primitive era of the Moro Spacetime, this spacetime of Mie-Qi was far superior.","At least here, the human race thrived, facing virtually no external threats.","The human race had always originated from the original universe, coexisting peacefully with special life forms.","Both the Qishen Temple and the Temple of World Annihilation, like Higher Heavens in the Moro Spacetime, provided practitioners with opportunities for breakthroughs.","After the Moro Temporal River’s Higher Heavens collapsed, it became even more formidable.","It remains to be seen whether the current destruction of the two temples would further advance this temporal river.","After many discussions with Hu Qing, Jian Wushuang gradually became familiar with external matters.","The main reason the Temple of World Annihilation could compete with the Qishen Temple was its low threshold for accepting Inheritors.","Or rather, it had no threshold.","It even accepted ordinary people.","And the layout was profound, reaching from the top-notch experts to the mundane forces.","All of them devoutly worshipped the Temple of World Annihilation.","With Mie Sheng as the main focus.","“Mie Sheng!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flashed with thunder, and the cup in his hand instantly turned into powder.","Hu Qing raised her eyebrows, asking, “Brother Wushuang, have you had dealings with this person? How strong is he?”","“I don’t know, but he can contend with Lord Zhen Ling. We are simply not opponents!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","In fact, he had learned about the strength of Zhen Ling from the mouth of the Shen Ling Frolasa. Estimating the current Mie Sheng’s power based on Zhen Ling’s strength, it was likely not much different from the Mie Sheng in the Moro Spacetime, perhaps even stronger than Zhen Ling.","However, he did not tell Hu Qing.","He had his own thoughts. Mie Sheng’s identity was not that simple; it was related to HIgher Heavens in the Moro Spacetime and also connected to Dong Jun in the Starry Sky.","Moreover, it had a huge connection with him.","This was his second person that he couldn’t figure out.","If it was just a half-step into the Seven Tribulation realm, Jian Wushuang had confidence and hope to catch up, without fear.","But considering Mie Sheng’s identity, the Mie Sheng during the period in Heaven Heavens was probably more powerful than even the Qishen in the present.","Without absolute strength, he wouldn’t take the risk.","That was also the reason he dared not go out.","Now, within the Qishen Temple, there were hidden currents.","Although it didn’t pose a threat to him, it could threaten those Inheritors!","To the extent that even Zhen Ling gave up cultivating Inheritors in the Qishen Temple.","Instead, they let billions of Inheritors all go out and establish the second generation of Inheritors.","But this way, the quality would also drop significantly.","Combined with the Qishen Temple’s lack of discrimination, it made the Qishen Temple even more passive.","Although they weren’t lacking in treasures compared to the Mie Sheng Temple.","Some treasures were specifically prepared for the geniuses, and they couldn’t be given to those useless ones!","Especially for some Emperors with weak Origin Source Daos, they were basically useless.","Facing this, the Temple of World Annihilation had made extensive preparations.","They had Holy Water that could sacrifice the body, causing the strength to soar."]},{"number":5634,"title":"Chapter 5634 A Secret","paragraphs":["Chapter 5634 A Secret","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Although unable to advance in the later stages, treasures that could instantly boost one’s strength hundreds or thousands of times proved more attractive than the slow cultivation methods.","Especially for those Emperors with mediocre aptitude.","Deep in thought for a moment, Hu Qing, as if having made a decision, spoke, “If I take another step forward, regardless of how Zhen Ling advises, I will go out and explore!”","It was only then that Jian Wushuang remembered, Jiang Shang had already gone to the Temple of World Annihilation, and her status was very high.","If Broly was the first War God of the Temple of World Annihilation, then Jiang Shang was akin to a saintly figure.","Formidable strength was frightening. After so long, no one knew how powerful she had become.","Over half a millennium ago, when the Azure Dragon Temple Master fought Broly, he almost directly killed the opponent.","Later, Jiang Shang intervened, and the outcome was unknown, but it was known that Jiang Shang left with Broly unharmed.","The Azure Dragon Temple Lord, however, suffered considerable injuries.","This information was highly confidential, known to very few, and Jian Wushuang also learned of it from the White Tiger Temple Master.","To avoid affecting morale, it was not made public.","Currently, on the surface, the Qishen Temple held the advantage.","But in the long run, the Qishen Temple’s advantage would gradually weaken.","Jiang Shang’s strength now could be said to dominate the entire temporal river.","Even the Azure Dragon Temple Lord was not her match.","As long as Mie Sheng and Zhen Ling’s true selves didn’t come out, no one could contend with her.","The only hope lay in Hu Qing at the moment.","After understanding this point, Zhen Ling constantly deceived Hu Qing in the Grave God Mountain, fearing that once Hu Qing left the Qishen Temple, he would join the Temple of World Annihilation.","What was needed now was animosity.","The more people Jiang Shang killed outside, the better. This would drive a rift between Hu Qing and Jiang Shang.","Hu Qing didn’t understand this, but Jian Wushuang quickly grasped it after a brief contemplation.","Perhaps, the future challenges for Jiang Shang were not his own tribulations but rather the great tribulation for Hu Qing.","Thinking about this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel a bit melancholic.","Hu Qing was really in a tough situation.","Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Seeing his expression, Hu Qing raised an eyebrow and asked, “Brother Wushuang, what are your plans this time?”","“Let’s first finish the Dao Merge!” Jian Wushuang said indifferently.","Now he wanted to focus all his thoughts on the Dao Merge. Once that succeeded, everything else would fall into place.","Hu Qing also nodded in agreement, saying, “It’s time for your Dao Merge. Your current strength is beyond my understanding. Once the Dao is integrated successfully, you will probably become the first-ranked Inheritor of the Grave God Mountain!”","Hu Qing didn’t have much preference for who would be the first, but he was genuinely happy that Jian Wushuang could achieve it, even if he snatched it away from him.","The relationship between the two could be described as a life-and-death bond, with Jian Wushuang having saved him countless times.","“Hu Qing, our focus can’t always be on the Grave God Mountain!” Jian Wushuang waved his hand. He had no interest in being the first-ranked Inheritor right now.","He continued, “You’ve always wanted to leave, right? After I successfully merge the Dao, let’s leave the Qishen Temple, my brother!”","Although he could resort to any means for strength, Hu Qing was still a reliable friend. Jian Wushuang couldn’t bear to see Hu Qing become a pawn of the Zhen Ling.","Upon hearing his words, Hu Qing revealed a delighted expression and said, “That’s exactly what I was thinking. When the time comes, let’s go out and experience the methods of the Temple of World Annihilation!”","Despite Hu Qing appearing reserved and benevolent on the surface, his inner spirit of combat was even stronger than Jian Wushuang.","“The Temple of World Annihilation is nothing!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, showing disdain. He continued, “Do you know how many temporal rivers there are in this Starry Sky, and how many formidable experts? Instead of staying here, why not go to other temporal rivers, elevate our strength to the peak, and then return to sweep away everything!”","He wasn’t boasting.","Once he was successful in the Dao Merge, as long as the Zhen Ling didn’t change his mind, he could open a passage to other temporal rivers.","If the targeted temporal river was similar to the Moro temporal river, his opportunities wouldn’t be worse than the current situation. Moreover, the improvement would be faster.","Then, after reaching the Tribulation Realm, he could return.","With his foundation, possessing the Temporal Treasures and the nearly restored Beast God Weapon, fighting against higher realms was not impossible.","Mie Sheng’s identity, no matter how mysterious, was useless.","In the face of absolute strength, everything was illusory.","“Go to other temporal rivers?” Hu Qing was stunned, then puzzled, “Starry Sky!”","“Yes! It’s the Starry Sky!” Jian Wushuang nodded.","It seemed that Hu Qing also knew about the Starry Sky. Indeed, the opponent’s strength was not only due to the events of the past life but more importantly because of the secrets held by the Starry Sky.","It appeared that every extraordinary individual had a connection with the Starry Sky.","“But how do we get there?” Hu Qing was also somewhat moved, or rather, had a certain concern.","Jian Wushuang pointed upwards and said, “The mighty Zhen Ling will open a passage for us!”","As he spoke, he intentionally raised his voice, and his tone was extremely respectful.","He didn’t know if Zhen Ling could see this place, but Zhen Ling could definitely hear their conversation.","Sure enough, not long after, someone from Zhen Ling was sent to summon Jian Wushuang.","Having discussed with Hu Qing for a while, he also laid out some plans for the future.","They would travel to other temporal rivers, strengthen themselves, and then return to the current temporal river.","The rest was left for Hu Qing to contemplate!","The one summoning Jian Wushuang was a guardian of the Grave God Mountain.","Jian Wushuang had encountered this person before.","There was no surprise!","The reason this Grave God Mountain had the word ‘Grave’ was because the great entity “Qishen” was buried here.","But thinking about the connection between Qishen and Mie Sheng, perhaps the word ‘great’ could be removed.","Following the guardian, Jian Wushuang directly reached the mountain’s summit.","There was a pavilion here.","Ancient characters were engraved above.","“Mourning Regret Pavilion!”","A profound and ancient power made Jian Wushuang’s entire body tremble involuntarily.","“Greetings, Lord Zhen Ling!” Jian Wushuang bowed slightly.","Lord Zhen Ling, standing in the Mourning Regret Pavilion, didn’t turn around, maintaining a cold demeanor. “Come in and have a seat.”","Jian Wushuang cautiously approached, while the guardian spirit, showing tact, had already left.","Lord Zhen Ling overlooked the Grave God Mountain, standing there!","He didn’t dare to sit down but positioned himself slightly behind, standing beside Lord Zhen Ling, both overlooking the Grave God Mountain.","“I have prepared all the treasures needed for the Dao Merge!” Lord Zhen Ling said indifferently.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel ecstatic. It was the first time he thought Lord Zhen Ling was so generous, having thoughtfully prepared all the necessary treasures for the Dao Merge.","However, upon second thought, something felt off. He feared being deceived by Lord Zhen Ling and hesitated to refuse.","“Don’t overthink it; I just don’t want you to fail in Dao Merge!” Lord Zhen Ling turned to glance at Jian Wushuang, feeling speechless deep down.","Honestly, was he really that stingy?"]},{"number":5635,"title":"Chapter 5635 Maybe I’m Wrong","paragraphs":["Chapter 5635 Maybe I’m Wrong","Jian Wushuang knew that Zhen Ling had seen through his internal hesitation. He quickly denied, “I haven’t even had the chance to express gratitude; how dare I entertain such thoughts? This great kindness, Wushuang will remember forever!”","....","“Hmph!” Zhen Ling snorted coldly, not in a good mood. “You haven’t even merged with the Dao, and you’re already thinking about running away with your family. Do you think you can remember my favor?”","“Umm!” Jian Wushuang felt awkward.","Initially, Zhen Ling had told him that he could open a passage to send him into other spacetimes. Now, it seemed as if he was accused of planning to escape.","Indeed.","He had ruined one of Zhen Ling’s pawns.","His commitment to Hu Qing was significant.","From the first reincarnation mastery to the Three King Courts later on, Zhen Ling had evidently invested considerable effort.","How could he betray that for the sake of a Dao Lord like him?","“Lord Zhen Ling, the potential of Hu Qing is known to both of us. We can’t afford to waste it like this!” Jian Wushuang decided to be direct, breaking through the veils. Zhen Ling was taken aback when he heard this. Jian Wushuang was a master at playing dumb, so why was he suddenly so straightforward?","“Oh! You think I’m wasting his potential?” Zhen Ling said, his aura suddenly rising, staggering Jian Wushuang, almost making him fall.","After stabilizing himself, Jian Wushuang clasped his fists and respectfully said, “Subordinate did not mean that. It’s just that, considering Hu Qing’s character, as the Lord surely knows, he is not ungrateful. He doesn’t need Jiang Shang’s involvement; he won’t harm Qishen Temple!”","“Is that so? Do you know that he once attacked the Azure Dragon for that Jiang Shang?” Zhen Ling’s face showed anger.","When Hu Qing attacked the Azure Dragon, Zhen Ling had almost given up on him.","If Mie Sheng hadn’t appeared and taken away Jiang Shang, Hu Qing would either have fallen or been suppressed.","Now, he could only be a chess piece, which was not bad.","After hearing this, Jian Wushuang shook his head, his tone heavy, “You’re mistaken!”","He expressed his inner thoughts.","The reason Hu Qing intervened with the Azure Dragon was that he didn’t know what Jiang Shang harbored inside him. He just wanted an explanation!","The original Jiang Shang had no intention of threatening Qishen Temple.","So, Hu Qing intervened to stop the Azure Dragon Temple Master.","But things had changed now; Jiang Shang had gone to the Temple of World Annihilation.","Even if Hu Qing remembered past affections, he wouldn’t join the Temple of World Annihilation like Jiang Shang.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang understood Zhen Ling’s concerns.","What if he nurtured a potential threat?","But he had absolute confidence in Hu Qing.","It was absolutely impossible!","Although the Zhen Ling’s expression softened, it remained stern.","“Perhaps I was wrong, but Jian Wushuang, you better understand more than anyone else. In the current Qishen Temple, even if I am wrong, we cannot afford any accidents!”","Jian Wushuang stood upright, looking at Zhen Ling. At that moment, he suddenly understood some of Zhen Ling’s pain.","A Zhen Ling, supporting this Qishen Temple.","Still striving to fulfill the Qishen’s last wish!","To make the Qishen Temple great again!","After bidding farewell to the deity, Mie Sheng arrived.","The most crucial factor was still the Qishen.","It seemed that Zhen Ling saw the true face of the Qishen.","You should know that the Qishen is Zhen Ling, and Zhen Ling is the Qishen.","Although Zhen Ling is bound to the Qishen Temple, it is more like a spiritual array.","But he has some memories of the Qishen and even habits.","This was a greater blow to Zhen Ling.","“My Lord, perhaps none of us are wrong; it is this era that is wrong!” Jian Wushuang gritted his teeth, his tone heavy. “We, the geniuses of the heavens, are unwilling to become pawns. I hope you can understand!”","Zhen Ling slowly turned his head, looking at Jian Wushuang on the side. A hint of anger surged in his eyes, then disappeared again.","It wasn’t that he couldn’t bear it, nor was it moved by Jian Wushuang’s sincerity. It was that he saw a glimmer of hope in Jian Wushuang, or perhaps he saw the future in him.","At that time, Jian Wushuang could shake the heavens and earth!","He was an unparalleled powerhouse!","Only such a powerhouse could possess such a temperament.","He indeed didn’t misjudge the person.","“Share your plan!” Zhen Ling’s expression softened, and he proactively inquired.","Jian Wushuang, seeing an opportunity, directly revealed his thoughts.","After merging the Dao, he wouldn’t leave alone.","Instead, he intended to take a group with him.","This wasn’t an act of fleeing.","Though Jian Wushuang was sometimes unscrupulous, he had a clear understanding of the favors from Qishen Temple, especially considering Mie Sheng’s primary purpose was for him.","Eventually, they would have to confront it.","However, he needed time.","To cultivate in other temporal rivers and return after reaching the Tribulation realm.","Initially, when he heard Zhen Ling offering to send him away, he had no intention of taking others with him. But since learning about the future, he devised a daring plan.","He was preparing for a strategic retreat by using an empty city strategy on Qishen Temple!","He would select a group of individuals with the most potential to accompany him to other temporal rivers. This move was not just for a better cultivation environment but also to leave behind a spark.","After witnessing the grim future, Jian Wushuang had no choice but to think this way.","If he relied solely on himself, even reaching the Tribulation Realm would take a long time, perhaps reaching the Five or even Six Tribulation realm.","Zhen Ling’s confidence in him didn’t automatically translate into his own self-assurance.","The future held the power to decide everything.","Just like how he had always been confident in the Dao Merge, only to fail.","If it weren’t for his complete Dao Heart, he might have never emerged from the shadows of the future. There was significant resistance to his pursuit of the Dao Merge.","Now, things were different. With a fulfilled Dao Heart, the hope for the Dao Merge was very high.","That’s why he proposed drawing a group of people out to leave together.","It was just to be on the safe side.","After hearing this, Zhen Ling hesitated for a moment.","After all, the powerful individuals cultivated by the Qishen Temple had consumed countless resources.","Sending them away like this, what if they never returned?","It was a gamble!","“Can you guarantee that?” Zhen Ling asked.","Jian Wushuang naturally knew what guarantee was meant. He immediately swore to the Origin Source.","“I mean the others!”","“My Lord, we can have them make an Origin Source Oath too. Don’t worry, they won’t dare not to return!”","Zhen Ling still had some concerns and continued, “What if they suppress their cultivation level?”","Jian Wushuang had already thought about this.","He explained, “My Lord, among our group of Inheritors, even if there are such individuals, they are not qualified to enter other temporal rivers. Those who are qualified won’t have such intentions, as they are unaware of the immense power of Mie Sheng!”","This explanation satisfied Zhen Ling to some extent. After nodding, however, he did not give a definite answer.","Jian Wushuang knew that such matters required Zhen Ling some time.","After waiting for a while, the topic shifted, and they began discussing Mie Sheng.","“As for the matter of Mie Sheng, it cannot be revealed to the public for now. His identity is very mysterious, even I cannot speculate!” Zhen Ling shook his head.","That was acceptable. However, it seemed that Zhen Ling knew less about Mie Sheng than Jian Wushuang did."]},{"number":5636,"title":"Chapter 5636 Binding","paragraphs":["Chapter 5636 Binding","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, Zhen Ling had no intention of making it public; even more so, he couldn’t let Zhen Ling know about Mie Sheng’s origin from the Higher Heavens.","“My Lord, what will happen when his Death power combines with my Life power?”","Zhen Ling revealed a slight smile, extending his palm, and two forces suddenly appeared.","“This is the origin of water and fire. What changes will occur when they combine?”","Jian Wushuang spoke directly, “The combination of water and fire is against the current, especially when the Origin Source is combined. Few in the Great Yan Immortal Realm have achieved it. Once successfully combined, it can erupt with a hundred or even a thousand times the power, much stronger than the pure Water and Fire Origin Sources!”","“That’s right, just like the combination of Life and Death. I don’t know what it will turn into, but I know that after they fuse, it will be very powerful, even surpassing the Temporal Origin Source!”","Surpassing the temporal origin means it is more powerful than the Tribulation Realm.","It’s one thing to say it, but achieving it is incredibly difficult.","No wonder Mie Sheng pursued him, from the Higher Heavens of the Moro Temporal Space until now.","Once fused, it surpasses the power of the Tribulation Realm.","After Zhen Ling realized this point, his attitude towards him changed.","“Oh, I forgot to tell you. Besides you, Jiang Shang also has the power of Life in her body, but it’s not as pure as yours. It should be the Life power of the Origin Source Spirit in her body!”","Jian Wushuang, upon hearing this, was greatly shocked and disbelieving, “How is that possible!”","Then, an unprecedented force of Life erupted directly from his body, condensing into a huge green sphere.","He pointed to this sphere and asked, “Probably stronger than this?”","This power of Life probably occupied one-tenth of the Life power in his body.","Zhen Ling, on the side, was startled and jumped far away, staring wide-eyed at the power of Life, shocked, “Not so exaggerated. Her Origin Source Spirit is very fragile, and the Life power she possesses is probably the vitality of a Tribulation Realm, or even the vitality of Grass and Wood. It’s probably one in a million compared to this force of Life!”","“Phew!” Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief, finally reassured.","However, Zhen Ling was astonished in his heart, expressing absolute affirmation of choosing Jian Wushuang.","This was too absurd.","He even had a bold idea in his mind.","If Jian Wushuang were to preside over the great formation, what would happen to the resurrection of the Qishen’s flesh?","In the first prison, Jian Wushuang’s life power was enough to restore Fuego. Now, Jian Wushuang is even more powerful than before.","After the successful merging of Dao, there was a qualitative leap.","Certainly, relying solely on the physical body couldn’t resurrect the Qishen, requiring his True Spirit for that.","Using Zhen Ling as the Origin Source, he worked to restore Qishen’s physical form.","If this were to succeed, he might finally break free from the Qishen Temple and venture outside.","However, he had no intention of directly informing Jian Wushuang at the moment. He decided to wait until Jian Wushuang became the Emperor before revealing the truth.","Right now, he was genuinely curious to see how powerful Jian Wushuang would become after ascending to the position of Emperor.","A Dao Lord alone displayed such strength; contemplating the power after becoming an Emperor was beyond imagination.","After understanding the current situation, Jian Wushuang abandoned the idea of visiting the Grave God Mountain and decided to directly head to the place Zhen Ling had prepared for him to enter seclusion once again.","This seclusion was specifically for the Dao Merge.","The Grave God Mountain!","In the public area.","Mountain and sea!","“Here, there is a natural Origin Source of All Things. I have opened up a cave mansion, you can enter directly!” Zhen Ling pointed, and the sea surface broke open, revealing a massive underwater mountain range.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened as he saw it. The glow emitted by that mountain was something he had seen before.","It was a mine.","A rare mine.","Its value surpassed even that of the Nine-Headed Dragon Mountain.","Perhaps, with just this mountain range, it rivaled the Space Fire Abyssal Mountain.","A natural Origin Source of All Things.","That should be the original Origin Source.","Jian Wushuang felt a bit excited.","Before the merging of Dao, he would elevate his entire being to the limit.","Only this way would there be a greater certainty.","The limit of the divine body, the limit of the Origin Source.","He aimed to achieve both.","“Remember, don’t be hasty in merging Dao. The condensation of space must be flawless. Otherwise, your Sword Dao will find it challenging to integrate!” Zhen Ling advised.","Jian Wushuang nodded, expressing gratitude, and without further ceremony, he entered the cave mansion within the mountain range.","Splash!","After passing through a curtain of water, Jian Wushuang entered the cave prepared for him by Zhen Ling.","The cave was somewhat messy, not as magnificent as he had imagined. There were even some weeds on the walls. However, these were not ordinary weeds; they were spirit herbs.","Yet, these herbs offered minimal assistance to Jian Wushuang, and he paid no attention to them. Instead, he walked straight towards the depths, where Zhen Ling had opened up a space.","There lay a massive stone bed with a faint aura of the power of All Things rising above it. It seemed to be the natural power of All Things mentioned by Zhen Ling.","Floating above the stone bed was a tiny mustard seed.","Exhaling, Jian Wushuang said, “Let’s see what treasure is here!”","He reached out and directly absorbed the mustard seed into his hand.","As his Thought power entered the mustard seed, a dazzling light appeared before his eyes. Then, he furrowed his brow.","“What is this?”","Jian Wushuang stared in astonishment at the treasure within the glowing light, his face filled with shock.","“Beast God Flesh and Blood!”","Moreover, it was the flesh and blood of the Gold Beast God. The Gold Beast God represented space.","The flesh and blood of a Spatial Beast God would be immensely helpful in his Dao Merge. Jian Wushuang’s breathing became somewhat heavy.","This flesh and blood not only helped him condense the Origin Source of Space but also aided in enhancing his divine body and even the Beast God Weapon.","Thinking of the Beast God Weapon, he directly took it off his body.","Always thinking of having Zhen Ling help him restore the full power of the Beast God Weapon, now it seemed he could handle it on his own.","All the components of the Beast God Weapon were already gathered.","On the stone bed floated the Beast God Weapon separated from Jian Wushuang.","From top to bottom, they were the Eye of Candle Dragon, Blood Skull of Candle Dragon, Candle Dragon Wings, Inner Armor of Candle Dragon, Claw of Candle Dragon, and the core, the Heart of Candle Dragon.","Plus, this piece of Candle Dragon Flesh and Blood.","A thought suddenly emerged in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","Raising his hand to refine the flesh and blood, he infused it into the Beast God Weapon, and an entire skeleton formed instantly.","Jian Wushuang then took out the essence blood of the Eight-Armed Beast Emperor he had slain in the Earthly Realm. The force of Life continuously stimulated, refining the vast amount of essence blood into a drop, dripping onto the heart of the Beast God Weapon.","Buzz!","Invisible barriers began to form.","It was a complete space, and very stable.","“Indeed, just as I guessed!” Jian Wushuang revealed a smile, looking up at the perfected space, the sword intent within his body humming continuously.","However, he didn’t directly merge them.","This space could be used as a reference; he wanted to comprehend within this space and then create his own space."]},{"number":5637,"title":"Chapter 5637 Dao Merge (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5637 Dao Merge (1)","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Once the space formed, he was left with Dao Merge.","This time, he comprehended the most primitive space.","The Life power within his body continuously surged and erupted, all pouring into the Beast God Weapon!","Within this space, the Beast God seemed to have revived.","The lifelike Candle Dragon roamed the space.","A complete Beast God Weapon.","The Origin Source within it was formed from the nutrients in the flesh, although it was still somewhat weak for now; it would undoubtedly be nurtured gradually in the future.","Regarding this, Jian Wushuang didn’t pay too much attention.","He was more concerned about this spatial realm.","Dao Merge.","For an ordinary Dao Lord to achieve Dao Merge, they needed to open up a space within their own Origin Source.","If one could comprehend the Origin Source of Space in advance, the process would be relatively easier.","After opening up the space, one would integrate their Dao into it.","Then, a powerful Origin Source would appear in their space.","For example, the Original Universe, a universe born naturally with countless Daos within.","To control it, one needed their own Spatial Origin Source, even more potent than the Original Universe’s Origin Source.","Space was everything for an Emperor.","And an Emperor’s cultivation was solely focused on space.","By continuously strengthening the space, the Emperor’s strength would also grow.","Moreover, after becoming an Emperor, having their own space capable of accommodating all things, the profound foundation was incomparable to what a Dao Lord could achieve.","The reason why Jian Wushuang was so extraordinary was precisely because of his formidable foundation, possessing the Dao of All Things, making him incredibly powerful.","Every Emperor had their space, making each Emperor comparable to the Extreme Dao.","However, the power of All Things in their spaces was too limited, unable to be devoured; they could only refine it slowly.","Jian Wushuang’s Extreme Dao was a shortcut.","Understanding this, Jian Wushuang quickly made some adjustments to himself.","The Sea of Origin within his body began to continuously gather.","He intended to use the countless power of All Things to create an unprecedented space and then merge his Sword Dao into it.","The power of All Things was the manifestation of the Extreme Dao.","In this way, his Extreme Dao would completely disappear, or rather, his Extreme Dao transformed into space, accompanying him in a different form.","“Return!” Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged on the stone bed, beckoning, and the soaring Candle Dragon of space flew into his physical body.","Crack!","Clang!","Dang!","A dark red battle armor tightly enveloped Jian Wushuang.","A single eye emitted a dark red halo, surrounded by constant flickering brown electric arcs.","Although the Beast God Origin Source was still somewhat weak, under the nourishment of Jian Wushuang’s Life power, it directly erupted with all its potential.","Before Dao Merge, he hadn’t expected to fully refine the Beast God Weapon first.","This surprised and pleased Jian Wushuang greatly.","Before Dao Merge, he still had an important matter to attend to.","That was the second Nascent Soul.","He wanted to leave behind the Origin Source of the Dao Lord from the time of Dao Merge, ready to refine the second Nascent Soul.","As long as there was the Origin Source from the time of Dao Lord, and the continuously flowing Life power to nurture it, it would exist forever.","After he successfully Dao Merged, he could then proceed to refine this second Nascent Soul.","By then, directly refining it into the Emperor’s Nascent Soul, his strength would be even more formidable, a gift from Zhen Ling.","With the second Nascent Soul, he could let his true self venture into other spacetimes, while the second Nascent Soul would stay in the Qishen Temple, serving as a double preparation.","After arranging everything, he began to comprehend his state of mind, immersing himself in true cultivation to maintain his peak condition.","In one night, calm and waveless!","In Jian Wushuang’s mind, everything suddenly became ethereal.","Various distracting thoughts disappeared, replaced by space.","A complete space lay before him.","“Gather!” Jian Wushuang spoke in a low voice.","In the Origin Source Sea, thunder rumbled.","On the sea surface, continuous waterspouts surged.","Countless seawater soared into the air, as if there was a suction force in the sky.","The Origin Source Sea within his body continued to gather strength, and a thin film of a barrier began to manifest.","The diameter, 100,000 miles!","A perfect space was emerging.","This was a pure space.","Jian Wushuang had not yet utilized the power of All Things.","For an ordinary Dao Lord, reaching this point was already very close to the success of Dao Merge.","Once the diameter of the space within his body reached 100,000 miles, successful Dao Merge would elevate him to the level of a tier 2 Emperor.","However, Jian Wushuang had comprehended space in advance, raising the origin of space to the level of a black hole.","How could he settle for less?","“Extreme point!”","Hum!","In that miniature space, countless violent forces suddenly erupted.","That was Jian Wushuang’s Spatial Origin Source.","The extreme point was the black hole.","Expanding continuously from the central point, the black hole kept growing.","However, without the support of the power of All Things, the expansion of the black hole was slow.","Yet Jian Wushuang was in no hurry.","Zhen Ling had specifically instructed him not to be impatient.","How could he mess up his formation?","One must eat the rice one mouthful at a time.","He needed to stabilize the origin of space completely before expanding with the Extreme Dao.","His spatial origin had reached the realm of a black hole, and although the expansion was slow, once it started, even without the Extreme Dao, he could reach the level of a tier 6 Emperor in one go.","Becoming a tier 6 Emperor required reaching the realm of a black hole. Of course, for the indigenous beings with incomplete origins, reaching the level of tier 6 didn’t necessarily require entering the realm of a black hole. But those who did reach the realm of a black hole could become supreme-peaks.","However, Jian Wushuang’s origin was flawless, not only lacking defects but also being exceptionally complete, almost to the point of being abnormal.","It was said to expand slowly.","In just the time it takes for an incense stick to burn, the spatial expanse transformed into a size of millions of miles.","As it progressed, the expansion rate accelerated.","Within the space, every hundred thousand miles, a star would emerge.","Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source within the space was adorned with countless stars.","For an ordinary Emperor, the space condensed during Dao Merge could at best accommodate a few stars.","Elite individuals like Si Tian, during Dao Merge, could encompass a hundred stars.","Moving further up were Dao Lords who followed the Myriad Daos, such as Jiu Yu and Wan Xing.","In the state of Dao Lord, their strength equaled that of the Ultimate Dao Lord, capable of accommodating over ten thousand stars in general.","However, upon reaching the status of Emperor, the pace of cultivation would slow down, albeit with some overall improvement.","The problem was the slow speed, primarily due to the lack of perfected methods.","Even within the Qishen Temple, there were scarce inheritances of Myriad Daos.","Only the Master of All Things possessed a relatively complete inheritance of Myriad Daos.","But that inheritance wasn’t something anyone could cultivate; it still lay on the Grave God Mountain to this day, inaccessible to anyone, only allowing cultivation of its surface-level aspects.","Then came the path of Ultimate Dao.","Ultimate Dao Lords, during Dao Merge, condensed a space with a minimum of fifty thousand stars.","Those with extraordinary abilities could condense a million stars, forming a galaxy.","Even a star sea!","Now, the stars in Jian Wushuang’s space had increased to ten thousand.","A day had passed.","The most extended part of Dao Merge wasn’t the condensation of space but the subsequent fusion.","This time, Jian Wushuang embarked on Dao Merge with the goal of spanning ten thousand years, or even a million years."]},{"number":5638,"title":"Chapter 5638 Dao Merge (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5638 Dao Merge (2)","His Extreme Dao was unprecedented, and it naturally took a considerable amount of time.","....","In the blink of an eye, three years had passed.","On the Grave God Mountain.","Only two individuals knew about Jian Wushuang’s Dao Merge: one was Zhen Ling, and the other was Hu Qing.","Hu Qing was even more anxious than Zhen Ling to know about Jian Wushuang’s Dao Merge.","To the extent that he didn’t even have the inclination to cultivate in his cave dwelling. Instead, he sat quietly on a peak in the public area, gazing at the mountain and sea.","“Inheritor Hu Qing, I want to challenge you!” a young voice rang out, drawing many eyes.","After all, this was a public area.","There were quite a few Inheritors present.","On the Grave God Mountain, challenges could be freely issued.","Of course, one could choose not to respond.","Hu Qing, as the first-ranked Inheritor, held a high position on the Grave God Mountain. Besides Zhen Ling, no one could command him.","A little guy dared to step forward and challenge Hu Qing, causing many old Inheritors to sneer.","The young Inheritor was the one who came with Jian Wushuang.","“Ji Ying!”","Hu Qing understood.","And beside Ji Ying, there was also a young girl.","She was Ji Chaoyang’s niece.","Hu Qing’s temperament was unexpectedly good, and he happened to be bored, so he accepted the challenge.","For a moment, the crowd was in an uproar.","Even the first few Inheritors on the Grave God Mountain came out.","Especially Gu Qianluo, who ranked fifth and had the most hostile aura.","While the outside world was in shock, Jian Wushuang remained oblivious.","Space continued to condense without a moment’s pause.","In the space he now condensed, millions of stars had already been accommodated.","“Whew!”","“I think this should be the limit!” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","When Hu Qing merged his Dao, he had condensed eight million stars.","Because Hu Qing had not reached the black hole realm initially, she only mastered eighty percent of the black hole.","A black hole represented millions of stars.","Jian Wushuang’s spatial Origin Source reached the limit of the Dao Lord, forming an entire black hole.","Attempting to condense a second black hole was already impossible.","This was the current limit of his Spatial Origin Source.","However, this was not his personal limit.","He possessed not only the Spatial Origin Source but also an even more extraordinary Dao Source.","The power of All Things instantly surged through the black hole.","Jian Wushuang’s entire body trembled.","The space within him expanded once again.","This time, it exceeded the scope of an entire world.","One star represented a hundred thousand miles.","One black hole represented ten million stars.","Now, within Jian Wushuang’s condensed space, two black holes instantly emerged.","Adding the black hole from the spatial Origin Source, there were already three black holes.","The fourth one was slowly forming amidst the stars.","In just one hour, he had increased three black holes.","Even Jian Wushuang was startled by his own progress.","The slow expansion of the spatial Origin Source was due to its weak enhancement of combat power.","He had only advanced from the tier 5 Emperor to tier 6.","His true trump card was the Extreme Dao.","It allowed him to directly reach the complete-stage of the supreme-peak.","Eternal Ancient Transformation and the Starry Sky Chronicles were all imbued with the power of the Starry Sky.","Unfortunately, the power of the Stars Sky did not belong to All Things.","He couldn’t condense too much of it; otherwise, he dared not imagine how powerful his space would become.","“The seventh one!” Jian Wushuang roared, feeling a hint of pressure.","The seventh one took shape.","This time, he spent an entire day on it.","Subsequently, the birth of the black hole became slower.","It was contrary to the expansion of his Spatial Origin Source.","Having experience in devouring the Universe Origin Source, Jian Wushuang remained calm.","He couldn’t calculate the stars within the Universe Origin Source.","But he knew the number of black holes.","It exceeded ten thousand.","Ten thousand black holes could form the power of a universe.","And the Universe Master, at least ten times more powerful than the force of a universe, could control the Original Universe.","Therefore, after reaching the Tribulation Realm, generally, only those at the Three Tribulation realm would be able to grasp the universe and become its master.","Of course, there were also some extraordinary individuals who, instead of refining the Original Universe, built their own universe.","Elevating the space within themselves to the level of a universe.","This required condensing countless black holes.","The required power was truly massive.","Jian Wushuang had never thought that he could condense such a powerful space during Dao Merge.","Let’s take it step by step for now!","The goal is a thousand black holes!","If this were known by outsiders, they would probably mock his ignorance.","However, Jian Wushuang knew very well that once he utilized the power of the Starry Sky.","He really could reach a thousand or even break through a thousand.","Because the Starry Sky was vast.","It not only carried the universe but also bore many temporal rivers.","This time, he spent a full hundred years, exhausting the power of the Extreme Dao, and condensed seventy-six black holes.","This was the peak of a tier 6 Emperor!","And he was left with no power at all.","“Starry Sky!” Jian Wushuang instantly invoked his Thought power.","“Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","His aura also reached its peak.","The first transformation of the Eternal Ancient Transformation.","The breath directly rose to the complete-stage of the supreme-peak.","This time, there was no dragging or muddling.","The condensation of black holes was like the stars.","It instantly broke through a hundred.","“Two hundred!” Jian Wushuang was ecstatic in his heart. As expected, it was almost as he had expected. Breaking through a thousand should be more than enough.","The spatial expansion within him continued incessantly.","“Six hundred!”","Jian Wushuang nodded in satisfaction. Six hundred black holes had formed. Although the power of the Starry Sky was scarce, the rate of condensation had not decreased, indicating less absorption.","“Eight hundred!”","This time, Jian Wushuang became somewhat unsettled, his heart pounding wildly.","Because the growth speed hadn’t slowed down; it had, in fact, accelerated.","In just the time it takes for an incense stick to burn, it had already surpassed a thousand.","This exceeded his expectations.","“Impossible!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes widened, round with disbelief. Even he found it hard to believe.","Although a larger space would result in more condensed black holes, making it more powerful, he still felt some anxiety.","Anxiety that he might push himself to the brink!","“One thousand three!” Jian Wushuang’s eye sockets contracted; now he was praying to stop.","He didn’t know if this state was good or bad.","“Enough, I didn’t intend to become this powerful!”","...","One thousand eight!","“You!”","Jian Wushuang was already out of control; the expansion of space accelerated even more.","He couldn’t see the end himself.","And he had no idea how he would stop.","“Two thousand!”","Jian Wushuang was completely dumbfounded.","Two thousand black holes.","This had already reached the level of spatial universe.","It even surpassed the universe.","The divisions in spatial realms were quite clear.","Around a thousand black holes would typically reach the level of a spatial universe.","Now, with two thousand, it was already considered the peak, even bordering on the limit.","Further expansion, and it would truly become a universe.","The universe realm was just one level.","To reach the universal space, one needed tens of thousands of black holes, and within those black holes, a universe secret realm must be able to be born.","“Fortunately, no secret realm has appeared!” Jian Wushuang observed carefully.","He was genuinely afraid of inadvertently creating a universe."]},{"number":5639,"title":"Chapter 5639 Dao Merge (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5639 Dao Merge (3)","When the time came, how was he going to merge with the Dao!","....","Although the Ultimate Dao was already perfected, it was minuscule compared to a universe.","Like stirring the vast ocean with a thin bamboo pole.","No sensation at all!","Swish!","The black hole at the center began to crack. Jian Wushuang held his breath, and in the next moment, the black hole exploded, and the power of All Things within burst out instantly.","A complete secret realm unfolded before his eyes.","Jian Wushuang almost passed out entirely.","...","At this point, in the space he condensed, it had already exceeded four thousand black holes and still showed no sign of stopping.","He was on the verge of despair.","It seemed like he was really going to impact the universe.","A Dao Lord, condensing space to merge with the Dao, directly opening up a universe.","How would those old monsters in the Tribulation realm think about this?","If he really opened up a universe, Jian Wushuang would be on par with a Three Tribulation realm powerhouse.","When he condensed the universe, it might be powerful, but what if it didn’t match his Ultimate Dao?","This would lead to a failure in merging with the Dao!","In the future spacetime, if he failed to merge with the Dao, it would probably be because of this.","“No, something’s wrong!” Jian Wushuang shook his head again.","He needed a stable Dao Heart.","His mentality had to be stable.","Regardless of what he faced, he had to remain calm.","No rush!","Jian Wushuang had a perfect Dao Heart, but in an instant, his turbulent emotions calmed down.","This moment of calmness made him think of the Starry Sky Chronicles!","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang instantly rejoiced, shouting in his heart, “I still have the Starry Sky Chronicles. When merging with the Dao, I only need to use the Starry Sky Chronicles. The Ultimate Sword Dao will become the Starry Sky Sword Dao, which will be even more powerful. Isn’t this in line with the current space?”","He was truly clever yet momentarily confused!","He should have thought of it long ago!","By utilizing the Eternal Ancient Transformation’s first transformation to condense space, he could use the Starry Sky Chronicles to integrate the Starry Sky Sword Dao into the space.","By then, he might truly be able to master the power of the Starry Sky.","From the initial Thought power, Heart power, Devouring power, power of All Things, to the power of Life.","The current Starry Sky power is now even more mysterious and unpredictable.","It’s not that the power of the Starry Sky is inherently stronger than the power of Life. It’s all about suitability.","It’s like the force of Devouring.","Even though Jian Wushuang rarely uses it now, it doesn’t mean that the force of devouring is weaker than the power of All Things.","In fact, they don’t differ much.","Presently, Jian Wushuang is clearly more suitable for mastering the power of the Starry Sky.","This power did not come from the evolution of the Extreme Dao, but rather, it is a force stolen by the Extreme Dao through the Starry Sky.","It’s not as simple as everything turning into the power of Life.","So, for a moment, Jian Wushuang didn’t think about it.","“Tsk tsk, bear witness!” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","The condensed space also stopped at this moment.","Without any signs.","Five thousand black holes.","And a cosmic secret realm.","This is an incomplete universe.","Even the perfect experts in the supreme-peak may not have a space as powerful as his.","Of course, the strength of the supreme-peak is not only related to the Origin Source but also to more important secret techniques.","Now Jian Wushuang doesn’t have the time to think about these things; he is preparing for the fusion.","Swish!","A flower emitting endless temporal energy appeared.","Abyss Flower!","The Origin Source contained in the Starry Sky Chronicles, as well as time, required the Abyss Flower to enhance.","“Go!” Jian Wushuang threw the Abyss Flower, which flew into the center of space.","The Abyss Flower was a treasure in the temporal river, greatly assisting the Universe Master.","This time, his Dao Merge could be considered a great cost.","Using all his treasures to strive for a perfect Dao Merge.","Leaving no regrets.","The entire space, with five thousand black holes and a cosmic secret realm, is incredibly stable.","In the future, this will be his Origin Source.","The more stable, the better.","This represents the foundation.","Perhaps even strong newcomers entering the Tribulation Realm may not have a space as powerful as his.","This is not the complete Dao Merge yet; there is still his Ultimate Dao to follow.","“Blossom!” Jian Wushuang’s voice was deep.","The next moment, the Abyss Flower burst forth with infinite radiance, overlooking the entire space.","Crack!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes condensed, and his pupils suddenly shrank.","Surprisingly, countless cracks appeared in the space.","This caught Jian Wushuang off guard.","For a moment, his mind trembled violently.","“Gather!”","Fortunately, his Dao Heart was complete, preventing him from losing his composure.","As cracks appeared in the space, he worked to perfect them.","In no time, numerous treasures flew out, continuously entering the space he condensed.","However, as these treasures entered the space, they were instantly devoured by the black holes, unable to repair the cracks.","“What is this?” Jian Wushuang could hardly believe it.","According to the intelligence he obtained, it was normal for cracks to appear when merging the Dao and spacetime; they just needed repair.","How come they couldn’t be repaired?","Jian Wushuang once again took out prepared treasures and put them into the space.","He also closed all the black holes within the space.","This time, the stream formed by all the transformed treasures entered the cracks.","Just when Jian Wushuang thought he could repair them, the cracks expanded once again.","After the blooming of the Higanbana flower, it completely disappeared, falling into numerous cracks.","At the core, nine huge chasms burst open.","Jian Wushuang’s breath became rapid.","Countless tiny cracks overlooked the entire space.","“It’s over!” Jian Wushuang felt a sense of despair.","Cracks that couldn’t be repaired.","The incomplete space made it incredibly challenging to integrate the Ultimate Dao.","Even with the help of the Extreme Dao in evolving the space, merging the Ultimate Dao into it, he would have successfully merged the Dao, but the appearing cracks couldn’t be repaired.","That meant his power would continuously dissipate.","This was exactly like what happened in the future.","Repeating the same mistakes!","“No!” Jian Wushuang shouted as he instantly elevated his own aura to its peak. Within the condensed space, his strength directly ascended to the level of the Tribulation Realm.","He was unwilling.","How could he abandon such a powerful space?","Those cracks couldn’t stop him.","He was determined to make a desperate attempt, forcefully integrating the Ultimate Dao into it.","Urgency!","This time, he was truly desperate.","He couldn’t bear the consequences of a failed Dao Merge.","Even with a perfect Dao Heart, he was extremely anxious.","“Starry Sky Chronicles!” Jian Wushuang roared angrily, a divine sword formed from the Origin Source descended, carrying the power of the Starry Sky, directly piercing the space filled with cracks.","Hum!","The burst of aura caused Jian Wushuang to suffer severe backlash; he spat out blood, and even the Origin Source was trembling.","The originally powerful 50,000-fold divine body had begun to crack.","Looking down at the cracks on his body, Jian Wushuang felt his heart being cut like a knife.","The fusion had failed!","The divine sword formed from the Ultimate Origin Source, after piercing the space, had shattered.","In the brief moment of astonishment, Jian Wushuang’s state of mind eased slightly. In that fleeting moment, he seemed to see a familiar scene.","It was the Starry Sky!","In the endless Starry Sky, there were also cracks.","The wild man he had encountered in the Starry Sky before had also shown cracks on his body"]},{"number":5640,"title":"Chapter 5640 Dao Merge (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5640 Dao Merge (4)","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Not right!” Jian Wushuang shook his head, suddenly looking towards that space, exclaiming, “This isn’t a crack!”","Nine enormous cracks, along with numerous small ones, contained white lines of varying sizes within them.","That was the appearance of the temporal river.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang understood.","His was a condensed space, depicting the Starry Sky.","The sword strike just now, coincidentally hit the mark, and now the space was undergoing tremendous changes.","The originally three-dimensional space had transformed into an illustrated record, a chronicle.","Within the chronicle, space evolved into an endless expanse of stars!","Pitch black!","Before Jian Wushuang’s eyes was a vast expanse of darkness; he could only see a small dot, which was his Spaital Origin Source.","Inside it were five thousand black holes and a cosmic secret realm.","As for the cracks, they were reflected in the Starry Sky.","The space he had condensed had illuminated the stars.","“I did it!”","Jian Wushuang exclaimed in disbelief, “I did it!”","Hum!","He clenched his fists, and suddenly, his aura burst forth, his strength instantly reaching unprecedented levels.","That power filled him with confidence.","The power of the Starry Stars was almost infinite.","The power of Life was a thousand times more profound than before.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s strength was almost boundless.","Because he could mobilize the power of an entire Starry Sky.","After the joy, Jian Wushuang began to examine the Origin Space within his body.","Or one could say, the Origin Source of the Starry Sky.","Upon entering, it was the space he had personally condensed, a semi-finished universe.","Surrounded by darkness, he could only see clear cracks around him.","In other regions, illumination required continuous empowerment on his part.","At present, he couldn’t even light up a single universe.","He wondered when he would be able to illuminate an entire Starry Sky or, perhaps, ignite a small temporal river.","The temporal river he saw now was a dark golden color, containing the power of spacetime but lacking a universe within.","His incomplete universe was inconspicuous.","“It’s time to leave!”","Swish!","Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source avatar remained in the Origin Source Starry Sky, while his main body returned to his physical form.","Dao Merge was a complete success.","Henceforth, he became the Emperor.","And his title needed a change; no longer the Invincible Dao Lord, but the Invincible Emperor.","Jian Wushuang, in his current state, was so formidable that even he didn’t know the extent of his strength.","“Phew!”","A breath of relief escaped him, and Jian Wushuang finally welcomed a long-lost ease.","He could finally take a breather.","Time constantly urged him to grow stronger, and now he had reached the level of an Emperor.","The most challenging part, Dao Merge, was successfully accomplished.","Only the opportunity of the Tribulation Realm remained.","Having just broken through to the Emperor level, his Origin Realm directly soared to the cosmic level.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to condense an incomplete universe.","Space and universe, a grand mastery.","The pinnacle secret art, Starry Sky!","It was now perfected.","All that remained was the fulfillment of space and mastery over time.","During his Dao Lord days, even though he hadn’t gained recognition from the Time Origin Source, he could still manipulate a trace of time when using the Starry Sky Chronicles.","He believed that it wouldn’t be long before he gained acknowledgment from the Time Origin Source.","However, the prerequisite was to perfect his understanding of space.","A perfected space was, essentially, a universe.","For an ordinary Emperor, 3,600 black holes were enough to form a universe.","With 1,000 black holes, one could already reach the cosmic level.","But Jian Wushuang’s spatial universe probably required tens of thousands, if not more, black holes.","Now that he had just broken through, there was no rush.","The Tribulation Realm was not so easily traversed.","The merging of the Dao served as a watershed in the process of becoming a Tribulation realm.","Both paths presented similar difficulties.","However, the difficulty of each opportunity to become a Tribulation realm was the same.","This was different from the merging of the Dao.","At present, there were still many areas that needed improvement, and there was no need to be in such a hurry.","His divine body and the Origin Source of Space both needed enhancement.","And the Temporal Treasure, he could now observe more of it.","Once, he could only observe some pawns.","Now, he could finally observe the pieces with the rank of a general.","Swish!","Before Jian Wushuang’s eyes, a grand chessboard suddenly appeared.","There were many pawn pieces on the top, but there were only 360 pieces with the rank of general.","The pieces with the rank of a king numbered only 72.","The pieces with the rank of a god numbered only 9.","There was strength disparity.","The first True King, in the beginning, was only a general.","Yet the first True King could be a strongman of the Five Tribulation realm.","The pieces with the rank of a king above were probably formed from the condensation of the origin source of the Six Tribulation realm at their weakest.","“Where did these pieces come from?” Jian Wushuang was somewhat curious.","Pointing a finger, he tried to peer into the pieces with the rank of a general.","However, a tremendous force of suction made Jian Wushuang’s breath enter the chessboard.","Above the empty chessboard, a vortex suddenly condensed.","Jian Wushuang’s breath also turned into an essence and finally settled in the pawn pieces.","This time, he completely understood.","This was how these pieces came into being.","But if that was the case, wouldn’t the first owner suffer a great loss?","At that time, there probably wouldn’t be any pieces on the chessboard!","This was the super treasure left by Teacher Xuan Yi. Naturally, he invested more thought and had many doubts.","Now that he had become an Emperor, he could manipulate it in front of him, continuously exploring.","It could also be considered a relaxation after merging the Dao!","After continuous exploration, especially after studying the chess manual of the First True King, he finally understood the manipulation of this treasure.","“Rise!” Jian Wushuang pointed a finger, carefully controlling a pawn-ranked chess piece.","After the chess piece made a difficult move, the internal Origin Source surged out, transforming into a figure wearing a straw cloak and bamboo hat.","The aura emanating from it was at least at the peak of the supreme-peak.","Much stronger than the Eight-Armed Beast Emperor he faced before.","“Master!” The figure in the straw cloak respectfully greeted.","Jian Wushuang nodded, reasonably satisfied.","Next, he continued to enlighten and revive those pawn-ranked chess pieces.","According to the chess manual of the First True King, possessing Tribulation Realm strength allowed the activation of pawn-ranked chess pieces.","When the First True King was in his peak at the supreme-peak, he could summon more than a dozen chess pieces.","Among them, the most powerful chess piece could rival the First True King when he was still an Emperor.","Enlightening and reviving were also straightforward, merely manipulating the power of the chessboard.","Of course, one crucial point was challenging for others.","That was the power of Life, which happened to be the simplest for Jian Wushuang.","His current power of Life was more than enough to enlighten those pawn-ranked pieces, but manipulating the power of the chessboard was still somewhat weak.","He couldn’t even control the pawn-ranked pieces as he wished.","Continuous experimentation was needed.","No need to rush; he could place them in the Origin Source of the Starry Sky and let his avatars explore gradually!","As for himself, he began the cultivation of the divine body.","The sixth layer of the divine body.","Based on a foundation of 50,000-fold, he began to elevate.","The numerous divine body treasures he obtained earlier were all used up at this moment."]},{"number":5641,"title":"Chapter 5641 Ending","paragraphs":["Chapter 5641 Ending","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The outcome, however, proved somewhat disappointing.","In the end, it stabilized at around 60,000-fold.","That was the culmination of numerous divine treasures he had collected.","Yet, it was only 60,000-fold.","In the realm of the supreme-peak, this could only be considered an entry-level accomplishment.","Not to mention the Tribulation realm.","Without a divine body exceeding eighty thousand times, it was simply insufficient to contend with the Tribulation realm.","In some universes dedicated to cultivating divine bodies, there were some extraordinary individuals who directly abandoned their Origin Source to cultivate divine bodies.","What they sought was the sheer terrifying divine power.","Jian Wushuang had also come across records of Tribulation Realm practitioners cultivating divine bodies in some ancient texts.","They had obtained methods from other spacetimes, possessing the most perfect techniques for refining divine bodies. This allowed rapid enhancement of their physique, with significant amplification.","However, obtaining such methods was extremely arduous.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang possessed the Beast God Weapon.","Now, with his foundational divine body at 60,000-fold, once he fully unleashed the Beast God Weapon in its complete form, he dared not imagine how powerful he would become.","The final step.","The second Nascent Soul.","Jian Wushuang looked towards the corner where the Origin Source was nurtured, reached out, and, with the catalysis of the Guti Heart, experienced a tearing consciousness pain, causing him to grin.","After approximately an hour, the second Nascent Soul succeeded.","A figure identical to Jian Wushuang stood opposite him.","“Greetings, my true self!”","“Greetings, second Nascent Soul!”","When Jian Wushuang revealed a smile, the counterpart on the other side also smiled.","Because they were one and the same.","Crash!","Jian Wushuang took out a set of exquisite Eternal Treasures and handed them to the second Nascent Soul.","At the same time, he also took out many basic treasures, gave them to the second Nascent Soul, and then brought the other party into the Starry Sky Origin Source.","The current second Nascent Soul, although an Emperor, might be a bit weak in terms of strength.","A lot of treasures are still needed for investment.","However, the second Nascent Soul, who has long been stationed at the Grave God Mountain, can easily obtain a large number of treasures.","“Leave the seclusion!”","Jian Wushuang stood up directly, and the surrounding aura vibrated.","Then it returned to calm.","Even the space couldn’t sense Jian Wushuang, and at this time, he had already left the cave.","Mountain and sea.","Waves surged.","A figure appeared above.","Zhen Ling was the first to notice and immediately came forward.","After discovering the change in Jian Wushuang’s aura, Zhen Ling couldn’t help but show a happy expression and said, “Good, good, very good!”","Jian Wushuang’s successful Dao Merge would significantly elevate the foundation of the entire Qishen Temple. How could Zhen Ling not be happy?","“Lord Zhen Ling!” Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","Hu Qing, who had been observing this place, also noticed his emergence. Transforming into a stream of light, he arrived instantly, just a bit slower than Zhen Ling.","“Congratulations, Brother Wushuang!” Hu Qing hurriedly came forward to congratulate.","This time, the Dao Merge took Jian Wushuang a hundred thousand years.","The time wasn’t too long or too short.","“Let’s go back and talk!”","With a wave of Zhen Ling’s big hand, an aura enveloped the two of them and instantly arrived at the top of Grave Tomb Mountain.","The three of them sat in a circle, and after Jian Wushuang briefly recounted his Dao Merge experience, he began to inquire about Zhen Ling’s plans.","Now Jian Wushuang doesn’t need to stay in the Qishen Temple anymore.","He needs to go out.","But outside, there is Mie Sheng with the strength of the Half-Step Seven Tribulations realm.","Although he has assimilated with the Temple of World Annihilation, who knows if he can come out again.","Back then, the other party broke through the Higher Heavens and entered the Moro Spacetime.","Jian Wushuang naturally wouldn’t take such a risk; even though he was confident now, Zhen Ling wouldn’t allow him to go out.","So, the only option was to venture into other spacetimes.","However, the original plan was to send only Jian Wushuang, but now he proposed bringing a group of people along.","This put Zhen Ling in a difficult position.","The current situation was far from optimistic!","Drawing another group of super Inheritors, shortage of manpower was a minor issue; the bigger problem was that after these individuals achieved their cultivation, they might not return.","“I need to reconsider this matter!” Zhen Ling aged visibly at the thought.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang didn’t press further and could only nod.","On the side, Hu Qing hesitated to speak.","In that case, he decided to head to the temporal river.","Seeing Hu Qing’s expression, Zhen Ling also understood.","The three of them fell into a momentary silence.","In the end, Jian Wushuang broke the silence, changing the subject, “Lord Zhen Ling, my second Nascent Soul will stay at the Qishen Temple, cultivating on the Grave God Mountain.”","“I thought about it; we shouldn’t put all our treasures in one place. Don’t you agree?”","Zhen Ling rolled his small eyes, seemingly contemplating something. He wasn’t concerned about Jian Wushuang’s second Nascent Soul.","“What about the matter with the Heart Demon?”","Upon hearing the term ‘Heart Demon’, Jian Wushuang recalled that he had suppressed the other party.","Immediately, he waved his hand, bringing out the Heart Demon.","“I forgot about this guy!” Jian Wushuang felt somewhat embarrassed, scratching his head.","The matter of the Heart Demon should be crucial to Zhen Ling.","In the past, Mie Sheng took away the Ten-Thousand Demon, Blood Demon, and Shan Jun.","Presumably, the heart demon was also significant to Mie Sheng.","Bang!","“Let me out!!!” Heart Demon inside the bottle roared incessantly upon discovering the outside world.","However, upon seeing the Zhen Ling, it couldn’t help but shrink back, refraining from making any more loud demands.","Jian Wushuang casually pulled out the bottle stopper and released the Heart Demon.","Heart Demon stood in place, cautiously watching the three individuals.","It realized that it couldn’t defeat any one of them.","Especially Zhen Ling, who felt like an endless sea.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, seemed like a black hole.","Hu Qing was more like an ancient tree, calmly undisturbed.","“You made your request, and then what?” Jian Wushuang stared at Heart Demon with a playful tone.","Heart Demon!","Born from the evil desires of humans, naturally sly and smooth.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, it quickly waved its hands, smiling apologetically, “Great ones, I just felt a bit stifled. Otherwise, I can go back in!”","Saying this, Heart Demon tried to crawl back into the bottle but was seized by Jian Wushuang by the neck and pulled over.","“Zhen Ling, this guy seems unaware of the situation with Mie Sheng!” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","However, Heart Demon, in his grasp, dared not move at all.","After hearing his words, Zhen Ling was momentarily stunned, then turned to look at Heart Demon, saying coldly, “You don’t know Mie Sheng, but you should know about Wind Demon, right? Where is he?”","“I know, I know where Wind Demon is!” Heart Demon answered honestly, “He’s with Mo Jun, both suppressed in the Original universe!”","Seeing the cooperation, Jian Wushuang released his grip.","Phew!","Heart Demon prostrated on the ground, not daring to take a breath.","After learning about Wind Demon’s whereabouts, Zhen Ling shook his head.","In the outside world, there was nothing they could do.","However, being able to control Heart Demon meant Shan Jun couldn’t become complete.","Three Great True Monarchs.","Mo Jun, Gu Jun, Shan Jun.","Mo Jun was suppressed in the Original Universe, and Gu Jun could not come out of Purgatory for a while.","The only variable was Shan Jun.","This was also the reason why Zhen Ling targeted Shan Jun everywhere.","Knowing this, Jian Wushuang felt speechless.","Originally, he wanted to give Shan Jun a helping hand.","Now, it seemed that there was no chance."]},{"number":5642,"title":"Chapter 5642 The Inheritor of the Grave God Mountain","paragraphs":["Chapter 5642 The Inheritor of the Grave God Mountain","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was unknown if there will be a chance in the future.","If they ever meet again, he would surely repay the debt.","After all, he owed a debt of gratitude.","It was something he could not forget.","Hu Qing, on the side, listened with a clouded mind.","Fortunately, Hu Qing’s character is simple, and he did not dwell on it.","“Alright, you’ve just successfully merged with the Dao. Take a good rest. Let Hu Qing show you around some places on Grave God Mountain. In a while, I’ll need your help with something. As for the passages to other spacetimes, it’s not something that can be built in a short time. It requires careful planning!”","Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing both stood up and bid farewell, then left together.","Although it was called sightseeing, it was actually for cultivation.","Grave God Mountain had many Dao Arenas.","The training grounds of the three major Divine Masters were all here.","As well as Qishen’s Dao Arena.","However, Qishen’s Dao Arena was still in a closed state.","The Dao Arena of the three major Divine Masters were open, but you had to reach the fiftieth level to cultivate there.","“Wushuang, let me take you to the public area first. You need a token to cultivate on Grave God Mountain!” Hu Qing explained, “Actually, similar to the Elder Palace, the resources on Grave God Mountain are best for the top-level Inheritors. But for most Inheritors, it’s too demanding, so many people go to the Elder Palace!”","Jian Wushuang nodded in agreement with Hu Qing’s words.","Grave God Mountain was probably created to leave behind a group of the most elite Inheritors.","As for the mediocre ones, they were considered elite and cultivated slowly.","Whoosh!","The two figures arrived at the foot of Grave God Mountain.","Thunder Island.","An island on a mountain.","It sounds fantastical, but it is a fact.","Because part of Grave God Mountain is condensed seawater.","An island in the sea is quite normal.","The island was also very lively.","Over the past 100,000 years, countless Inheritors arrived here.","However, each time, the number decreased.","The first-generation Inheritors probably wouldn’t take long before there was no fresh blood.","But the second-generation Inheritors had already grown up outside, and those with good aptitude had been brought into the Qishen Temple.","After coming in, they went directly to Grave God Mountain without any screening or need for any tempering. They only needed to cultivate for thousands of years on Grave God Mountain.","Those with strength could stay, while those not strong enough were sent out.","But the threshold for these second-generation Inheritors to enter the Qishen Temple was very high.","Firstly, absolute loyalty and swearing by the Origin were required.","Then it was potential.","The Ultimate Dao, of course, goes without saying.","But the number of people on the Ultimate Dao was very few. Most of them were second-grade Origin Source Dao Lords and some mutated Origin Source Dao Lords.","Only by continuously cultivating these individuals can enough seedlings be selected for the future tribulation.","“Go this way!” Hu Qing led the way.","On the road, many people stared at Hu Qing, and some even whispered.","“Is he Hu Qing?”","“Yes, the contemporary Grave God Mountain’s first-ranked Inheritor. He has reached the 60 levels, his strength is terrifying, and he is among the first batch of Inheritors!”","A white-robed youth with decent strength, full of admiration, added, “He is also the pride of our Original Universe and the strongest in the Tongtian Buddha Realm!”","This statement immediately enhanced the luster of the faces of many strong individuals from the Original Universe.","However, there were only a few Inheritors from the Tongtian Buddha Realm, and only the white-robed youth was present.","He had only recently entered the Grave God Mountain in the past 10,000 years.","Most of these Inheritors were Dao Lords, with only a few being Emperors.","Some cultivators, who were unremarkable as Dao Lords, shone brightly after becoming Emperors.","As a result, the Grave God Mountain had also recruited quite a few Emperor Inheritors.","Hu Qing was not very concerned about these gazes and comments.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, teased, “Hu Qing, I didn’t expect you to be so famous!”","“Brother Wushuang, you’re joking. It’s just some empty reputation. Senior Shang broke through a few days ago and has also reached the 60th level!” Hu Qing replied, turning around.","Shang’s breakthrough made Jian Wushuang’s expression change.","Shang was definitely a strong candidate.","If Zhen Ling agreed to his proposal, he could consider including Shang.","Even if he didn’t consider it, if Zhen Ling agreed, Shang would likely be arranged to accompany him.","Shang was the first Ultimate Emperor in their temporal river, and also the longest-reigning first-ranked Inheritor of the Grave God Mountain.","After briefly surpassing Hu Qing, he erupted in breakthrough again and had now reached the 60th level.","He was probably approaching the Tribulation Realm.","Hu Qing might need some more time, but Shang’s background was much deeper than theirs.","After all, when they were not yet born, Shang was already a tier 5 Emperor.","Coming to the Grave God Mountain, he quickly became a tier 6 Emperor, seamlessly entering the supreme-peak, and then even fought against the Half-Step Tribulation Realm Fuego.","No matter how you calculated, he would be the Inheritor who broke through the Tribulation Realm the fastest.","Apart from Shang, Jian Wushuang was also interested in a few other well-known Ultimate Emperors on the Grave God Mountain, especially the Emperor of Light and Shadow, ‘Guangying’, who had once been in the same batch as them.","In the current setting of the Grave Tomb Mountain, Jian Wushuang also ranked in the top five.","There were also Tongtian Buddha and Zhen Wuyang.","The foundations of these individuals were quite impressive.","Their potential was also considerable.","Especially Zhen Wuyang and Tongtian Buddha.","Both of their Origin Sources were not the Ultimate Origin Sources, but they were abnormal or special Origin Sources.","They could compete with Ultimate Emperors of the same level without being weaker.","They even surpassed a large group of them.","Now, the Grave Tomb Mountain had a hundred Ultimate Emperors.","However, Zhen Wuyang and Tongtian Buddha being in the top ten did not mean they surpassed most of the Ultimate Emperors.","Among the Ultimate Emperors, some more unconventional ones still surpassed them.","Like the monster Hu Qing.","Or individuals like Shang, ancient creatures who had cultivated for endless ages, with terrifyingly deep foundations.","On the other hand, individuals like Guangying and Gu Qianluo managed to enter the top ten among these monsters, which was no simple feat.","Thinking about these, in no time, the two arrived at a large hall after 100 years.","“Ancient Desolation Hall!”","Jian Wushuang looked up and silently pronounced the words on the plaque.","Whether this ‘Ancient Desolation’ represented the Moro Spacetime or the Desolate Divine Master, he did not know.","“Brother Wushuang , this Ancient Desolation Hall is the Hundred Affairs Hall on the Grave God Mountain. Inheritors accepting tasks or new Inheritors must come here first!” Hu Qing pointed to the hall, explaining to Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, there happened to be a spirit guardian and an Envoy from the Vermilion Bird Temple entering the hall.","Seeing this situation, Jian Wushuang and the others followed suit and entered.","This group of inheritors was numerous, exceeding ten thousand.","Among them were many Emperors.","Jian Wushuang knew that they were probably gathered from the outside world.","They were likely here to study for a short period and probably wouldn’t stay too long.","In a scale of Inheritors of this magnitude, it would probably take hundreds of millions of years for such a group to arrive.","Despite the ten thousand people, the queue in the hall was not crowded at all."]},{"number":5643,"title":"Chapter 5643 Open up an Abode","paragraphs":["Chapter 5643 Open up an Abode","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The grand hall appeared vast, capable of accommodating countless individuals.","The spatial structure within might only be discernible upon reaching the cosmic realm.","Within the hall at this moment, only Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing possessed such strength.","As for the guardian spirit, he could hardly be considered human.","The two walked directly to the front counter, ignoring the newly arrived Inheritors.","“My Lord, are they the Inheritors of this place?” many in the group were curious. Perhaps, from the time of their birth, they had heard legends of the Qishen Temple. It was their first time entering, and curiosity naturally ran high.","Among them were a few first-generation Inheritors who had come from the outside world. Returning now, there was nothing particularly unusual.","Upon seeing Hu Qing, eyes were filled not only with envy but also with respect.","Upon hearing the inquiries of those youngsters, the guardian spirit promptly interrupted, “Show some respect. This is the Grave God Mountain. They are your Senior Uncles, not to mention that figure is the current first-ranked Inheritor of Grave God Mountain!”","“The first-ranked Inheritor?”","“Stronger than Emperor Wan Xing?” someone curiously asked.","This question elicited a bitter smile from the first-generation Inheritor.","Emperor Wan Xing.","He had long since become a supreme existence.","Ruling over an entire universe, his power and influence reached their peak.","Among these youngsters, many hailed from the Wan Xing Universe. Naturally, they held immense admiration for Emperor Wan Xing, considering him the strongest presence in Grave God Mountain.","“Well, you’ll have to personally ask Wan Xing about that!”","After receiving the token, Jian Wushuang glanced at some of the tasks displayed above.","Most of them were missions from the external temporal river.","Tasks from the Four Great Realms were scarce, and if present, they were auxiliary tasks, posing no real danger.","These tasks were open to Inheritors, and the newcomers from the external world didn’t need to bother with them. They just had to diligently cultivate on the Grave God Mountain for thousands of years.","“Now, where should I go?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Hu Qing pointed to a bronze furnace outside. “Ordinary Inheritors need to temper their physical bodies now. But Wushuang, you don’t need to do that. Just go climb the mountain directly!”","Tempering the physical body!","Jian Wushuang indeed had no need for this; his physical body was incredibly powerful. Back in the Universe Bronze Furnace of Shan Jun, he had completed the Tenth Refinement, reaching a perfect state.","As for climbing the mountain mentioned by Hu Qing, Jian Wushuang understood.","It was something all Inheritors had to do.","The height they reached would also serve as a criterion for future resource allocation.","With Jian Wushuang’s current strength, reaching the 60th level was effortless.","But it remained uncertain if he could reach the 70th level, according to the divisions.","A Universe Master could reach the 70th level.","In other words, a Three Tribulation realm powerhouse could reach the 70th level.","The 80th level was the Five Tribulation realm.","The 90th level was the Six Tribulation realm.","The 99th level would be comparable to the strength of a Seven Tribulation realm.","Surpassing the 99th level and passing through all the way would truly make one a Seven Tribulation realm powerhouse.","Perhaps, when establishing the Grave God Mountain, it was to find an Inheritor capable of reaching the Seven Tribulation realm.","A Seven Tribulation powerhouse!","No matter which temporal river, they were absolute dominant figures.","The Qishen of the past even rivaled Eight Tribulation powerhouses.","That kind of strength was even more terrifying.","No wonder even Mie Sheng behaved obediently and didn’t cause trouble.","After breaking through the Higher Heavens, Mie Sheng’s strength remained at the Half-Step Seven Tribulation realm. Unfortunately, his arrogance got the best of him.","Maybe it was due to calculations, or else there wouldn’t have been any trouble with Qishen.","Before the rise of Qishen, killing them off would have been better, securing control over the Moro Spacetime.","Or perhaps, it was because of calculations up to now, thinking that no powerful being controlling the force of life could emerge from the Moro Spacetime?","All possibilities existed.","Jian Wushuang stood at the foot of the mountain, gazing upwards.","Hu Qing stood by his side and spoke, “Climbing this mountain is not dangerous, nor is there any opponent. You just need to release your aura and proceed forward. However, once you reach the fiftieth level and try to open a cave mansion, you will encounter guardian savage beasts with considerable strength!”","Savage beasts?","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered. If Hu Qing described them as having ‘considerable strength’, it must be noteworthy.","Encountering guardian savage beasts when opening a cave mansion, then at the 80th level, wouldn’t it mean facing savage beasts at the Tribulation Realm when opening a cave mansion?","But the current Qishen Temple, apart from the Purgatory, didn’t have any Tribulation Realm experts, right?","Zhuang Zhong had also been thrown into the temporal river by Zhen Ling.","Could it be that this place still suppressed many Tribulation Realm savage beasts?","If that were the case, he could make a hefty profit this time.","The entire body of a savage beast was a treasure!","Its blood and flesh could be refined into essence blood, supplementing his Beast God Origin Source.","The bones could enhance his divine body, serving as a great tonic.","And the savage beast’s Origin Source, though barbaric, held some intriguing rules from above.","Also, it was a treasure.","But now that he was an Emperor, ordinary savage beasts naturally wouldn’t catch his eye.","At least, he needed savage beasts with Tribulation Realm strength for consideration.","So, let’s start from the 60th level!","“I’ll be back soon, it should be quick...” After saying this, he directly ascended the steps of the Grave God Mountain.","Leaving behind Hu Qing alone, eagerly looking forward.","At this moment, there were many people on the steps.","Many were even establishing caves.","Although there were no savage beasts below the 50th level, the structure of Grave God Mountain was exceptionally tough, and the overall quality exceeded that of Eternal Treasures.","Opening a cave was not so simple.","Even if the quality below the mountain was not good, it still took several years to establish.","Many Inheritors were below the 50th level.","Few people were above the 50th level.","Among the Emperors, reaching the 50th level required supreme-peak strength.","Even a weak supreme-peak was not enough.","Even Wu Zuo, I’m afraid, could only reach a little beyond the 50th level.","After all, many Ultimate Emperors were not supreme-peak variations of the Origin Source.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang was a bit puzzled. How did Qishen accept Wu Zuo as a disciple?","Even if he was a named disciple, it was a bit far-fetched.","In the normal supreme-peak, the strength could still be seen, but in Grave God Mountain, it was mediocre.","And he had practiced for so long without any progress.","Putting aside these distractions, Jian Wushuang took a step, and his aura didn’t even reach the normal state, yet he instantly reached the 50th level.","Phew!","In just a breath, Jian Wushuang directly reached the 50th level.","It’s worth noting that there were only dozens of Inheritors on Grave God Mountain who had reached the 50th level.","After all, the time of cultivation was still very short.","Those who could reach the 50th level were all strong among the supreme-peak.","Jian Wushuang stepped up effortlessly.","Except for Hu Qing, when the countless people at the bottom looked at Jian Wushuang, their eyes were filled with disbelief.","“Who is he, and why is he so strong?”","The supreme-peak experts who were establishing caves on the 50th level felt a familiar aura and instantly broke through the barriers.","When they saw that it was Jian Wushuang, there was no surprise."]},{"number":5644,"title":"Chapter 5644 Kill Desolate Beasts","paragraphs":["Chapter 5644 Kill Desolate Beasts","....","“You can be considered to have merged with the Dao!” The speaker was Zhen Wuyang!","However, this was just one of Jian Wushuang’s avatars.","His true self should be in the temporal river outside the external world.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly upon seeing a familiar face, not saying much, and prepared to directly open up a cave mansion.","At this moment, on the 50th floor, there were more than ten cave mansions.","Of course, some cave mansions had already been abandoned.","Some of the powerhouses who had reached the 50th floor had already broken through and reached higher positions.","Seeing Jian Wushuang opening a cave mansion on the 50th floor, Hu Qing below was somewhat surprised.","With his insight, he could see that Jian Wushuang’s strength was by no means weaker than his own.","At least, he could reach the 60th floor.","There was no need to waste time on the 50th floor.","However, in the next moment, he understood.","Roar!!!","A fully-grown desolate beast, at the supreme-peak level, instantly charged out from the Grave God Mountain.","As if it had been suppressed for countless years, the moment it appeared, its aura suddenly surged, an unmatched force emerged, and the intimidating power made many Inheritors below pale-faced.","The strength of this desolate beast could definitely rank in the top ten on the Grave God Mountain.","When Zhen Wuyang felt the aura, his face trembled, unable to help but remind, “Be careful, this desolate beast is not simple. It’s very likely that it broke through its strength while being suppressed!”","When he opened up a cave mansion on the 50th floor, he didn’t encounter such a powerful desolate beast.","The strength of this desolate beast was slightly stronger than his true self.","It could only be said that Jian Wushuang’s luck was a bit unfortunate.","He thought that when Jian Wushuang opened a cave mansion on the 50th floor, his strength only reached that level. However, he knew Jian Wushuang’s true thoughts.","The current Jian Wushuang not only coveted treasures but also sought to improve himself.","Even more so, he thirsted for life-and-death battles.","Unfortunately, on the Grave God Mountain, everyone was a formidable opponent!","If the formidable Tribulation Realm expert, Zhuang Zhong, were present, he could have tested his own strength.","Facing the desolate beast, Jian Wushuang didn’t even draw the Jueyun Sword on his back. With a swift movement, he instantly appeared next to the desolate beast. There was no change in his aura; he simply used a knife-hand strike, piercing through the beast’s body.","The force from this knife-hand strike erupted from within, directly causing the entire body of the desolate beast to burst. Jian Wushuang was even startled by the power of his own strike.","Having just broken through, he didn’t control it well for a moment, unexpectedly causing the opponent to burst open with a single blow.","Fortunately, he possessed the power of devouring. With a single hand, he gathered the exploded flesh and blood into a mass.","The beast, originally the size of 10,000 feet, now turned into a drop of essence blood in the blink of an eye.","Jian Wushuang smoothly absorbed it into the Beast God Weapon.","The Origin Source within the Beast God Weapon strengthened once again.","Although the Beast God Weapon had already reached completion, the internal Origin Source was still somewhat weak, not reaching the level of the Universe Origin Source. Hence, continuous devouring of powerful bloodline beasts was needed for improvement.","“Umm...” Zhen Wuyang couldn’t believe his eyes as he stared at Jian Wushuang.","The exchange just now happened too quickly; even Zhen Wuyang couldn’t perceive any changes in Jian Wushuang. That ancient desolate beast, stronger than his own true form, was completely defeated.","How terrifying must Jian Wushuang’s strength be!","Seeing the dumbfounded Zhen Wuyang, Jian Wushuang revealed a faint smile, raised his hand slightly, and said, “See you later!”","After speaking, he flashed and had already reached the 51st level.","Then, one by one, he opened up caves on each level, and the slaughtered desolate beasts vaguely entered his Beast God Weapon.","60 levels!","So far, the highest among all the inheritors on Grave God Mountain.","This news instantly detonated all the Inheritors on Grave God Mountain, drawing them to come and witness.","Even Shang, who had been in seclusion, walked out of his cave.","Seeing Jian Wushuang, they didn’t speak. The two just nodded at each other.","On the 54th level, a powerful figure with a body covered in white bones walked out of a cave. He looked up at Jian Wushuang above, revealing a hint of unwillingness in his gaze.","He was one of the top three super experts on Grave God Mountain, having reached the universe realm in space and created a unique pinnacle skill.","He was the Ultimate Emperor of the Bone Dao lineage.","Before Hui Qing’s Dao Merge, only Shang could surpass him.","He didn’t care, for Shang was the original Ultimate Emperor on Grave God Mountain, having cultivated for much longer than him. He was confident that he would surpass Shang in the future.","However, later on, Hu Qing successfully merged with the Dao, instantly catching up with his pace.","Upon returning from the Mortal Realm, he directly became a supreme-peak powerhouse, surpassing Shang in just one epoch.","This made him feel an unprecedented pressure, to the extent that he ignored external conflicts, dedicating himself entirely to cultivation.","The universe named after him in his hometown was breached by the Temple of World Annihilation, but it still couldn’t make him emerge from seclusion.","Now, someone had surpassed him again, shaking his Dao Heart.","It was Jian Wushuang.","The once invincible Dao Lord.","Just after merging with the Dao, he was about to take on the title of an Invincible Emperor.","Ranked fourth, Guangying’s figure was like a shadow in a dark zone, also lifting his head to gaze at Jian Wushuang.","However, his Dao Heart showed no change.","Because deep inside, he always believed that light and shadow would obscure spacetime, and in the future, he would be the true superpower.","Besides these top-tier super Inheritors, there were many ordinary Inheritors who had just arrived at the Grave God Mountain. In their eyes, there was envy and yearning.","Reached the 60th level of the Tomb God Mountain.","With the strength to traverse the entire temporal river.","The current strongest in the outside world was the Master of the Azure Dragon Temple.","However, their strength was only at the 60th level.","Of course, in terms of real combat power, it was probably Zhuang Zhong who was the true number one.","After all, he was a Tribulation Realm powerhouse.","But Zhuang Zhong hadn’t revealed himself and had been sitting in a dangerous place.","Deterring the Temple of World Annihilation.","This was more effective than launching an expedition.","If conquering could destroy the Temple of World Annihilation, these Inheritors would have long gone out.","If a Tribulation Realm expert took action, Mie Sheng might also intervene.","Or rather, Mie Sheng had other means to create Tribulation Realm strength.","After all, the power of that Holy Water was too terrifying.","A strength on the 60th level.","Among those who could reach this standard in the entire temporal river, except for those in the Tribulation Realm, there were no more than five individuals.","Broly was not a match for the Azure Dragon; he probably hadn’t reached this cultivation realm yet.","Now, atop the Grave God Mountain, there were three individuals, including himself.","Jiang Shang outside also possessed this level of strength, surpassing even the 60th level.","Add to that the Master of the Azure Dragon Temple.","Exactly five individuals.","Such formidable strength, even in some powerful temporal rivers, would still be considered top-tier.","In the former Moro Spacetime, despite having a large number of individuals in the Tribulation Realm, and many Universe Masters, there were rarely any conflicts, with the Emperor being the main authority.","Someone with the strength of Jian Wushuang would have been considered a Divine General back then, positioned quite high.","This was because the strength of individuals like Divine General Moyin varied, some stronger and some weaker.","“Level 60, truly extraordinary!” Jian Wushuang muttered to himself.","At this point, he felt a hint of fatigue."]},{"number":5645,"title":"Chapter 5645 Frost Demon Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 5645 Frost Demon Clan","That was the Law Rule power of the Grave God Mountain, pressing down on him.","....","Now he was curious to see how powerful the desolate beasts on this level were.","The Origin Source of the Beast God Weapon was almost complete.","To reach the level of Cosmic Origin Source, he only needed a desolate beast with the strength of a Tribulation Realm.","Just on the 59th level, the desolate beast he encountered had attacks comparable to a Tribulation Realm.","But that wasn’t enough.","It wasn’t just about comparable attacks; the crucial point was that the strongest move was on par with a Tribulation Realm.","If it were truly a Tribulation Realm desolate beast, any random move would be as powerful as the strongest attack of the previous desolate beast.","In terms of strength, there was a world of difference.","At the peak, Zhen Ling, feeling this scene, smiled.","With a hint of Thought power, he manipulated the Grave God Mountain and awakened a true Tribulation Realm desolate beast.","Consider it a favor for Jian Wushuang; he even begged Jian Wushuang.","Consider it a small reward!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes shifted, and he noticed a presence quietly appearing.","This time, before he could even open up his cave mansion, a desolate beast appeared, probably the work of Zhen Ling.","Buzz!","In the 60th level of the Grave God Mountain, an inconspicuous stone was cracking.","The size of that stone was only a few yards long and wide.","Not particularly eye-catching.","But in the next moment, the stone shattered, and a beastman with a head and two feet rushed out.","It was indeed similar to what Jian Wushuang had expected.","The desolate beast in front of him could no longer be considered a desolate beast, but a killer.","“The Frost Demon Clan!” Jian Wushuang stared at the opponent’s appearance, thinking of a monster he had seen in the Moro Spacetime.","That was the dominant race in the Moro Spacetime, the overlords of the ancient times.","Although they were overlords, their numbers were very scarce, even rarer than Special Life Forms.","In total, not more than 10,000 of them.","But they were born as Earth Immortals and became Emperors in adulthood.","With no constraints, breakthroughs were even easier during their advancement.","He had seen their portraits in books.","“You actually recognize the Frost Demon Clan!” The small killer, looking surprised that Jian Wushuang could recognize him, asked in astonishment.","Jian Wushuang calmly replied, “I happened to come across information about them!”","“Now, which era do you belong to? Why can’t I sense the operation of the temporal river!” The small killer with sharp horns looked up at the void sky, somewhat puzzled.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t be bothered to explain; he casually replied, “Defeat me, and you’ll understand!”","“Hahaha!!!”","“Your aura is too weak; defeating you would be too simple!”","“Try it!”","Jian Wushuang took direct action.","In an instant, he reached behind the opponent; his speed was so fast that even Shang nearby couldn’t see clearly.","Only Hu Qing, who had returned to the 60th floor, saw the moment when Jian Wushuang flashed past.","The speed had already merged with time.","Jian Wushuang’s speed far surpassed that of the Emperor.","Others couldn’t see it, which was normal.","Those Inheritors above the 50th floor, who initially could discern Jian Wushuang’s techniques, now found that their awareness couldn’t keep up with his changes.","Jian Wushuang, now behind the fierce beast, threw a punch. Surprisingly, the opponent, without turning around, caught his punch with hands behind its back.","This surprised Jian Wushuang.","“With this level of strength, I’m afraid I’ll soon understand the truth!”","The small beast suddenly turned its head, opened its brown lips, and a burst of violent force instantly erupted, directly facing Jian Wushuang.","Because his hand was caught, Jian Wushuang could not dodge. He could only withstand this blow.","Boom!!!","An attack directly shattered the mountain, rivaling Eternal Treasures.","Jian Wushuang disappeared into the rolling dust.","Hu Qing’s forehead broke into a cold sweat. The next moment, feeling a familiar aura in the sky, he looked up. It was Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was draped in dark red battle armor covering his entire body.","Above the battle armor, there was still a trace of that destructive power.","Crack!","Jian Wushuang revealed his face, stared at the assailant below, and asked, “What level of Tribulation Realm are you?”","“You’re able to withstand that?!” The small beast assailant was astonished. Seeing the treasure on Jian Wushuang, its eye sockets contracted, saying in shock, “Beast God Weapon!”","“You actually recognize it?” This time, it was Jian Wushuang’s turn to be surprised.","The opponent recognized the Beast God Weapon, probably having some reputation in Moro Spacetime.","Although the Frost Demon Clan had fallen later in Moro Spacetime, it was still a super clan.","The small beast assailant gritted its teeth, glaring at Jian Wushuang fiercely, and said, “It’s hard for me not to recognize it. Back then, someone used the Beast God Weapon to sneak attack my Frost Demon Clan, killing my clansmen!”","Looking at the opponent’s appearance, it seemed genuine.","And the hatred was not small.","“I, Gu Sha, will avenge my clan today!” A roar shattered countless rocks around.","On the 60th floor, the other two, Shang and Hu Qing, were also forced back by this roar.","“Tribulation Realm!”","At this moment, whether it was Hu Qing or Shang, or the other Ultimate Emperors below, they could all feel the oppressive force emanating from Gu Sha.","Only the Tribulation Realm could induce such pressure.","“It’s only the 60th floor, how could there be a Tribulation Realm!” Everyone found it unbelievable.","However, Jian Wushuang was eager to give it a try.","He hadn’t expected to encounter the Tribulation Realm ahead of time.","It seemed unnecessary to battle on this floor.","Otherwise, the 60th floor would become untenable.","With a thought, he communicated with Zhen Ling, instructing them to teleport him to the 65th floor.","“Are you sure? The power of the Law Rules there will exert significant suppression on you!” Zhen Ling inquired uncertainly.","Jian Wushuang remained resolute.","At this moment, only he was clear about his own strength.","The Law Rules forces on the 60th fifth floor couldn’t suppress him; instead, they would allow him greater freedom.","Swish!","Swish!","Although Zhen Ling was somewhat puzzled, he complied.","Like Jian Wushuang, he wanted to see how powerful he became after merging with the Dao.","The 65th floor was deserted.","The space here was even more solidified, gravity exceeded myriad times that of the outside world, and the power of the Law Rules was terrifyingly strong.","Jian Wushuang found it challenging to tear through the space in this location.","When he lowered his head, he could clearly see the figures below.","“What’s going on?” Gu Sha was somewhat puzzled, wondering how he suddenly ended up in this place.","Moreover, he felt a significant oppressive force in this location, subtly affecting him.","“Human, is this your doing?” Gu Cha inquired!","Jian Wushuang did not refute, calmly nodding.","“I’ve said it before, as long as you defeat me, you can know everything. As you are now, there’s no need to ask too much. Just understand, if you don’t defeat me, you will die!” Jian Wushuang roared, and the aura around him began to boil.","The instantly erupted strength made the short-statured Gu Sha use both arms to resist.","Hum!","Around Jian Wushuang, a dark red arc of electricity began to swirl.","This was his strongest state under normal circumstances.","If not for the power of the Starry Sky, his current state would probably be his utmost strength.","“You even hid your strength!” Gu Sha sneered, unimpressed even after sensing that Jian Wushuang had unleashed a strength comparable to his own."]},{"number":5646,"title":"Chapter 5646 Gu Sha","paragraphs":["Chapter 5646 Gu Sha","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He was very calm.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t surprised by this because he knew the innate secret techniques of the Frost Demon Clan.","They were naturally talented in the Dao of Transformation.","After reaching the Tribulation Realm, one could undergo a metamorphosis.","Gu Sha’s strength was not weak; he might be a Two Tribulation realm expert.","The ability to transform oneself, unleashing a stronger power.","“Quit the nonsense, let’s get started!” Jian Wushuang charged forward. The two found themselves on a staircase amid scattered rocks, facing each other from a distance.","In just a moment, he launched an instant attack.","This time, Gu Sha struck first, sharp claws appearing in front of Jian Wushuang in an instant.","Unfortunately, Jian Wushuang had already erupted with his aura this time, his strength far surpassing the past. He saw through the opponent’s move and directly grabbed Gu Sha’s wrist.","Jian Wushuang’s hands were like a chain tightly binding Gu Sha’s wrist.","Especially the left arm infused with the Beast God Claw.","It emitted a dark red light.","The power of the 60,000-fold divine body instantly burst forth with boundless strength.","Hum!","The two stood in a stalemate, Gu Sha gritting his teeth, his forehead with spiral patterns, and beads of sweat forming. Blood vessels burst in his eyes.","They were competing in divine power.","The onlookers below could see clearly because this time it was not a quick battle but a stalemate.","Although Jian Wushuang firmly held the opponent’s wrist, he could still sense the opponent’s strength.","To outsiders, Gu Sha seemed to be in a passive position now.","But only Jian Wushuang knew that his current strength was somewhat insufficient.","If he didn’t erupt again, he might be shaken off by the opponent.","“Beast God!”","Jian Wushuang shouted angrily, the dark red aura on his body instantly skyrocketing.","The power of the Beast God erupted completely.","The Beast God Domain opened wide.","Jian Wushuang’s divine body power transformed into the power of the Beast God.","Crack!","After Jian Wushuang erupted, he easily crushed Gu Sha’s technique, freeing his left hand and delivering a punch to his opponent’s chest.","Cracks appeared in the soft battle armor on Gu Sha’s body.","Brown blood sprayed from Gu Sha’s mouth.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang dodged in time, avoiding getting splattered.","In the Domain, Jian Wushuang’s speed was astonishingly fast. After punching Gu Sha away, he instantly circled behind him, raised his leg, and delivered a fierce kick.","Under the dual explosive force, Gu Sha suffered minor injuries, and his battle armor completely cracked.","In the midst of this, Jian Wushuang didn’t forget to taunt, “If you want to make me bleed, you’ll have to do it faster!”","After saying that, he clenched his fists and ruthlessly smashed them onto Gu Sha’s head.","Boom!","The ancient temple, which had been smashed to the ground from high in the sky, struggled to rise.","This time, Jian Wushuang didn’t make a move again. It wouldn’t be interesting to resolve the opponent too quickly.","He could sense that Gu Sha’s strength was far beyond this.","At this moment, the Beast God Domain he activated could be considered the power of the Beast God, amplifying his divine body to about 80,000-fold.","Already at the Tribulation Realm, coupled with the formidable power of the Beast God, he could use divine power to violently strike the opponent.","These powers were considered top-notch at the Tribulation Realm, but not at the peak.","If he couldn’t withstand this level of power, the opponent would disappoint him.","Gu Sha stood up from a small crater, wiped the blood from the corner of his mouth.","Staring at Jian Wushuang with crimson eyes, there was no fear but rather a strong fighting spirit.","“Your divine body is 80,000-fold. Not bad!” Gu Sha tore off the tattered armor, revealing a well-defined chest.","However, the limbs were very slender, and it was hard to tell how strong they were.","Seeing the armor being casually torn off, Jian Wushuang frowned.","Although he was confident in his own strength, he wasn’t so arrogant as to destroy a top-notch Eternal Treasure.","The opponent’s strength was so formidable, and being a Frost Demon Clan of the Tribulation Realm, there should be a set of top-notch Eternal Treasures on them, even if not Universe Treasures!","Now, he could easily buy top-notch Eternal Treasures.","Moreover, the opponent was in the Tribulation Realm, and their treasures couldn’t be ordinary.","They were easily broken by him in just a few moves.","“What’s wrong, do you think the treasures on my body are rubbish?” Gu Sha moved his wrist, and the broken bones had long since healed. Then he said, “Because my divine body exceeds 100,000-fold, I don’t need any defensive Eternal Treasures!”","As soon as the words fell, a power that shook the heavens and earth suddenly erupted. Jian Wushuang’s gaze became fervent; he felt that the opponent was not that simple.","Under the eruption of Gu Sha’s divine body again, he indeed reached a 100,000-fold.","The eruption of power made his speed surprisingly fast.","Jian Wushuang didn’t even see the opponent’s shadow; he was directly knocked down by a foot from the opponent. Just as he was about to get up, Gu Sha exerted force again, stomping him into a depression with a kick.","If it weren’t for the Beast God Weapon, this kick might have pierced through his divine body.","Boom!!!","This wasn’t over yet. The Gu Sha didn’t give Jian Wushuang any chance. With a single hand clenched into a fist, each punch thundered towards Jian Wushuang’s head.","The force shattered the ground directly, embedding Jian Wushuang’s entire body into the earth.","Ancient superpowers were truly extraordinary, especially those who followed the path of the divine body.","The strength of that force made Jian Wushuang feel despair.","“The power of the Beast God!” Jian Wushuang endured the cracking of his divine body and forcibly erupted the power of the Beast God. This time, he unleashed twice the power of the Beast God.","His divine body also surged to 100,000-fold, matching that of Gu Sha.","With a flip, he instantly shot up.","Gu Sha raised an eyebrow, surprised, “You recovered so quickly!”","The opponent didn’t know that Jian Wushuang possessed a robust Life power. Even if he didn’t use twice the power of the Beast God, the opponent couldn’t kill him.","This was the advantage of the Origin Source.","Its foundation was too strong.","Although both were currently using pure divine power, the Origin Source was indispensable.","Jian Wushuang, who rose from the ground, quickly entered a state of life-and-death struggle with Gu Sha.","The battle was difficult to decipher.","Even the double power of the Beast God was something Jian Wushuang could currently withstand. As for the Beast God Weapon, there was even less of a problem.","Although the Origin Source within the Beast God Weapon had not yet reached the level of the universe, it could sustain Jian Wushuang’s tripled Beast God power.","However, handling the tripled Beast God power proved to be somewhat challenging for Jian Wushuang.","The strongest was still the doubled Beast God power, amplifying the divine body to a staggering 100,000-fold.","In essence, it added a whopping 40,000-fold to the basic divine body.","The Beast God power referred to the force unleashed when the Beast God Weapon, the Candle Dragon, fully restored its complete form—a force Jian Wushuang dubbed the Beast God power.","Initially, when it wasn’t in its complete form, it could only unleash the Beast God Domain and amplify the divine body. As for the Beast God power, it was weak and incompatible with Jian Wushuang’s own divine body. At that time, Jian Wushuang didn’t pay much attention to it.","However, after becoming complete, Jian Wushuang discovered that this Beast God power was much stronger than the force unleashed by his basic divine body.","Now, with Jian Wushuang’s divine body enhanced to 100,000-fold, the transformed Beast God power could erupt with a strength surpassing his own."]},{"number":5647,"title":"Chapter 5647 Bear Witness!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5647 Bear Witness!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang became stronger with each battle, and there was no trace of decline in his divine body.","Although the Life power and the power of All Things could replenish themselves, the injuries to the divine body were challenging to recover.","Even if Jian Wushuang were injured, it would lead to a decline in his divine body. However, this time, despite sustaining some injuries, his divine body became stronger with each battle.","This was the resilience of the Beast God power.","Boom!","A fist directly slammed into the face of Gu Sha.","“How is this possible!” Gu Sha couldn’t believe it. After being injured, his divine body had started to decline, but Jian Wushuang’s divine body was growing stronger with each battle, already capable of suppressing him.","Jian Wushuang was full of fighting spirit, showing no intention of stopping, continuously pounding Gu Sha.","If he really wanted to kill the opponent, he could simply use his sword technique. However, there was no need; he was just playing!","Since the opponent’s divine body was strong, he would defeat him using his own divine body.","Swish!","With a casual kick, Gu Sha was sent flying into a pile of stones. Jian Wushuang, panting heavily, sneered, “Is this all the strength you have?”","Gu Sha in the stone pile did not reply.","Jian Wushuang could clearly sense the opponent’s aura and did not believe that Gu Sha had fallen so easily.","“I heard that your Frost Demon Clan can undergo a metamorphosis after reaching the Tribulation Realm. I wonder if it’s true!” Jian Wushuang stared below and continued, “If you don’t unleash your power, I won’t give you another chance!”","The people below, witnessing Jian Wushuang beating Gu Sha, thought he was about to win. However, seeing him not pursuing further, they were puzzled.","They couldn’t hear Jian Wushuang’s voice, only seeing his lips moving.","Jian Wushuang, filled with the rising battle intent, didn’t want to just kill the opponent like this.","At least he should display some surprising strength!","Otherwise, it would be too much of a waste.","He didn’t engage in battle with the Origin Source against his opponent. It seemed unjust to him without displaying some strength.","Whoosh!","Gu Sha rose from the pile of stones, casually patting off the dust on his body. With faltering steps, he walked out and looked at Jian Wushuang, his eyes trembling.","“Do you know that I can undergo metamorphosis? Aren’t you afraid that I’ll kill you after my strength surges?” Gu Sha’s voice was low.","Metamorphosis was the innate secret technique of their clan.","Very few knew about it, and the fact that the person in front of him, from the human race, was aware of it suggested a high status, probably within the Qishen Temple.","At this moment, Gu Sha’s thoughts were still in the ancient Moro Spacetime.","His strength back then was not considered formidable.","Even in the Tribulation Realm, he was just an ordinary member.","Jian Wushuang could suppress him, indicating that Jian Wushuang’s strength was not outstanding either.","In his impression, there were many formidable figures among the Five Tribulation realm experts of the Qishen Temple.","And the three Divine Masters were even super-strong at the Six Tribulation realm.","So, he thought Jian Wushuang’s status shouldn’t be very high.","However, knowing the innate secret technique of their clan was extraordinary.","Probably someone like a genius from the Qishen Temple.","Only extraordinary geniuses would be so arrogant as to offer him the opportunity to undergo metamorphosis.","Jian Wushuang stared at Gu Sha, shook his head, and said calmly, “Are you so confident?”","“Hahaha!” Gu Sha burst into laughter. His eyes began to condense, and his aura started to change. He continued, “It seems you don’t know much. Do you think my metamorphosis is simple?”","The reason the Frost Demon Clan could dominate the Moro Spacetime in the Ancient Desolation era before the arrival of Higher Heavens Era was due to their real abilities.","Without relying on any external objects or secret techniques.","Purely relying on talent, they could rule the temporal river alone.","The sparsely populated Frost Demon Clan could be so powerful.","How could they be ordinary?","“Mortal, bear witness!”","A dazzling white light flickered. Gu Sha laughed manically, saying, “Are you ready to embrace death?”","Hum!","The white light exploded, and the dazzling brightness made it difficult for Jian Wushuang to open his eyes.","He could only vaguely see a figure, curled up in a ball, slowly standing up.","After the light dissipated and the aura dispersed.","Jian Wushuang saw the appearance of Gu Sha after metamorphosis.","The appearance had undergone a tremendous change from before.","From short and weak, it transformed into robust and sturdy!","There were few changes in the facial features, but the two antennae on the top of the head were retained.","For a moment, Jian Wushuang couldn’t sense the opponent’s strength.","“How do you find my transformation? Are you satisfied, sir?” Gu Sha opened his palms and slowly raised them.","Jian Wushuang was about to nod in response when a powerful force instantly flipped him, sending him back thousands of miles.","Before he could stabilize his figure, Gu Sha was already in front of him, pressing Jian Wushuang harshly to the ground with a knee.","With a single knee pressing against Jian Wushuang’s neck, Gu Sha looked down at him and said in a cold voice, “My current divine power is 180,000-fold!”","Upon hearing this number, Jian Wushuang’s eyes contracted!","180,000-fold!","What kind of monster was this?","Was this the superpowerful of the divine body path?","He had heard before that the stronger a divine body path cultivator became, the more powerful they would be in the later stages. However, he had not expected it to be so outrageous.","Earlier, he thought that after the transformation, the opponent’s strength might reach a maximum of 120,000-fold, or even 130,000-fold, which would be impressive.","But he had not anticipated it reaching a direct 180,000-fold.","This level of divine power might directly rival a superpowerful in the Three Tribulation realm.","No wonder the other party was so confident.","It was truly a surprise.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang, in the hands of Gu Sha, was like an ordinary person, with no room for any counterattack.","He was continuously being beaten.","The divine body was already cracked, plummeting from 100,000-fold to 60,000-fold.","The power of the Beast God faded away.","Gu Sha bound Jian Wushuang’s neck with his tail, lifted him into the air, and pounded his chest with fist after fist.","Soon, the basic divine body could no longer hold up.","Jian Wushuang’s divine body completely shattered.","His face was covered in blood.","Six of his orifices were bleeding!","“No... enough!” Jian Wushuang struggled to utter a few words, his eyelids uncontrollably attempting to close.","However, Gu Sha did not stop; relentlessly ravaging Jian Wushuang, all the while taunting, “Didn’t you want to see my true strength? Why can’t you endure it now?”","This time, Jian Wushuang truly couldn’t endure.","Though his divine body was blessed with the power of the Beast God, allowing him to reach the strength of the Tribulation Realm, the difference compared to his opponent was too vast.","100,000-fold against 180,000-fold seemed like a difference of 80,000-fold, but in reality, it spanned countless levels.","Even if Jian Wushuang had an additional 10,000-fold, he still couldn’t match his adversary.","Not to mention, there was an extra staggering eighty thousand.","Even with the threefold augmentation of the power of the Beast God, boosting his divine body to a 120,000fold, it wasn’t enough.","In a contest of divine power, Jian Wushuang lost...","But it wasn’t entirely his fault. Gu Sha was a formidable figure of the Tribulation Realm in the divine body path.","His foundational divine body was only 60,000-fold, and after Dao Merge, the assistance to the divine body wasn’t significant. Even after spending countless treasures, he only managed to elevate it to 60,000-fold. How could he compare to his opponent?","It was only after the complete formation of the Beast God Weapon that he possessed such formidable divine power.","If he could elevate both his divine and physical bodies to the perfection of an Emperor, then he might stand a chance against his adversary in battle."]},{"number":5648,"title":"Chapter 5648 Hurry Through","paragraphs":["Chapter 5648 Hurry Through","Those special beings, the divine bodies at the supreme-peak, could reach up to 80,000-fold at the limit.","....","Jian Wushuang, if he reached that level, could possibly unleash five times the power of the Beast God by elevating the Origin Source of the Beast God Weapon to the cosmic level.","He was not afraid of Gu Sha.","However, at the moment, just after successfully merging with Dao, all his treasures were depleted and couldn’t reach that level.","After abandoning the divine body, Jian Wushuang moved his Thought force, and the power of Life instantly surged.","Although the injuries of the divine body had not fully recovered to their peak, the injuries on Jian Wushuang’s physical body healed instantly.","As for the Origin Source?","Even if the opponent had 180,000-fold divine powers, it couldn’t harm his Starry Sky Origin Source.","He had illuminated half of the universe and an endless Starry Sky.","Even if the Universe Master came, there was no guarantee that he could shatter Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source.","Let alone Gu Sha following the divine body path.","180,000-fold divine bodies were indeed powerful.","It could already rival ordinary Three Tribulation realm powerhouses; of course, facing the Universe Master was certainly not without competition.","Mastering the tribulation of the universe was not that simple.","And now, Gu Sha was facing a powerhouse who controlled half of the universe from the Origin Source.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source erupted instantly, a breath powerful enough to influence the Law Rules burst out, making Gu Sha’s mind tremble.","“Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","Gu Sha’s eyes were shocked; he didn’t expect Jian Wushuang to have such a powerful Origin Source.","He had thought that like him, Jian Wushuang was a powerhouse on the divine body path. However, it turned out he was an existence that mastered the Ultimate Dao.","Feeling Jian Wushuang’s Origin Source, Gu Sha, astonished, directly let go of his tail, tossing Jian Wushuang aside, and trembled, “You’re just an Emperor!”","Jian Wushuang slowly stood up, arcs of electricity running over his body, turning into a faint blue color, the power of the Starry Sky.","This was still his first time exhibiting the Eternal Ancient Transformation after merging with Dao, reaching the peak state.","“Surprised?” Jian Wushuang’s gaze became unusually firm.","Clang!","Drawing the Jueyun Sword from behind, time and space ceased to flow.","Gu Sha even retreated in fear.","That force reminded him of the former Universe Master.","“I’ve had my fun; now it’s time for you to die!”","Hum!","A massive sword shadow appeared in the heavens and earth.","This made everyone tremble.","With a single slash, Gu Sha, with his 180,000 divine body, felt a slight asymmetry in his eyes, and the next moment his body turned into two pieces.","Jian Wushuang instantly created hundreds of swords, and in the midst of Gu Sha’s surprise, he shattered into pieces.","Raising his hand, the power condensed from the vast power of All Things directly exploded.","Boom!","After the explosion of the power of All Things, the body of Gu Sha turned into blood, floating in the void.","Jian Wushuang was surprised; even this didn’t kill the opponent.","The 180,000-fold divine body was indeed extraordinary.","However, now that Gu Sha was in this bloody form, now reduced to flesh and blood, Jian Wushuang used his Devouring power to drag him directly into the palm of his hand. Under the suppression of the powerful Starry Sky power, he obliterated the residual consciousness in the blood, leaving only blood filled with boundless power.","Whew!","Jian Wushuang infused this blood into the Beast God Weapon, breathing a sigh of relief.","Finally resolved.","Now, without using the Starry Sky Chronicles, he could slay peak experts of the Two Tribulation realm.","Of course, despite Gu Sha’s battle power reaching the threshold of the Three Tribulation realm, it was ultimately on a pure divine body path and still somewhat weak.","Suppressed for so many years, the 180,000-fold divine body also did not play a significant role and were easily dealt with by him.","It could only be considered as peak of the Two Tribulation realm at best!","If he were to unleash the Starry Sky Chronicles, he could contend with ordinary experts in the Tribulation Realm. However, when it came to the Universe Masters, he might not be their match.","Among the Tribulation Realm, the gap between those who mastered the cosmic tribulation and those who did not was immense.","This was incalculable.","If they were to fight in the universe controlled by the Universe Master, any number of experts in the Tribulation Realm would fall.","In their own Dao Arena, the Universe Masters were almost invincible.","This also made Jian Wushuang very interested in his own One Thought Universe.","If his One Thought Universe could become a real universe, it could be a dynamic Dao Arena.","By then, wouldn’t he be invincible below the Fourth Tribulation Realm, and even contend with Fourth Tribulation Realm experts?","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel excited.","He was still just an Emperor now, and his understanding of the universe had not yet reached true perfection.","Once he illuminated an entire universe in the Starry Sky Origin Source, he might be able to unleash a true One Thought Universe.","Continue cultivation?","This was obviously not appropriate. Even if Zhen Ling were generous, he couldn’t give him all the treasures.","He still needed to venture out on his own.","The 65th level.","Jian Wushuang casually opened up a cave.","But this time, no desoalte beast appeared.","He really wanted to kill another one.","The Origin Source of the Beast God Weapon had just entered the level of the Cosmic Origin Source, still weaker than the half-universe within his body.","“Forget it, I’ll find one myself later!” Jian Wushuang shook his head. He was satisfied this time.","After casually opening up the cave, he let the second Nascent Soul stay behind, while his true self went to the 60th level.","When Hu Qing and Shang saw him, their eyes were colored with admiration.","At this moment, even the relatively taciturn Hu Qing had a tenacity, a determination to surpass Jian Wushuang.","In fact, Jian Wushuang used to be like them.","Remembering the time at the Three Kings Court, he witnessed Hu Qing successfully merging Dao, and wasn’t it an envious sight?","Seeing the strength of Shang, rivaling the resurrected Fuego, filled him with even greater longing.","Now that he has successfully merged Dao, not only has he surpassed them, but he has also opened up a considerable gap.","The path of the strong is the right one!","Jian Wushuang’s heart was unwavering; he would continue on this path.","Amidst congratulations, the three of them chatted freely.","This was the first time chatting with Shang. Jian Wushuang learned some secrets of the Original Universe from Shang, and gained a better understanding of his personal thoughts.","As for the matter of traveling to other spacetimes, he did not mention it, as Zhen Ling had not given a definite answer.","If he spoke prematurely and Zhen Ling did not agree, wouldn’t that be awkward?","Just as the three were preparing to enter Hu Qing’s cave to reminisce, Zhen Ling’s transmission came, and Jian Wushuang’s expression changed.","Zhen Ling transmitted his message, and the three went to the mountaintop together.","This made Jian Wushuang very happy.","It meant that Zhen Ling was moved.","Perhaps his strength impressed Zhen Ling, or Zhen Ling had confidence in them.","In Jian Wushuang’s view, Shang’s character was not bad either; he was a perfect Inheritor and a righteous strong cultivator.","Integrating knowledge and action is the mark of a true gentleman.","No need to say much about Hu Qing.","When it comes to character, he himself has some flaws.","Considering the repeated betrayals, the trust Zhen Ling placed in him was immense.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang was deeply moved. For the glory of Qishen Temple’s restoration, they must not shirk their responsibilities!","At the Mourning Regret Pavilion.","When Jian Wushuang and the others arrived, several people were already waiting here!","Originally ranked third, Gu Qianluo, as well as the fourth-ranked Guangying, and Jian Wushuang’s old acquaintance, Zhen Wuyang."]},{"number":5649,"title":"Chapter 5649 Candidates","paragraphs":["Chapter 5649 Candidates","Six individuals stood, with only Zhen Ling sitting alone.","....","“The matter is as it is. All of you go back and consider. This time, no more than ten people will venture into the alternate spacetime. Absolutely do not disclose it to anyone!” Zhen Ling said and then let the others disperse.","However, Jian Wushuang was left behind.","Returning home, already aware of the situation, he had made a decision in his heart, finding it quite easy.","It was different for the others.","Especially for the senior figures of the Original Universe.","Zhen Wuyang and Shang.","The two of them attached great importance to the external temporal river, especially the Original Universe.","They felt that Zhen Ling’s directive for them to go to other temporal rivers was a blatant evasion.","There was hesitation in their hearts.","On the other hand, Gu Qianluo and Guangying were quite relaxed, only considering gains and losses without caring much about the outside world.","Thinking about it, it made sense.","They didn’t have much attachment to the outside world.","After coming to the Qishen Temple, their only goal was to become stronger, with no intention of giving back.","Otherwise, with the chaos in the outside world, they would have gone out.","Shang was in seclusion, or else he would have gone out as well.","Zhen Wuyang’s main body had always been conquering in the outside world.","There was also Tongtian Buddha, who hadn’t even left a clone behind and was currently leading 16 universes in the outside world, confronting the Temple of World Annihilation head-on.","These people were the future backbone.","No wonder Zhen Ling hesitated.","It was also for this reason.","In case they raised a white-eyed wolf, it wouldn’t be good.","With only the two of them left, Jian Wushuang didn’t hold back and directly sat down.","Zhen Ling personally poured tea for Jian Wushuang.","“Tsk tsk, taste it. This is the tea from your temporal river. You won’t know when you’ll get to drink it again in the future!”","Indeed, after Zhen Ling and the others left, it would probably take tens of thousands of epochs for them to return.","Normal Tribulation Realms were simply ineffective.","At least Three or even Four Tribulation realms were required to have a certain effect.","Among the current candidates, all were potential Tribulation Realm cultivators.","The opportunity had come. Becoming a Tribulation Realm was not difficult.","But how far one could go depended on their own abilities.","In the long run, practitioners like Zhen Wuyang and Tongtian Buddha could actually go further.","Because they had extremely strong adaptability.","This was also the reason why Zhen Ling initially favored Shang.","Being too against the heavens was also not good because the path was difficult.","Just like Jian Wushuang, who as a Dao Lord could kill the supreme-peak, which was incredibly against the heavens.","But thinking about it, in the same era, practitioners like Hu Qing and Gu Qianluo were already supreme-peak experts before Jian Wushuang merged with the Dao.","It meant that Jian Wushuang won the gamble, succeeded in merging with the Dao, and surpassed everyone.","If merging with the Dao failed, their strength would probably be inferior to these people.","The risk was too great.","“After this opportunity, there would be very few chances, but I will do my utmost to come back as soon as possible!” Jian Wushuang declared firmly.","Whether it was for his hometown universe, the temporal river, or the power of Death, he had to confront Mie Sheng; there was no escaping it.","That was fate!","Zhen Ling had some confidence in Jian Wushuang and wasn’t afraid that he would truly run away and not return.","“How much do you know about Mie Sheng’s situation now?” Zhen Ling asked tentatively.","Since Mie Sheng’s appearance, there had been little connection between the two.","However, in the cave of the Mahayana Spirit Mountain, Jian Wushuang traveled to the once fragmented Moro Spacetime and saw a lot, gaining some understanding of Mie Sheng.","Jian Wushuang didn’t hide anything and explained the matter of the power of Death and the power of Life.","He felt that the complexity of this matter was not only due to the power of Life but also because of the involvement of Qishen.","He just couldn’t easily say it.","If Mie Sheng was solely after him, he probably would have been annihilated long ago.","Why wait until now?","After hearing the whole story, Zhen Ling nodded slightly and sighed, “Have you seen the future of this temporal river?”","This sentence startled Jian Wushuang.","Subconsciously wanting to shake his head, he found himself frozen.","With a wave of Zhen Ling’s hand, in front of them, the image of a Temporal Origin Source appeared—a Temporal Origin Source already shrouded in darkness.","“This temporal river will eventually perish. This is the prediction of a powerful seer!”","Jian Wushuang was stunned upon hearing this.","Initially, he thought Zhen Ling could see that he had traveled to the future, but it turned out that someone had foreseen the changes in the future spacetime.","This temporal river was destined for destruction.","And the Qishen Temple would be destroyed along with it!","Seeing the shocked expression on Jian Wushuang’s face, Zhen Ling smiled faintly and spoke, “Of course, you don’t have to believe in the existence of that prophecy!”","Jian Wushuang, just like when he entered the future spacetime, had absolute faith.","In the world to come, he failed to merge with the Dao and ultimately perished.","As for the subsequent demise of the temporal river, he was unaware.","However, being able to see the future failure made him feel that there was probably some connection.","“Is this existence a powerhouse from the Qishen Temple?” Jian Wushuang asked curiously.","Predicting the future, the Universe Masters could achieve such feats.","The First True King had also foreseen the future of the Three Kings Court.","Unfortunately, when facing some extraordinary individuals, accurate predictions were impossible.","This was also the reason why Jian Wushuang was able to succeed in merging with the Dao.","If the predictions were too accurate, he would probably have already failed.","“It’s not the case. Besides me, the Qishen Temple no longer has such super-strong individuals. Even the original entity back then wasn’t that powerful!”","Zhen Ling sighed and shook his head. If there was such a formidable existence in the Qishen Temple, he wouldn’t be in such a passive situation.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly, pressing for answers, “Why, Senior, would you help the Qishen Temple predict the future?”","Since the prediction indicated that the Qishen Temple would be destroyed along with the temporal river, there must be some connection between them.","Otherwise, there was no reason for such a matter to be brought up out of the blue.","Just like now, a presence he couldn’t fully comprehend suddenly appeared, directly telling him that he would become a Nine Tribulations realm powerhouse in the future; surely, he couldn’t believe it.","“Speaking of which, the relationship with the Qishen Temple is not significant, but there is some personal connection with the Temple Master Xuan Yi, so I was willing to inform them!”","Now, without Zhen Ling saying much, Jian Wushuang began to understand.","No wonder the Black Tortoise Temple and the Qishen Temple were somewhat out of sync.","It turned out that, after believing the words of some old fellow, they were preparing to leave early, without even thinking about restoring the Qishen Temple!","Zhen Ling seemed to perceive Jian Wushuang’s thoughts and hurriedly corrected, “Actually, the Black Tortoise Temple is not in an easy situation either. In recent years, due to the emergence of Mie Sheng, their assets have been almost depleted!”","In external wars, the Temple of World Annihilation had the Holy Water, assisting practitioners in undergoing the sacrifice ritual to enhance their strength.","Qishen Temple relied on the puppets of Black Tortoise Temple.","This was the only way they could barely suppress the other side.","If the Black Tortoise Temple ran away, the Qishen Temple would now be on the brink of collapse.","“As for this prophecy, I believed it somewhat before, but after seeing you all, I changed my mind!” Zhen Ling said as he stood up.","Previously, he thought that the one who would destroy this temporal river was the Inheritor nurtured by his Qishen Temple."]},{"number":5650,"title":"Chapter 5650 Culprit","paragraphs":["Chapter 5650 Culprit","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Now that Mie Sheng had emerged, Jian Wushuang finally realized.","It was Mie Sheng!","He was the true mastermind behind the scenes.","As for the Inheritors, they would all destroy the temporal river because of Mie Sheng.","That was the real root of the problem.","So, the solution lay in dealing with Mie Sheng.","As for that Inheritor, they were no longer important.","The Temple of World Annihilation also had an Inheritor, perhaps someone from their side.","He didn’t need to worry about it.","Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged, no longer asking questions but sinking into silence.","To predict the future with such accuracy, who exactly was that being, and what cultivation realm had they reached?","“Oh, by the way, do you have any suitable candidates?” Zhen Ling turned to Jian Wushuang, steering the conversation away from the destruction of the temporal river.","The prospect of the destruction of the temporal river was still somewhat oppressive.","Jian Wushuang raised his head, looking at Zhen Ling. He did have a few suitable candidates in mind.","“What about Wu Zuo?”","When Zhen Ling heard the name Wu Zuo, he paused.","He hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to mention Wu Zuo.","For a moment, Zhen Ling took in a sharp breath, unable to comprehend why Jian Wushuang would bring up Wu Zuo’s name. With astonishment, he looked at Jian Wushuang and asked, “How did you think of him?”","“I just feel that this person is not simple. Despite his ordinary strength, he managed to become a personal disciple of Qishen. Moreover, he has lived from ancient times to the present. Apart from Mie Sheng, he is the only ancient cultivator who has not fallen!”","After hearing Jian Wushuang’s explanation, Zhen Ling’s heart stirred.","Previously, he hadn’t really considered this question.","That Wu Zuo could survive until now, even drifting through endless Starry Sky with the Qishen Temple and arriving at this temporal river, without perishing.","His luck was simply too good.","Despite Wu Zuo’s current ill-fated circumstances, not even able to secure a position as a Palace Master, crossing the temporal river should have required at least a Tribulation Realm expert. For Wu Zuo, a mere supreme-peak, to survive until today was somewhat unusual!","“Put him on the list of candidates!” Jian Wushuang nodded, then continued, “We should also send Wanyan and Dongsheng over!”","This time, Jian Wushuang changed his approach, not intending to bring over all those super Inheritors.","It’s better to cultivate some who are more loyal.","Rather than ending up with a group of selfish individuals who might be difficult to command later.","Currently, Dongsheng and Wanyan both possess considerable strength.","Dongsheng has even become a supreme-peak powerhouse, catching up with the first group of emperors who entered the Qishen Temple.","Although they are temporarily not as strong as Zhen Wuyang and the others, they have great potential.","“I’ll dispatch their original selves, and there will be further tests for them in the future!”","Jian Wushuang naturally didn’t have much to say about this; everything was decided by Zhen Ling, he just gave a suggestion.","“Plus, with some people from the Grave God Mountain, it should be enough!” Jian Wushuang added.","Hu Qing, Gu Qianluo, Guangying, Zhen Wuyang, Tongtian Buddha, Shang, Dongsheng, Wanyan, Wu Zuo!","Adding Jian Wushuang, it’s exactly ten people!","“In a while, I will subject them to targeted tests; whether they can pass depends on them!” Zhen Ling also didn’t give Jian Wushuang a definite answer.","But this already satisfied Jian Wushuang greatly.","At least he won’t be alone in venturing into unfamiliar spacetimes; there will be some people accompanying him.","“Oh right, this time I’m leaving you with one more thing to do, I need your help with it!” Zhen Ling looked at Jian Wushuang and revealed his plan.","Upon hearing it, Jian Wushuang applauded.","The odds of success increased by another ten percent.","Revive the Qishen Temple!","In the second epoch since Jian Wushuang ascended the 65th level of the Grave God Mountain...","Within the God’s Tomb emerged a towering figure—a Tribulation Realm body.","Climbing out from the tomb, it stood amidst the chaos of the God’s Tomb.","Qishen!","Jian Wushuang had spent an entire epoch and exhausted countless lifeforces to finally revive the body of Qishen.","Zhen Ling also seamlessly entered Qishen’s body.","Hum!","The figure continuously shrank until it was the size of a palm.","Jian Wushuang stood in the chaos like a grain of sand compared to Qishen’s body, vastly inferior in both strength and size.","“Haha, with this body, I can break the Law Rules of the Qishen Temple and go to the temporal river!” Qishen exclaimed excitedly.","Previously, Zhen Ling couldn’t leave the Qishen Temple at all.","Now, with the revived body, not only did its strength soar to the Half-Step Seven Tribulation realm, but it could also freely enter and exit the Qishen Temple.","The worry about Mie Sheng also diminished significantly.","At the same time, they could confidently let Jian Wushuang and others go to other spacetimes.","It wasn’t that they were overly cautious, but there was one thing they were very clear about.","There was Life power within Jiang Shang’s body.","Perhaps Mie Sheng didn’t need Jian Wushuang at all to reach completion.","Thus, combining Death and Life to achieve the pinnacle of the Great Dao.","“Congratulations, My Lord, on your rebirth!” Jian Wushuang looked exhausted, but there was also joy in his heart.","He couldn’t bear all the burden alone. With the Zhen Ling reaching the Half-Step Seven Tribulation realm, it was indeed a significant trump card for dealing with Mie Sheng in the future.","Mie Sheng currently had no idea that the Zhen Ling had revived Qishen’s body.","When the time came, they could catch him off guard.","Wrapping the flesh of Qishen, the Zhen Ling, once stored within, looked at Jian Wushuang and smiled, saying, “Thanks to your Life power, otherwise, even if all the treasures of the Qishen Temple were exhausted, it would not have been enough to revive this flesh!”","Indeed, that was true.","Even with Jian Wushuang’s abundant Life power, it would take an epoch of time. One can imagine how immense the Life power required to restore Qishen’s flesh must be.","The treasures of Qishen Temple were lifeless.","Yet Jian Wushuang was alive, able to continuously generate Life power.","“It’s just something I should do!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","This bit of help wasn’t much.","During this epoch, he continuously generated Life power, taking the opportunity to refine his control over it, killing two birds with one stone.","“Hmm?” Zhen Ling’s brows furrowed, his expression changing.","A breath came from the Grave God Mountain.","Sensing something amiss, Jian Wushuang also looked in the direction of the Grave God Mountain.","A new aura soared.","It was the power of the Tribulation Realm.","Someone had broken through!","“Let’s go, take a look!” Zhen Ling smiled even more this time, his eyes almost closed into slits.","Who says fortune never comes alone, misfortune never comes singly.","This time, it was truly double happiness.","The two instantly arrived at the peak of the Grave God Mountain. Among the 60th floors and below, a beam of light shot up into the sky, with a figure within.","“Shang!”","Feeling the other’s aura, Jian Wushuang wasn’t too surprised.","Shang was the first to break through, just as they had guessed.","There wasn’t much surprise.","However, with this development, Shang probably wouldn’t be able to enter other spacetimes with them.","This aura instantly alarmed many people.","They came out one after another to watch."]},{"number":5651,"title":"Chapter 5651 300 Years","paragraphs":["Chapter 5651 300 Years","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment on the sixtieth level, besides Shang, there was another person present – Wu Zuo!","Since Jian Wushuang proposed to take Wu Zuo along to other spacetimes, Zhen Ling tested them both and brought Wu Zuo to the Grave God Mountain to cultivate alongside the inheritors.","Unexpectedly, Wu Zuo’s potential pleasantly surprised Zhen Ling by reaching the 60th level.","As for Hu Qing, he had already reached the 65th level.","He became Jian Wushuang’s neighbor.","The speed of their breakthroughs made Jian Wushuang feel a sense of suffocation.","No wonder he was the first-ranked Inheritor.","A beam of light covered the entire Grave God Mountain and slowly disappeared after an incense stick’s time.","Shang also emerged from his cave.","There had been significant changes in his strength.","Amidst congratulations, Shang followed Zhen Ling to the summit.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, returned to his own cave.","This time, reviving Qishen’s physical body left his soul exhausted; it was time for him to rest.","Next, he had to prepare for the journey to other spacetimes, he couldn’t afford to be careless.","As for Shang’s breakthrough, Jian Wushuang didn’t feel pressured by it, unlike the pressure Hu Qing gave him!","Even though Shang had now broken through to the Tribulation Realm, it didn’t feel as formidable to him as the unchanged power of the Gu Sha.","The Gu Sha he had slain was already at the pinnacle of the One Tribulation realm before his transformation. And after transforming, he directly reached the perfect state of the Two Tribulation realm.","He even matched the power of the Three Tribulation realm.","None of this posed a threat to him, let alone Shang.","Now that Shang had broken through, a spot was vacant, but he didn’t have a suitable candidate in mind and didn’t consider recommending anyone.","Let Zhen Ling worry about that!","Comfortably lying on the stone bed in the cave dwelling, Jian Wushuang slept for a whole year before restoring his soul power to its peak.","During this year, Zhen Ling also communicated with him, asking for any treasures he needed, and he was generous enough to provide whatever could be fulfilled.","And the time for departure had been determined.","300 years later, they would assemble in the Hulan Mountains of the Heavenly Realm.","Jian Wushuang was somewhat surprised by this. It wasn’t because Zhen Ling was so generous, but because they were heading to the Heavenly Realm.","He had thought they would go to the God’s Tomb!","But it didn’t matter much; it would only take a day to arrive.","Exhaling heavily, Jian Wushuang casually crushed the sound transmission jade slip, then stood up and stretched his limbs.","At the same time, he began to calculate the treasures he currently lacked.","After the Dao Merge, he hadn’t properly cultivated, nor had he advanced the realms he needed to.","Indeed, he was lacking many treasures.","Even with treasures, advancing in realms required time for cultivation.","With only three hundred years left, Jian Wushuang naturally wouldn’t waste time cultivating the cosmic space.","Instead, he chose the divine body.","The appearance of Gu Sha made him yearn for the path of the divine body experts.","Especially after seeing records in some ancient books stating that in the early stages of the temporal river, there were many divine body practitioners.","What if the temporal river he was going to was also dominated by divine body practitioners?","Using the Origin Source would surely expose him.","So, he couldn’t abandon the path of the divine body.","Although he needed many treasures, for a strong practitioner, as long as their strength was formidable, they wouldn’t lack treasures.","With his mind set, Jian Wushuang took out the identity token from the Grave God Mountain and informed Zhen Ling of all the treasures he needed.","Seeing the treasures Jian Wushuang required, Zhen Ling, who was sitting on the mountaintop, widened his eyes in disbelief.","He wasn’t generous to begin with, and finally being so, he still calculated meticulously. With only 300 years left, how much could these people get even if they asked for it all?","But he didn’t expect Jian Wushuang to be so ruthless, demanding divine body treasures worth 100 million cubic units of universe crystals.","Treasures worth worth 100 cubit units of universe crystals!","For a Tribulation Realm expert, it wasn’t easy to come up with so many universe crystals.","These treasures were enough for Jian Wushuang to cultivate his divine body to 100,000-fold.","He simply didn’t believe Jian Wushuang could cultivate his divine body to a 100,000-fold within 300 years.","At the same time, this time, all ten selected individuals chose divine body treasures.","Even the usually modest and straightforward Hu Qing chose a divine body treasure.","They weren’t foolish; with only 300 years, there was no shortcut to enhancing their strength besides improving their divine bodies.","“Fine, consider it my contribution to you all!” Zhen Ling shook his head, feeling a pang of heartache.","However, he wasn’t about to come out at a loss. Meanwhile, his avatar set off for the Original Realm to seek out Temple Master Zhu Yi, the God of Wealth.","In no time, the awkward situation was resolved.","On Grave God Mountain, within the super transmission array.","Nine figures descended simultaneously, drawing the attention of many around.","So far, the strongest Inheritors of Grave God Mountain appeared together, an unprecedented sight!","If not for Shang’s breakthrough, there would probably have been ten of them.","“Wushuang, it seems great minds think alike!” Dongsheng exclaimed loudly from the side.","Among these nine, except for Gu Qianluo and Guangying, everyone had a good relationship with Jian Wushuang.","Casually chatting, they directly activated the transmission array.","Zhen Ling instructed them to go to a hidden secret realm in the Original Realm, where there was a natural divine body treasure that could enhance their divine bodies.","This gathered them all at once.","At the same time, Zhen Ling also transmitted a message, informing them that another powerful individual, who would accompany them to other timelines, was waiting for them there.","This piqued Jian Wushuang’s curiosity. Who could be accompanying them to other timelines?","He knew a bit about some of the more famous Inheritors in Qishen Temple.","There were probably few who could catch Zhen Ling’s attention.","But they would soon have an answer.","Whoosh!!!","The nine descended into the Original Realm.","A familiar aura greeted them.","This was the same place they had entered when they first entered Qishen Temple.","Grand Yan Immortals would enter the Primitive Realm, while Yan Immortals entered the Black Tortoise Temple.","The Emperors went to the Azure Dragon Temple.","Everything seemed as if it were just yesterday.","Just as the nine individuals arrived, a familiar figure came to greet them.","“Zhu Qi!”","Many recognized him without the need for introductions and followed him to the secluded area.","The Original Realm bore some resemblance to the Great Desolate Wilderness, both relatively desolate.","Within the time it takes for an incense stick to burn, they reached the secluded area as mentioned by Zhen Ling.","It was a forested sanctuary.","From afar, it appeared unremarkable.","But up close, it struck them with awe.","This forest was not as simple as it seemed.","“It’s divine power!” Jian Wushuang was the first to notice the peculiarity.","Remarkably, this sanctuary possessed divine power.","Similar to the Divine Power Universe.","It was an excellent place for enhancing divine bodies.","Zhu Qi halted and spoke, “Within this forested sanctuary lies a spring of divine essence. You only need to absorb its power from ten battles away. Do not get too close, as it may backlash against your divine body!”","With that, he turned and departed.","The group exchanged glances and without hesitation, descended directly.","The peculiar nature of divine power drew them in.","They headed straight towards the heart of the forested sanctuary.","The spring’s eye lay deep within the forest."]},{"number":5652,"title":"Chapter 5652 Fan Feng","paragraphs":["Chapter 5652 Fan Feng","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, there was already someone sitting cross-legged there.","The nine individuals quickly found their positions, forcibly tearing through space and instantly entering a damp mountain cave.","Upon sensing the arrival, the practitioner who had been sitting cross-legged there also opened his eyes.","In those phoenix-like eyes, there was a hint of crimson flames.","“Who are you?” Except for Wu Zuo, the rest were all surprised and asked in unison.","Only Wu Zuo stared tightly at the figure, his eyes carrying a trace of fear.","Because he recognized the person in front of him.","He had thought it might be the inheritor, but no matter how he looked at the other party, they didn’t seem like it.","He had never heard of such a powerful female cultivator on Grave God Mountain!","Buzz!","A force of flame swept over instantly, except for Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing, everyone else took half a step back.","These people were not to be trifled with either. If the other party dared to make a move, could they just let her off?","When they were about to counterattack, Wu Zuo stopped them and also revealed the identity of the other party.","“She is Fan Feng!”","Upon hearing this name, the nine people instantly understood.","When Jian Wushuang heard it, he also frowned.","“Fan Feng, the leader of the Eighteen Divine Generals!”","They had all heard of this title, but they never expected that this time Zhen Ling would arrange such a figure to accompany them.","Wu Zuo didn’t speak, just nodded.","In addition to being the leader of the Eighteen Divine Generals, the other party also had another identity, that is, the elder sister of Emperor Jueyun.","But only Wu Zuo and Jian Wushuang knew about this.","Fan Feng didn’t even look at Wu Zuo, but instead looked at Jian Wushuang, then said coldly, “Are you going to pull out her sword?”","It seemed that the elder sister of Emperor Jueyun didn’t get along well with him.","There was hostility towards Jian Wushuang in her eyes.","Jian Wushuang also found the other party somewhat unpleasant because of this, secretly cursing in his heart. Why did Zhen Ling have to throw such a troublesome person at them?","She had an air of ‘I am invincible for all eternity’, making Jian Wushuang wonder if she thought she was Qishen!","The title wasn’t impressive, but the stature certainly was.","The rest of the group showed little interest in Fan Feng, the leader of the eighteen Divine Generals. They all found a spot to sit cross-legged, preparing to elevate their divine bodies.","Wu Zuo then transmitted, “Brother Wushuang, how about we team up and take care of this woman first?”","“What kind of joke is that? She’s someone arranged by Lord Zhen Ling himself. Besides, I’m not a natural-born killer to just take someone’s life over trivial matters,” Jian Wushuang replied impatiently via transmission.","But indeed, he didn’t fancy this Fan Feng.","After a brief response, he ignored her.","Hopefully, she wouldn’t stir up trouble, or else he’d have to break her legs.","So what if she was the leader of the 18 Divine Generals?","His current strength could rival the Emperor of the past.","The former Emperor Jueyun could contend with the Universe Masters, and so could he.","Fan Feng’s strength was still lacking.","Moreover, she was vengeful and narrow-minded.","According to Wu Zuo, these two were archenemies.","Of course, it could just be that Wu Zuo was beaten badly by her in the past.","The leader of the 18 Divine Generals was at least in the top three under the Emperor back in the Moro Spacetime.","Wu Zuo was nowhere near a match for her.","If he weren’t standing nearby, Wu Zuo probably wouldn’t even dare to breathe in her presence.","So much so that even in their cultivation session now, Wu Zuo stuck close to him.","He didn’t mind this at all.","This time, heading to a different spacetime, he still needed the help of these people.","Naturally, he acted as the leader.","However, not everyone might obey him.","For instance, Zhen Wuyang and Tongtian Buddha, these two old guys.","Despite being from the same universe, their minds weren’t trustworthy.","Only Hu Qing and Wu Zuo could be completely trusted.","Dongsheng and Wanyan were also reliable.","They had a friendship.","They would also fully support him when the time came.","So, that made five people on his side.","The others wouldn’t make much of a difference.","Huff!","Just as Jian Wushuang sat cross-legged, he felt a surge of divine power approaching. His devouring power instantly enveloped the incoming force, drawing it into his body.","This place was indeed extraordinary.","Within the span of ten breaths, a clump of divine power would arrive, ready for him to absorb.","However, he felt the speed was somewhat lacking.","The others also absorbed for a while and could clearly sense that the pace was far from sufficient.","Looking over at Fan Feng’s direction, the spring was only five feet away.","“Brother Wu Zuo, what do you think?” Jian Wushuang asked tentatively.","With Wu Zuo’s divine body being 70,000-fold, he probably found the supply and demand of divine power too slow as well.","“It’s a bit slow!” Wu Zuo replied directly.","Upon this, all nine people rose simultaneously, each advancing another battle.","It seemed Zhu Qi didn’t quite understand their strengths, hence his statement about potential backlash within ten feet.","Initially, they all believed him.","Among the ten, Fan Feng possessed the strongest divine body.","At least 80,000-fold.","Next was Wu Zuo.","As for the others, including Hu Qing, their divine bodies were roughly 60,000-fold, similar to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s six times multiplier was at the bottom among them.","Dongsheng had 63,000-fold.","Thinking back to Gu Sha, who declared 100,000-fold, exuding an unbeatable aura. Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but take two more steps forward, maintaining a distance of five feet.","Hu Qing followed suit.","Those who could maintain this distance were the ones who could convert power exceptionally fast.","Although Wu Zuo’s divine body was powerful, his conversion speed was somewhat slow, stopping at six feet.","There was no need to force it.","On the other hand, Gu Qianluo, feeling somewhat competitive, also reached the distance of five feet.","The continuous onslaught of divine power turned his complexion a shade of purple-blue, but after a brief pause, he managed to endure it.","Jian Wushuang smiled inwardly at this and paid it no mind, instead immersing himself in his own deep cultivation.","In the span of a day, Jian Wushuang had increased his divine body by nearly a hundredfold.","Indeed, the assistance proved immensely beneficial.","In the outside world, not only would the progress be slower, but it would also require more treasures.","Here, the divine power was purer, and the absorption rate, without impurities, was also very rapid.","In the blink of an eye, ten years had passed, and now all nine of them could reach a distance of five feet.","Meanwhile, the obstinate and domineering Divine General, Fan Feng, reached a distance of three feet.","The strength of her divine body left them all astonished.","It had nearly reached 90,000-fold, advancing at a speed far beyond theirs.","Among the nine, the fastest to progress was Tongtian Buddha. In the span of ten years, he had only increased by 5,000 times, reaching a divine body strength of about 70,000-fold.","As for Jian Wushuang, despite his rapid absorption rate, his Boundless Divine Body required an immense amount of divine power, resulting in an increase of only 3,000 times.","But this was just the beginning. Hence, his progress was somewhat slower at the start, but as time went on, his speed would increase, eventually surpassing everyone else.","Such were the advantages of the Boundless Divine Body."]},{"number":5653,"title":"Chapter 5653 Peeping Into the Cave","paragraphs":["Chapter 5653 Peeping Into the Cave","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Huff!","But Jian Wushuang didn’t have much time now; he had to move faster.","So he could only move forward, getting closer to the spring.","Jian Wushuang, opening his eyes, stared at the spring for a while.","He found that there was no spring water in the spring, although it was covered by a thin mist. Still, he could see that it was a hollow abyss.","Staring at it for too long would make him dizzy.","Jian Wushuang dared not look too much, so he could only send a message to Wu Zuo to ask if the other party knew anything about it.","Unexpectedly, even Wu Zuo didn’t know.","This made Jian Wushuang a little curious.","But for now, he couldn’t get closer, so he could only continue devouring.","Splash!","As he approached within three feet, Jian Wushuang fully absorbed the divine power, and his divine body began to multiply.","When he was a Dao Lord, he could reach 50,000-fold.","After becoming an Emperor, with the help of the Beast God Weapon, he could burst out to 100,000-fold, and that wasn’t the limit.","At the limit, he could burst out with a divine body of 120,000-fold.","In other words, both his physical body and divine body could withstand it. In this way, the limit of his basic divine body could also be raised to that level.","It’s just that the treasures needed to reach that level are too many.","Even Zhen Ling would feel distressed.","The treasures needed by a powerhouse of the Tribulation Realm in the divine body lineage could support several Origin Source Tribulation Realm powerhouses.","Moreover, he was about to leave the Qishen Temple soon, so he could only search for treasures to enhance his divine body in other spacetimes in the future. However, at that time, it wouldn’t be as easy as in the Qishen Temple.","So he had to desperately improve. Whatever he could improve, he would improve, anyway, it was free.","“The power of the Beast God!” Jian Wushuang shouted angrily in his heart, and a dark red aura burst out of him.","Instantly, everyone present was shaken by it.","The others were fine because they knew he had the Beast God Weapon.","Fan Feng, however, looked at Jian Wushuang with surprise. She didn’t expect Jian Wushuang to have the Candle Dragon.","But the next moment, her aura changed abruptly too.","A familiar aura came rushing over.","It was the Phoenix, one of the nine Beast God Weapons!","It was also a Beast God forged by nature.","But Jian Wushuang wasn’t surprised; the other party had a Beast God Weapon.","In ancient times, Jian Wushuang was well aware of the news regarding the Beast God’s weapons.","Initially, to gather all the Candle Dragon parts, he had to extensively peruse ancient texts.","However, the Beast God Weapon of the Phoenix wasn’t merely an amplifying divine weapon of the Beast God but rather a fusion of the weapon with the physical body.","The opponent’s divine body’s immense strength during the Emperor’s time probably had some connection to that Beast God weapon.","Otherwise, for the Emperor to reach a 90,000-fold divine body wouldn’t be so simple.","After Jian Wushuang unleashed the power of the Beast God, the speed of his absorption accelerated even further.","300 years had passed, one-third of the time gone by, and Jian Wushuang’s divine body finally reached 70,000-fold.","Simultaneously, he had approached within just one battle’s distance, becoming the closest among everyone present.","Though he progressed relatively swiftly, the enhancement of his divine body wasn’t the fastest.","It was Gu Qianluo, whose divine body was a set of dry bones, starting from 65,000-fold and, within 100 years, directly surged to 80,000-fold, which astonished everyone.","Jian Wushuang and Fan Feng had the Beast God Weapon, which could enhance rapidly, so that could be excused, but for someone who lacked in every aspect to become the first was truly surprising.","Regarding this, Jian Wushuang wanted to shatter the opponent’s divine body to thoroughly understand it.","Of course, it was just a fleeting thought.","“At last, I see it clearly!” The reason why Jian Wushuang’s advancement was slow also had another cause. He was curious about what treasures this cave held that could erupt with such a tremendous amount of divine power.","So, mainly to adapt to absorbing divine power and to continue forward, he didn’t concentrate solely on absorbing divine power.","Now, as he approached the cave, he glanced downward.","With just one glance, Jian Wushuang felt a violent force that instantly assaulted his eyes.","The pain made him lose his rationality in an instant, causing him to retreat 100 feet backwards.","This scene frightened everyone.","Wu Zuo and Hui Qing hastily ceased their cultivation and rushed over.","“Wushuang, what’s going on?” Hu Qing stepped forward, astonished. “Is there some kind of creature in there?”","Jian Wushuang felt a deep ache in his head, his eyes stinging so much he couldn’t even open them. He shook his head, unable to speak a word.","Wu Zuo placed a hand on Jian Wushuang’s shoulder, saying, “It should be backlash. Rest for a moment, you’ll be fine!”","“Haha!!!” Fan Feng sneered, disdain evident in her voice. “What fools! Just like my silly little sister, not knowing there are forbidden things inside that shouldn’t be seen?”","Upon hearing the mockery, Wu Zuo’s expression turned cold, but he dared not retort.","Hu Qing, however, was fearless. Standing up straight, she glared at Fan Feng and said angrily, “If you didn’t want to warn us, fine, but there’s no need for such sarcasm!”","“Humph, a bunch of idiots. I really don’t understand why bother raising you natives, what’s the use!” Fan Feng taunted a few more times before closing her eyes.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand, not feeling particularly foolish about the situation.","When there’s something to be understood, it’s necessary to investigate.","That’s the path of the strong!","If one is always timid and fearful, how can they become strong?","So there’s no need to pay attention to the other party.","Seeing that Jian Wushuang was fine, Hu Qing and Wu Zuo returned to their positions to continue their cultivation.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang stayed a hundred feet away, beginning to heal the injuries caused by the backlash.","He possessed the power of Life, so even with a powerful backlash, he recovered in just the time it takes for an incense stick to burn.","During his recovery, he suddenly noticed a change in his eyes.","They could penetrate with a divine power.","His eyes actually contained a power surpassing that of 100,000-fold divine bodies.","“This can’t be possible,” Jian Wushuang couldn’t believe it himself.","He only glanced at the cave, then was struck by a backlash.","But after the recovery, it brought him a divine body exceeding 100,000-fold.","Although only his divine eyes reached 100,000-fold, the benefits were continuously distributed.","In just one day, he increased his divine body by 1,000 times.","“I understand!” Joy spread across Jian Wushuang’s face as he took a step forward, approaching the cave directly.","This scene puzzled Fan Feng somewhat, not because Jian Wushuang approached the cave again, but because she noticed the disappearance of Jian Wushuang’s backlash.","To dissipate the backlash in just one day was too quick, even with a restorative treasure, which would normally take at least 100 years.","Initially, she thought Jian Wushuang would waste this opportunity in vain, but she didn’t expect him to recover and return to the edge of the spring again.","Wu Zuo and the others exchanged smiles, unsurprised by this.","But when they saw Jian Wushuang once again peering into the cave with his head tilted, their jaws dropped.","The result was foreseeable: Jian Wushuang was once again shaken back, but this time, he saw a blurry mass, unlike last time when he saw nothing."]},{"number":5654,"title":"Chapter 5654 Golden Skeleton","paragraphs":["Chapter 5654 Golden Skeleton","His strength had increased, and with each repetition, he could discern more clearly what exactly was concealed within the cave.","....","Though seemingly trivial, it aided him in swiftly advancing his divine body.","With a splash!","This time, Jian Wushuang only took a few breaths to repair the backlash of his divine body, returning to its peak once again.","“The power of the Beast God!” Jian Wushuang growled lowly, and his divine body instantly soared to 100,000-fold.","Buzz!","The bursting divine power swept over the nearby people in an instant.","This power, except for Fan Feng, was familiar to everyone.","When Jian Wushuang battled Gu Sha, he had unleashed this power.","Fan Feng wasn’t surprised by this; it was normal for the Emperor to wield the power of the Beast God within the Beast God Weapon.","However, Fan Feng was somewhat astonished that Jian Wushuang’s mere doubling of the power of the Beast God could amplify his divine body by 20,000-fold. This level of manipulation had already exceeded the Tribulation Realm.","She didn’t know that when Jian Wushuang originally fused with the Beast God Weapon, there was an Origin Source belonging to him within it.","Now the Beast God Weapon was like an extension of Jian Wushuang himself.","Naturally, it was much more powerful than when others used it.","Now the Beast God Weapon was like an extension of Jian Wushuang himself.","Naturally, it was much more powerful than when others used it.","After Jian Wushuang erupted with his aura, he once again stepped towards the cave.","This time, many people realized that every time Jian Wushuang was afflicted by backlash, he would rapidly improve his divine body, far more than if they were to sit and absorb for years.","And the recovery was fast.","Wu Zuo and Hu Qing knew that Jian Wushuang possessed the power of Life, but the others didn’t.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s actions, Gu Qianluo felt itchy to try. Without waiting for Jian Wushuang to go first, he stepped to the edge of the cave.","But before he could peek into the cave’s interior, he was overturned by a tremendous force, thrown back thousands of feet, unable to get up for a long time.","Fan Feng sneered, but no one approached Gu Qianluo to check on him.","Several others who had been eager to try also halted their intentions.","They believed that Jian Wushuang must have some ability to quickly overcome the backlash.","“What a lucky little guy!” Tongtian Buddha, with his kind eyes and benevolent smile, glanced at Jian Wushuang and then continued to absorb divine power.","Among the ten of them, all were engaged in dual cultivation.","Their cultivation in the Origin Source realm was already high enough; there was no need to pursue too much in terms of divine bodies. Of course, opportunities like this free chance naturally had to be seized.","Everything depended on their own luck.","However, Jian Wushuang was particularly devoted to his divine body.","He had perfected his physical body in the past and even integrated the Origin Source with his divine body, all for the sake of one day making his divine body first-class and reaching its peak.","The might of the Origin Source was its own affair.","The divine body, too, had its own direction.","When Jian Wushuang was a Dao Lord, he had overcome numerous difficulties relying on his divine body.","He wouldn’t forget the importance of the divine body.","Jian Wushuang, standing at the edge of the cave, once again lowered his gaze to the depths.","This time, what he saw was clearer—a blurry figure below, a skeleton.","A golden skeleton.","The terrifying power emanating from above filled Jian Wushuang’s body, the backlash was terrifying.","Jian Wushuang clenched his teeth, staring intently, while his divine body continued to erupt, directly unleashing three times the power of the Beast God.","This amplified his divine body to about 140,000-fold.","The divine body surpassing its limits made Jian Wushuang’s flesh tremble.","If it weren’t for that impact, he could have perfectly demonstrated his strength by unleashing three times the power of the Beast God.","But now, after being severely affected, he could only barely hold on.","Countless divine power surged into his body. In the Starry Sky Origin Source, half of the universe was lit up, with over 5,000 black holes, simultaneously devouring that raging divine power.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s body was utilized to the extreme, and his operation had reached its peak.","The absorbed divine power was enough for Jian Wushuang to break through to a divine body of 100,000-fold.","Yet he didn’t retreat.","Instead, he wanted to enter the cave.","Jian Wushuang scrutinized the skeleton carefully, and the aura above it was very familiar to him.","The skeleton lacked one arm, a golden frame standing there, towering like the heavens.","A faint shadow made Jian Wushuang somewhat bewildered!","“Dong Jun!”","The owner of this skeleton was Dong Jun.","The human he had encountered in the Starry Sky back then.","In the Moro Spacetime, Divine Master Huang obtained Dong Jun’s inheritance and also gained Dong Jun’s arm.","Jian Wushuang was very familiar with Dong Jun’s aura.","“How could his skeleton be here!” Jian Wushuang was puzzled.","When he had seen Divine Master Huang before, he had only obtained a piece of Dong Jun’s arm and that stone axe.","This skeleton appearing here was probably not related to Divine Master Huang, but rather to the Qishen Temple.","Now, Jian Wushuang had no intention of devouring those divine powers. Instead, he wanted to ask the Zhen Ling about the origin of this skeleton.","Dong Jun was slain by Mie Sheng.","This skeleton being here probably had some connection to Mie Sheng!","As he contemplated this, a terrifying force surged out from the cave in an instant, propelling Jian Wushuang far away with its momentum.","The others were also pushed back hundreds of feet, and the surging divine power quickly receded, disappearing without a trace.","When they looked again, all they saw was a lone armless skeleton suspended in the air of the cave.","“Mie Sheng!” Jian Wushuang exclaimed in fear!","The power of Death absorbed all the divine power emitted by the golden skeleton.","And the shadow on the skeleton was the appearance of Mie Sheng!","“Hehe... I knew you were going to run, I’ve been waiting here for a long, long time!” Mie Sheng clenched his fist with one hand, and the power of Death swept across everyone in an instant, transforming into an unbeatable divine power afterward.","This was just one of Mie Sheng’s avatars.","Although its strength wasn’t overwhelming, the ability to manipulate the golden skeleton set it apart.","These people couldn’t even face the skeleton directly, let alone deal with Mie Sheng who controlled it.","Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate. Upon realizing it was Mie Sheng, he immediately transmitted his voice to Zhen Ling.","“Too late!” Mie Sheng, manipulating the golden skeleton, shook his head.","A divine power barrier immediately rose around them.","The power of the barrier was something Jian Wushuang and his companions couldn’t hope to break.","Even if Zhen Ling were to arrive, it would take a considerable amount of effort.","At this moment, there were muffled sounds coming from outside.","Jian Wushuang knew it was Zhen Ling arriving.","However, currently, the two of them couldn’t communicate due to the barrier being broken.","It was uncertain how long it would take for Zhen Ling to break the barrier.","At present, Mie Sheng manipulated the golden skeleton, using that divine power; even if they joined forces, they would not be able to beat him.","The others just stabilized their figures when they heard Jian Wushuang’s words, and they were all stunned!","“Mie Sheng, Temple of World Annihilation!” Zhen Wuyang was the first to guess what was happening.","The others also suddenly realized.","Fan Feng had just recovered, but she didn’t understand much about Mie Sheng. At this moment, she angrily shouted, “A mere trick, daring to cause trouble in the Qishen Temple, aren’t you afraid of death?”","“Tsk tsk, let me see who this is?” Mie Sheng slowly turned his head, looking at Fan Feng, and in an instant, a purple light burst out from his eyes."]},{"number":5655,"title":"Chapter 5655 Mie Sheng, Dong Jun","paragraphs":["Chapter 5655 Mie Sheng, Dong Jun","That surge of power was immense.","....","It pierced directly through Fan Feng’s head.","Everyone was startled.","Gu Qianluo, who had been injured earlier, couldn’t help but retreat to the edge of the barrier.","The gap in strength was too vast.","Mie Sheng manipulated the divine power of the golden skeleton, capable of unleashing at least 200,000-fold the divine strength, much stronger than even Gu Sha.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang was heavily injured, and the backlash force seemed to be branded within him, lingering in his body without dispersing despite the continuous cleansing by the rich Life power.","“Everyone, Lord Zhen Ling needs the time it takes for an incense stick to burn. As long as we withstand the opponent, we can survive!” Jian Wushuang’s expression was solemn as he removed the backlash force while comforting everyone.","Zhen Wuyang clenched his fists and said in a low voice, “The time it takes for an incense stick to burn?”","He was ready to take action.","They were all top Inheritors with prestige; they couldn’t just resign themselves to fate.","They would definitely fight.","Fan Feng, who had just restored her head, swiftly approached Zhen Wuyang and said coldly, “Don’t rush to act. His strength is not as simple as you imagine. Without cooperation, we’ll all die!”","Fan Feng, after realizing something was amiss, no longer acted arrogantly but chose to join forces with everyone else.","However, among the ten people, Jian Wushuang and Gu Qianluo were injured and couldn’t be of much help.","Dongsheng’s and Wanyan’s strengths were too weak.","Among the remaining few, only Hu Qing, Wu Zuo, and Fan Feng had relatively decent strengths.","It’s not that Jian Wushuang looked down on Zhen Wuyang and Tongtian Buddha; their strengths were still far behind.","At most, they could only rival an average Tribulation Realm cultivator. Their current strength was insufficient to battle against strong Tribulation Realm experts.","“Hmph, if you’re afraid, you need not bother to intervene!” Zhen Wuyang’s words were arrogant.","This made Jian Wushuang somewhat anxious.","He knew better than anyone the terror of Mie Sheng.","“Don’t be careless. What she said is right. Without joining forces, we’ll all die. As long as we hold on for the time it takes to burn an incense stick, Lord Zhen Ling will break the barrier. We just need to hold out!” Jian Wushuang hastily transmitted his thoughts.","The time of burning an incense stick was just his guess. Without giving these people some confidence, they wouldn’t be able to endure.","It seemed unnecessary now.","It wasn’t that Jian Wushuang and the others lacked confidence; their confidence was just too excessive.","Swish!","Jian Wushuang drew out a mass of Life power and threw it directly to Gu Qianluo, shouting, “Take it!”","A mass of green energy flew towards Gu Qianluo, igniting even greater greed in Mie Sheng’s eyes. In the next moment, she struck directly towards Gu Qianluo.","The speed exceeded everyone’s imagination.","Gu Qianluo was momentarily stunned, only to see the terrifying face of Mie Sheng and feel the overwhelming aura.","Just as he thought it was over, Mie Sheng’s body froze on the spot.","Behind Mie Sheng, a figure appeared.","The only strong one among all present who caught sight of Mie Sheng’s figure.","Crack!","It was Hu Qing!","Hu Qing grasped Mie Sheng’s ankle with one hand, shouting loudly as she flung Mie Sheng out of the battle.","And the golden flames erupting from Hu Qing surpassed even Mie Sheng.","“It’s you who took away my disciple!” Hu Qing soared into the air, looking down on Mie Sheng with unparalleled dominance.","Everyone couldn’t help but gasp in shock.","They hadn’t expected Hu Qing to be so powerful now.","Even Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but exclaim!","Mie Sheng’s divine power just now was at least 200,000-fold.","Hu Qing was able to suppress the golden skeleton.","At present, Mie Sheng possessed only a small fraction of the power of Death. However, by possessing the skeletal remains of Dong Jun, he could harness the divine power within the bones.","However, Mie Sheng’s avatar had limited strength to manipulate; it could only exert about 200,000-fold of power.","This made Jian Wushuang worried.","If not for Mie Sheng’s sneak attack, he could have managed in his peak state. But now, injured as he was, he stood no chance.","Unexpectedly, it was Hu Qing who stepped forward at this critical moment.","Struggling, Mie Sheng rose from the ground, his gaze shifting to Hu Qing in the air, his eyes filled with astonishment and then instantly turned fierce as he made his move.","Boom!","This time, the divine power unleashed by Mie Sheng exceeded 250,000-fold.","Evidently, he was becoming increasingly familiar with this body.","With a swift movement, he was already before Hu Qing. With only one arm, Mie Sheng chopped towards Hu Qing, while his eyes erupted with immense purple thunder, aiming straight at his chest.","Jian Wushuang had somewhat recovered his strength and hastily warned, “Be careful!”","At this moment, Wu Zuo and the others also unleashed their powers, soaring into the sky to assist.","Dongsheng and Wanyan, however, were persuaded by Jian Wushuang to stay back.","He could see through their strength; they were merely ordinary supreme-peak cultivators. Going up there would mean certain death. It was better to protect them here.","Under the surprise of the situation, Gu Gengluo absorbed the Life power Jian Wushuang sent him. The backlash on his body instantly disappeared, simultaneously converting that backlash into divine power. His divine body erupted to 90,000-fold.","Seeing Mie Sheng in the air, his eyes filled with murderous intent.","Whoosh!","In a flash, he was in mid-air, casually tearing off the shattered clothes on his body, revealing the grim white bones underneath.","“Ah! Ah! Ah!” Gu Qianluo clenched his fists, roaring in anger. His aura underwent a dramatic change, and his gaze became even sharper.","Jian Wushuang below observed, a hint of surprise flickering in his eyes.","It seemed that everyone had their own bottom line.","Gu Qianluo must have unleashed some kind of peak secret technique, and it appeared to be the pinnacle secret technique of the divine body path, instantly multiplying his divine body’s strength 100,000-fold.","Furthermore, his Origin Source also erupted simultaneously, directly granting him the power of the Tribulation Realm.","He joined the battle group as well.","Not only Jian Wushuang was astonished, even Mie Sheng was deeply shocked!","How could there suddenly be so many forces of the Tribulation Realm within the Qishen Temple?","Fan Feng was one thing; as the leader of the 18 Divine Generals, her background was known since ancient times.","But now, even among the Inheritors whom he had never regarded highly, there existed such astonishing peak power, capable of erupting with the strength of the Tribulation Realm.","Especially Hu Qing, who displayed a power beyond his imagination.","More terrifying than the captured Jiang Shang.","Initially, he had only thought Jiang Shang was extraordinary because of Hu Qing. Now it seemed he was mistaken.","It was precisely because of Hu Qing’s extraordinary nature that Jiang Shang possessed such a terrifying power of the Tribulation Realm.","Boom!","Mie Sheng erupted once again, directly dispersing the crowd.","With his divine power increased to 250,000-fold, he now possessed the strength of Three Tribulation realm.","Even if Hu Qing and the others each had the strength of One or even Two Tribulation realm, they were no match for Mie Sheng.","“Die, all of you!” Mie Sheng burst into a golden light.","His 250,000-fold divine power erupted entirely.","His speed and strength doubled.","With a flash, he appeared before Wu Zuo, knee thrusting upward, while a purple thunderbolt gathered in his palm, instantly severely injuring Wu Zuo, causing him to fall from the sky."]},{"number":5656,"title":"Chapter 5656: The Terror of Divine Power","paragraphs":["Chapter 5656: The Terror of Divine Power","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang’s Life power promptly caught Wu Zuo.","Otherwise, Wu Zuo would surely have perished this time.","Wu Zuo, having recovered from his injuries, instantly retreated, fearing that Mie Sheng would target him again.","Now that Mie Sheng’s strength is such that once it targets someone, that person is likely to perish.","This time, Jian Wushuang acted just in time, but it’s uncertain for the next time.","Seeing Wu Zuo flying back lively once more, Mie Sheng’s eyes glinted not only with greed but also with a hint of murderous intent.","This time, it seemed he was going to make a serious move.","That trace of murderous intent kept growing.","Tonngtian Buddha felt it keenly. His aura of Buddhist light burst forth once again, and a vast and mighty power of the universe instantly descended, enveloping everyone together.","“Tongtian, leave it to me!” Zhen Wuyang nodded at Tongtian Buddha.","The two seemed to have some kind of coordination.","Mie Sheng, who was being pushed out, was just about to attack the universe cover when he found that the pale blue universe cover suddenly shrank, only wrapping around Zhen Wuyang alone.","“Tsk, a divine body path powerhouse, I’d like to see how strong your divine power is!” Zhen Wuyang roared, making the heavens and earth lose their color.","A huge manifestation of Zhen Wuyang descended, bearing his own likeness.","At this moment, Zhen Wuyang was right before them.","Zhen Wuyang, in the form of a giant thousands of feet tall, single-handedly withstood Mie Sheng’s punch.","This surprised even Mie Sheng.","What surprised him wasn’t so much the strength of Zhen Wuyang, but rather that the universe cover could actually block his attack.","That was a punch with 250,000-fold divine power.","Yet it was blocked.","Fan Feng stood on the side, her eyelids trembling incessantly.","Once among the top three Ultimate Emperors in the Moro Spacetime, how could it be that now, after her revival, so many people have surpassed her in the blink of an eye?","Now Jian Wushuang’s strength had already surpassed hers.","There was also Hu Qing, and the universe cover displayed by Tiantian Buddha.","Originally, she thought that reviving her was to save the situation.","Unexpectedly, there were so many people stronger than her.","The long-lost sense of oppression in her heart once again made her feel exhausted.","She couldn’t forget the period when she was suppressed by Emperor Jueyun in ancient times.","It’s just that Emperor Jueyun at that time was too powerful.","He had already rivaled the Universe Masters, those were the powerful beings who controlled the universe in the Tribulation Realm.","He was much stronger than Mie Sheng, who had now possessed Dong Jun’s bones.","This made Fan Feng feel very uncomfortable.","She had thought that with the fall of the previous strong ones, she should have become the strongest person, but who could have expected that now she couldn’t even enter the top three.","Buzz!","Although the universe cover was strong, it couldn’t stop Mie Sheng’s continuous attacks.","200,000fold the divine power was not that simple.","The next moment, cracks began to appear in the universe cover.","Jian Wushuang’s aura also began to decline.","Just two breaths, and Jian Wushuang couldn’t withstand Mie Sheng’s attack anymore.","Each fist strike made, even though Zhen Wuyang’s Dao Image had reached the level of the universe, it still couldn’t withstand it.","Mie Sheng raised his hand, extending a skeletal palm, gathering divine power, a mass of scorching purple electric light appearing in the palm of his hand.","From the size of a fist to the size of ten thousand feet in an instant.","The power contained above made everyone inhale sharply, fear evident on their faces.","“Everyone, must die!” Mie Sheng shouted loudly, directly smashing the purple electric light down on everyone.","Although he didn’t know whether Jian Wushuang’s claim of ‘one stick of incense’ was true or false, he was clear that this was the Qishen Temple, the base of Zhen Ling.","Late actions lead to changes!","It was imperative to deal with these people promptly.","He could sense that Jian Wushuang’s strength was steadily increasing.","If these people weren’t dealt with soon, it would be even more troublesome when Jian Wushuang fully recovered.","Now, after successfully merging with the Dao, Jian Wushuang’s strength was terrifyingly immense.","No one knew if the power he displayed on the Grave God Mountain was his full strength.","Mie Sheng couldn’t afford to delay any longer.","Purple lightning burst forth, directly striking towards the crowd.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed. He knew that if he didn’t intervene this time, these people would surely perish.","The others, he could overlook.","But among these people were Hu Qing, Wu Zuo, and their companions.","These people must not perish.","They would need these people to venture into the alternate spacetime and confront Mie Sheng.","He couldn’t just stand by and watch.","Whew!","Although Jian Wushuang’s strength had declined significantly and he couldn’t intervene personally, he still had the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard.","He revived hundreds of chess pieces bearing various insignias.","All of them possessed peak-perfect combat capabilities.","Now, they came in handy.","Some of them even matched the strength of the Tribulation Realm.","“Go!” Jian Wushuang pointed, and the illusion of the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard descended. Over 100 figures above began to tremble, then opened their eyes.","“Block him!” Jian Wushuang commanded.","These revived chess pieces hesitated not and rushed towards the purple lightning.","It was as if moths were flying into the flame, resolute even in the face of death!","With these chess pieces obstructing, it gave Zhen Wuyang and the others a chance to catch their breath, and they began to retreat one after another.","But the power within the lightning was not so easily deterred.","All the pieces were utterly destroyed, leaving behind residual power that left everyone shaken to the core.","Even Hu Qing was heavily injured.","At that moment, Hu Qing possessed the strength of a Two Tribulation realm, second only to Jian Wushuang in prowess. Yet, despite everyone exerting their full strength, they were still no match and had already sustained severe injuries.","Although Mie Sheng was surprised by Jian Wushuang’s methods, he didn’t dwell on it.","However, Jian Wushuang noticed this detail. He had thought Mie Sheng might be aware of the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard, but apparently not.","Initially, although the First True King claimed that no one knew about his Temporal Treasure, Mie Sheng was an ancient monster that crawled out from the Higher Heavens.","Teacher Xuan Yi existed in the future, while Mie Sheng belonged to the past.","Since Mie Sheng was unaware of the Chessboard’s existence, his methods probably weren’t as sophisticated as Xuan Yi’s, and naturally, his strength was inferior.","This realization eased Jian Wushuang’s worries. He feared Mie Sheng’s unfathomable realm, which would complicate matters.","Although Mie Sheng appeared to be at the Half-Step Seven Tribulation realm, Jian Wushuang couldn’t be certain that Mie Sheng had no hidden cards.","It was worth noting that Mie Sheng had slain Dong Jun.","To Jian Wushuang, the aura of Dong Jun was probably no weaker than that of Qishen.","At least, he was at the Seventh Tribulation Realm or even stronger.","Of course, when Mie Sheng killed Dong Jun, he was still in the Higher Heavens, much stronger than he was now.","Jian Wushuang was not hesitating at this moment; instead, he stood up.","This time, either he would die and these people would live, or they would all die together.","Why not become a hero for once?","Jian Wushuang took a step forward.","Dongsheng and Wanyan wanted to intercept, but although their strengths were intact, they still needed Jian Wushuang’s help to withstand the residual effects of the purple lightning just now. Now, going up was futile.","“Jian Wushuang!”","“Mie Sheng!”","The two faced each other, and in the next moment, Mie Sheng attacked directly.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes twitched; he hadn’t even said a few words, so why was Mie Sheng attacking already?","Being a hero felt a bit frustrating at times!","Boom!","Struggling to withstand the Divine Annihilation Palm, Jian Wushuang retreated a hundred feet, with a powerful divine force still gathering on his chest, lingering for a long time."]},{"number":5657,"title":"Chapter 5657: The Power of the Starry Sky","paragraphs":["Chapter 5657: The Power of the Starry Sky","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If it weren’t for the Beast God Weapon absorbing and resisting, he would probably have been seriously injured by now.","“Mie Sheng, I’m curious, you’ve tried to plot against me several times, if you really want to kill me, why bother? You can’t take away my Origin Source,” Jian Wushuang said, genuinely curious.","Mie Sheng stared at him unwaveringly, a fact Jian Wushuang understood well.","After all, Mie Sheng could devour his Life power. He was Mie Sheng’s greatest opportunity.","But if he were to fall here in the Qishen Temple, even if his Origin Source was devoured by Mie Sheng’s avatar, how could he retreat unscathed?","Upon hearing this, Mie Sheng offered no explanation but continued to attack relentlessly, giving Jian Wushuang no chance to stall.","“As long as I can kill you, I can retreat unscathed. You don’t need to worry about that. In fact, you should feel proud that you can merge with me. When the time comes, with us together, we will become the masters of this Starry Sky. Isn’t that exhilarating?” Mie Sheng laughed maniacally.","Upon hearing these words, everyone couldn’t help but look at Jian Wushuang.","Obviously, they were unaware of these matters.","However, Jian Wushuang frowned and said coldly, “Why don’t you let me devour you instead? I can offer you the entire Starry Sky. Are you willing?”","Devouring the Origin Source was just that, there was nothing so appealing about merging.","“Listen to my advice, your strength is too weak. The waters of the Starry Sky run deep, even if you devour my power of Death, you won’t be able to control it!”","“Whether I can control it or not is not for you to decide!” Jian Wushuang lowered his head, and a burst of violent Life power erupted from him instantly.","All the backlash divine power on his body was completely removed.","His strength instantly returned to its peak.","Jian Wushuang took a breath and looked at Mie Sheng again, a hint of a smile creeping onto his lips.","“It seems you’re not willing to say anything useful!” Jian Wushuang stared at Mie Sheng, but his aura had erupted to the extreme.","Even under normal circumstances, his peak was now at the pinnacle of the Tribulation Realm.","His Life power, especially after becoming Emperor and assisting Zhen Ling in reviving the Qishen’s flesh body, had become incredibly powerful, far from the weakness Mie Sheng imagined.","He merely wanted to test the depths of Mie Sheng’s abilities.","Since the other party remained stubborn, he decided to leave behind a hint of fear before departing.","He wanted Mie Sheng to know that when he returned next time, it would be beyond Mie Sheng’s comprehension.","Upon his next return, he would surely slay Mie Sheng, devour the power of Death, and ascend to the pinnacle.","“Eternal Ancient...”","Whoosh!","A sudden gust of cold wind swept through the suppressed space, leaving Mie Sheng feeling somewhat uncomfortable.","Back when he was with Dao Lord, Mie Sheng couldn’t recognize the power of the Starry Sky when he peered into it.","But now, as Jian Wushuang truly unleashed this terrifying power of the Starry Sky, Mie Sheng’s face was filled with astonishment.","“Transformation!” Jian Wushuang roared to the sky, and his figure underwent a tremendous change.","Even his aura changed its hue.","In an instant, he ascended to the peak state, and then pushed that peak state to its extreme.","No one knew just how powerful Jian Wushuang had become.","If Gu Sha of the Frost Demon Clan appeared before him now, Jian Wushuang was confident he could annihilate his soul with a single punch.","Within the faint blue flames enveloping his body, there were also wisps of blue arcs.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned light blue as he glanced slightly at Mie Sheng, and said, “How about it? Not bad, huh!”","At this moment, he possessed the power of Three Tribulation realm, even rivaling the Universe Master who held sway over the cosmos.","Clang!","As Jian Wushuang drew the Jueyun Sword, an overwhelming intent to kill erupted.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang stood at the pinnacle of slaughter.","Seeing Jian Wushuang draw the Jueyun Sword, the heavily injured Fan Feng seemed to glimpse the shadow of an ancient emperor in the distant past.","Zhen Wuyang and Tongtian Buddha couldn’t conceal their incredulous expressions.","Back at the Grave God Mountain, they had only witnessed Jian Wushuang’s battle with Gu Sha from afar and hadn’t felt the aura of slaughter emanating from him.","Now, up close, they couldn’t help but tremble inwardly.","Hu Qing stood there, excitedly watching Jian Wushuang, as if everything was reminiscent of the scenes during the Great Desolate Wilderness migration.","Jian Wushuang was once again saving the world.","“This is, this is... the power of the Starry Sky!!” Mie Sheng could hardly believe his eyes.","Jian Wushuang remained expressionless, just nodding coldly.","The power of the Starry Sky within him had already condensed into reality, though compared to the power of Life, it was merely an adjunct, not his true Origin Source power.","After all, he had yet to illuminate his own Starry Sky. Over the years, he simply hadn’t had the time to cultivate.","However, in the future, he was confident he could illuminate his own Starry Sky and wouldn’t need to rely on this stolen power of the Starry Sky anymore.","“Hmph!” Mie Sheng gritted his teeth, emitting a deep, muffled growl from his throat.","The power of the Starry Sky.","He had seen it before but never used it.","It was a power on par with reincarnation and spacetime.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t become that kind of existence, yet he wielded such power, which indeed surprised and envied him.","Why did this power not belong to him?","“Even if you wield the power of the Starry Sky, you are still an Emperor, a mere ant to be crushed by me!” Mie Sheng erupted in rage, launching a direct attack.","But now, Jian Wushuang had drawn the Jueyun Sword.","Even if Mie Sheng unleashed 250,000-fold divine power, he was no match for Jian Wushuang.","“Starry Sky Chronicles!” Jian Wushuang didn’t tolerate the other’s arrogance and immediately unleashed his strongest attack.","At that moment, the barrier began to collapse.","It wasn’t shattered by Zhen Ling but by the might unleashed by the Starry Sky Chronicles, crushing the barrier like paper with a single poke.","As for the Mie Sheng who had possessed the golden skeletal frame, its Origin Source was directly shattered by Jian Wushuang’s attack, losing its golden skeletal frame and becoming an ordinary supreme-peak existence, incapable of withstanding this sword strike.","“Disappear!” Jian Wushuang’s sword cleaved down.","The Origin Source of Mie Sheng instantly turned into dust.","As for the golden skeletal frame, it now lacked even a trace of its golden radiance.","This was the first time Jian Wushuang unleashed the Starry Sky Chronicles since becoming the Emperor.","Even he hadn’t expected it to be this powerful.","Directly annihilating the Origin Source of Mie Sheng’s Origin Source avatar, his sword even severed a bit of the golden divine power from the golden skeleton.","“Whew...” Jian Wushuang gasped as he held the sword with one hand.","If it were an ordinary move, he could use the Starry Sky Sword Technique and continue fighting for a while, but the strongest sword within the Starry Sky Chronicles, even after becoming the Emperor, still put a significant strain on him when unleashed.","It drained the Starry Sky power within him in an instant.","Even the Eternal Ancient Transformation couldn’t be sustained for too long and reverted back to its usual state.","Zhen Ling slowly flew over at this moment.","Feeling the disappearance of Mie Sheng’s aura, he breathed a sigh of relief, but the killing intent in his eyes remained unyielding.","There’s no place for peaceful slumber in the bed.","This wasn’t the first time.","Zhen Ling kept calculating in his mind; once Jian Wushuang was sent away, he would also launch a full-scale war against the Temple of World Annihilation."]},{"number":5658,"title":"Chapter 5658 The Gravestone of Qishen","paragraphs":["Chapter 5658 The Gravestone of Qishen","“Since you don’t want to cross, then don’t even think about it.”","....","Jian Wushuang and the others were his backup plan. Whether they succeeded or not, they could give him something to think about.","As for the others, he couldn’t manage that much; he could only fight!","They couldn’t afford to drag this out any longer.","Otherwise, if they gave Mie Sheng too much time, trouble would inevitably arise.","With a swoosh, Zhen Ling waved his hand, directly healing all the injuries on everyone’s bodies.","This was tapping into the Origin Source of the Qishen Temple.","Even Jian Wushuang’s aura recovered, but he couldn’t restore the power of the Starry Sky.","At least Jian Wushuang needed half an hour of rest to completely recover the power of the Starry Sky and unleash his strongest abilities.","“Now that Mie Sheng’s avatar has disappeared, you shall continue to cultivate here. This time, I will personally protect you until we journey together to the heavens!” Zhen Ling said solemnly.","The group was pleasantly surprised and thanked him one after another before returning to their cultivation.","However, Jian Wushuang understood Zhen Ling’s intentions; this was to prevent these people from leaking information about Mie Sheng, essentially protecting him in a roundabout way.","For this, Jian Wushuang naturally felt grateful.","It was obvious that Mie Sheng had come for him. If this matter were known by other Inheritors, and if he couldn’t handle it and forced Zhen Ling, it might lead to Zhen Ling handing him over to Mie Sheng.","That would be troublesome.","Although Zhen Ling could easily suppress others, losing his authority would be disastrous.","Credibility was paramount.","Sitting cross-legged around the golden bones, everyone once again worked on enhancing their divine bodies.","Without the cover of the cave, they were all quite far apart this time.","Jian Wushuang was no exception.","Although Jian Wushuang’s divine body had reached 80,000-fold, he still couldn’t get close.","He had intended to ask Zhen Ling about Dong Jun’s matter, but then he realized that if Zhen Ling asked him why he knew about Dong Jun, it wouldn’t be good.","Some things were better left unsaid.","So, Jian Wushuang diligently continued his cultivation.","After this battle, everyone’s perception of Jian Wushuang had also changed.","Although they knew that Mie Sheng had come for him.","But when they looked at Jian Wushuang, there was no resentment; their eyes held more jealousy.","Especially Fan Feng and Gu Qianluo.","Though they didn’t dare to provoke Jian Wushuang openly, deep down, jealousy brewed within them.","Especially Fan Feng, who harbored jealousy towards Jian Wushuang since their clash with Emperor Jueyun, leading to the subsequent discord among sisters.","It was all because of her narrow-mindedness.","Such people were the most dangerous.","A hundred years passed in the blink of an eye.","It was time to set out.","On this day, everyone stopped their cultivation.","Because Zhen Ling had already set up a teleportation array here to transport them directly to the God’s Tomb, and from there, they would proceed to the Heavenly Realm together.","After the ten individuals entered the teleportation array, Zhen Ling remained unhurried.","Under Zhu Qi’s gaze, he effortlessly collected Dong Jun’s golden skeleton into his mustard seed.","“Cough, Zhu Qi, tell your master for me, I’ve taken the Mountain Forest Secret Realm too!” Without waiting for Zhu Qi’s reply, he jumped into the teleportation array.","The next moment, the array erupted with a dazzling light, instantly carrying the entire Mountain Forest Secret Realm into God’s Tomb.","No wonder they were to go to the God’s Tomb first before proceeding to the Heavenly Realm.","Turns out, it was for this Mountain Forest Secret Realm.","Jian Wushuang was fine with it; he had grown accustomed to such things.","After all, the Demon Sound Mountain was obtained in a similar fashion.","Though others were surprised, faced with Zhen Ling, they dared not show disrespect.","“Come with me to the tombstone!” Zhen Ling beckoned, leading everyone from the peak of the Grave God Mountain into a passageway.","Everything went black before their eyes.","When they reappeared, they found themselves in a massive Dao Arena.","“This is the Qishen Temple, where the tombstone is located. Originally, it was supposed to be opened soon, but since the tombstone has not been excavated yet, it will have to be delayed for some time,” Zhen Ling explained as they walked.","Leading everyone to the core of the temple, beneath the manifestation Dao Image of Qishen.","Jian Wushuang and the others looked up at Qishen.","Jian Wushuang was already familiar with the appearance of Qishen.","He had touched even the physical body countless times, so he remained calm, showing no surprise.","Others, however, reacted differently.","Tongtian Buddha and Zhen Wuyang immediately bowed in reverence upon seeing such a powerful manifestation, then lowered their heads, not daring to meet the gaze.","Wanyan and Dongsheng, too, displayed a similar demeanor after their initial shock – a devout appearance.","On the other hand, among the younger generation, each displayed a demeanor of self-assuredness, assessing the situation directly.","Zhen Ling went to the place where incense burners were placed and lit a few sticks for himself.","Fan Feng, the leader of the 18 Divine Generals, knelt down with a thud, tears streaming down his face, yet he dared not make a sound, fearing to disturb the tranquility of the place.","The 3 great Divine Masters!","The 18 Divine Generals!","108 Envoys!","The Divine Masters, all Six Tribulation realm experts, were terrifyingly powerful.","The Divine Generals, like the Envoys, were at the supreme-peak.","But among the Divine Generals, each were Ultimate Emperors.","They were the closest to Qishen, treated by him as children.","Seeing the sorrow in the eyes of these Divine Generals at the manifestation of Qishen, Jian Wushuang’s opinion of Fan Feng softened a bit.","After lighting several incense sticks, Zhen Ling casually inserted them into the censer.","Seeing Fan Feng kneeling on the ground, a hint of gentleness crossed his face.","“Rise, child,” Zhen Ling said.","Fan Feng wiped the tears from the corners of his eyes and respectfully stood up.","Then, Zhen Ling turned to glance at the others, hands behind his back, and began, “Once, a great being predicted the future for the Rising Hall, saying that a peerless powerhouse would emerge, but the cost of this appearance would be the withering of countless bones!”","“In the past, I firmly believed it. But seeing all of you now, I have changed my perspective. I believe that each of you has the opportunity to become that peerless powerhouse!”","Zhen Ling’s sincerity resonated, and the eyes of the crowd glimmered with longing.","Who wouldn’t want to become a peerless powerhouse?","As for the withering of countless bones, it wouldn’t be their own bones that withered.","“Here, I wish you all the best, rapid advancement in your cultivation realms, and an early return to the Qishen Temple, to your homeland, to save the temporal river!” Zhen Ling waved his hand, summoning a jug of wine.","Before everyone, a bowl appeared.","The wine flew into the bowls on its own.","Everyone took their bowls, their eyes filled with anticipation as they looked at Zhen Ling.","“Cheers!” Zhen Ling lifted the jug directly and took a gulp.","Without hesitation, everyone followed suit and drank it all.","Jian Wushuang grimaced, finding the wine unbearably spicy, offering no help to his divine body, but instead making him dizzy.","Clearly, it wasn’t good wine.","Even for a farewell drink, couldn’t Zhen Ling bring out something better?","Just as Jian Wushuang was grumbling inwardly, a mirror-like image appeared in his mind, followed by his body returning to normal.","In the mirror, the visage of Zhen Ling appeared!"]},{"number":5659,"title":"Chapter 5659 Parting","paragraphs":["Chapter 5659 Parting","Upon seeing his reflection in the mirror, Jian Wushuang was taken aback.","....","“Hehe, Jian Wushuang!” Zhen Ling let out a mischievous grin.","Deep down, Jian Wushuang felt a twinge of unease. Why did he sense poison in the wine? Were they afraid that they, the people of Qishen Temple, would betray them?","However, this time, Jian Wushuang anticipated the thoughts of others and acted accordingly.","“Lord Zhen Ling, what is this?” Jian Wushuang cautiously inquired.","Zhen Ling extended an arm from the mirror and spoke, “This is a treasure prepared for you. Remember, treasures must be stored in your own Origin Source space, otherwise, the cost of teleportation to other spacetimes will be higher than the treasures you possess!”","“Yes!” Jian Wushuang hastily agreed, then accepted the small bead.","These were some treasures given to them before their departure.","After all, in a different spacetime, nobody knew where they would end up!","It didn’t hurt to be more prepared.","This time, it was Zhen Ling who dug into his own stash and distributed some treasures to everyone.","Not only Jian Wushuang but also Hu Qing and others received corresponding treasures.","In Hu Qing’s mind, Zhen Ling even took out a crystal ball and handed it to him.","“Hu Qing, I value you the most, you know that. Don’t disappoint me. I know your circumstances, but rest assured, I will take care of you personally!” Zhen Ling’s sincerity was palpable, but deep down, he couldn’t wait for Jiang Shang to meet his end.","“Hu Qing, I value you the most, you know that. Don’t disappoint me. I know your circumstances, but rest assured, I will take care of you personally!” Zhen Ling’s sincerity was palpable, but deep down, he couldn’t wait for Jiang Shang to meet his end.","Upon hearing Zhen Ling’s words, tears welled up in Hu Qing’s eyes, feeling somewhat reluctant.","Throughout the journey, Zhen Ling had indeed taken care of him a lot.","He dared not forget.","Once he achieved success, he would definitely repay the kindness.","On the other side, Zhen Ling also said similar words to Wu Zuo.","“Wu Zuo, you are my disciple, not the strongest, but the only surviving disciple. Don’t disgrace me. Don’t come back until you’ve reached the Tribulation Realm. Remember, preserving your life is paramount!”","These words instantly reminded Wu Zuo of his master from the past.","Although they rarely met, he remembered every admonition his master gave them: just stay alive.","Wu Zuo’s facial muscles trembled, showing emotion. “Master’s teachings, the disciple will never forget. If Qishen Temple faces crisis again, I, Wu Zuo, am willing to be the first to die in battle!”","He should have been living in the former Moro Spacetime, but the current struggle for survival made him forget the once boundless glory.","Full of youthful spirit, he thought, why not look back suddenly?","He was determined not to let down the past glory of Qishen Temple, nor would he embarrass his master.","Outside, everyone’s expressions were grave.","Zhen Ling scanned the crowd, his expression turning solemn, and he shouted loudly, “Let’s go!”","Whoosh!!!","Everyone soared into the sky, tearing through the heavens away from the Grave God Mountain.","From the God’s Tomb, there was silence all the way as they headed straight for the Heavenly Realm.","There was no pause or reluctance along the way.","In the northern border of the Heavenly Realm, above the mountains.","The ten most outstanding Inheritors of Qishen Temple had already arrived.","People were waiting for them here.","Zhen Ling had to manipulate the great array and couldn’t personally send them off.","Only Temple Master Xuan Yi was here to greet them.","Surrounding them were over a million All Things Envoys, all possessing supreme strength, super All Things Envoys controlled by Temple Master Xuan Yi.","“Follow me, everyone!” Temple Master Xuan Yi didn’t waste any words, leading them directly into the depths of the mountains.","Jian Wushuang looked around and felt a majestic divine power.","Others felt it too.","Temple Master Xuan Yi didn’t forget to enlighten them, explaining, “This time, the spacetime channel we’re opening leads to the temporal river at the core of the Starry Sky. That temporal river is even more powerful than the Moro Spacetime, mainly containing divine power with the Origin Source as its support. You may find it uncomfortable at first!”","“Mainly cultivating divine power?” Jian Wushuang was quite surprised. The Origin Source was supposed to be the right path; how could there be a focus on cultivating divine power?","Temple Master Xuan Yi noticed Jian Wushuang’s confusion and continued, “The Starry Sky is unpredictable; anything is possible!”","If there were cultivators focusing on the Origin Source, then there must be those focusing on divine power.","“Let’s go in!” Temple Master Xuan Yi halted his steps, pointing towards the pitch-black abyss ahead. Addressing everyone, he said, “This place is just the entrance to the chaotic flows of spacetime. Within the chaotic flows, there’s a formation that can assist you in temporal traversing. Remember, keep all external objects within the Origin Space. Otherwise, don’t blame me for not warning you if anything gets lost!”","This point had already been conveyed by Zhen Ling; they had long since stored their treasures within the Origin Space.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang only had a set of ordinary clothes on him.","No treasures whatsoever.","Without hesitation, everyone stepped into the abyss.","Jian Wushuang looked back one last time, his gaze lingering on the dense forest before he too entered the abyss.","Upon entering the depths of the abyss, everyone initially felt a bit uneasy.","Because it was chaotic spacetime, even entry by those in the Tribulation Realm posed dangers, let alone them.","Fortunately, Zhen Ling had mostly cleared the dangers within the chaotic flows.","They only felt a bit uncomfortable physically, but thankfully, there was no real danger.","“Up ahead should be the spacetime passage, right?” Wu Zuo reminded everyone.","Jian Wushuang followed his gaze.","In the distance, there was indeed a circular passage emitting an aura familiar to Jian Wushuang—not divine power, but the power of Life.","This surprised him somewhat.","A spacetime passage imbued with the power of Life.","Unfortunately, his understanding of spacetime was limited, so he didn’t fully comprehend.","This took him somewhat by surprise.","A temporal passage brimming with the power of Life.","Unfortunately, his understanding of spacetime was limited due to his realm, leaving him unaware.","Now, everyone had arrived close by.","There wasn’t time to consider much, so they all entered one after the other.","Before entering, Jian Wushuang and Hu Qing agreed to enter together, one after the other.","It would be best if they appeared together.","They had no idea where the temporal passage would transport them along the river of time.","It would be troublesome if they didn’t end up together.","Hence, each person had already left behind their own code.","In the different spacetime, they would use their own names as titles.","If they got in and lost their direction, they would first announce their names and then seek refuge in a local power.","Once everyone gathered, they would explore together.","Even if they didn’t want to explore together, they needed to establish contact beforehand.","They couldn’t afford to act independently; it would be troublesome if they couldn’t find each other later.","“Wushuang, Hu Qing, I’ll go in first!” Tongtian Buddha entered the temporal passage with Zhen Wuyang.","Following them were Gu Qianluo and Emperor Guangying.","Fan Feng didn’t say much either, flying in behind the two.","“Dongsheng, stay safe together with Wanyan!” Jian Wushuang reminded as he watched the two enter.","With Wu Zuo leading the way, Hu Qing following, and Jian Wushuang bringing up the rear, they all entered the temporal passage one after another.","Seeing Hu Qing also entering, Jian Wushuang took one last breath of the breath of this temporal river and resolutely flew in."]},{"number":5660,"title":"Chapter 5660: Celestial Maiden","paragraphs":["Chapter 5660: Celestial Maiden","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When Jian Wushuang and the others entered, only a moment seemed to pass before they found themselves in the passage, yet they couldn’t see anyone around.","The spatial and temporal dynamics within the spacetime passage were beyond Jian Wushuang’s comprehension, which wasn’t surprising.","They flew on, reminiscent of their initial entry into the black hole.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang suddenly felt his own cultivation realm continuously declining as he flew. It startled him. Moreover, his Life power was rapidly diminishing.","“What’s happening?” Jian Wushuang panicked. Not only was his realm plummeting, but his strength was also steadily draining away.","Soon, Jian Wushuang fell out of the Emperor realm and became a Dao Lord. Without the power of the Starry Sky, his Life power was completely drained.","Jian Wushuang’s pupils contracted. If his strength degraded like this before even leaving the spacetime passage, it would be questionable whether he could maintain his Immortal cultivation level once outside. That would be troublesome!","If he ended up stranded in the wilderness without any combat ability, how would he survive?","But now that he was halfway through, it wasn’t feasible to turn back!","Jian Wushuang could only grit his teeth and continue forward.","As his cultivation realm continued to decline, the Origin Space within his body had turned into a singularity, completely sealed off. Jian Wushuang was no longer even an Immortal.","He had reverted to being a mortal.","As he walked, a bright light appeared before him, followed by a wave of Death power rushing towards him.","Jian Wushuang felt a sense of unease, thinking it might be Mie Sheng up to no good again.","Without waiting for him to react, he was already falling into slumber.","In his dream, he entered another world.","His mind roamed, witnessing a vast and turbulent temporal river.","Nine heavens and ten earths, truly magnificent!","However, in the next moment, this temporal river suddenly collapsed!","Jian Wushuang, in a daze, caught sight of a celestial maiden. She wore a flowing red fairy robe, her beauty breathtaking.","This celestial maiden stepped barefoot into the temporal river.","Step by step, she traversed nine steps, creating a nine-colored sky.","Breath by breath, by the tenth breath, she had formed ten ancient secret realms.","As she paused, Jian Wushuang frowned and caught a glimpse of her gaze.","That glance, stifled his breath.","She was a peerless powerhouse who created the temporal river.","Jian Wushuang was completely awestruck.","When this celestial maiden first entered the temporal river, she was merely an emperor.","But with each step, she transcended a tribulation.","After nine steps, she became a supreme expert of the Tribulation Realm.","After ten breaths, she was invincible!","Such dominance.","Yet in the blink of an eye, the celestial maiden’s body shattered.","Leaving behind only the nine heavens and ten earths.","After witnessing this, Jian Wushuang felt a subtle force pulling him, drawing him into the ancient wood continent within the ten earths.","The ancient wood continent teemed with lush vegetation.","As Jian Wushuang’s consciousness entered the ancient wood continent, he vaguely heard a voice.","“This is my Dao Arena, and you dare to intrude!”","Startled, Jian Wushuang turned around to see a familiar figure, shielding him from the speaker.","“Hu Qing?” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but call out.","But Hu Qing didn’t pay him any attention; instead, he confronted the celestial maiden.","To Jian Wushuang’s surprise, Hu Qing actually managed to stop her.","What was going on?!","The opponent was a celestial maiden who had traversed the Nine Tribulations and possessed the power to create the temporal river.","And yet, Hu Qing had managed to intercept her.","The crucial question was: How did Hu Qing appear here?","He hadn’t noticed anyone else’s presence; he only saw Hu Qing.","At that moment,","The others also witnessed the scene Jian Wushuang had just seen. While being blocked by the celestial maiden, they were all stopped by Hu Qing.","For a moment, everyone felt an immense curiosity about Hu Qing’s identity.","But then, the attraction drew everyone into the Nine Heavens or Ten Lands.","Jian Wushuang’s consciousness, however, descended upon the Ancient Wood Continent.","In the Yue Kingdom, at the Qingyun Sect.","The Wu family!","Drip, drip...","The sound of dripping water in his ears woke Jian Wushuang, making him grumpily regain consciousness.","As he tried to lift his head, he felt a sharp pain in his chest and an instant wave of exhaustion that prevented him from even opening his eyes.","He was injured!","Jian Wushuang realized this and tried to mobilize the power of Life to recover, only to find that he not only lacked the power of Life but even the damn Origin Source.","“Young Master, you’re awake!”","A sweet voice came, making Jian Wushuang shudder.","This voice, it felt like it reached into his bones, causing shivers down his spine.","The crucial point was, were they calling him Young Master?","How did he become a Young Master!","Clearly, he had traveled from another spacetime, so there shouldn’t be any familiar faces here!","Just as Jian Wushuang was puzzled, a strange memory suddenly struck his mind.","Wu family descendant, Wu Shuang.","Great Yue Kingdom!","Seven Star Sect, Azure Cloud Sect.","One after another, unfamiliar pieces of information were accepted by Jian Wushuang.","At this moment, he also recognized the owner of that voice.","“Su Mei’er!” Jian Wushuang’s throat emitted a voice of disgust.","She was his personal maid.","But according to the knowledge from that memory, this maid was not a good person.","He also knew how he got his injuries.","Swish!","With a strong will, Jian Wushuang flipped off the bed and pulled the maid, Su Mei’er, into his arms, then grabbed her slender neck like sheep fat jade, and said viciously, “Who sent you!”","Su Mei’er couldn’t break free from his grip, her face filled with terror.","Deep down, she was even more astonished. How could this loser of a Young Master dare to lay hands on her?","He was only at the Foundation Establishment stage, yet he couldn’t break free.","Ancient Moon Spacetime!","The realm of cultivation here was vastly different from where Jian Wushuang resided.","It spanned from Post-Heaven, Pre-Heaven, Foundation Establishment, Myriad Forms, Nascent Soul, Mahayana, Immortal, Emperor, to Tribulation Realm.","The temporal river here was ancient, even mightier than the Moro Spacetime, with more refined methods of cultivation.","There were fewer delineated cultivation realms, with just Immortality encompassing realms like Yan Immortal, Grand Yan Immortal, and Dao Lords.","The maid he had by the neck was a Foundation Establishemnt cultivator, while his own body was merely that of a common Pre-Natal cultivator.","And he was not even 18 yet.","Only 17.","Yet now, he was unleashing strength comparable to a formidable Foundation Establishment cultivator.","How could this not astonish the maid, Su Mei’er!","“Young Master Wu Shuang, it’s me, Mei’er!” Su Meier attempted to explain.","But Jian Wushuang was resolute, gripping Su Meier’s face in his hand, his voice cold, “If you don’t start telling the truth, I’ll tear your face apart!”","From disbelief, Su Mei’er’s expression turned to fear.","She could sense that this young master seemed different, not like before. If she kept hiding, he might actually tear her face apart.","“I’ll talk... Young Master, Mei’er will tell you everything!”","Jian Wushuang pushed her away and got off the bed.","But the sensation of tearing in his chest almost made him faint.","When he touched his chest, it was covered in blood."]},{"number":5661,"title":"Chapter 5661: Yue Kingdom, Wu Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 5661: Yue Kingdom, Wu Family","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Looking around, his eyes were blurred.","But he could vaguely make out this rundown house.","The Wu Family, one of the top ten influential clans in Yue Kingdom.","Renowned for their swords, they even had a Wu Family Sword Tomb, housing the strongest sword in Yue Kingdom.","Jian Wushuang was reborn into such a family, which was actually quite fortunate.","However, he didn’t expect to be framed right after his rebirth.","In his mind, he gleaned the memories of this body.","As a collateral branch member of the Wu Family, it was natural for him to wield a sword. But his naturally weak bones made it impossible for him to cultivate divine power.","Though he was piled with pills to become a Pre-Natal cultivator, his divine power was still inferior to that of Post-Natal cultivators.","Gradually, the family gave up on him.","If it were really so, it might have been for the best.","What he didn’t expect was the stepmother’s venomous heart towards this body.","She initially treated him fairly well, perhaps because he was just a waste.","But in an accident, his stepmother, Chen Qingxuan, discovered a nascent sword bone in his body.","Sword bone!","It was a naturally born sword embryo.","Possessing a sword bone meant that one was destined to become an Immortal cultivator.","And they would also master the ultimate swordsmanship, becoming the most extraordinary sword cultivator.","It was precisely because of this ancient sword fragment that Wu Shuang couldn’t cultivate divine power.","Because most of the cultivated divine power went into the sword bone, nourishing it continuously.","The glory of the Wu Family’s ancestors gave birth to someone with a sword bone.","Wu Shuang was the second.","For those who possessed a sword bone, the divine power cultivated in their youth would all enter the sword bone.","That’s also why Wu Shuang was cursed as a loser and a waste by others.","The formation of sword bones requires many treasures.","Upon learning this, Chen Qingxuan devoted all her efforts to nurturing Wu Shuang.","Although the members of the Wu family were somewhat puzzled, they greatly admired Chen Qingxuan’s character.","She was Wu Shuang’s stepmother and had no obligation to care for him so much, especially since she had her own child.","That child was Wu Di, Wu Shuang’s half-brother.","But outsiders were unaware that Chen Qingxuan’s actions were all for the sake of her own son.","She wanted the sword bones within Wu Shuang to be transplanted into her son, Wu Di!","Wu Di was only a year younger than Jian Wushuang.","He had just turned 16 this year.","In his early years, Wu Shuang’s father, Wu Yong, doted on him greatly, following the order of seniority.","However, it was later discovered that Wu Shuang’s physique was simply not suitable for cultivation, so he was given up on, becoming even more indifferent.","On the contrary, Wu Di displayed extraordinary potential, making Wu Yong proud within the family.","Wu Yong’s strength only reached the Mahayana Realm, not even attaining Immortal status.","Although he was a direct descendant, he didn’t hold much power.","It was solely because of this one son that he rose to a mid-level position within the family and became an elder.","Wu Di, at just 16, was already reached the Myriad Forms cultivation realm.","It was truly remarkable.","Jian Wushuang also admired him greatly; at 16, he was still a naive youth.","But these despicable individuals actually extracted Wu Shuang’s sword bones and gave them to Wu Di!","This made him very displeased.","Even though it was only borrowing this body.","But since he was reborn into this body, he was going to seek justice for Wu Shuang.","Wu Shuang, Wushuang.","How truly fateful.","Jian Wushuang picked up the water jug on the table and took a sip.","Watching Su Mei’er kneeling on the ground, Jian Wushuang spoke coldly, “Finish speaking and get lost!”","Su Mei’er knelt on the ground, looking pitifully at Jian Wushuang, tremblingly said, “Thank you, young master, for sparing my life. Everything was instructed by Chen Qingxuan.”","“Don’t worry, I never kill women!” Jian Wushuang waved his hand dismissively.","Su Mei’er was obedient, under his threat, she spilled everything.","Her memory of three days ago was very vague, she didn’t know much about it.","It followed on from the memories she had absorbed.","After understanding the current situation, she stabilized.","For now, there was no worry of life or death!","Upon hearing his words, Su Mei’er revealed a flattering smile, hastily got up, and was about to leave.","Jian Wushuang stared at her figure, shaking his head.","Swish!","A chopstick on the table was flicked by him and pierced directly through Su Mei’er’s chest.","“Hmph, Wu Shuang might spare women, but I, Jian Wushuang, don’t carry that burden in my heart!”","Now he was Jian Wushuang.","An invincible Emperor who had lived for several epochs and had not yet fully recovered his strength.","How could he be softhearted?","After dealing with Su Mei’er, Jian Wushuang dragged her body under the bed, then sat cross-legged on the bed, starting to recover his strength.","His current state had dropped too severely.","He could only barely maintain the power of All Things, which was not enough to seek justice from Wu Shuang.","On second thought.","He had no relatives or friends here.","His mother, Yuchi Mingyue, had fallen early.","His father, Wu Yong, looked down on him and hadn’t seen him for years, even if they met, it was indifferent.","When he was outside, he was treated as if he hadn’t seen him at all.","In a world where martial prowess reigned supreme, particularly within prominent families like the Wu family, a worthless son was akin to hanging shame upon the family name. But for reasons tied to Wu Di, it seemed Wu Yong would forever struggle to hold his head high.","It was because of Wu Di that Wu Yong couldn’t bear to face Wu Shuang.","Jian Wushuang shook his head, sighing, “Poor child.”","Pitiful!","Miserable!","He was once the seed of ultimate potential, but his destiny was cruelly snatched away by his wicked stepmother.","If Jian Wushuang’s suspicions were correct, it was likely Wu Shuang’s death that led to him inhabiting this body.","The cycles of the world.","Though Wu Shuang had perished, his name lived on. But now with the word ‘Jian’ preceding it.","Jian Wushuang!","Huh!","After taking a moment to recuperate, Jian Wushuang’s cultivation had regressed significantly. However, drawing from experiences of his past life, he swiftly used some acquired divine power to staunch the bleeding from his chest wound.","Now, without Wu Shuang’s sword bone, Wu Di could cultivate a potent divine power, somewhat freeing himself from constraints.","Living as a mortal, he led a mundane existence.","Soon, three days had passed.","At the rear mountain of the Wu residence, within a luxurious estate nestled amidst the resting quarters for the womenfolk, Chen Qingxuan, with her exquisite beauty, was guiding her son’s training.","“My son, how is your recovery progressing?” Chen Qingxuan doted on her son, pride evident in her gaze.","The transplantation of the sword bone had left more than just Wu Shuang injured.","At this moment, Wu Di was also greatly weakened.","Yet, with countless treasures bolstering him, he quickly adapted to the backlash brought forth by the sword bone.","And this segment of sword bone had already reached perfection within him.","He already possessed the sword eye, and now, coupled with the sword bone.","His future adversaries, perhaps, would truly become unbeatable.","However, he didn’t feel too much joy. When he looked at his mother, there was puzzlement in his sword eye, as well as a trace of unwillingness.","He already possessed the sword eye; the path to invincibility had begun.","Why bother seeking a segment of sword bone from a weaker individual?","Wu Di was still too young to understand, and unwilling too.","It was the unwillingness of his self-esteem.","As for Wu Shuang, he hadn’t even bothered to consider him.","Although Chen Qingxuan was Wu Di’s mother, she was unaware of her son’s inner thoughts."]},{"number":5662,"title":"Chapter 5662: Yuchi Mingfeng","paragraphs":["Chapter 5662: Yuchi Mingfeng","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Mother, I’m fine,” Wu Di’s tone was cold as he responded softly.","Chen Qingxuan, however, was quite excited. She continued, “Good that you’re fine. Just focus on recuperating here, I’ll take care of things outside.”","“The outside?” Wu Di was somewhat puzzled. What did his mother mean by the outside?","He had no fondness for Wu Shuang and had never considered him as an opponent.","Naturally, he was unaware.","But Chen Qingxuan knew.","Even Wu Shuang himself didn’t know that he had an uncle.","An Immortal uncle.","And he had already arrived at the Wu Family.","“It’s Yuchi Mingfeng!” Chen Qingxuan slowly rose to her feet, leaning against Wu Di.","Wu Di’s expression changed, surprised. “You mean that Mingjiao prodigy, Young King Yuchi Mingfeng from Mingjiao?”","In Yue Country, there were two major super sects.","One was the Seven Star Sect, the orthodox sect of the Ancient Wood Continent. The other was Mingjiao.","The Seven Star Sect, Qingyun Sect, was said to be as old as the heavens and earth, with its origins traced back to the celestial maiden who opened the Ancient Moon Spacetime. It had been passed down to this day and was the number one sect in Yue Kingdom.","Even the royal family treated Qingyun Sect with utmost respect.","Mingjiao, however, was different.","It was a rising star. Though not as ancient as Qingyun Sect, its overall strength was not inferior.","Young King Yuchi Mingfeng was one of the contemporary geniuses of Mingjiao.","He was a significant figure.","Even the Wu Family had to take him seriously.","Although Wu Di was young, he harbored aspirations for those geniuses, and deep down, he had confidence in himself.","Little did he expect that someone like that would be related to his useless brother, Wu Shuang.","“Don’t worry, I have arranged for your uncle to return. Yuchi Mingfeng is ultimately just an Immortal, but your uncle is an Emperor!” Chen Qingxuan said confidently.","Even if it was a prodigy from the Mingjiao Sect, so what?","This was the Wu Family.","A prominent clan of Yue Kingdom, a super family under the Qingyun Sect of the Seven Star Sects.","In terms of background and strength, they were much higher than the Young King.","After inspecting his son, Chen Qingxuan hurriedly left.","The guest hall of the Wu Family.","Wu Qiong, the eldest son of the Wu Family’s third branch, Wu Di’s uncle, and also Wu Shuang’s uncle, was confronting a handsome young man.","“Wu Qiong, my nephew is just a b*stard child of your third branch. Why bother stopping me? Since you don’t value him, what harm is there in letting me take him away?” Yuchi Mingfeng’s tone was cold.","He owed a lot to this nephew of his.","When his sister fell, he was in seclusion. Now that he had emerged from seclusion and learned of his sister’s death, that nephew whom he had never met became the butt of jokes in the Wu Family.","Naturally, he wanted to take him away.","He was his last living relative.","Even if he was useless, he would protect him for life.","But he never expected that the Wu Family would refuse to let him take him away under the pretext of being a family member.","This caught him completely off guard.","Given the nature of the Wu Family, with a b*stard child who couldn’t cultivate divine power, they would be more than happy to let Wu Shuang go with his uncle.","Wu Qiong had been smiling all along, neither offending nor helping this Young King.","“Mingfeng, my dear friend, you needn’t worry about matters concerning my Wu Family’s descendants. Wu Shuang is living well within the Wu Family. Why bother? It’s better to let him enjoy a leisurely life. It’s a beautiful thing!”","Yet, deep down, Yuchi Mingfeng harbored suspicions. Pausing for a moment, he sneered, “Haha, a leisurely life?”","If that were truly the case, he would be relieved.","However, some days ago, there was a sudden pang of pain, a backlash brought about by karma.","He sensed that his nephew had encountered trouble, compounded by the fall of his sister. Hence, he hastily left seclusion to come here.","Before arriving at the Wu Family, he learned about his nephew’s situation and had already made up his mind to take Wu Shuang away.","“Isn’t this a good arrangement?” a voice interrupted their confrontation.","Entering the main hall was Chen Qingxuan.","Yuchi Mingfeng didn’t turn his head, but an overwhelming sense of pressure burst forth from him.","Seeing this, Wu Qiong’s expression also changed.","Chen Qingxuan remained composed, walking up to Wu Qiong and offering a slight bow before turning to Yuchi Mingfeng, saying slowly, “Although Wu Shuang is not my biological son, in terms of status, he’s also my child. Brother Mingfeng, there’s no need to worry.”","After all, Wu Shuang’s surname was Wu.","This statement was also meant to persuade Yuchi Mingfeng to back down.","But the other party didn’t seem inclined to do so.","Wu Qiong nodded with a smile, remaining silent on the sidelines.","The confrontation in the main hall continued.","Meanwhile, after three days of adjustment, Jian Wushuang finally managed to recover from his injuries to a large extent.","“Phew!” Jian Wushuang breathed out heavily.","Now, apart from his soul, he was just an ordinary person.","With his Origin Source temporarily inactive, he couldn’t possibly regain his peak state.","“I need to find some help!” Jian Wushuang frowned.","If he continued to cultivate like this, he feared he would have to live another life.","But now, finding himself in this situation, he didn’t have the time to live another life and slowly cultivate with the talent of this body.","It would probably take at least 10,000 years to reach the Immortal realm, that is, to unlock the Origin Source and become a Yan Immortal.","Even with his past life’s experience, it would still require hundreds of years.","And it would also require many external items.","He couldn’t afford to wait.","He came to this spacetime to achieve the Tribulation Realm.","Actually, several hundred or even ten thousand years of time wasn’t considered long.","It’s just that his current situation doesn’t allow him to wait.","What if that stepmother of his decides to kill him!","When in doubt, it’s better to slip away first.","If an Emperor is willing to help him, he only needs a trace of the power of Origin Source, to activate the Origin Source space within him, which would instantly draw out the power of Life.","With the power of Life, he could quickly recover to his peak.","But now, with no one to turn to, where could he find an Emperor to help him?","Just when Jian Wushuang was in a dilemma, he suddenly felt a wave of karma descending in his heart.","It’s not far away.","And the other party is very powerful.","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrows.","There are too many people in the Wu Family who are connected to him by blood.","However, the feeling it gave him was rather indifferent.","But the aura that had just descended was incredibly gentle.","It felt like family, and the attitude towards him was different from that of the Wu Family.","This surprised Jian Wushuang greatly.","Right now, he lacked such a relative!","As long as he restored his peak, the grudges in this body could be quickly resolved, and then he could search for others.","I wonder where Hu Qing and the others went!","According to the memories of this body and various things he had seen before.","This temporal river was very powerful.","Indeed, it was as powerful as Teacher Xuan Yi said, even more so than the Moro Spacetime he had encountered before.","It was one of the most dazzling nine temporal rivers in the Starry Sky.","Its internal structure was also different from other temporal rivers.","The main structure consisted of Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","As for the universe, it floated above the temporal river like stars.","The Ancient Wood Continent was one of the Ten Lands.","He had entered the Ancient Wood Continent.","Where did Hu Qing and Wu Zuo go again?","At this moment, others had the same thoughts.","It’s just that the experiences of others were slightly better than Jian Wushuang’s.","But not significantly better, as they were all striving to restore their peak."]},{"number":5663,"title":"Chapter 5663: Karmic Guidance","paragraphs":["Chapter 5663: Karmic Guidance","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Hui Qing’s experience, however, was different from theirs.","But whether it was good or bad, everything was still unclear.","The situation was yet to be determined.","The ten members of the Qishen Temple all had different experiences.","But their goals were the same.","To become great and strong, to shine once again!","Jian Wushuang didn’t dwell on these thoughts. Instead, he got up and left the room.","As for the maid’s body, he had already destroyed it completely.","Stepping out of the room and pushing open the door to the courtyard, he found two men in sturdy attire standing outside.","Both seemed to be at the initial stage of the Myriad Forms stage.","When they saw Jian Wushuang coming out, their eyes narrowed.","These two were arranged here by Chen Qingxuan.","Originally, they weren’t meant to keep an eye on Jian Wushuang, but Wei Chi Mingfeng suddenly showed up at the door.","Fearful that Jian Wushuang might leave, she decided to keep him under soft confinement for a while.","At the same time, she arranged for treasures to be sent over, intending to heal Jian Wushuang’s injuries first before anything else.","Even if she didn’t agree to let Yuchi Mingfeng take Jian Wushuang away, she couldn’t stop him if he wanted to see Jian Wushuang.","If they found injuries on Jian Wushuang later, it wouldn’t be good.","However, what Chen Qingxuan didn’t expect was that the treasures she bestowed had already been secretly taken by these two Myriad Forms cultivators.","They both thought Wu Shuang was just a waste. Even if he was given treasures, they wouldn’t be useful.","So they decided to take advantage of it themselves.","This wasn’t the first time they had done something like this.","“Young Master Wu Shuang, where are you going instead of recuperating here?” One of the cultivators with triangular eyes stepped forward, blocking Jian Wushuang’s path.","Although they didn’t know why this young master had chosen this place to recuperate, since Chen Qingxuan had instructed, they wouldn’t let Wu Shuang leave even half a step.","Jian Wushuang didn’t even spare them a glance, coldly remarking, “Do I need your permission for where I want to go?”","The two servants from the Wu Family dared to offend him so brazenly.","It seemed like his current appearance was quite pathetic!","Despite the pseudo care from Chen Qingxuan, it was doubtful if anyone would regard him with respect.","Seeing the young master who was originally weak-willed, unable to cultivate any divine power, suddenly showing some backbone, left everyone surprised.","For a moment, they were taken aback.","But as Jian Wushuang continued to move forward, the two men simultaneously blocked his path.","“Tsk tsk, where does the young master intend to go, servants naturally don’t dare to ask too much, but someone above has instructed us to guard the young master here, please understand!” The man with triangular eyes, with a smirk that didn’t reach his eyes, stood in Jian Wushuang’s way, revealing his broad chest.","However, Jian Wushuang just sneered.","He never imagined that one day he would be threatened by two ordinary humans.","“You’re asking for death!” Killing intent flashed in Jian Wushuang’s eyes as he raised his leg and kicked directly into the chest of the man with triangular eyes.","The force behind this kick was tremendous, coupled with the fact that the other party didn’t take it seriously, thinking that the Wu Shuang in front of them was still the useless young master as before, they didn’t pay much attention.","But what surprised him was that just with one kick, he sent the man flying several yards away, severely injuring his physical body.","In the cultivation system where divine power was primary, the physical body was the first barrier.","Mortals primarily cultivated their physical bodies, and divine power was like the Origin Source.","Much like the two Myriad Forms practitioners before him.","Although they were mortals, they possessed bodies ten times stronger than normal, yet they still fell short in front of Jian Wushuang.","Although his current body was weak, with his past life’s experience and his powerful soul, he now possessed the peak combat power of the Myriad Forms realm.","While his physical body was weak, his divine power was extremely strong.","He was actually surprised that his kick didn’t kill the other person.","The cultivation system in this dimension was quite interesting.","“You!” The other Myriad Forms practitioner stared at Jian Wushuang in astonishment.","They never expected Jian Wushuang to suddenly attack.","This caught them off guard.","The young man with triangular eyes who had been kicked far away was brimming with anger. Ignoring his injuries, he stood up straight and shouted at Jian Wushuang, “You ignorant brat, you don’t know what’s good for you! Otherwise, you’ll regret it today!”","Even though they were just servants of the Wu Family, being beaten by a waste like Jian Wushuang still stirred feelings of resentment and anger within them.","“Regret?” Jian Wushuang clenched his fists slightly.","There were many things that could make him regret.","But none of them were within the capability of these insignificant minions.","In the next moment, he flashed forward and instantly appeared in front of the other party, a swift chop severing the man’s head clean off.","Hot blood gushed out instantly.","The man with triangular eyes was thoroughly shocked to see his companion killed instantly.","He never imagined that the weak young master from before, a waste, could kill a Myriad Forms Realms cultivator in an instant.","“You! How dare you kill someone!” The man with triangular eyes kept retreating, pointing shakily at Jian Wushuang, unable to articulate his words coherently.","But privately, he had already sent a message for help.","Chen Qingxuan had issued strict orders to not let Jian Wushuang take a single step out.","At the same time, a patrol team of cultivators was already approaching from the distance.","However, inside the guest hall, Chen Qingxuan’s eyes flickered, and a hint of unease emerged in her heart.","This unease seemed to be not because of the current situation with Yuchi Mingfeng.","But because of Wu Shuang.","The Wu Shuang who had already become a complete waste.","The care she had shown him before was only for the sake of the sword bone.","Now that Wu Shuang had completely fallen into ruin.","The reason for stopping Yuchi Mingfeng from taking him away was fear of the truth being exposed.","In just a few months, she would erase everything.","Then, sword bone would truly belong to her son, Wu Di, and Wu Shuang would be completely worthless.","There would be no need to pay any more attention to him.","Now appeared Yuchi Mingfeng, but there was a murderous intent in her heart.","Although the sword bones could be stolen, the traces couldn’t be erased.","If discovered, it would be troublesome.","She wasn’t worried about someone standing up for Wu Shuang, but rather concerned about bringing disgrace to her son.","Wu Di was everything to her.","He was her proudest son.","She couldn’t let her son’s reputation be tarnished because of a useless person.","“Hold him back, I’ve arranged for someone to go!” Chen Qingxuan’s surface was calm, but privately, she had already arranged for someone to intercept Wu Shuang.","At the same time, she was also surprised why Jian Wushuang recovered so quickly and even managed to kill a Myraid Forms realm cultivator.","Although the strength of the two Myriad Forms cultivators she sent over was weak.","But Wu Shuang was only a Pre-Natal realm cultivator.","Even if she gave him treasures that could help him breakthrough to the Foundation Establishment realm, he shouldn’t be this powerful!","Little did she know, Wu Shuang had died three days ago.","The current Wu Shuang was no longer the Wu Shuang of the past.","Although she took away Wu Shuang’s sword bone, she also added a ‘Jian’ character to Wu Shuang’s name.","As for Jian Wushuang on the other side.","Killing a mortal at will was nothing out of the ordinary for him.","It was the triangular-eyed man who kept yelling and annoying him.","He could clearly feel the friendly karma emanating from the central hall of the Wu Family.","There was no time to entangle with these small fries."]},{"number":5664,"title":"Chapter 5664 Powerful Soul","paragraphs":["Chapter 5664 Powerful Soul","The moment he moved to confront another Myriad Forms cultivator, Jian Wushuang couldn’t be bothered; instead, he just left.","....","At that moment, a white-clad youth, accompanied by dozens of people, flew over from the sky.","The newcomer was familiar to Jian Wushuang.","Based on his memory’s description.","The relationship between him and the white-clad youth before him was extraordinary.","Like him, they were both descendants of the Wu Family.","However, this white-clad youth was the legitimate descendant of the third branch.","He was Wu Qiong’s second son, ‘Wu Liang’!","In terms of age, Jian Wushuang still had to call him ‘elder cousin’.","But this elder cousin had given him a hard time more than once.","He had even humiliated him in the past.","Seeing Jian Wushuang approaching, Wu Liang tilted his head up, not bothering to look at his cousin properly.","A waste.","There was no respect for him anywhere.","Even though they were blood relatives.","Even Jian Wushuang himself thought there was nothing wrong with the other.","Usually, wastes were just ignored.","But to even bother with a waste like him.","Then what’s the difference between this person and a waste?","The key was that the original Wu Shuang was not a waste at all, but a future Ultimate Sword Dao expert.","“Killing a servant privately is a serious crime, take him down!” Wu Liang ordered his subordinates coldly.","In his eyes, this cousin of his was not even comparable to a family servant.","Of course, there were also his father’s instructions in this matter.","Although he didn’t know why Wu Shuang was to be detained, he couldn’t be bothered to ask.","Dozens of Myriad Forms cultivators, led by a Nascent Soul stage cultivator, were present.","Jian Wushuang’s current strength was simply not a match.","Moreover, Wu Liang had been born for thousands of years and had reached the Mahayana stage.","In this situation, defeat was inevitable.","Jian Wushuang, without any cards left to play, relied solely on the power of his soul.","Just as these people closed in around him, a powerful wave of Thought power surged suddenly, freezing everyone in place.","Wu Liang’s expression turned to astonishment as he stared at Jian Wushuang, incredulously asking, “How is this possible? How could a waste like you possess such strength?”","“Strength?” Jian Wushuang looked at him as if he were a mere ant.","Although the Wu family’s strength in Yue Kingdom was considerable, ranking among the top ten families, in his eyes, they were too weak. Even when he was a Dao Lord, he could take on the entire Wu Family alone.","The outward release of soul power immediately caught the attention of the strong within the Wu Family.","In a secluded place, an old man suddenly opened his eyes, shock evident in them.","“What a powerful soul force!”","At the same time, within the heart of the family, some of the secluded family elites also emerged.","The sudden appearance of this mysterious soul force within the family was a significant matter.","The third son of the family, Wu Qiong, who had been in the guest hall, also sensed it, his expression changing instantly.","Compared to the matter with Chen Qingxuan, this was more important.","“Yuchi Mingfeng, we might need to postpone the matter with Wu Shuang!” Wu Qiong’s expression changed, leaving behind only a spiritual avatar. His true body rushed towards Jian Wushuang.","Chen Qingxuan, being only at the Immortal cultivation realm, couldn’t sense the soul power at all.","Naturally, she knew nothing about it.","Instead, she smiled as she looked at the handsome young man before him, but harbored different thoughts in her heart.","Although Yuchi Mingfeng was also at the Immortal cultivation realm, his strength had already reached the limit of the Dao Lord realm. He was a genius of the Mingjiao, his strength not inferior to that of an Emperor. Naturally, he too felt the soul power.","Although the soul power was unfamiliar, it was connected by karma.","It was related to his sister.","Is that the nephew he had never met?","That took him by surprise.","“I think there’s no need to wait any longer!” Yuchi Mingfeng acted directly.","He had already noticed that Wu Qiong had only left behind an avatar.","Wu Qiong couldn’t stop him at all.","Wu Qiong’s face changed drastically, angrily saying, “How dare you!”","But Yuchi Mingfeng just sneered, “What’s there to fear!”","He was the pride of Mingjiao.","Although the Wu Family was backed by the Seven Star Sect’s Qingyun Sub-Sect, they were nothing more than dogs.","Even if they were from the Qingyun Sect, so what?","He wasn’t afraid!","Moreover, he wasn’t a fool. These people were making things difficult for him for the sake of their nephew. There must be something they didn’t want him to know.","He certainly wouldn’t let go.","...","Jian Wushuang’s soul power spread outward, even he didn’t know it would cause such a big disturbance.","For a moment, he felt several powerful auras soaring into the sky.","“This is bad!” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","He suddenly realized that this place was primarily based on divine power.","Soul power was different from this place.","Although his soul realm was only at the level of an Emperor, because of the nourishment of the Origin Source, his soul realm had long surpassed that of an Emperor, even stronger than the realm of Tribulation.","He had reached the level of the Universe Master.","This attracted the attention of countless people.","But now there was no other way.","They could only hope for the arrival of the powerful individual whose fate was intertwined with theirs. He only needed a trace of the Origin Source within the other person to restore himself to his peak.","Although the strong individuals in this spacetime were mainly practitioners of the divine power Origin Source, they were also Origin Sources, capable of restoring him to his peak.","Without strength, he felt insecure in everything he did.","Soon enough, several Emperors descended.","“What has happened here, Wu Liang?” The elder of the family was the first to speak.","The white-browed old man stared intently at Jian Wushuang.","He could sense the mysterious soul power emanating from the young man before him.","Seeing so many powerful figures descending, Wu Liang was also taken aback, but he quickly reacted and hurriedly explained Jian Wushuang’s situation.","The white-browed elder revealed a strange expression.","He was unaware of Jian Wushuang’s situation.","He was just a distant relative within the family.","Although he was also a disciple of their third branch, the Wu Family had nine branches, each with tens of thousands of disciples.","It was impossible to know them all.","Moreover, he was just a young disciple who had been born only a few decades ago.","For Immortals and above, one cultivation session could span thousands or even millions of years.","It was normal not to be aware.","After learning that he was a member of their family, these people breathed a sigh of relief.","It was good that he was one of their own.","If he were an outsider, they would have to treat him cautiously.","After the white-browed elder breathed a sigh of relief, he smiled at Jian Wushuang and asked, “Are you the reincarnated one?”","To possess such powerful soul strength at just a few decades old.","He could only think of it as a reincarnation.","But his guess wasn’t far off; Jian Wushuang indeed was a reincarnation.","Jian Wushuang didn’t hide it either, as it held no meaning, so he simply nodded.","It’s best this way.","With everything clarified, if the other party cooperated, he could recover his peak faster.","Yet, he was somewhat worried about what would happen if these people decided to attack him.","“I wonder about your identity in your past life...” the elder asked cautiously.","Jian Wushuang replied, “I am not from the Ancient Wood Continent!”","This wasn’t a lie either; he truly wasn’t one of the powerful beings on the Ancient Wood Continent, nor did he belong to this spacetime.","“Oh, I see!” There was a hint of curiosity in the elder’s eyes.","Simultaneously, he conveyed this information to the true powerhouses within the clan."]},{"number":5665,"title":"Chapter 5665: Reincarnation","paragraphs":["Chapter 5665: Reincarnation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After the reincarnation of a powerful individual.","He descended upon their Wu Family.","It was uncertain whether it was good or bad.","The benefits were evident; having the bloodline of their Wu Family meant having profound karma.","In the future, upon reaching the pinnacle once again, he wouldn’t forget the Wu Family.","It was considered a good thing.","However, there were drawbacks.","The uncertainty about the person he was before reincarnation lingered. What if he was a powerful cultivator of the demonic path? How would he harm the Wu Family?","Moreover, lacking any background information, they were unaware of his strength or weaknesses.","This matter couldn’t be decided by him alone, a mere elder of the third branch.","They needed to consult the true powerhouses within the family.","Upon hearing about this matter, Wu Qiong, who rushed over, had a drastic change in expression.","He knew about the deeds of Chen Qingxuan.","It was probably impossible to conceal it now.","Furthermore, as for Yuchi Mingfeng, his avatar couldn’t him and was already charging towards them.","“Wu Qiong, is this true?” The elder, ‘Elder Bai Mei’ frowned slightly upon hearing Wu Qiong’s message.","The matter regarding Jian Wushuang had already been exposed.","Elder Bai Mei was first amazed, then filled with regret.","But upon hearing that Jian Wushuang’s soul was transplanted into Wu Di, he felt relieved.","At least it remained within the family and wasn’t a boon to outsiders.","However, in doing so, they would offend the reincarnated individual before them!","Not much of a loss compared to the sword bone.","But there’s something that Elder Bai Mei finds puzzling.","Why transplant it to Wu Di instead of Wu Qiong’s eldest son or second son, Wu Liang?","There must be some hidden reason behind this.","But that’s not important now; what matters is how to deal with Wu Shuang.","Such a big event has occurred.","In the city below the mountain, Wu Yong, Wu Shuang’s biological father, had already been brought over.","“My son, turns out you’re a reincarnate!” Wu Yong exclaimed in surprise at first, then his face lit up with joy.","Although his strength is mediocre, he understands reincarnation.","Those who can reincarnate are all great beings, maybe even supreme experts.","With this, he has another powerful backing.","And it’s his own biological son, a powerful being like an Emperor.","As for his other son, Wu Di, although talented, he has yet to fully grow.","Wu Shuang, as a reincarnate, is different; he can quickly recover his peak.","Then he will be a great support.","The eldest son is a reincarnate, a great being like an Emperor.","The second son possesses the Sword Eye and, unknown to him, the Jian Gu, making him even more qualified.","What virtues and merits did Wu Yong have in his past life to have such two proud sons in this life?","Wu Qiong glanced at his incompetent younger brother, his face somewhat embarrassed.","But deep down, he sneered.","As a reincarnate, even if he is Wu Yong’s son, he probably won’t receive much favor due to past events.","As for the second son, Wu Di, that’s even more intriguing.","And because of the matter of the sword bone, he probably holds a grudge and it’s already generous if he doesn’t seek revenge on them.","Elder Bai Mei also understands this point.","Now there had to be a decision.","Wu Shuang was a reincarnated powerhouse, and without discussing the future, he would soon grow into a superpower whose strength rivaled his own.","Even potentially become a supreme-peak expert.","And Wu Di, possessing absolute talent, would become an Emperor in the future, perhaps even reaching the supreme-peak.","Both of these individuals were the hope of their respective families.","Whether to give up or not, that was the question.","If one must truly give up, it would be Wu Shuang.","After all, he was a reincarnated being.","Wu Di, on the other hand, was a true scion of the Wu Family.","A direct descendant of the family.","The true powerhouse of the clan soon arrived at the scene.","Clad in simple black robes, with a cold demeanor, his presence exuded absolute pressure.","In the Wu Family, an Emperor might be considered high-ranking.","But for one to reach supreme-peak, they were leaders of a faction.","However, within the clan, those who had reached the Tribulation Realm were the backbone of the entire family and clan.","They were also the capital upon which they stood in the Yue Kingdom.","And this black-robed powerhouse was one such Tribulation Realm expert.","A wandering Tribulation Realm expert, unable to transcend the Three Tribulation realm.","Even so, this individual’s strength was second only to Gu Sha that Jian Wushuang had once slain.","His divine body count was definitely above 100,000-fold.","He was a bona fide powerhouse among divine body cultivators.","His arrival instantly suppressed the formidable soul power emanating from Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s expression turned somewhat awkward; the pressure emanating from the other party was quite intense.","It was likely unfavorable for him.","“I wonder what your name is, sir?” the old man in black robes asked.","Jian Wushuang replied calmly.","“Jian Wushuang!”","At this moment, Yuchi Mingfeng also arrived.","He noticed the gathering of so many strong individuals and felt that something was amiss.","But Jian Wushuang felt a flicker of joy within him.","The powerful individual with whom he shared karma seemed to be among the present.","Immediately, he directly conveyed his message to the other party, revealing his identity.","And he recounted his encounter.","He pretended to be a reincarnation, which was true, but after all, he was the other party’s nephew!","He merely pretended to have awakened memories of his past life.","The other party would still cherish this kinship.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s transmission, Yuchi Mingfeng also felt amazed.","He never expected his nephew to be a reincarnation.","There was also some sense of loss.","His only relative turned out to be a reincarnated powerful being.","Although it was true in terms of bloodline, there were still some differences.","But since his help was needed, he wouldn’t decline.","At present, the people of the Wu Family probably wouldn’t let Jian Wushuang leave, and might even resort to killing him.","“Those unrelated, you may withdraw!” the figure in black robes gestured, signaling for them to leave.","What was to come next would be detrimental to the family if it spread.","Naturally, they didn’t want those youngsters to know.","Only Wu Qiong, Wu Yong, and Elder Bai Mei remained, knowing about the matter.","The elder in black robes turned to Yuchi Mingfeng and said, “People of Mingjiao, this matter has nothing to do with you. You may leave!”","With no room for negotiation, he directly waved his hand, tearing through the space, intending to teleport Yuchi Mingfeng away.","However, Jian Wushuang stepped forward at this moment, directly intercepting the elder.","“Elder, according to the seniority of this era, I should address you as ancestor. If there’s anything, why not just say it directly? There’s no need for such a fuss!” Jian Wushuang looked up at the elder in black robes.","Indeed, he had the blood of the Wu Family flowing in his veins.","Although it had only been three days since his reincarnation.","Yet he possessed the body of Wu Shuang.","The only difference was the soul.","Seeing this, the elder’s gaze shifted.","Meanwhile, Yuchi Mingfeng condensed a mass of divine power, walked to Jian Wushuang’s side, patted his shoulder, and transmitted the divine power into Jian Wushuang’s body.","“Wu Shuang is right. If the Wu Family finds it hard to accept, I’ll take him away!” Yuchi Mingfeng said firmly.","He had already communicated with the strong figures of nearby Mingjiao.","At present, things might not be so simple.","The other party was a Tribulation Realm powerhouse.","He was just an Immortal realm cultivator.","Even if he was a genius, capable of matching the Emperor, it wasn’t quite enough.","Seeing this, the elder suppressed the killing intent in his heart and said calmly, “Since that’s the case, let’s go to the ancestral hall!”","He was a Tribulation Realm powerhouse, so even if an Immortal was here, it wouldn’t matter much.","At worst, they could all be killed together.","The ancestral hall.","The core of the Wu Family.","The elder in black robes, Wu Changqing, was the Grand Elder of the Wu Family.","He was considered the second most important figure in the Wu Family."]},{"number":5666,"title":"Chapter 5666: Ancestral Patriarch of the Wu Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 5666: Ancestral Patriarch of the Wu Family","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","His strength ranked in the top three.","The first in strength was naturally the ancestor who founded the Wu Family.","That elder of the Wu Family who secluded himself in the Sword Mound all year round.","However, for such trivial matters, that elder wouldn’t appear.","Only when a new Tribulation Realm expert emerged in the clan would that elder make an appearance.","As for the clan’s patriarch, he is currently not in the Wu Family.","That’s why this time, Wu Changqing was sent out.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel curious.","How many Tribulation Realm experts does the Wu Family really have?","Originally thought the Wu Family had at most one supreme-peak expert.","Never expected there would actually be Tribulation Realm experts, and it seems there’s more than one.","It’s likely that all ten major families of Yue Kingdom have Tribulation Realm experts.","According to the most memorable names in memory.","Seven Star Sect, Qingyun Sect, and Yue Kingdom.","This side of spacetime is far stronger than he imagined.","Inside the clan hall, Chen Qingxuan and Wu Di were brought in by someone.","They were kneeling in the hall at this moment.","Jian Wushuang, however, sat on the left side of Wu Changqing, the elder of the Wu Family, as if he were a guest.","And Elder Bai Mei from the third branch sat on the right side.","As for Wu Qiong and Wu Yong, they didn’t even have the qualification to sit; they just stood there.","Wu Yong was not familiar with the situation. At this moment, he felt anxious. Even though he was somewhat incompetent, he could tell that today’s matter was not simple.","“Chen Qingxuan, do you acknowledge your guilt?” the elder with white eyebrows snapped.","Chen Qingxuan, who was kneeling on the ground, knew that she couldn’t hide it any longer today, so she simply confessed everything.","“Elder, everything was done by me, it has nothing to do with my son!” Chen Qingxuan buried her head between her knees.","Wu Di turned to look at his mother, his expression complex.","Chen Qingxuan didn’t know that Wu Shuang was a reincarnation, but seeing Jian Wushuang sitting beside the patriarch of the clan, she realized that things were probably not simple.","Today, she might face a catastrophe.","At this moment, Wu Changqing slowly picked up the teacup, took a sip of tea, and said calmly, “In that case, Wu Qiong will take her down and escort her to the Enforcement Hall!”","The Wu family, as a large clan, was no less than a divine kingdom, and the rules of the clan were naturally intact.","What needed to be done would be done.","It was considered fair.","Upon hearing that she was to be taken to the Enforcement Hall, Chen Qingxuan’s face showed fear.","If she entered the Enforcement Hall, she would really be finished.","But for the sake of her son.","She had no choice.","Upon hearing this, Wu Yong angrily exclaimed, “You vile woman, how could you harm my son like this!”","Taking the sword bone from Wu Shuang and transplanting it to Wu Di.","This matter was too vicious.","Finally, Chen Qingxuan glanced at her son, and as she stared at Wu Di, she shook her head.","She stood up, bowed to the several elders, and looked at Jian Wushuang, her eyes still filled with disdain and arrogance.","Jian Wushuang gripped the armrest of the chair, but inside him, there appeared a singularity.","This singularity was expanding continuously.","It was a Starry Sky.","His Origin Source, and the freedom he had obtained.","Inside the Origin Source space, there were many treasures of his, as well as his complete physical and divine body.","Now he could restore himself to his peak at any time.","His confidence surged.","“Wait!”","Chen Qingxuan, who was about to leave, was halted.","Seeing Jian Wushuang blocking the way, Wu Changqing furrowed his brows slightly, looking at Jian Wushuang and said, “Jian Wushuang, this matter concerns the Wu Family!”","“She’s surnamed Chen!” Jian Wushuang stood up slowly, replying calmly.","The next moment, his physical body began to transform in front of everyone.","A figure with white hair and a slender figure appeared before them.","As his true self appeared, the ancestral figure of the Wu Family’s Sword Tomb Mountain also opened his eyes at the same time.","Carrying the Jueyun Sword, Jian Wushuang was fully restored.","“Since I have reincarnated, I must fulfill Wu Shuang’s duties and understand his karma!” Jian Wushuang’s tone was indifferent but firm.","Even with a formidable expert of the Tribulation Realm sitting beside him.","Wu Changqing and Elder Bai Mei were astonished!","They were aware of reincarnation.","But they had never heard of reincarnation accompanied by the transfer of the physical body.","And the recovery was too quick!","The current Jian Wushuang was even difficult for Wu Changqing to fully understand.","“Tribulation Realm!” Wu Changqing stood up instantly.","He hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang to be a Tribulation Realm expert.","With his insight, unable to fully grasp Jian Wushuang’s depth, he naturally thought Jian Wushuang was a Tribulation Realm expert.","Upon hearing the term ‘Tribulation Realm’, both the Elder Bai Mei and Wu Qiong were stunned.","Both of them were Emperors and naturally knew the terror of the Tribulation Realm.","Currently, there were only five people in the Tribulation Realm in the entire Wu Family.","Two of them were at One Tribulation, two at the Two Tirbulation realm.","And one Three Tribulation ancestral figure.","As the pride of Mingjiao, Yuchi Mingfeng naturally understood the might of the Tribulation Realm and was also greatly surprised.","“What?” Chen Qingxuan was somewhat puzzled.","As a mortal being, she naturally didn’t understand the power of Tribulation Realms.","Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate. A burst of light erupted between his fingers, directly killing Chen Qingxuan.","He understood Wu Shuang’s karma.","At the same time, a hand reached out from the void and grabbed Wu Di directly in front of him.","Wu Changqing wanted to intervene, but he found himself inferior to Jian Wushuang in spatial realms.","The strong of this spacetime relied mainly on divine power.","Even though he had reached the Tribulation Realm, he wasn’t particularly proficient in spatial matters and naturally couldn’t stop Jian Wushuang.","“Jian Wushuang, you’re going too far. What Chen Qingxuan did has nothing to do with this child!” Wu Changqing advised.","After all, Wu Di was in Jian Wushuang’s hands now.","It seemed that Jian Wushuang had no sentiment towards their Wu Family anymore.","He acted directly, without any tact.","Wu Di was important to the Wu Family.","Having the sword eye, he was destined to become an Emperor, and becoming a supreme-peak figure wouldn’t be difficult.","Plus, with the current sword bone, his future achievements would be extraordinary.","An Ultimate Emperor, or even the Tribulation Realm.","That was the Tribulation Realm of Ultimate divine power!","Even the ancestors would highly regard it.","He couldn’t be killed by Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang pinched Wu Di’s neck and turned to Wu Changqing, saying coldly, “Indeed, it has nothing to do with him, but that piece of sword bone must be taken back. It doesn’t belong to him!”","After saying that, he directly took out the stolen sword bone from Wu Di’s body through his flesh.","After taking it out, Jian Wushuang handed it to Yuchi Mingfeng behind him.","“Make a grave for Wu Shuang, he’s dead!”","It was a kind of consideration.","It was also a relief.","Such talent coming to the Wu Family was unfortunate.","Yuchi Mingfeng’s eyes turned red as he took the sword bone, his gaze filled with endless anger as he looked at Wu Di in Jian Wushuang’s hand and the dead Chen Qingxuan.","Snap!","Jian Wushuang casually threw Wu Di aside, not really killing him.","He could sense that there was no real enmity from the other side towards him.","But it wasn’t good to say now.","He killed Chen Qingxuan, and Wu Di probably wished he could kill him right now.","Unfortunately, he didn’t have that strength.","Wu Yong was completely shocked by everything he saw.","His wife died instantly in front of him, and his son’s sword bone was taken back by Jian Wushuang.","For a moment, it was hard to accept.","However, Wu Qiong was the first to lift Wu Di from the ground. There was tenderness in his eyes, not because of Chen Qingxuan, but because of Wu Di now."]},{"number":5667,"title":"Chapter 5667: Ancient Moon, Jian Wushuang","paragraphs":["Chapter 5667: Ancient Moon, Jian Wushuang","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang, upon seeing this, paid no heed.","He could discern that Wu Di harbored the bloodline of Wu Qiong within him.","Perhaps Wu Yong was still unaware that his own elder brother had betrayed him.","Back when the sword bone was seized, it was likely also because of Wu Qiong.","And Chen Qingxuan’s knowledge of the probability of the sword bone residing within him was also due to Wu Qiong.","Following this line of reasoning, it seemed likely that Wu Qiong was the true culprit behind the scenes.","However, Chen Qingxuan proved to be tough enough, bearing the burden of all these matters.","Upon witnessing this scene, Wu Changqing also grasped the situation.","The fury in his heart surged to its peak at this moment.","“Get out!” Wu Changqing erupted with a formidable divine power, directly enveloping Wu Qiong and Wu Di, the father and son, and expelled them from the ancestral hall.","“He cannot leave!”","Jian Wushuang intervened with his signature move, tearing through space to intercept Wu Qiong.","Since Wu Qiong was the true culprit, he couldn’t be let off easily.","Wu Changqing was thoroughly enraged, his eyes flashing with killing intent.","Although Jian Wushuang’s strength was somewhat peculiar, his mastery of space exceeded even Wu Changqing’s, but when it came to divine power, he was inferior.","Thus, Wu Changqing had confidence.","“Jian Wushuang, don’t go too far, this is the Wu Family!”","However, Jian Wushuang shook his head and declared, “Wu Qiong must die!”","But this time, whether it was for the sake of prestige or for the descendants of the Wu Family, Wu Changqing directly took action.","His divine body erupted instantaneously, surpassing 100,000-fold.","Jian Wushuang felt this surge of power and furrowed his brows slightly.","“With just this level of strength, you can’t stop me!” Jian Wushuang’s Beast God power erupted suddenly, also surpassing 100,000-fold.","Now, when he unleashed even a fraction of his Beast God power, it could amplify his divine body to 100,000-fold.","Naturally, he was not inferior to his opponent.","Now he was the identity of this temporal river, naturally needing to use divine power.","Unless absolutely necessary, he couldn’t resort to the power of the Origin Source.","Revealing such strength would raise suspicions.","The voice of the celestial maiden upon entering this spacetime still echoed fresh in his memory.","This was the other party’s Dao Arena.","Nine heavens and Ten Earths, an entirely formidable spacetime, was unexpectedly the other party’s Dao Arena.","Just how strong was the other party?","He dared not imagine.","This figure was much more powerful than Qishen.","While using divine power to protect Yuchi Mingfeng, he confronted Wu Changqing.","“Changqing, you are no match for him!” A solemn voice echoed.","Jian Wushuang and Wu Changqing both turned their gazes towards the entrance of the clan hall.","An elderly with white hair and a youthful face stood there, holding a sword upside down, his presence akin to a sword, suppressing the area.","This was indeed the strongest individual of the Wu Clan.","“Elder Ancestor!” Wu Changqing retracted his aura and respectfully saluted.","The Wu Clan Elder Ancestor walked over slowly, devoid of any killing intent.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang also restrained his own aura.","“Wu Clan, Wu Li!”","“Ancient Moon, Jian Wushuang!”","Both of them announced their names simultaneously.","The word ‘Ancient Moon’ represented the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","As long as one was a strong individual of the Ancient Moon Spacetime, they could utter the word ‘Ancient Moon’.","In the eyes of Wu Li, this was also perhaps why Jian Wushuang didn’t want to reveal his identity.","However, Jian Wushuang sneered inwardly. The name of this Wu Clan Elder Ancestor was quite similar to the Wu Clan, quite disrespectful1.","Wu Li spoke up, “Dao Friend, care to chat?”","Jian Wushuang nodded, replying, “Let’s chat!”","He could sense the sincerity in the other’s words.","“Old Ancestor!” Wu Changqing was somewhat puzzled.","Wu Li, however, muttered in a low voice, “This is none of your business, step aside!”","Despite his grievances, Wu Changqing held deep respect for the Old Ancestor and dared not disobey, so he could only leave.","With that, there were only three people left in the grand hall.","And also Ancient Moon, who was suppressed on the side.","Jian Wushuang treated this causality, which was kind-hearted, with great courtesy.","Wu Li also politely said to Yuchi Mingfeng, “Friend from the Mingjiao Sect, please feel free to sit, it’s impolite of my Wu Family!”","This puzzled Wuche Mingfeng. If Jian Wushuang was polite, it was understandable, but why was he so polite to him?","Although he was the pride of the Mingjiao, he was just an Immortal realm cultivator after all. What would make the other party so polite to him?","Could it be because of Jian Wushuang?","Thinking of this, he understood.","Strength was paramount.","Being able to make the Old Ancestor of the Wu Family say that Wu Changqing was not as good as Jian Wushuang meant that the strength of this cheap nephew of his was on the same level as the Old Ancestor of the Wu Family, or even stronger.","After exchanging pleasantries, Jian Wushuang and Wu Li sat on either side of the main seat.","There was no designated main seat, indicating equal treatment.","Jian Wushuang was also curious whether the other party was being overly polite.","What was the purpose?","“Dao Friend, feel free to speak!” Having just entered this spacetime, he was not very clear about many things.","Naturally, he didn’t want to say much and preferred to let the other party speak.","Otherwise, he might be seen as knowing nothing and arouse suspicion.","Wu Li smiled and said, “Dao Friend Jian Wushuang, since you’re a straightforward person, I’ll be direct too!”","“Dao Friend, do you know what this is?” Wu Li produced a jade sword.","There were strange patterns on the top, and it was entirely green.","Jian Wushuang examined it carefully.","Although it was exquisitely crafted, it didn’t seem particularly special.","It could only be said to be a good item, not even considered a treasure!","“This is?” Jian Wushuang looked at Wu Li in confusion.","Wu Li awkwardly smiled and said, “Dao Friend, since we’re being open with each other, there’s no need to be so formal!”","It was evident he didn’t believe Jian Wushuang didn’t recognize the object.","But Jian Wushuang truly had no idea.","This jade sword didn’t seem to have any connection to him!","The only link could be his surname, Jian?","“I would like my friend to enlighten me,” Jian Wushuang said sincerely.","He could tell the other party wasn’t joking.","This jade sword probably had a special purpose and was related to him.","But he hadn’t used a sword here.","The fact that the jade sword was related to him could probably be because of something on him.","Like the Jueyun Sword.","Wu Li also paused, realizing Jian Wushuang really seemed to know nothing.","“Dao Friend really doesn’t recognize this item!” He still found it hard to believe, while glancing at the Jueyun Sword behind Jian Wushuang.","The aura above it, he was extremely familiar with.","Jian Wushuang still shook his head.","Seeing this, Wu Li was certain Jian Wushuang truly didn’t know.","He decided to directly explain the matter of the jade sword.","The more Jian Wushuang listened, the more incredulous he felt.","It wasn’t the jade sword itself that was unbelievable, but rather the fact that it was indeed related to the Jueyun Sword and had been passed down for a long time.","Ancient Wood Continent.","It was named Ancient Wood because at the core of the continent, there stood an ancient willow that had endured for millennia.","That was the core of the Ancient Wood Continent.","And it was also the core of the Ancient Wood Sect, one of the Eight Star Sects.","The structure of this spacetime mainly consisted of the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","And the division of power had long been intertwined with the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","Each of the ten lands had an Eight Star Sect, existing as long as the heavens and earth.","Then there were the Seven Star Sects, like the Qingyun Sect within the Yue Kingdom.","But the Seven Star Sects were all established later.","The Eight Star Sects inherited the true masters of the Ancient Moon Spacetime, the only Nine-Star Sect being the Ancient Moon Sect."]},{"number":5668,"title":"Chapter 5668: Ancient Wood Spacetime","paragraphs":["Chapter 5668: Ancient Wood Spacetime","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Amongst the Nine Star Sects, only the Ancient Moon Sect truly reigned supreme.","With some insights gleaned from Wu Li’s words, Jian Wushuang came to understand the hierarchy of these sects.","The Seven Star Sects seemed more like subsidiaries of the Eight Star Sects.","And the Eight Star Sects were in turn subservient to the Ancient Moon Sect.","It was a hierarchical structure that extended downward.","In reality, the influence throughout the Ancient Moon Spacetime was unified.","There was only one Nine Star Sect, the Ancient Moon Sect.","The Eight Star Sects, however, numbered 19 in total.","Each representing the Nine Heavens and Ten Earths.","Then came the Seven Star Sects. To establish one, it required a Seven Tribulation realm powerhouse.","This revelation greatly shocked Jian Wushuang.","In the former Moro Spacetime, there was only Qishen, a Seven Tribulation realm powerhouse.","But in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, were Seven Tribulation realm experts so common?","In Yue Kingdom alone, there was already a Seven Star Sect.","However, as he delved deeper into understanding the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he realized.","It wasn’t that the Ancient Moon Spacetime was exceptionally powerful.","It was just that this spacetime had existed for an incredibly long time.","If the former Moro Spacetime had experienced five epochs, then the Ancient Moon Spacetime had endured at least billions of epochs.","No wonder so many powerhouses had emerged.","Yet, over the years, the number of surviving Seven Tribulation Realm experts had dwindled significantly.","Most were scattered remnants after failed tribulations.","Jian Wushuang had long known that those at the Tribulation Realm were peculiar.","Once they failed in their tribulation, the weaker ones perished directly.","Some, known for their renown, severed their own tribulations.","Forever remaining trapped within a certain tribulation.","For those confident in themselves, they would cross the tribulation. If they fail, they either perish or, if their strength is formidable, they can transform into wandering Tribulation Realm cultivators.","With this in mind, Jian Wushuang thought of Qishen Temple. With Qishen’s strength at the Half-Step Eight Tribulation realm, even if he failed the tribulation, he should have become one of the strong ones amidst scattered and wandering Tribulations. How did he end up perishing?","However, now in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, he no longer thought about Moro Spacetime.","Now he was more interested in what Wu Li said.","According to Wu Li, his Jueyun Sword and the jade sword on him were master and servant.","When his true self appeared, the jade sword had undergone changes, leading him here.","Jian Wushuang drew the Jueyun Sword and handed it to Wu Li.","Wu Li also handed the jade sword to Jian Wushuang.","The two observed simultaneously.","Only when holding the jade sword did Jian Wushuang truly feel that it contained a complete divine power Origin Source.","It also contained the power of Life!","“Was this refined by Divine Wood?” Jian Wushuang finally recognized the material of the jade sword.","If it weren’t for the Origin Source, he wouldn’t have been able to tell at all.","While praising the Jueyun Sword, Wu Li smiled knowingly when Jian Wushuang discovered the jade sword’s uniqueness and said, “Dao Friend, your insight is truly extraordinary. It took this old man several years to realize the connection between the jade sword and Divine Wood!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t care about such boasting.","What he was more curious about now was why these two were connected.","The Origin Source within this jade sword was very similar to that of the Jueyun Sword.","Or rather, it was very similar to the Jueyun Sword he had nurtured.","Both contained the power of Life.","The connection between the two lay in the power of Life.","But he clearly came from a distant branch spacetime in the Starry Sky.","This Ancient Moon Spacetime was probably one of the nine core spacetimes in the Starry Sky.","How could there be a connection across such a distance?","Although curious, Jian Wushuang did not expose the Life power within his body.","He didn’t plan to reveal it later either.","Because this ability is probably related to the Ancient Wood Sect.","That’s an Eight Star Sect.","A superpower with experts in the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Stronger even than the Qishen Temple.","Although there are no experts in the Eighth Tribulation realm in the current generation.","But there are those who have failed in their tribulation in the Eighth Tribulation realm.","That alone surpasses the Qishen Temple.","Not to mention Jian Wushuang now.","So he couldn’t expose it.","Otherwise, it would be inviting disaster.","After playing with the jade sword for a while, Jian Wushuang returned it to Wu Li. However, the latter, caressing the Jueyun Sword, seemed reluctant, which amused him.","Seeing him returning the jade sword, Wu Li felt embarrassed to continue watching, so he handed the Jueyun Sword to Jian Wushuang.","After receiving it, Jian Wushuang didn’t put it into the scabbard on his back this time, but instead tucked it into his mustard seed.","After all, the current Jueyun Sword contained secrets, and he didn’t want to attract unnecessary attention.","Moreover, even Wu Li could sense the uniqueness of the Jueyun Sword.","Although he was only an expert in the Three Tribulation Realm, he had already mastered the universe, becoming a Universe Master.","But such strength is only impressive in the Yue Kingdom.","In the vast Ancient Wood Continent, it still falls short.","After all, the top sects of the Ancient Wood Continent have experts in the Eighth Tribulation realm.","There are probably quite a few in the Seventh Tribulation realm as well.","The Universe Master at the Three Tribulation realm wasn’t much in the grand scheme of things.","When faced with stronger beings at the Tribulation Realm, it was likely they could easily discern the extraordinary nature of Jueyun Sword at a glance.","He had to refine the life force within the Jueyun Sword.","He couldn’t afford to be ostentatious.","“Dao Friend, have you noticed the similarity between these two?” Wu Li asked.","Jian Wushuang nodded, seeing no reason to conceal anything.","Indeed, the Life power was the same.","It was akin to the Life force of plants and trees.","“In that case, I’ll be straightforward!” Wu Li cut to the chase this time.","Jian Wushuang shared the same anticipation.","Although the Life power was special, it didn’t warrant such treatment from Wu Li.","Perhaps this jade sword held a purpose unknown to him.","Before Wu Li spoke, he had already set up a barrier.","Their conversation was completely inaudible to Yuchi Mingfeng.","All he could see was the two of them sitting there, as if time had frozen.","Wu Li’s voice was barely audible, and his face trembled.","“Dao Friend, do you know that the Thousand Willow at the center of the Ancient Wood Continent is actually the Ten Thousand Willow, the treasure left by the celestial maiden who opened up the spacetime in the beginning!”","Jian Wushuang abruptly stood up, furrowing his brow, unable to believe his ears.","Ten Thousand Willow!","This reminded him of the Forest of Eternal Secrets.","At the same time, he understood why the Life power within the Jueyun Sword was so similar to that within the jade sword.","His Life power was comprehended from the Origin Source of All Things.","And within the Origin Source of All Things, there also existed the origin of the Forest of Eternal Secrets.","No wonder the two are connected.","Now he finally understood.","Both are manifestations of plant life.","That was the legendary Ten Thousand Willow, a Divine Tree left by the celestial maiden, far more formidable than the Forest of Eternal Secrets.","If he could obtain it, not to mention breaking through the Tribulation Realm, even reaching the Seven Tribulation realm wouldn’t be an issue.","A thought struck him, and he asked with some excitement, “Could it be related to the Ten Thousand Willow?”","He found it hard to believe.","If it were truly related, then this matter was not as simple as it seemed.","Involving the Ten Thousand Willow’s Divine Wood, if word got out, even if they had ten lives each, it wouldn’t be enough to escape death.","Wu Li was also quite frightened by this statement, and at the same time, he reinforced the barrier.","“Fellow Daoist, you mustn’t say such things!” Wu Li shook his head, then continued, “Whether it’s related to the Divine Tree or not, I don’t know, but the Ancient Wood Sect has been searching for this object, and it holds great secrets within!”"]},{"number":5669,"title":"Chapter 5669 Wanliu","paragraphs":["Chapter 5669 Wanliu","According to Wu Li’s words, although the Ten Thousand Willow’s Divine Wood belongs to the Ancient Wood Sect, the other party cannot activate the divine tree.","....","This jade sword is probably the key to activating the divine tree.","Wu Li’s words were obscure, but Jian Wushuang wasn’t foolish.","He could make connections.","However, why would such an important matter be told to him, an outsider?","Thinking this, Jian Wushuang had already begun to ponder the other party’s intentions.","Wu Li also noticed his doubts and hurriedly explained, “Dao Friend, you are not a native of the Ancient Wood Continent, so you probably don’t know that although the Divine Tree belongs to the Ancient Wood Sect, it doesn’t necessarily have to be a disciple of the Ancient Wood Sect to activate it!”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang was somewhat surprised.","“The Ten Thousand Willow is also known as the Wanliu Divine Tree. In the Eternal Wood Era on the Ancient Wood Continent, there appeared a master of Eternal Wood. He was also a powerhouse at the Six Tribulation realm who used a sword. He once used a three-foot wooden sword to activate the Wanliu Divine Tree, taking away a great opportunity from it, and achieved the strength of a Seven Tribulation realm powerhouse. In the later stage, he soared to the sky, becoming a Half-STep Eight Tribulation realm powerhouse!”","Originally a Six Tribulation realm powerhouse, it didn’t sound like there were many breakthroughs.","But how many Six Tribulation realm powerhouses could actually become a Seven Tribulation realm powerhouse, let alone reaching the Half-Step Eight Tribulation realm?","Even if they failed the tribulation, they could become wandering cultivators.","Unfortunately, like Qishen, the other party also held a determination to die, unwilling to become wandering Tribulation powerhouses even if they died.","Activate the divine tree.","Jian Wushuang took a sharp breath, extremely excited.","If this could be activated, his tribulation opportunity would come.","Not only could it help him break through, but he might also quickly become a super powerhouse in the Tribulation Realm.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s eager expression, Wu Li seized the opportunity and continued, “Dao Friend, do you know where that master of Eternal Wood came from?”","“I don’t know!” Jian Wushuang naturally didn’t know.","Wu Li answered, “The Eternal Wood Master is from the Yue Kingdom, and the current Sword Mound is where he passed away!”","When the Eternal Wood Master failed the tribulation and had only one breath left, he returned to his homeland and passed away on a bitter mountain.","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang was also very shocked!","Doesn’t this mean that Wu Li inherited the legacy of the Eternal Wood Master?","A Half-Step Eight Tribulation realm legacy.","That was a power comparable to the Qishen Temple!","Wu Li discerned Jian Wushuang’s thoughts and shook his head with a bitter smile. “Unfortunately, the Eternal Wood Master only left behind this jade sword, disappearing without leaving a trace of bones!”","Thinking about it, if Wu Li could have obtained the other party’s inheritance, he wouldn’t just be at the Three Tribulation realm like he is now.","Even a pig could become a Five Tribulation realm powerhouse.","Having heard so much, Jian Wushuang probably understood the other party’s intentions.","It seemed like they wanted to cooperate with him!","He wanted to activate the Wanliu Divine Tree.","Not to mention becoming a powerhouse like the Eternal Wood Master, at least there would be no problem for Wu Li to advance further.","Jian Wushuang could tell that the other party was not just a Tribulation Realm powerhouse; they should have been suppressing their strength all along.","They weren’t confident about crossing the tribulation.","“I’ve said so much, I believe you should understand my intentions. Within the Wanliu Divine Tree lies the core inheritance and secrets of the Ancient Wood Continent. If you and I join forces and truly enter it, becoming the Eternal Wood Master and stepping into the Five Tribulation realm for a lifetime wouldn’t be difficult!”","As the Eternal Wood Master, being at the Half-Step Eight Tribulation realm indeed made one a renowned figure.","Throughout the Ancient Wood Continent, there was only one Eight Tribulation realm powerhouse, and they were a scattered and wandering Tribulation powerhouse, the ancestor of the Ancient Wood Sect.","Having lived for who knows how many years, they never appeared.","The former Eternal Wood Master was practically invincible in the Ancient Wood Continent.","If one could successfully cross the tribulation, they would probably be the only true Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouse in the Ancient Wood Continent.","Although the Ancient Moon Spacetime was one of the Nine Cores, true Eight Tribulation realms were still rare, with most being Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouses who had failed their tribulation.","This temptation was too great.","The other party was clearly using the matter of the Eternal Wood Master to tempt him.","But right now, he was indeed falling for it.","If he wanted to quickly enhance his strength, currently, there was only this one path.","He entered the Ancient Moon Spacetime with the goal of becoming a super powerhouse within the Tribulation Realm, returning to the Qishen Temple to deal with the True Monarchs of the Original Universe, and Mie Sheng.","Mie Sheng was his number one enemy.","Only one of them could survive.","He had a premonition that even if he continued hiding in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, Mie Sheng would eventually come looking for him.","The other party had been laying out plans since the Moro Spacetime; they wouldn’t just give up like this.","In order to break through, he could only rapidly improve his strength.","Before the fall of the Qishen Temple, he needed to deal with Mie Sheng.","Mie Sheng was a Half-Step Seven Tribulation realm powerhouse, requiring at least the strength of Six Tribulation realm to return.","But even in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, it was extremely difficult to become a Six Tribulation realm expert.","Any Emperor, even a Five Tribulations realm powerhouse, couldn’t guarantee becoming a Six Tribulation realm expert.","Jian Wushuang, even with confidence, didn’t have enough time to slowly advance.","Now was an excellent opportunity.","It could allow him to rapidly break through.","Although he didn’t know what secrets lay within the Wanliu Divine Tree, or what opportunities he could obtain.","But as long as he could improve quickly, he wanted to give it a try.","This time, luck was on his side. He hadn’t expected to encounter such a thing just after crossing over.","If it weren’t for Wu Li’s greed, he probably wouldn’t have told him, and might even have killed him to seize the treasures.","Fortunately, his strength was enough to deter the other party.","Otherwise, a bitter battle would be inevitable.","Wu Li was the Universe Master. If he returned to his own Dao Arena, Jian Wushuang would have no way to deal with him.","Conversely, if Wu Li left his Dao Arena, Jian Wushuang would have no way to deal with him.","So the two could be frank with each other.","Only in this way could they cooperate and win together.","“Cooperate!” Jian Wushuang pondered for a moment.","Although he was moved, he couldn’t blindly trust the other’s words.","Wu Li also understood the gravity of the situation and had a plan in mind long ago.","He revealed all the arrangements he had made.","“Although my position in the Qingyun Sect is not top-notch, it’s still high-ranking. Moreover, I have a mistress in the Ancient Wood Sect. Her strength may not be as good as mine, but her background is strong. She’s the elder sister of the contemporary Holy Maiden of the Ancient Wood Sect. As long as you enter the Qingyun Sect and become a core member, you’ll be able to participate in Saint Gathering of the Ancient Wood Continent, and then you’ll have the chance to encounter the Wanliu Divine Tree!”","The meaning was simple: he would first enter Qingyun Sect and then, leveraging its background, plan for future participation in the Saint Gathering.","Then, during the Saint Gathering, discreetly, he would enter and activate the Divine Wood.","It sounded simple enough.","But in reality, it was far from easy.","The crux was that he was currently only an Emperor.","Yet, the other party mistook him for a Triubulation Realm expert.","Seeing the other’s sincerity, Jian Wushuang spoke frankly, revealing his true status as merely an Emperor."]},{"number":5670,"title":"Chapter 5670 You Are an Emperor?","paragraphs":["Chapter 5670 You Are an Emperor?","“Are you the Emperor?” With a sudden movement, Wu Li stood up, his eyes almost bulging out of their sockets.","....","Though he had seen much in his lifetime, he still took a moment to compose himself.","Jian Wushuang, seeing the astonishment on the other’s face, felt somewhat perplexed.","In the Moro Spacetime, figures like Emperor Jueyun could appear.","In such a vast ancient temporal river, it wouldn’t be surprising to encounter several extraordinary Emperors!","“Dao Friend Wushuang, don’t try to deceive this old man. If you are truly an Emperor, how could you master spatial manipulation so proficiently?” Wu Li asked with skepticism.","With a mere gesture, Jian Wushuang pointed out a black hole.","Then, the black hole disintegrated, transforming into a secret realm.","His current realm was very close to the Mahayana of the universe.","A perfect universe, with myriad black holes.","Within Jian Wushuang’s Spatial Origin Source, half had already been filled.","If it were an ordinary Universe Master facing Wu Li, even though the latter was a Universe Master, he would control less than 3,000 black holes.","However, each black hole contained divine power, though different from pure Origin Source, it wasn’t far off.","Jian Wushuang’s spatial realm was roughly twice as powerful as his opponent’s.","This was what astonished Wu Li.","However, it also had a great deal to do with combat prowess.","The strength demonstrated by Jian Wushuang was no weaker than that of a Three Tribulation realm.","Although the ancient temporal river was vast, there were indeed few who could rival the Universe Masters at the highest level.","Countless epochs had passed, and now there were only one or two extraordinary Emperors left.","Wu Li’s eyelids trembled, unable to shake off his amazement, and he exclaimed, “The rumors are indeed true. Extraordinary Emperors can indeed match the masters of the universe!”","“Rumors?” Jian Wushuang was surprised. “In such a vast temporal river, there should be many who are stronger than me!”","Hearing that someone might be stronger than him, Wu Li quickly shook his head, resolutely stating, “Impossible. The strongest extraordinary Emperor today, I have heard of him. He is a high priest of the Black Heaven, has been alive longer than I have, and is already at the Five Tribulation realm, but still at the peak. Rumor has it that he cultivated some kind of secret technique that requires the Mahayana of secrets to break through. However, his strength is not as terrifying as yours. A friend of mine has seen him before; his realm is inferior to yours, though his combat prowess is unknown!”","“Is his realm not as high as mine?”","Then his combat prowess must be lacking.","Now Jian Wushuang felt that his own cultivation realm was somewhat low, almost mismatched with his strength.","Since the successful Dao Merge, it seemed like he had never fully unleashed his battle strength.","He hadn’t even deployed the One Thought Universe.","Although the Starry Sky Chronicles was his strongest trump card, he had used it against Mie Sheng’s avatars.","But without the blessing of the One Thought universe, in his view, it was far from reaching its peak.","If Wu Li knew his thoughts, he would probably go crazy.","Forget about the Emperor, even if it were a Second Tribulation realm expert, with his strength and potential, they would laugh in their sleep.","It seemed that only Jian Wushuang himself was somewhat dissatisfied with his current strength!","If he truly reached the pinnacle, Jian Wushuang was confident that he could kill the Universe Master, even when he was only at the Emperor level.","Even within the opponent’s universe, he had great confidence.","The opponent had an Origin Source Universe.","He had the One Thought Universe.","And it was also a mobile Dao Arena, which was the most terrifying method.","The most perfect universe, with myriad black holes.","Although Jian Wushuang still had a long way to go, as long as he had sufficient treasures and opportunities, he could quickly reach that realm.","“What about the Ancient Moon Sect?” Jian Wushuang suddenly remembered that Nine Star Sect.","Eight Star Sects had produced Two Tribulation realm experts before. Even if there were no true Two Tribulation realm experts now, there were probably scattered Two Tribulation strength experts.","So what about the Nine Star Ancient Moon Sect?","These were the most powerful forces in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","How strong would their strongest Emperors be?","But when he uttered these words, it left Wu Li momentarily stunned. Then he squinted at Jian Wushuang, as if he thought Jian Wushuang was joking.","“The Ancient Moon Sect... Although all their members are experts of the Tribulation Realm internally, these experts, when they were Emperors, weren’t particularly outstanding, nowhere near as remarkable as that High Priest!” Wu Li paused for a moment, but still misunderstood.","Thankfully, Jian Wushuang caught on, nodded quickly, then pretended to be profound, saying, “These great powers, so mighty, often appear quite ordinary in their youth, like me, perhaps becoming a Tribulation Realm expert would be quite difficult!”","“Dao Friend Wushuang, you’re worrying too much. As long as one isn’t practicing some special secret technique, becoming a Tribulation Realm expert is as easy as pie!”","As Wu Li spoke, he brought up some rumors circulating within the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t sure if it was the other party’s temperament or if it was because he had been in a high position for too long, lacking peers to chat with, always talking endlessly.","If Jian Wushuang hadn’t come from another spacetime, he would have grown impatient long ago.","Fortunately, he needed to know these rumors now, otherwise, if he remained clueless when questioned later, wouldn’t it raise suspicions like a fool?","Seeing Jian Wushuang listening with relish, Wu Li completely opened up.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime was vast and full of opportunities.","Becoming a Tribulation Realm expert wasn’t difficult.","What was difficult was the strength of each tribulation, obliterating countless Tribulation Realm experts.","Just the inheritance of the Tribulation Realm in the Ancient Moon Spacetime was too numerous to count.","The accumulation of experience in becoming a Tribulation Realm expert was extremely rich.","So Wu Li felt that becoming a Tribulation Realm expert wasn’t difficult.","What was difficult was how to traverse the path beyond the Tribulation Realm.","From the first tribulation, all the way to the ninth tribulation!","Although the Eight Tribulation realm was rare, there were still some rumors about it.","However, the existence of the Nine Tribulation realm was unheard of.","Even within the Ancient Moon Sect, there was no one at the Nine Tribulation realm.","The only recorded individual at the Nine Tribulation realm was the celestial maiden who opened the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","But after opening this path in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, that celestial maiden fell.","Following her, there was never another Nine Tribulation realm expert. The strongest were only at the Half-Step Nine Tribulation realm.","Of course, some boasted about being able to match the Nine Tribulation realm, but since no one had seen it, who knew if they could truly match it.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime didn’t have it.","But there were Eight Tribulation realm experts who, while traveling to other spacetimes, encountered NIne Tribulation realm experts roaming the boundless Starry Sky.","Their divine bodies were like cosmic giants, exceedingly dazzling.","Even Eight Tribulation realm experts couldn’t get close, let alone engage in conversation.","Jian Wushuang listened with fascination.","Especially when it came to the Nine Tribulation realm.","Roaming the Starry Sky.","Their divine bodies were like cosmic giants.","Even Eight Tribulation realm experts were not qualified to approach.","How powerful must they be?","Was Teacher Xuan Yi at that level?","Jian Wushuang had many doubts in his heart.","Things like Temporal Treasures were probably created by these great beings.","The Nine Tribulation realm, an existence akin to eternity.","They were transcendent beings.","Unbound by control or constraint, unaffected by time.","Utter freedom!","Whenever he reached that level, he must explore the entire expanse of the Starry Sky.","Witness anything within the boundless expanse of time.","As the two conversed more eagerly, they forgot about the passage of time."]},{"number":5671,"title":"Chapter 5671: Qingyun Sect","paragraphs":["Chapter 5671: Qingyun Sect","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Nowadays, there were rumors circulating outside about a mysterious powerful figure emerging from the Wu Family.","Meanwhile, a strong figure from the Ming Sect had also arrived at the Wu Family, seeking out Yuchi Mingfeng.","“Let’s settle it today!” Wu Li spoke up. “Dao Friend Jian Wushuang, I have already contacted the steward of the Qingyun Sect. You can head to the Qingyun Sect at any time. Once you’re there, we can discuss further!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and replied, “Then I’ll wait for your message at the Qingyun Sect.”","The matter regarding the Wanliu Divine Tree wasn’t as simple as it seemed.","It required careful consideration.","Just Wu Li’s plan alone was quite elaborate.","First, he needed to enter the Qingyun Sect as a friend of Wu Li’s, and then, as a disciple of the Qingyun Sect, proceed to the Ancient Wood Sect to participate in the Saint Gathering Sacred Assembly.","However, the timing of the Sacred Assembly was always different.","Every time the Sacred Assembly was held, a Holy Maiden from the Ancient Wood Sect would appear.","Wu Li learned from his mistress that the current Holy Maiden was about to undergo tribulation and had no confidence in surviving it. She was already making arrangements for her succession.","At this point, they began to set up their plans, not a moment too soon.","If they waited for the Holy Maiden to fall, the Ancient Wood Sect would take precautions and initiate the Sacred Assembly, inviting all the strong figures from the Ancient Wood Continent to the core of the continent to participate.","Unfortunately, the Ancient Wood Sect only had a Holy Maiden, not a Holy Son.","Otherwise, Jian Wushuang could have tried his luck.","After breaking the barrier, Yuchi Mingfeng finally relaxed seeing the two of them unharmed.","“Wu Li, I’ll take my leave now!” Jian Wushuang clasped his fists and then enveloped Yuchi Mingfeng with a strand of Thought power, tearing through the space and leaving the main hall directly.","Sensing Jian Wushuang’s departure, Wu Li pondered for a long time.","This time, he was quite lucky.","Such a significant opportunity had landed on his head.","Originally, he also had hopes of activating the Wanliu Divine Tree, but unfortunately, the Life power above the jade sword was gradually diminishing, which significantly reduced the probability of success.","However, he didn’t inform Jian Wushuang about this.","Typically, it was the strong figures of the Ancient Wood Sect who activated the Wanliu Divine Tree, monopolizing those special Life power.","The ordinary sects had no qualifications to obtain it.","“Tsk tsk, I hope I didn’t misjudge things!”","Wu Li’s figure also faintly disappeared.","Silence enveloped the hall.","The matter concerning the Wu family was not much of a disturbance, and very few people were aware of it.","Not long after Jian Wushuang left, news spread of Wu Li receiving his friends, marking the hidden identity of Jian Wushuang’s reincarnation.","In just three days, Jian Wushuang returned to his peak, officially stepping into the vast and turbulent Ancient Moon Spacetime.","And just as he arrived, he encountered a significant opportunity.","Among the ten individuals, his luck could be said to be top-notch.","The luck of the others wasn’t as good.","The Ancient Wood Continent.","The Sixteen Kingdoms of Green Grass.","The Yue Kingdom was just one of them.","It was considered a medium-sized kingdom or country.","The one ruling over the Sixteen Kingdoms was not the Eight Star Sect of the Ancient Wood Sect, but rather the largest spacetime secret realm above the Ancient Wood Continent.","Within it lay the strongest divine-level kingdom among the Sixteen Kingdoms, the ‘Shi Kingdom’!","After 10,000 years since the reincarnation of the ten individuals from the Qishen Temple.","A peerless genius appeared in the Shi Kingdom.","Born as an Immortal realm cultivator, she had become peerlessly perfect in 10,000, almost invincible at the same level, able to rival ordinary experts in the Tribulation realm.","With the power of flames coursing through her body, she traversed the sky.","As her phoenix eyes opened, the sun rose.","“Fan Tianfeng!”","She was none other than Fan Feng, the leader of the 18 Divine Generals of the Qishen Temple, reincarnated.","She and Jian Wushuang reincarnated into the Ancient Wood Continent together, but their backgrounds were worlds apart.","Fan Feng’s identity after reincarnation was no less than that of the Qishen Temple.","She was the descendant of the ancient family of the flame god Hou Yi, possessing absolute bloodline power.","Actually, recovering to the peak in 10,000 years was considered a normal speed, and even somewhat slow.","But she had completely integrated into the cultivation system of the Ancient Moon Spacetime, equivalent to a complete re-cultivation, hence the slow speed.","However, the increase in strength was very significant.","Now her combat power was several times stronger than before reincarnation.","Otherwise, she wouldn’t be invincible at the same level within the Shi Kingdom.","Perhaps only the geniuses of the Ancient Wood Sect could rival her.","“The Holy Maiden of Ancient Wood?” Fan Feng, bathed in flames, smiled.","She was now the direct descendant of the Flame God Clan, with the richest bloodline among them, holding an extremely high status. She naturally disdained the position of the Holy Maiden.","Even though she had been cultivating in the Shi Kingdom all along, she managed to break through to the realm of Tribulation.","Within the Dao Arena of the Flame God Clan.","Fan Tianfeng received a transmission from the ancestor, instructing her to participate in the Ancient Wood Sect’s assembly ten years later to vie for the position of the Holy Maiden.","Although she was somewhat puzzled, she couldn’t refute the ancestor’s command.","Moreover, she came to the Ancient Moon Spacetime to become stronger, so there was no reason not to go.","At the same time.","The geniuses of the Sixteen Kingdoms almost all received a similar order to attend the assembly of the Ancient Wood Sect.","Regardless of gender!","Not only for the position of Holy maiden, but also because this sacred assembly would produce four spots, which were important for many superpowers.","The Emperor and the Realm of Tribulation each had four spots.","So this time, it was not only about the competition for the Emperor’s position, but also about personally going to compete.","In the Yue Kingdom, within the Seven Star Sect, the Qingyun Sect.","Jian Wushuang had been in the Qingyun Sect for thousands of years, but this amount of time was too short for cultivators.","So even after staying for such a long time, he still hadn’t thoroughly understood the Qingyun Sect.","Let alone becoming a core member.","Although his strength was formidable, he was still an outer disciple, usually dealing with trivial matters.","This was all thanks to the effect of Wu Li’s personal recommendation. If it weren’t for the recommendation, he probably wouldn’t even have been able to become an outer disciple.","He could only run errands.","“Greetings, disciple!”","On this day, Jian Wushuang, as usual, headed to the Shenji Hall. Every outer disciple he encountered paid their respects to him.","Jian Wushuang just nodded lightly, without stopping his steps, and headed straight to the backyard of the Shenji Hall.","This place was important to the Qingyun Sect, and it was where the sect missions were assigned.","Jian Wushuang needed to come here every year.","Sometimes three or four times a year. Over thousands of years, he was already familiar with the place.","“Jian Wushuang, you’re quite early today!” In the rear courtyard, within a secluded hall, Jian Wushuang had just entered when he heard a familiar voice calling out.","Jian Wushuang quickly clasped his fists and replied, “Isn’t it Elder Muchen’s birthday today? He has shown me kindness, so I came to seek a precious item!”","After joining Qingyun Sect, he had become a disciple of Elder Muchen due to his relationship with Wu Li. Elder Muchen’s strength was not inferior to Wu Li’s, and his background within the sect was strong as well.","Following him over the years, Jian Wushuang hadn’t suffered any losses.","The main reason was Elder Muchen’s connection to the royal family of Yue Kingdom.","Wu Li had instructed him to curry favor with Elder Muchen to set up their plans.","For these years within Qingyun Sect, Jian Wushuang had been mostly pleasing Elder Muchen.","Coincidentally, Elder Muchen also held him in high regard."]},{"number":5672,"title":"Chapter 5672: Hundred Flowers Mountain","paragraphs":["Chapter 5672: Hundred Flowers Mountain","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","When he first entered the trial of the Qingyun Sect, he, with the talent of an Emperor, erupted with 90,000-fold divine power, showing astonishing potential, not weaker than some of the core disciples within the sect.","With the added relationship with Wu Li, he was nurtured as if he were a trusted confidant.","Many internal matters were left for Jian Wushuang to handle.","Even the matter of taking concubines was managed diligently by Jian Wushuang.","Now, on the occasion of a grand celebration, Jian Wushuang couldn’t afford to neglect it.","So, according to the information provided by Wu Li, he came to the Shenji Hall to find the Elder Mu Chen for the usual Hundred Flowers Vine.","This plant grows within the borders of Yue Kingdom, not particularly rare, but obtaining it could be somewhat troublesome.","However, for Jian Wushuang, none of this posed a problem.","“The Hundred Flowers Vine?”","Upon hearing this name, the person behind the counter revealed a look of surprise and cautioned, “Don’t blame me for being meddlesome, but the Hundred Flowers Vine is not simple. Even Tribulation Realm experts find it hard to obtain. Why not buy some ready-made instead?”","But Jian Wushuang insisted repeatedly, and the other party didn’t say much more, simply handing over some information about the Hundred Flowers Vine.","“All the information about the Hundred Flowers Vine is here, take a look at your leisure!”","In the eyes of the other party, Jian Wushuang also had a background, and those like them who could enter the Shenji Hall were all from prominent families.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang was treated equally.","If it were just an ordinary steward with no background, they might have given him a hard time but offered some benefits.","Jian Wushuang smiled, thanked them, copied the information from the jade slip, and left the Shenji Hall.","After leaving the Shenji Hall, he headed straight for his cave dwelling.","It was located on the waist of Mount Li within the Qingyun Sect, in a position that didn’t attract much attention.","On the entire mountain, there was only his cave dwelling.","The spiritual energy here was average, not attracting other stewards.","Jian Wushuang was quite satisfied with this place because of its seclusion.","After entering the cave dwelling, he directly activated the prohibition array.","Then, he took out a simple and ancient mirror.","With a light touch, a faint figure appeared above it.","“Brother Wu Li, this time Elder Muchen will go to the capital to celebrate his birthday. It’s a rare opportunity!” Jian Wushuang couldn’t contain his excitement in his heart.","After planning for thousands of years, the first step was about to be taken.","The figure of Wu Li in the mirror looked grim. He wasn’t particularly concerned about Elder Muchen’s matter and reminded, “I recently lost contact with someone from the Ancient Wood Sect. There might be some big moves happening soon. Be careful in everything!”","“That’s where Muchen is!” Jian Wushuang exclaimed, surprised. “It’s been such a long time, it would be a waste to give up now!”","Now, he was feeling somewhat hesitant.","Muchen was the prince of the Yue Kingdom’s royal family, the current Empress of Yue, and also his younger sister.","What’s more crucial, the current Crown Princess is seeking a consort!","Moreover, that Crown Princess’s strength is formidable, almost sweeping through the entire realm of the Yue Kingdom’s Emperor level.","She is the most hopeful candidate from the Yue Kingdom to compete for the position of the Holy Maiden in the Ancient Wood Sect.","Wu Li and Jian Wushuang were keen on each other because of this point, which led them to curry favor with Muchen.","Although Elder Muchen’s strength was only average, having a good younger sister, whose strength reached the Half-Step Six Tribulation realm, made her one of the top superpowers in the Yue Kingdom.","After all, the Qingyun Sect currently didn’t even have a true Six Tribulation realm, only scattered strong individuals with the power of the Six Tribulation realm.","Moreover, that Crown Princess, having grown up without a father, was well taken care of by Muchen, and the two had a very good relationship.","If it weren’t for this relationship, given Muchen’s strength, Jian Wushuang wouldn’t even bother with her.","After hearing this, Wu Li pondered for a moment before saying, “Muchen’s birthday celebration this time will be held in the capital. We’ll go together then, and I’ve already figured out a plan!”","After the two agreed, they severed contact.","Everything was under control.","However, Jian Wushuang didn’t inquire about the plan in detail, figuring they would discuss it when they met.","But the general strategy seemed somewhat clandestine.","To become a consort wouldn’t be a loss for him, but he had heard that the Crown Princess was rather robust.","He was afraid he couldn’t handle it.","For the sake of opportunity, he had to give his all!","With a determined bite, Jian Wushuang prepared to go and search for the Hundred Flowers Vine.","Yue Kingdom, Border Province Capital.","This place was located to the south with a lot of mountains and forests.","It wasn’t surprising; in the Ancient Wood Continent, opportunities entirely covered the mountains and forests.","The earth was flourishing.","The Hundred Flowers Vine grew on the Hundred Flowers Mountain in the Border Province.","Jian Wushuang tore through the void, and after a day’s effort, he arrived at the Hundred Flowers Mountain.","This time, he went all in. The Hundred Flowers Mountain was guarded by flower demons, among which were those at the Tribulation level.","The Hundred Flowers Vine withered day by day.","At most, it could be prolonged for three days.","That’s why this place hadn’t been divided by major forces.","The main reason was the strength of the Flower Demon King on the mountain.","It was rumored to be on par with Four Tribulation. Even the Universe Masters would detour when they came.","It wasn’t easy to take, and with the vine withering every day, if luck wasn’t on one’s side, by the time the Hundred Flowers Vine withered, one might not even have left the Hundred Flowers Mountain.","The Hundred Flowers Mountain was divided into six layers.","The lower three layers were fine, with few Tribulation Realm flower demons.","But the upper three layers were almost all inhabited by flower demons.","As for the Hundred Flowers Vine, it wasn’t the only treasure on the mountain.","Jian Wushuang needed to reach the fourth layer to find the Hundred Flowers Vine. If he wanted to time it right, he needed to enter the fifth layer.","There was still a month left until Muchen’s birthday celebration.","He needed to sneak into the fourth layer and wait in the dark.","When the time was right, he would then proceed to the fifth layer.","Once he found the Hundred Flowers Vine, he had to leave immediately and arrive in the capital before the first withering, at the peak speed, he could reach it in an hour.","The only variable was going down the mountain.","Flower demons dwelled on the Hundred Flowers Vine. If stolen, it would surely attract pursuit.","Wanting to descend the mountain within a day, even Jian Wushuang didn’t have much confidence.","After all, this was the territory of the flower demons.","If it were just a single Three Tribulation realm flower demon, he would have the ability to escape.","But there were quite a few Three Tribulation realm flower demons in the fifth level.","Even that Flower Demon King occasionally ventured into the fifth level.","If he encountered that one, it would be all over.","In a short time, he definitely couldn’t free himself.","If push comes to shove, he could only use the power of Life.","These flower demons probably couldn’t comprehend the uniqueness of the power of Life.","Of course, he also feared that there were other cultivators here who could see through it.","Now, he also had a rough understanding of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Wu Li was able to see the special nature of the power of Life from the Jueyun Sword because Wu Li originally had the jade sword. Others might not necessarily be able to see it.","“Why is this old guy so fixated on this!” Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly.","It made him extremely passive now.","In fact, the Hundred Flowers Vine wasn’t particularly special.","The Hundred Flower Vine could enhance divine power and be used to refine divine pills, but these could also be achieved after withering.","The most precious aspect of fresh Hundred Flowers Vine was its ability to nurture the Origin Source divine power.","It contained the pure source of plants and trees, which could make divine power extremely vigorous.","Divine power differed from the Origin Source.","To maintain vigorous divine power continuously, what was needed wasn’t just secret techniques and realms, but more importantly, the nourishment of treasures."]},{"number":5673,"title":"Chapter 5673 Harvesting","paragraphs":["Chapter 5673 Harvesting","Jian Wushuang empathized deeply.","....","His divine body was forged through the use of treasures.","Although the Ancient Moon Spacetime boasted a perfect method for cultivating divine bodies, it was still challenging, not much easier than cultivating through the Origin Source.","Yet, enhancement through treasures was swifter.","When Jian Wushuang utilized the skeleton of Dong Jun to enhance his divine body, he multiplied his power tens of thousands of times in just a few hundred years.","If in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, practicing the highest level of divine body cultivation techniques, it would probably take several epochs.","Thinking of this, a smirk played on Jian Wushuang’s lips.","When he left the Qishen Temple, Zhen Ling actually gifted him Dong Jun’s skeleton.","Over the past ten thousand years, his foundational divine body had already increased by more than 90,000-fold, almost reaching the perfect 100,000-fold.","During his time in the Qishen Temple, as an Emperor, he had achieved 80,000-fold.","However, the Ancient Moon Spacetime was different. Due to the main focus on divine power cultivation, an Emperor could increase their divine power to 100,000-fold times, reaching the perfect state to transcend tribulations.","Jian Wushuang was now very close to 100,000-fold divine power.","Once his foundational divine power reached 100,000-fold, when he unleashed the power of the Threefold Beast God, at that time, merely by exerting divine power alone, he could rival a strong opponent at the level of the Three Tribulation realm.","If it weren’t for the prohibition imposed by the Zhen Ling on this skeleton of Dong Jun, he would have eagerly devoured it entirely.","Unfortunately, he was only an Emperor now.","The restrictions above required him to reach 100,000-fold before he could unlock them.","Zhen Ling feared he might dismantle the skeleton and sell it, hence imposed the prohibition out of concern.","This could only be seen as a narrow-minded move on their part.","In the Qishen Temple, the Emperor’s divine power would reach perfection at 80,000-fold.","Things were different here; it was not a complete success, but with the skeletal remains of Dong Jun, he could go much farther.","When the time comes, he would dismantle Dong Jun’s framework, devouring each bone one by one.","After reaching the Tribulation Realm, he wouldn’t need to worry about enhancing his divine power anymore.","All he needed to do was to scour the ancient Moon Spacetime for treasures that could enhance his Origin Source.","Divine power was primary, Origin Source was secondary.","Naturally, treasures related to Origin Source were not as valuable as divine power treasures.","But he prioritized the Origin Source over divine power.","He could definitely make a hefty profit.","When the time comes, he would exchange all the divine body treasures he obtained for Origin Source treasures.","“Fortune is right before my eyes!” Jian Wushuang’s figure kept shuttling and had already entered the Hundred Flowers Mountain.","And indeed, fortune lay before him.","Being able to enter the Ancient Moon Spacetime was the greatest opportunity.","After entering the first level, Jian Wushuang didn’t linger.","He concealed his figure and relied on the realm of space. Those Emperor-level flower spirits couldn’t see him at all.","He easily entered the second layer.","It was also on the second layer that he encountered many cultivators.","However, these cultivators were already obsessed.","In the first three layers of Hundred Flowers Mountain, there were countless flower spirits and beauties, and these cultivators had already become engrossed in them.","This was also the most distinctive treasure of the first three layers of Hundred Flowers Mountain.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but sigh.","While it was true that the scenery was beautiful, it was more like a human hell.","Even the hearts of the strong were worn away.","He couldn’t stay here for long.","Jian Wushuang accelerated, directly passing through the first three layers and entering the fourth layer.","After reaching the fourth layer, he calmed down a lot.","There were hardly any cultivators to be seen, and the flower spirits and demons here were also violent, far from the seductive feeling of the first three layers.","Jian Wushuang also figured out the reason.","These flower spirits devoured the divine power inside the cultivators’ bodies to enhance their strength.","It was a shortcut, but it also had backlash.","After becoming a Tribulation Realm, her character became more erratic and violent.","Jian Wushuang, however, found the devouring power within them quite intriguing. Being able to devour divine power, it reminded him of himself.","He too could devour.","Back then, he had devoured the divine body of his opponents, then transformed it into divine power.","However, he soon discovered the repercussions involved, so he stopped doing so.","At most, after taking the opponent’s divine body, he would refine it into pure divine power before devouring it.","It was somewhat troublesome, not as convenient as directly seeking out treasures of divine bodies to devour.","Seeing these flower spirits now, he became interested again.","He wanted to take the opportunity to study them.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime was mainly about divine power.","If he could improve the backlash during devouring, the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime would become his garden.","Unfortunately, things were never that simple.","If he really did that, he was afraid he would follow the path of Mie Sheng.","If Mie Sheng devoured the power of Life, he would achieve perfection.","The entire spacetime would become a cycle of reincarnation. It would become Mie Sheng’s Dao Arena.","Although it was also an invincible path, it definitely wasn’t the path Jian Wushuang would take.","Even if in the future, he killed Mie Sheng and devoured the power of Death, he wouldn’t achieve invincibility through the power of reincarnation.","Instead, he would continue on his own path.","The Origin Source spacetime was the true path in the Starry Sky.","Although the Ancient Moon Spacetime was strong, it followed the path of divine power.","To forcefully break through all laws might be domineering, but it was too difficult.","Assistance was acceptable.","Spacetime was the only way.","Traveling through time and space would be even more exhilarating.","Moreover, due to his Extreme Dao affinity, he was even more suitable for the spacetime path.","After observing for a long time, Jian Wushuang still couldn’t understand the devouring power of these flower demons.","Thinking about it, it made sense. Initially, Mie Sheng, to open up a new path, didn’t know how much time it took. How could it be easy for him to succeed?","Concealed in the fourth layer, Jian Wushuang transformed into a piece of rubble, lurking faintly in a stream.","Time flew by.","A month’s time was nothing but a sigh.","On this day, as the stone that Jian Wushuang had transformed into flowed along the stream, preparing to advance to the fifth layer, he sensed a fluctuation of divine power.","“Hmm?”","“Is it a commotion coming from the fifth layer?”","Jian Wushuang was somewhat surprised.","He hadn’t expected his luck to be this good.","If there was a fight on the fifth level, it would help him attract many flower spirits and demons. He could take the opportunity to collect the Hundred Flowers Vine.","It was a perfect opportunity, and he naturally wouldn’t let it slip by.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang directly transformed back into his true form and effortlessly tore through the space, entering the fifth level.","Before him lay a scene of serenity, with flowers blooming under the full moon.","It was precisely midnight.","Everything seemed tranquil.","However, the divine power fluctuation grew stronger.","It wasn’t just one person’s aura.","There were at least three Tribulation Realm existences.","Jian Wushuang didn’t dare to be careless. He cautiously used his Thought power to explore, beginning to search for the Hundred Flowers Vine.","Fortunately, the fifth level wasn’t too large, and his THought power could cover a tenth of it.","Expanding further would risk exposure. Although Jian Wushuang was pressed for time, he didn’t want to mess up his own plan.","Within just the time it takes for an incense stick to burn, he discovered a section of Hundred Flowers Vine in the southeast direction.","Moreover, it seemed there were 400 flower spirit seeds above it.","It far exceeded the average Hundred Flowers Vine.","It is rumored that on the sixth level, there is a Thousand Flowers Vine.","Whether it’s true or not, no one knows.","No one knew.","Initially, there was an unbelieving Emperor of the Five Tribulation realm who went to investigate, but in the end, he left empty-handed.","This place is the lair of the flower demons. Even if it’s on the sixth floor, the Five Tribulation experts wouldn’t gain any advantage by going there.","Jian Wushuang dared not dwell on it any longer.","He was already satisfied with the vine ith 400 flower seeds before him.","With this item, if brought out,","It would be more than enough to offer blessings to Muchen."]},{"number":5674,"title":"Chapter 5674: Mysterious Girl","paragraphs":["Chapter 5674: Mysterious Girl","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang moved slowly, finding only ten flower demons at the Two Tribulation realm nearby, not even a single one at the Three Tribulation realm, which was indeed a golden opportunity.","Seizing this Hundred Flowers Vine, he could leave in an instant.","There were still ten hours left until the banquet arranged by Muchen.","He had plenty of time.","Hundred Flowers Mountain, fifth layer.","“Young Master, I’ve restrained a large number of flower demons. We can take action now!” an elderly man in green clothes said, his divine power surging violently.","He alone held back several flower demons at the Tribulation Realm.","Behind him were two other Tribulation Realm powerhouses, both formidable, at least at the Three Tribulation level.","However, these two Three Tribulation realm powerhouses were not Universe Masters.","They were wandering Tribulation experts.","Compared to genuine Tribulation Realm experts, wandering Tribulation experts lacked a Dao Arena.","By severing their own Dao, their Dao Arena and universe naturally collapsed.","But the man in green clothes was a genuine Universe Master, with strength several times greater than those two wandering Tribulation Realm experts.","He alone held back a large number of flower demons, including several at the Three Tribulation realm.","In a secluded thicket, a young girl in a light blue skirt had pointed ears and bright green eyes, giving her a mischievous look.","Upon hearing the transmission from the old man, her divine power didn’t erupt, but her speed was exceptionally fast.","With a few flashes, she broke free from the encirclement of flower demons, heading straight for the Hundred Flowers Vine with 400 flower seeds.","However, she was unaware that someone had already seized the opportunity.","“Hmm?”","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly, sensing a very faint force approaching, not threatening, but peculiar.","He didn’t dare to be careless, so after carefully storing the Hundred Flowers Vine, he concealed his figure, preparing to leave.","Those flower demons couldn’t detect him at all.","However, after the Hundred Flowers Vine was stolen, many flower demons glanced around, emitting sharp, piercing sounds, unusually grating to the ears.","Jian Wushuang’s figure gradually materialized under the rippling sound waves.","“They still possess this kind of ability?” Jian Wushuang marveled.","He had encountered similar melodies on the Demon Sound Mountain.","The moment his figure was exposed, he abandoned all disguise and directly erupted with nearly 100,000-fold divine power, recklessly departing.","The young demoness rushing from below, upon unexpectedly encountering a mysterious powerful being, felt a shock in her heart.","Then, realizing the mystery and glancing towards the Hundred Flowers Vine, her expression darkened, puffing her cheeks in frustration.","“Elder Feng, the Hundred Flowers Vine has been snatched away by another powerful individual. Hurry to the fourth level and intercept this person!”","The plot they had planned for so long had been usurped by someone else, leaving the girl infuriated.","Unfortunately, she hadn’t reached the Tribulation Realm yet; otherwise, she would have slaughtered the other party on the spot.","However, the next moment, upon sensing the fluctuation of the mysterious strongman’s divine power, a cold smile crept onto her lips.","“His divine power is less than 100,000-fold!”","Buzz!","The girl soared into the air, her power bursting forth. Although not in the Tribulation Realm, she possessed over 100,000-fold divine power. With the aid of her body-transforming treasures, her divine power could amplify to around 120,000-fold.","Jian Wushuang, who was about to leave, was somewhat surprised to see the girl blocking his path. A mere Emperor, unexpectedly so powerful.","Of course, it was just a passing exclamation.","She must be a genius from some major clan; otherwise, she wouldn’t have come to the fifth layer of the Hundred Flowers Mountain.","Presumably, she was also here for the Hundred Flowers Vine.","However, the treasures in his possession wouldn’t be easy to snatch away.","Jian Wushuang stood proudly, indifferently saying, “Little girl, I advise you to step aside!”","He didn’t have time to conflict with these people now.","“Stealing my opportunity and then asking me to step aside? You’re quite audacious!”","The girl stood with hands on her hips, staring at Jian Wushuang, showing no intention of backing down. Instead, she was preparing to take down Jian Wushuang.","Though an Emperor, her strength could rival that of an average Tribulation Realm expert.","In her eyes, Jian Wushuang was nothing more than an ordinary Tribulation Realm cultivator, with his divine power not even reaching 100,000-fold.","He was simply not her match.","Jian Wushuang slowly raised his arm, curling his fingers slightly into a fist, finally realizing what was happening.","He was being treated like a soft target.","A mere Emperor, even if comparable to a Tribulation Realm cultivator, was insignificant in his presence.","“Then let’s do this!” Jian Wushuang suddenly clenched his fist, roaring angrily as his divine power surged abruptly.","The immense power brought forth a gust of wind, toppling countless trees and shrubs around him.","His divine power, which had been close to 100,000-fold, skyrocketed in an instant to 130,000-fold.","The mischievous and astute girl exclaimed, “You’re quite nimble, I must say. I didn’t expect your divine power to reach 130,000-fold. But this level of strength isn’t enough!”","With that, she dared to strike first.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t anticipated the confidence the girl displayed, knowing full well she only had 120,000-fold divine power, yet she dared to challenge him.","As the girl rushed forward, Jian Wushuang’s true body had long departed, leaving only an afterimage behind.","Her attack missed its mark, and as the girl hastily turned her head to search for Jian Wushuang’s whereabouts, he, being a seasoned veteran of combat, wasn’t about to make it that easy.","In the instant the girl turned, he appeared above her, hands crossing as he delivered a powerful blow that sent her plummeting from the sky.","Then, relying on his agility, he swiftly returned to the ground, injecting the power of All Things into his divine body with one hand before the girl could land. He unleashed a force exceeding 150,000-fold divine power.","This force formed a pillar of light that soared straight into the sky.","That girl, even if she didn’t die, would surely be gravely injured.","In the heat of the battle, it lasted but a moment, and Jian Wushuang acted swiftly.","“I’ve told you, step aside!” Jian Wushuang shook his head with a wry smile.","He thought he had dealt with his opponent already, but as he turned to leave, he felt a formidable force rising behind him.","That force erupted into blazing flames.","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows.","As he slowly turned around, the fire illuminated half of his face. Behind him, there appeared an immensely huge mass of roots and vegetation, continuously growing.","This scene instantly caught the attention of the flower demons.","Originally engaged in besieging the Three Tribulation realm experts, they now went berserk upon witnessing this scene.","Even the sixth-layer flower demons and spirits were alarmed.","“This?”","The old man in green clothes turned pale, trembling as he said, “The young lady has activated the prohibition. Hurry, go help, or else the backlash will devour her!”","“Steward, notify the mansion immediately!”","“If something happens to the young lady, we won’t be able to bear the consequences!”","Gritting his teeth, the old man in green clothes, who had sneaked out with the young lady this time, knew that seeking help might bring punishment upon them.","But not seeking help now might lead to dire consequences they couldn’t bear.","After a moment of hesitation, the green-clothed steward finally nodded in agreement.","He relayed the message back to a certain mansion in Yue Country, and then the three of them rushed towards the direction where the young lady’s power was erupting."]},{"number":5675,"title":"Chapter 5675: You’ve Angered Me!","paragraphs":["Chapter 5675: You’ve Angered Me!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, Jian Wushuang realized that the flower demons had already surrounded him, making it impossible to break free.","Moreover, the mysterious girl suddenly erupted, probably feeling desperate. Now, he couldn’t escape anymore. He wished he had sought out other Hundred Flowers Vines earlier.","Encountering such a tricky situation now.","It wasn’t fear that gripped him but annoyance.","However, this sealed environment had its benefits for him.","He could boldly display his strength without fear of prying eyes.","Within the flames.","The green aura on the girl’s body transformed into a fiery red.","Her eyes were like bells, filled with anger.","And behind her stood a bear-shaped ancient tree with a spherical form.","“You, have angered me!” The girl pointed her finger.","Her divine power erupted once more, soaring from 120,000-fold to a staggering 150,000-fold.","Jian Wushuang was shocked!","A divine body of 150,000-fold, already at the level of the Two Tribulation realm.","For an Emperor to possess such strength was astonishing.","Among the ten members of their Qishen Temple, perhaps only Hu Qing and himself had this level of combat power.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime was indeed one of the Nine Core Temporal Rivers.","Even within the borders of Yue Kingdom, encountering such formidable individuals was commonplace.","Unfortunately, she had picked the wrong person.","“You, an Emperor, possessing such strength, is impressive, but still not enough!” Jian Wushuang’s aura surged outward. This time, he wasn’t planning to leave in a hurry.","After all, there was still half a day left, so he could play with her for a while.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, the girl’s expression changed dramatically, disbelief evident as she said, “You can tell that I’m an Emperor?”","Her identity was extremely noble, possessing the ancestral treasure of her family, which could conceal her own tribulation realm. The ancestor had mentioned that unless one was a powerhouse in the Tribulation Realm, they couldn’t see through her realm at all.","Could it be that the other party was disguised as a veteran of the Tribulation Realm?","Thinking of this, the young girl felt a bit afraid.","Jian Wushuang saw the expression on the other party’s face and realized he had misspoken again.","As a practitioner of the Spacetime Origin Source, he could directly perceive the other party’s cultivation realm, which was easy for him.","However, the Ancient Moon Spacetime mainly relied on divine power.","“Cough, with my discerning eye, how could I not see through a little girl like you?” Jian Wushuang feigned a profound appearance.","At the same time, he looked up at the giant bear-like creature, sensing an aura surpassing 150,000-fold divine power.","It was a tough opponent.","Moreover, the flower demons had already gathered around.","This time, he wanted to leave, but it seemed impossible; he could only fight.","Seeing the girl hesitating to make a move, Jian Wushuang also felt somewhat at a loss.","Both of them had their reservations about each other.","But those flower demons had no such reservations.","They were already close.","Jian Wushuang could only take the initiative to deal with those flower demons.","Countless vines attacked, and several streams of Starry Sky Sword Qi instantly floated around Jian Wushuang.","This power was completely different from the power of Ancient Moon Spacetime. When the girl felt this power, her brow furrowed, feeling a terrifying force that made her unable to move.","Deep down, she became even more convinced that he was undoubtedly an old monster.","However, Jian Wushuang had no idea what the other party was thinking.","Facing so many flower demons, Jian Wushuang could only use the Starry Sky Sword Intent to quickly clean them up.","At the same time, he began to head towards the entrance of the fourth layer.","The Three Tribulation realm powerhouses who rushed over from afar breathed a sigh of relief when they saw that their young lady was safe.","“Young Miss, I have informed the mansion, and within an hour, powerful reinforcements will arrive!” The steward in green clothes said respectfully.","However, the girl put away the prohibition secret technique, and the tree bear slowly disappeared.","“No need, it’s useless to call more people. That mysterious powerhouse should be a Five Tribulation realm old monster!”","Upon hearing the term ‘Five Tribulation realm’, the three of them were stunned, and cold sweat broke out on their backs.","The Tribulation Realm... Nine Tribulations.","The first Three Tribulations can only be considered as just entering. Only when one reaches the Three Tribulation realm, mastering a universe, only then can they be considered as stepping into the ranks of the powerful.","Then there’s the Four Tribulation realm.","There are the most Tribulation Realm cultivators at this level.","But reaching the Five Tribulation realm isn’t so easy.","In Yue Kingdom, and even throughout the entire Ancient Wood Continent, Five Tribulation realm powerhouses are almost all influential figures.","Because the Universe Masters of the Six Tribulation realm almost never appear; they are all leaders of a faction.","So the Universe Master of the Five Tribulation realm is a figure who stirs up the winds and clouds in a region.","As for the scattered and wandering Tribulation Realm powerhouses, even if they were scattered Tribulation powerhouses of the Six Tribulation realm, they were ultimately wandering Tribulation Realm cultivators, without any further advancement, and their strength was constantly declining.","They can only slumber to maintain their peak state.","The stronger the scattered calamity expert, the greater the consumption.","For instance, the Qingyun Sect of the Seven Stars Sect has a scattered Tribulation expert at the Seven Tribulation realm, who has existed for endless ages.","But in these endless ages, they have only awakened three times.","Each time, their strength has declined significantly.","Usually, unless there is something significant, they won’t awaken at all.","As for scattered Tribulation experts at the Eight Tribulation realm, they are even rarer.","The ancestor at the Eight Tribulation realm from the Ancient Wood Sect has never appeared, with scant records of their existence.","As for the Universe Masters at the Seven Tribulation realm, or even the Eight Tribulation realm, they are even more elusive.","These figures are the true super experts of this spacetime.","Some once-glorious Eight Star Sects had fallen to the point where they lacked even the Universe Masters of the Seven Tribulation Realm. These sects were in decline, relying solely on scattered Tribulation experts to sustain them.","But it was precisely because of these scattered Tribulation experts that the Eight Star Sects almost eternally endured, never facing complete annihilation.","In the Ancient Moon Spacetime, 19 Eight Star Sects had existed for endless ages.","No one knew for sure just how many scattered Tribulation experts lurked within the Eight Star Sects.","“If it’s a Five Tribulation realm expert, he might also be a scattered Tribulation expert!” Qing Shan, the steward in the green robe, reassured, “Even if it’s a Universe Lord of the Five Tribulation realm, they should still give our Yue Kingdom some face!”","However, the young woman shook her head in surprise. “After all, Five Tribulation realm experts are formidable. It’s best not to provoke them if we can help it!”","“In that case...”","“Let’s go. Obtaining a section of the Hundred Flowers Vine will suffice. Even if we don’t get it, it’s no big deal. I have other gifts prepared!”","The young woman faced Jian Wushuang and completely gave up.","Moreover, with Jian Wushuang currently slaughtering those flower demons wantonly, she took the opportunity to leave.","The Three Tribulation realm experts nodded in agreement.","Leaving was the best option.","Boom!!!","For some reason, those flower demons only besieged Jian Wushuang, ignoring the mysterious young woman and her group.","This infuriated Jian Wushuang even more.","Though he could freely use the Sword Intent of the Starry Sky, it was merely the Sword Qi from the Starry Sky Chronicles.","Even if he were to slaughter them all, including those on the fifth level, it wouldn’t matter.","But he didn’t have the time for that now!","Seeing that the mysterious young woman and her group had quietly slipped away, Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief.","He was afraid that they might act recklessly and attack him.","Then he would be caught in a pincer attack.","“Forget it, let’s just consider it as enhancing my divine body!” Jian Wushuang chuckled bitterly.","His figure sank into a black hole, revealing a hidden realm behind him. All those flower demons he had slaughtered were now falling into his cosmic secret realm.","Their frenzied divine power would be transformed into pure divine power."]},{"number":5676,"title":"Chapter 5676 Starry Sky Sword Intent","paragraphs":["Chapter 5676 Starry Sky Sword Intent","Unfortunately, the extraction was too minimal, only increasing his divine power by a few hundredfold.","....","This slight augmentation of power, once appealing to him, now paled in comparison to the skeletal remains of Dong Jun in his possession.","After once again utilizing his Sword Qi to slaughter dozens of flower demons, Jian Wushuang prepared to depart.","However, in the next moment, the ground began to tremble, and an immense aura emanated from above.","Furrowing his brow, Jian Wushuang recognized this aura as likely coming from the Flower Demon King.","It was the aura of a Four Tribulation realm expert.","Though the opponent was a scattered Tribulation Realm cultivator, such powerful individuals at the Quadruple Tribulation Realm didn’t consume much energy.","Moreover, with this natural Daoist ground, even significant energy consumption could be quickly replenished.","This adversary was formidable.","No wonder even when a Four Tribulation realm expert came before, they couldn’t gain any advantage.","However, he didn’t want to have any conflict with the opponent.","It was best to leave as soon as possible.","The entrance to the fourth layer was right in front of him; Jian Wushuang leaped forward and entered the cave directly.","A large group of flower demons missed their target, then rushed towards the entrance of the fourth level.","But at that moment, a voice echoed from the sky.","“Let him go!”","It was an absolute command from the Flower Demon King.","Even though those flower demons had become extremely violent due to devouring the divine power of cultivators, they calmed down.","Descending from the sky, the Flower Demon King was accompanied by a thousand blooming flowers.","Upon reaching the ground and sensing the residual power of the Starry Sky, cold sweat appeared on his forehead.","“A Starry Sky expert?”","“It seems like I have to accelerate my plan!”","After dispersing those flower demons, the Flower Demon King returned to the sixth level of the Hundred Flowers Mountain.","As for her plan, it was indeed related to Jian Wushuang.","It wouldn’t be accurate to say it was related to Jian Wushuang alone, but rather to all the Tribulation Realm cultivators on the Ancient Wood Continent.","The Saint Gathering Sacred Assembly of the Ancient Wood Sect would convene soon.","The four major positions, as well as the position of the Holy Maiden, were about to be decided. Everyone was keeping an eye on it. Now, Flower Demon King once again perceived the significance of the positions, considering the countless formidable experts in the Starry Sky.","She decided it was better not to stir up trouble unnecessarily. However, Jian Wushuang will not have an easy time leaving today.","Upon reaching the fourth layer, Jian Wushuang found it remarkably easy. He no longer concealed his figure, instead unleashing his divine power and breaking through with all his might. Along the way, although there were flower demons of the Two Tribulation realm, none hindered him. This surprised Jian Wushuang, but it was for the best.","After leaving the fourth layer, he directly tore through the space of Hundred Flowers Mountain and departed from there through the chaos of spacetime. When he reappeared, he was already at the boundary capital of the outside world.","“Finally out!” Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief, then reverted to his original appearance, suppressing his strength to the level of an ordinary Two Tribulation realm expert, with his aura completely divine.","At the same time, as Jian Wushuang appeared, a group of mysterious girls happened to pass by.","Jian Wushuang recognized them, but now he had changed his appearance and aura, so they didn’t recognize him.","Among the luxurious entourage, the mysterious girl sensed the aura of an Emperor but paid no attention.","“Miss, this person is a steward of the Qingyun Sect!” The old man in green naturally saw Jian Wushuang and recognized his identity from his robes.","The mysterious girl said indifferently, “No need to bother, let’s return to the royal capital first!”","“Yes!”","The group ignored Jian Wushuang and left directly.","Only after they were gone did Jian Wushuang begin to move.","“It seems that he’s a genius from some family in the royal capital. I just wonder who?” Jian Wushuang didn’t inform Wu Li of this matter.","The Emperor possessed the strength of a Two Tribulation realm, indicating that the opponent’s identity wasn’t ordinary.","It was best not to provoke them.","It’s better to cooperate honestly with Wu Li and plan for the Wanliu Divine Tree together!","It would take at least three hours to travel from the border province to the capital.","Of course, if Jian Wushuang were at his peak, he could make it in the time it takes to burn an incense stick, but it wasn’t necessary.","It was only noon now; the banquet would be in the evening.","There were still several hours left.","And it had taken less than three hours to pick the Hundred Flowers Vine.","The first withering period happened to coincide with Elder Muchen’s banquet, and it would be a good opportunity to offer it then.","As long as he could establish a strong relationship with Elder Mochen, he would be able to infiltrate the core.","Then he would qualify to visit the Ancient Wood Sect.","Otherwise, as someone like him, a nameless and powerful individual, even with Wu Li’s recommendation, it would be very troublesome to enter the Ancient Wood Sect.","Even in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, one’s background was important.","That’s why he sought to attach himself to others.","Even if he had to hold his nose and take away the princess, he was willing to do it.","For the Qishen Temple, he had spared no expense this time.","He hadn’t taken Dong Jun’s bones in vain.","...","The capital of Yue Kingdom sat atop a relatively flat landmass, grand in its expanse.","It served as the nucleus of the kingdom, boasting a splendor surpassing even that of Qingyun City beneath the Qingyun Sect.","All thanks to the power of the Empress of Yue Kingdom.","She was a pinnacle figure of the Five Tribulation realm, rumored to be a superpower with hopes of successfully crossing the tribulation.","Moreover, within the royal family, there was a scattered ancestor at the Seven Tribulation realm.","Their heritage was no less than that of the Qingyun Sect.","Presently, the Qingyun Sect lacked formidable strength.","Its reputation in the Ancient Wood Continent had plummeted.","Not even a cosmic master at the Six Tribulation realm was present; only one at the Five Tribulation realm upheld its facade.","Hence, Wu Li Zhong’s plan was to align himself with the royal family of Yue Kingdom rather than the upper echelons of the Qingyun Sect.","Upon entering the capital, he immediately contacted Wu Li.","As there was still some time left, the two found refuge in one of the Wu family’s mansions in the capital until nightfall, when they would head to Muchen’s Royal Palace.","Muchen, titled as the Wood King.","One of the eight kings of Yue Kingdom.","He was also the only Three Tribulation realm powerhouse among the eight kings, and moreover, he was a Universe Master.","His position within the royal family was lofty.","In the current era, only the Empress of Yue Kingdom surpassed him in strength.","Therefore, his grand celebration was bound to attract strong figures from all directions, with rumors even suggesting the Empress herself might attend.","Naturally, Wu Li accompanied him, being one of the ten major families’ ancestors and a good friend of Muchen.","His strength was even at the Half-Step Four Tribulation realm!","Jian Wushuang had heard some things about Wu Li later on; this old guy kept a low profile but had quite a reputation in Yue Kingdom.","Otherwise, the Wu family wouldn’t have stood firm among the ten major families.","“Brother Wushuang, you’ve gone to too much trouble this time. You’ve actually brought the Hundred Flowers Vine. It seems freshly picked!” Wu Li scrutinized the Hundred Flowers Vine in the wooden box with fervent eyes.","Originally, he had also prepared a gift for Muchen’s birthday, but it seemed unnecessary now.","Jian Wushuang casually poured himself some tea, savoring it delicately, and replied calmly, “It’s nothing much. Without putting in some effort, the other party may not truly value me!”","Although his strength was decent, under Muchen’s banner, there were still many top-notch retainers and disciples.","After returning the wooden box containing the Hundred Flowers Vine to Jian Wushuang, Wu Li couldn’t help but marvel at Jian Wushuang’s strength.","To obtain such a top-tier Hundred Flowers Vine, one had to go at least to the fifth layer.","Those flower demons were not weak in strength.","Even if he were to go, if luck wasn’t on his side, he wouldn’t obtain such a treasure.","Moreover, he would have to time the picking precisely, then return swiftly."]},{"number":5677,"title":"Chapter 5677 Pang De","paragraphs":["Chapter 5677 Pang De","Jian Wushuang’s strength not only matched his own but perhaps even surpassed it.","....","He increasingly felt that his decision to collaborate with Jian Wushuang was a wise one.","Simultaneously, he was extremely curious. Jian Wushuang was so powerful, yet he was only an Emperor.","His identity was certainly not simple.","He was either a scion of some terrifying family or a prodigy inheriting the legacy of a certain eight-star sect.","And he was the most powerful among them, without a doubt.","Emperors capable of contending with the Tribulation Realm were not few, but those who could defeat it were rare.","In the current era, there were probably few who could.","Even that high priest, perhaps, wasn’t as powerful as Jian Wushuang.","He had thought that if Jian Wushuang were to reveal his strength, even the Ancient Wood Sect would vie for his allegiance.","But then, his background would surely be investigated.","Wu Li speculated that Jian Wushuang was unwilling to reveal his past life’s identity, or perhaps it was too sensitive.","His information was well-informed. As one of the Emperors of the Nine Heavens and Ten Earths, he had been collecting information diligently, yet he hadn’t come across anything related to Jian Wushuang.","In the recent 10,000 years, he hadn’t heard of any incident of Emperor Fall.","Although there were some doubts, since they were now in a cooperative relationship, he naturally wouldn’t ask too much.","After a brief chat, Wu Li accompanied Jian Wushuang out of the mansion, heading towards the Wood King’s Mansion.","Just as they arrived outside the Wooden King’s Mansion, a shout came from afar.","“Brother Wu Li!”","Following the voice, a sturdy man with the head of a dragon and the body of a man approached.","When Jian Wushuang saw the figure, his eyes narrowed slightly, feeling a familiar sense of pressure deep within.","That oppressive feeling, he had felt it before in Broly.","He hadn’t expected to encounter such a sensation here.","Broly was a super powerhouse in the Dao of Transformation. Could it be that the other party was also proficient in the Dao of Transformation?","But that seemed unlikely; this was a spacetime dominated by divine power.","Moreover, that sense of oppression was related to the divine power emanating from the other party.","Upon seeing the other person, Wu Li also smiled and quickly approached with courtesy. “Brother Pang De, long time no see, your strength has improved again!”","“Haha, recently went on a trip to the Shi Kingdom with those women from the Scorpion Clan. We gained quite a lot!” Pang De’s character was hearty, without any concealment.","This made Jian Wushuang develop a slight fondness for the burly man in front of him.","Being a powerhouse in the Tribulation Realm, maintaining such a character was quite rare.","Or perhaps, apart from Hu Qing, he hadn’t seen anyone else like that.","This was the second one.","Pangde also noticed Jian Wushuang’s gaze, stared back, and asked, “Wu Li, who’s this kid?”","“My nephew!” Wu Li waved his hand, introduced Jian Wushuang, and then said, “He couldn’t make it in the Outer Domain recently, so he came to seek refuge with me. Now he’s got a job in the Qingyun Sect!”","Jian Wushuang was somewhat speechless, feeling like Wu Li had taken advantage of him for no reason.","But initially, his identity was just Wu Li’s friend.","Now that it had changed, their relationship was probably not ordinary.","In this way, his identity seemed more complex.","After all, the identity of a friend wasn’t accurate.","How could Jian Wushuang, an Emperor, be just a friend!","It could only be described as a relative by marriage.","“Outer Domain?” Pang De became very interested in Jian Wushuang after hearing about the Outer Domain, and exclaimed, “For an Emperor to not Fall in the Outer Domain is already impressive. And you seem so indifferent upon seeing me. I suppose your strength is also quite formidable. Why would you go to a place like Qingyun Sect, where nothing much happens?”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but smile bitterly, unsure of how to respond.","Fortunately, Wu Li was smooth-tongued. He quickly spoke up, saying, “Hey, we were being chased in the Outer Domain, got injured, and without any treasures for recovery, we could only come sneakily seeking refuge with me!”","“If that’s the case, when your injuries are healed, why not come with me to the Shi Kingdom? That’s where you Emperor types should be adventuring!” Pang De nodded, showing respect for Jian Wushuang, which was why he said so.","Jian Wushuang could only smile awkwardly and brush it off.","Seeing the situation, Wu Li changed the subject, saying, “Let’s hurry inside, today is the celebration for Brother Muchen’s birthday!”","As time was passing, many people had already entered the royal mansion.","The three of them also headed towards the mansion.","Outside the Wood King’s Mansion, it was particularly lively.","Many savage beasts emitting the aura of the Tribulation Realm and immortal chariots were parked on both sides.","There were even quite a few powerful figures of the Tribulation Realm.","It was considered a rare event in Yue Kingdom.","Many experts of the Three Tribulation realm came.","In Yue Kingdom, experts of the Three Tribulation realm were considered top-notch, and there were even Four Tribulation realm experts who came.","They were elders of the Qingyun Sect.","Elder Muchen came out to greet them directly.","Wu Li and the others naturally waited tactfully.","After the Four Tribulation realm super expert entered the mansion, Elder Muchen saw Wu Li and Pang De, and he walked over with a smile on his face.","“Brother Wu Li, Brother Pang De!” Elder Mu Chen hurried over and exchanged a few words with the two.","When he saw Jian Wushuang, he also nodded.","“Then, let us go in first!”","“Alright, make sure to have a few extra drinks later!”","The three of them had a very good relationship.","Wu Li was the patriarch of the Wu family, while Pang De was a prominent figure in the Pang family, one of the top ten families in the Yue Kingdom. In their youth, they were peers with Muchen.","Upon entering the royal mansion, they were escorted into the banquet hall.","The place was extravagantly decorated, even more so than when they took concubines.","As Jian Wushuang was only an Emperor, he couldn’t sit at the high table with the other two. So, they separated for the time being.","Guided by a servant, Jian Wushuang took a seat towards the back.","He stopped at a beautifully adorned table.","Behind the table was a cushion with Jian Wushuang’s name inscribed on it.","After thanking the servant, Jian Wushuang sat down.","The people around him were all Emperors, few of whom he knew well. He didn’t engage in conversation but instead used his Thought power to eavesdrop on the conversations of the Tribulation Realm above.","Through this, he gained a bit more understanding of the Ancient Wood Continent.","At the same time, he noticed some Emperors who could sit on par with the Tribulation Realm experts.","Each of them was a prominent figure in the Yue Kingdom.","Their combat power could rival the Tribulation Realm, and their divine power was about 100,000-fold.","They were Emperors with perfect divine power.","These individuals, if thrown into the Qishen Temple, could be nurtured like treasures by the Zhen Ling.","However, they were merely geniuses within one of the kingdoms of the Ancient Wood Continent.","Not to mention looking at the entire continent, even if they were to go to the strongest kingdom, they wouldn’t rank among the top in the Shi Kingdom.","Although he didn’t have a deep understanding of the Ancient Wood Continent over the years, he was aware of some specific matters.","Currently, the eight star sects like the Ancient Wood Sect were somewhat similar to the Qingyun Sect of the Yue Kingdom.","Both were in a period of decline.","In terms of current strength, the Ancient Wood Sect was not even comparable to the Shi Kingdom.","Because within the Shi Kingdom, there was a terrifying Flame God whose power was unimaginable."]},{"number":5678,"title":"Chapter 5678: Birthday","paragraphs":["Chapter 5678: Birthday","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Equivalent to the ancestor of the Ancient Wood Sect.","In the contemporary Shi Kingdom, there were several Universe Masters at the Six Tribulation realm, and there was even one at the Seventh Tribulation realm.","Just with this point alone, the Ancient Wood Sect couldn’t compare.","The current Holy Maiden of the Ancient Wood Sect was only at the Six Tribulation realm, and she was about to undergo tribulation soon, with a high probability of failure.","At that time, morale would once again decline.","In reality, this situation was quite advantageous for Jian Wushuang.","His and Wu Li’s plan revolved around the Wanliu Divine Tree.","The weaker the Ancient Wood Sect became, the greater the opportunities for the two of them.","The Wanliu Divine Tree did not solely belong to the Ancient Wood Sect, but most of it was monopolized by the other side.","It was impossible to quietly activate it.","The two of them also didn’t have the strength of the former Lord of the Eternal Wood Era.","They could only approach the Ancient Wood Sect first, and then find a way to activate the Wanliu Divine Tree.","According to the information Jian Wushuang had gathered over the years, many practitioners had entered the Wanliu Divine Tree, but apart from the disciples of the Ancient Wood Sect, there were very few.","It would be best to first enter the Ancient Wood Sect and then use the Wanliu Divine Tree.","This depended on today’s performance.","Yue Kingdom had a quota to attend the Sacred Assembly. To obtain this quota, it was not only necessary to rely on strength but also on connections.","Although Wu Li had strong connections, it wasn’t enough.","Just as Jian Wushuang was contemplating how to obtain the quota, a loud shout came from outside the door, “Her Majesty Feng Chen is here to offer congratulations!”","Sure enough, the peerlessly beautiful Empress had arrived.","Jian Wushuang also retracted his thoughts, even more so, he withdrew his Thought power into his body, not daring to have the slightest exposure.","His gaze also fixed on the door frame, wanting to catch a glimpse of the Empress’s magnificence.","The voice had just fallen.","Leading the way across the threshold were two withered old men, dressed in splendor yet exuding restrained aura, but still capable of making others feel the complexity within them.","Four Tribulation realm powerhouses.","Merely scattered Tribulation cultivators.","But even so, their presence commanded attention.","After the two entered, they stood on either side of the threshold.","Next came into view a cold and exquisite face.","Eyes sharp as blades, lips thin as edges.","Clad in a golden dragon robe, with a vividly embroidered five-clawed golden dragon above, as she entered the banquet hall, one could faintly hear the roar of a dragon.","At this moment, whether Tribulation Realm powerhouses or Emperors, all rose to their feet.","Everyone bowed respectfully.","The cold and elegant Empress remained unchanged in expression, calmly taking her seat at the main position.","“Please rise!”","Only after hearing these words did everyone dare to straighten up.","Jian Wushuang could sense the extraordinary aura emanating from her. A Universe Master of the Five Tribulation realm, that was no mere title.","Although he had also come into close contact with a Six Tribulation realm powerhouse before, the feeling this Empress gave him was different.","Back then, aiding Fuego, after all, they were allies, and he was very courteous, deliberately restraining his aura.","But this Empress was different; her aura surged directly.","It was different for each person.","For Tribulation Realm cultivators, it was awe-inspiring.","For Emperors, it was breathtaking.","After everyone had savored the moment, Elder Muchen rose from his seat, first spouting a bunch of useless words, then boasting about his own younger sister, the Empress of Yue, and finally, the banquet truly began.","This banquet, truth be told, was rather dull. It was simply a gathering of old friends seizing the opportunity to come together. Who knows, perhaps there might be some stroke of luck, and they could plan some adventures together in the future.","However, there was a highlight in the early part of the event.","That was the birthday ceremony.","From low to high status, each person stepped forward to pay respects to Muchen.","It was also an opportunity to see various treasures.","As the banquet commenced, someone took the initiative to approach.","“Junior, I am the Fourth Guardian of the Mingjiao Sect. I present a Nine-Leaf Fan to Senior Muchen as a birthday gift!” With that said, the person took out the treasure and offered it respectfully.","Muchen chuckled and expressed gratitude with words, though his actions were less courteous.","With just a glance, he signaled to his attendant to accept the treasure.","Then, he nodded and exchanged a few polite words with the Guardian from the Mingjiao Sect.","The Guardian was tactful as well, not overstaying his welcome, and returned to his seat after a few words.","Those who could present gifts were either geniuses among the Emperors or formidable experts in the Tribulation Realm.","There was a clear order of precedence.","Actually, the order was arranged according to the value of the treasures presented. Naturally, the stronger one’s power, the more precious the gift offered.","Just then, Jian Wushuang received a message from Wu Li.","He would present the gift together with Wu Li.","An Emperor, accompanying a Three Tribulation realm Emperor to offer a gift together.","This was quite a rare occurrence.","Even some young clan leaders of major families didn’t have this privilege.","Wu Li intended for Muchen to value Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang had no objections to Wu Li’s arrangement.","He was contemplating the value of the treasures brought to him.","Just moments ago, a disciple from Qingyun Sect had presented a treasure worth a staggering 200,000 universe crystals.","In his heart, he silently marveled at the wealth of the strong in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Within the Qishen Temple, acquiring tens of thousands of universe crystals was an arduous task.","Yet in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, these Emperor’s prodigies could casually throw around several hundred thousand.","The universe crystals he currently possessed amounted to just over 100,000.","He was too impoverished.","Initially, he had exchanged a considerable amount of universe crystals in advance.","Now it seemed, he had overestimated.","In the Ancient Moon Spacetime, obtaining universe crystals was much easier than in the Qishen Temple.","However, some of the treasures he possessed were invaluable even in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Like the Temporal Treasure ‘Skysight Heavenly Chessboard’!","And the Beast God Weapon.","The Beast Gods of the Ancient Moon Spacetime had long since fallen, their whereabouts unknown, with rare rumors even circulating about them.","Let alone mentioning Beast God Weapons.","The absence of such treasures didn’t mean there weren’t ones more powerful than beast God Weapons.","According to the classification of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","The treasures of the universe were also divided into Nine Tribulations.","This also depended on the strength of the origin within the treasures of the universe.","The Origin Source within the Beast God Weapon peaked at the Five Tribulation realm, but now it was only at the Three Tribulation realm.","To enhance it, nurturing was required.","For a Universe Master at the Five Tribulation realm, at least tens of thousands of epochs needed to be nurtured to cultivate a Universe Treasure at the Five Tribulation realm level.","The stronger the supreme treasure, the longer the nurturing time required.","Above the Nine Tribulations are the Temporal Treasures.","Whether it was in the original Moro Spacetime or the current Ancient Moon Spacetime.","There is very little information about Temporal Treasures.","Almost none at all.","It may also be because Jian Wushuang’s status is too lowly, and he has not yet come into contact with the true core levels.","Just like at this banquet, Jian Wushuang has seen and heard more than he has in the past 10,000 years.","One precious treasure after another was presented, making Jian Wushuang extremely envious.","Among them were many precious treasures cultivated from the origin.","Unfortunately, they all went into Muchen’s bag.","Every epoch Muchen celebrates his birthday, he can effortlessly obtain so many treasures without moving.","Having status, having identity, is indeed good.","Jian Wushuang also felt some envy.","When the day comes for him to reach the tribulation realm, he will also experience the taste of being a regional overlord.","This is just the status of a powerful prince.","The wealth of that Empress is probably even more astonishing!","“Uncle, I’m late!” A thick voice came from outside the door.","Everyone’s attention was immediately drawn away."]},{"number":5679,"title":"Chapter 5679: The Grand Princess‘ Secret","paragraphs":["Chapter 5679: The Grand Princess‘ Secret","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The newcomer wasn’t from the Tribulation Realm, but an Emperor.","He was burly, with a physique akin to a barrel, and his countenance was fierce and terrifying.","By conventional standards, upon reaching the Immortal stage, one could change their appearance at will.","Even using some secret techniques would allow for a change in appearance.","However, this Emperor appeared in this visage.","“That’s the Grand Princess!” someone whispered softly.","Most of those present here had seen this Grand Princess before.","There were also some juniors seeing her for the first time.","All of them were taken aback by the appearance of this Grand Princess.","Jian Wushuang was equally surprised.","However, unlike these people, he sensed a familiar aura emanating from the other party.","Moreover, he had just recently seen this person not long ago.","“Tree Bear!” Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow, a hint of a smile creeping onto his lips.","The mysterious girl from Hundred Flowers Mountain who summoned the Tree Bear bore a striking resemblance to the current Grand Princess, and their auras were nearly identical.","There was a strong connection between the two.","Furthermore, by observing the opponent’s life force, Jian Wushuang could tell that the current Grand Princess was almost certainly not her true form.","This was something that experts below the Five Tribulation realm couldn’t discern at all.","However, Jian Wushuang could sense it thanks to the special Life power.","The current Grand Princess was definitely not her true self but rather the transformed Tree Bear.","Her true form should not be here but in the imperial palace. Normally, this Grand Princess would take the Tree Bear form as her true self.","Thinking of that mischievous girl, Jian Wushuang became quite interested in her cunning and scheming.","The arrival of the Grand Princess delighted Elder Muchen, who personally stood up and, with concern, addressed the sturdy Tree Bear, “My dear niece, I’m so glad you could come. There’s no need for such extravagance!”","“Uncle, this time I’ve prepared a special gift just for you!” the Grand Princess said, instructing her servant, “Steward Li, present the Lotus Heart!”","At the mention of the Lotus Heart, everyone’s expressions changed.","That was an extraordinary treasure.","The Lotus Heart was a unique treasure of the Shi Kingdom, a priceless item.","Regular people couldn’t buy it even if they wanted to.","Unless they had strong backgrounds and extraordinary strength.","Upon hearing this, Elder Muchen’s heart stirred, his expression changing slightly. He covertly transmitted, “Jinchen, are you trying to bribe your uncle?”","“Uncle, you must help me this time. Mother is determined to find me a husband!” Princess Jinchen’s tone sounded aggrieved, resembling an 800-pound chubby dumpling.","Elder Muchen, who had always cherished his niece, furrowed his brows, sighing, “Niece, I can’t help you this time. What the clan has decided cannot be changed by anyone!”","He understood why his niece was resisting so much, even resorting to transforming her appearance to ugliness just to avoid being married off by the family.","But how could one resist the imperial decree?","The Kingdom of Yue needed a crown prince.","And that crown prince had to be the princess.","Hence the need for a husband.","Moreover, they needed a husband with a clean background and decent strength at the same cultivation realm.","But this princess already had someone in her heart.","However, that person was from the royal family of the Shi Kingdom.","Even if the other party agreed to become the son-in-law, the Kingdom of Yue dared not invite the wolf into the house!","The princess was the future Empress, how could she accept an uncontrollable son-in-law?","Even if the Empress could face the Shi Kingdom with confidence, the clan wouldn’t allow it.","Princess Jincheng pouted, casting a resentful look at her mother.","Elder Muchen pulled Princess Jincheng to his side and gestured to continue.","Such family matters were better resolved privately.","At this moment, Wu Li nodded towards Jian Wushuang, simultaneously transmitting, and soon they were together.","“Wushuang, my friend, don’t let this little girl deceive you. This isn’t her true form. If this succeeds, I promise you, you won’t suffer any loss!” Wu Li assured through transmission.","Actually, he didn’t need comforting. Even if the other party’s true self was like this, he had to go in with a stiff upper lip.","This was about the Wanliu Divine Tree.","The opportunity in the Tribulation Realm.","According to Wu Li’s most conservative estimate, whatever they gained inside, as long as they came out alive, they could quickly become Five Tribulation Realm experts.","This was also deduced from their past experiences.","The prerequisite was coming out alive.","And, of course, one had to enter first.","Entering required the qualifications of the Sacred Assembly.","These qualifications were very rare even in the Qingyun Sect.","Only by passing through the Yue Kingdom Imperial Family could one manage to get in.","Wu Li himself had no problem; he had some connections in the Ancient Wood Sect and could easily get himself in.","But getting Jian Wushuang in was a different story.","After all, that was the eight-star sect, not something a Half-Step Four Tribulation realm like him could control.","“Don’t worry, I know what to do!” Jian Wushuang replied through mental communication.","He wasn’t some clueless kid just born yesterday.","How could such trivial matters bother him?","After Pang De presented his gift, Wu Li slowly got up, deliberately calling Jian Wushuang over in front of everyone.","Jian Wushuang behaved obediently, like a junior, and walked towards Wu Li.","This caught the attention of many people.","Some even recognized him; after all, he had been following Elder Muchen for thousands of years and was somewhat famous.","Moreover, these people had heard that Jian Wushuang’s relationship with Wu Li was not ordinary.","Presumably, he was also an extraordinary Emperor.","“Muchen, ever since my nephew joined your sect, he has received much care from you. It’s quite sudden for us to come here together to congratulate you this time!”","Muchen smiled knowingly at this remark and replied, “Brother Wu Li, since he’s a nephew, there’s no need to stand on ceremony. I see that Jian Wushuang’s talent is quite good among the younger generation, so it’s not really considered as taking care of him. Even without my help, he could have found a decent position in the Qingyun Sect!”","“By the way, in the next inner disciple trial, Wushuang can give it a try!”","Jian Wushuang held the wooden box in his hands and felt a stir in his heart upon hearing this.","Sure enough, a few compliments and benefits would follow directly. Even though he hadn’t given any birthday gifts, Muchen had already arranged the matter of becoming an inner disciple for him.","Saying it’s a trial, how could he possibly fail?","Unfortunately, Jian Wushuang and Wu Li’s intentions were not just about becoming inner disciples of the Qingyun Sect.","“Wushuang, why don’t you thank Elder Muchen properly?” Wu Li’s expression turned serious as he instructed.","Jian Wushuang respectfully handed over the wooden box containing the Hundred Flowers Vine and pretended to be excited, saying, “Thank you, Elder Muchen, I will never forget this kindness!”","The steward of the mansion took the box from Jian Wushuang’s hands. As usual, he prepared to report the names of the treasures inside upon opening it.","But just as he was about to open it, a terrifying divine power leaked out from above.","Although the steward of the mansion had seen much in his life, he couldn’t help but swallow hard and pause for a moment. Then, he loudly exclaimed, “400 flower seeds, and a Hundred Flowers Vine!”","And they hadn’t even reached the first withered stage.","This also meant that these treasures were just brought from the Hundred Flowers Mountain today."]},{"number":5680,"title":"Chapter 5680 Gift","paragraphs":["Chapter 5680 Gift","Feeling the surge of power and hearing the mention of 400 flower seeds, many couldn’t help but gasp, simultaneously speculating about Jian Wushuang’s intentions, or perhaps Wu Li’s intentions.","....","Jian Wushuang, an Emperor, bringing out such treasures; many believed it was a gift from Wu Li, attributing it to Jian Wushuang.","This segment of Hundred Flowers Vine, if auctioned at this moment, could definitely fetch a price of 3 million universe crystals.","But if three days passed, it would be worth at most 300,000.","Such a grand gift was rarely seen even from Emperors of the Tribulation Realm.","Yet here it was, brought out by Jian Wushuang, an Emperor—nobody would believe it.","Princess Jincheng, sitting beside Muchen, couldn’t help but show a hint of hesitation upon seeing it.","Upon closer inspection, it was indeed the same vine she had been outmaneuvered for on Hundred Flowers Mountain.","Looking at Jian Wushuang, she narrowed her eyes.","While others might think that this item was obtained by Wu Li and sent out in the name of Jian Wushuang, Princess Jincheng felt that there was more to it.","The terrifyingly powerful Universe Master of the Five Tribulations, perhaps.","Elder Muchen’s eyes gleamed with excitement; he hadn’t expected such a grand gift from Wu Li.","But recalling the words Wu Li had said to him a few days ago, he began to understand.","After today’s banquet, they could have a chat.","“Such a precious treasure, Nephew Wushuang, you’re too courteous!” Muchen didn’t just verbally agree this time; he personally stood up and toasted with Wu Li and Jian Wushuang.","With so many people watching, it wasn’t appropriate to say much more.","Wu Li naturally understood and pulled Jian Wushuang back to their seats.","Back at their seats, Jian Wushuang could feel many eyes on them.","These people had their own calculations in their hearts.","The Kingdom of Yue was seeking a son-in-law, a matter that many had their eyes on.","Now, it seemed that Wu Li had set his sights on this matter as well.","The birthday celebration proceeded smoothly.","As for the Emperors of the Three Tribulation realm, they were peers with Muchen, and their numbers were considerable.","There were over a hundred strong individuals of the Three Tribulation realm who came to congratulate.","Among them, more than half were Universe Masters.","Only a small portion were scattered Tribulation Realm individuals.","Scattered Tribulation Realm strong individuals represented those who could not advance further. Their strength and status would decline significantly. There was a considerable gap between them and individuals like Wu Li, a Half-Step FOur Tribulation realm Universe Master.","Apart from these people, the rest were Four Tribulation realm strong individuals.","Regardless of being Universe Masters or scattered Tribulation Realm cultivators, Four Tribulation realm individuals had a much higher status than those of the Three Tribulation realm.","Even though Mu Chen’s background and status were high, there were still few who came.","Those who came were either from the royal family of Yue or Four Tribulation realm strong individuals from the Qingyun Sect.","In total, there were six people.","The treasures they presented, though unique, were not of too high value.","The fact that they came was already the greatest face for Muchen.","However, Jian Wushuang noticed one thing: each of these Fopur Tribulation realm strong individuals brought along their family juniors or their own direct disciples.","Although all were Emperors, their strengths were impressive, each being very formidable.","Moreover, they intentionally or unintentionally recommended their own juniors.","Before Jian Wushuang could react, Wu Li transmitted a message to him to explain.","“Wushuang, my friend, pay attention to these people later. Their strength is not a concern, but their backgrounds are complicated. Like us, their aim is the same, all for the Crown Princess!”","Wu Li’s face held a smile as he looked towards Jian Wushuang, nodding.","Soon enough, Jian Wushuang understood.","This wasn’t for Muchen’s benefit; it was for the Empress.","The birthday banquet was just a facade, actually meant for seeking a son-in-law.","It seemed the rumors were true.","The Yue Kingdom was indeed serious about seeking a son-in-law, and they were eager to make it happen.","This was probably related to the future position of the Saintess.","The strength and talents of the Empress of the Yue Kingdom would certainly lead her to participate in the Sacred Assembly, aiming for the position of the Holy Maiden.","Once she ascended to this position, the Yue Kingdom’s status would rise significantly.","At that time, there would be a need for someone to inherit the position of Empress.","Currently, the Crown Princess was a very suitable candidate.","For a future Empress, seeking a son-in-law was normal.","And the son-in-law couldn’t be too powerful.","It wasn’t about strength but about background.","They couldn’t marry someone with a powerful background. Strength didn’t matter; as long as they were of the same level, even if they were stronger than the Crown Princess, it wouldn’t be an issue.","The throne relied on imperial authority.","And imperial authority was the foundation of the Yue Kingdom, along with those slumbering scattered experts of the Tribulation Realm.","Jian Wushuang’s current identity and strength were both suitable.","On the surface, his combat power might be lacking, but as long as he reveals some of his strength at crucial moments, there’s nothing anyone can do about it.","He also observed the Emperor prodigies sitting among them.","The strongest among them was just the young master of a prominent family in Yue, incomparable to the royal family of Yue.","As for his combat prowess, Jian Wushuang thought it was just average, nothing too impressive.","Among these people, his status couldn’t be considered lowly, but it wasn’t at the bottom either.","Backed by the Wu family, he was also considered a prestigious family.","Ignoring his true strength, just his current tenfold basic divine power put him ahead of these people.","Over the years, Wu Li’s layout seemed to have some effect.","He had unknowingly been drawn into this vortex of contention.","Some of the Emperor prodigies beside him also cast unfriendly glances his way.","It seemed everyone had the same goal in mind.","Jian Wushuang remained calm, sitting still as if he were above it all.","The birthday celebration was nearing its end as these people began to withdraw.","Now, only the Empress remained silent.","Everyone was waiting expectantly.","But they dared not meet the Empress’ gaze directly, instead, they waited silently for her to speak.","“On this day of my brother’s grand feast, I also wish my brother a breakthrough in the cultivation realm, advancing beyond the Four Tribulation!” The Emperess suddenly spoke, and the atmosphere warmed up.","Muchen quickly stood up and respectfully accepted the treasure bestowed by the Empress.","This time, he didn’t let servants take it!","While the Empress was his true sister, for the sake of the stability of the imperial power, everything had to be orderly, leading by example to inspire others.","“Thank you, Your Majesty!” Muchen bowed and graciously accepted the treasure.","The birthday celebration came to an end.","Next, it was time for official matters.","Muchen first interacted with various parties, expressing the intentions of the royal family of Yue.","Of course, he wouldn’t speak the truth, even if everyone understood, it couldn’t be said directly.","“Ladies and gentlemen, on this day of my birthday celebration, I take this opportunity to announce the engagement of the Princess to a worthy suitor. I hope all esteemed nephews will not feel constrained!” he said, patting the broad shoulder of the Princess, indicating for her to rise.","Although the Princess already had someone in her heart, she complied when she felt a piercing gaze.","Some Emperors, unaware of the truth, couldn’t help but feel uncomfortable upon seeing the Princess’s reaction."]},{"number":5681,"title":"Chapter 5681: Holy Assembly Quota","paragraphs":["Chapter 5681: Holy Assembly Quota","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even though the other party held a noble status and formidable strength, Jian Wushuang couldn’t muster much interest.","Some of these individuals were unaware, while others, like the Emperor prodigies, had some inkling of the truth.","Take Jian Wushuang, for instance!","He cast a friendly glance towards the eldest princess.","Princess Jincheng, catching Jian Wushuang’s gaze, shot him a fierce glare.","While she recognized the Hundred Flowers Vine Jian Wushuang produced, she didn’t believe Jian Wushuang to be particularly powerful.","Instead, she thought his background was definitely more complex than it appeared.","Jian Wushuang, however, remained unfazed by her gaze, merely smiling in response.","Meanwhile, those Emperor prodigies with strong backgrounds in the Yue Kingdom also began to display their own demeanor and strength.","Each of them was eager to try.","This puzzled some of the ordinary Emperor prodigies.","They simply couldn’t understand why these well-established Emperor prodigies, who had both background and power, insisted on marrying a princess who seemed like nothing special.","Information!","The importance of information was fully realized at this moment.","Not only did they know that the princess’s true identity was not as it seemed now, but they also understood the benefits that marrying her would bring.","The spots in the Saint Gathering Sacred Assembly.","In the entire Yue Kingdom, there were probably only a few.","The Yue royal family, Qingyun Sect, Mingjiao.","And the ten major families.","Divided evenly, each family probably only had one spot.","Surely, those spots would go to the formidable Tribulation Realm experts.","If there were two, they could consider giving one to an Emperor.","The key was that among the ten major families, there were differences in strength.","Perhaps only one or two families could secure two spots.","The other families would have to figure something out.","Half of the Sacred Assembly comprised Emperors, and the other half comprised Tribulation Realm experts.","It is best to have two spots.","For families like the Wu’s, who are relatively low-ranking, they only have one spot, and that spot is also because of Wu Li’s status.","Out of 20 spots in a nation, families occupy at least half.","The remaining spots are divided among the three major powers, and each spot is extremely precious.","There simply isn’t any surplus.","That’s why the competition is so fierce.","The method of selecting a son-in-law is also simple; anyone who comes to this place today, including the Emperor, is qualified to participate.","But ultimately, it’s decided by strength.","The backgrounds of the Emperors who can come here have all been thoroughly investigated, leaving only a competition of strength.","When Muchen saw that some people were still not very active, he mentioned, “There’s one more thing I almost forgot to mention. The Saint Gathering of the Ancient Wood Continent will be held soon. Among the 20 spots allocated to the Yue Kingdom, one will be for a son-in-law!”","Upon hearing this, the weaker forces looked at each other.","The Saint Gathering Sacred Assembly!","It’s the conference for electing the Holy Maiden. Normally, they would just go to watch the excitement at most.","Even if they were given spots, their families wouldn’t have suitable candidates to participate!","The candidate for the Holy Maiden must be a Universe Master and also a female cultivator.","Just this threshold blocks off 99 percent of the strong.","Why bring up the matter of recruiting a son-in-law now?","This time, it wasn’t Muchen’s turn to explain. The Empress spoke up personally, “This Saint Gathering is extraordinary, and it’s related to the Divine Wood King. You should all take the opportunity to learn more!”","Divine Wood King!","At the mention of this title, everyone was shaken.","Even Jian Wushuang frowned. He hadn’t heard Wu Li mention that this Saint Conference would involve the Divine Wood King.","Although Wu Li’s information was very well-informed, he didn’t know that this Saint Conference was related to the Divine WOod King.","As for this name, Jian Wushuang had known about it since he first went to the Qingyun Sect.","As long as practitioners who know a little about the Ancient Wood Sect, they all know.","From the Tribulation Realm to the mundane world.","They all know what the Godwood King represents!","He is the ancestor of the Ancient Wood Sect.","A powerful figure who was crowned king.","The strong who can be crowned king are all ancestors of the eight-star sects.","If an ancestor falls, the title can be inherited!","The superpowers of the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Jian Wushuang held his breath.","If this sacred meeting really had something to do with the Wood King, then his matters with Wu Li might not proceed so easily.","They were experts of the Eighth Tribulation realm!","Although they were scattered in the Tribulation Realm and lacked the grandeur of the cosmic Dao Arena, they were not the kind of small fries that they could peek at.","In general, when the sacred meeting identifies candidates for the Holy Maiden, at most, they could mobilize a Seven Tribulation realm expert from the Ancient Wood Sect, which was considered good.","Now, with the involvement of the Divine Wood King, it was likely that the old ancestor would appear.","This also meant that this sacred meeting was not only for the Holy Maiden candidates but also for other actions.","Both Wu Li and Jian Wushuang showed shock on their faces, exchanging a glance.","The Empress was present, so they dared not say much, they could only endure and discuss privately after the banquet.","However, Jian Wushuang couldn’t let go of the matter of becoming the son-in-law.","This sacred gathering was of extraordinary significance, and there would be a lot of movement. Even if the Divine Wood King appeared, they had to go and try together.","Even if they couldn’t activate the Wanliu Divine Tree, they still had to attend the sacred meeting.","Wu Li had participated in many sacred meetings, so it might not be a big deal to him.","But Jian Wushuang had just arrived in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","He couldn’t afford to miss such a sacred meeting.","Whoosh!","The crowd was shocked. After a moment, the Empress took out a piece of heaven and earth from her palm, placing it directly in the center of the banquet hall.","All the guests around could see it clearly. The message was clear, no need for further words. Those who had the ability should step forward.","At this moment, Muchen smiled and stood up, entering the heavenly realm. He spoke, “All esteemed nephews and nieces, you may enter. Just hold out for a quarter of an hour in this realm. After entering, you can act as you please, without any restraint!”","Obviously, this time, it wasn’t just one person selected, but a group. Holding out for a quarter of an hour couldn’t be done by just one person; it might require several.","Moreover, they could even act against each other, making it more interesting.","As Muchen’s voice fell, the Emperor among the guests couldn’t contain himself.","“My son, go with confidence and hold out for a quarter of an hour!”","“Yes!”","Not only the descendants of the family but also the Tribulation Realm powerhouses within the Qingyun Sect allowed their disciples to go forward.","Becoming a son-in-law meant obtaining a spot in the Sacred Assembly. Such crucial spots were limited to 20 in the entire Yue Kingdom.","Usually, when not taken seriously, half of the Emperors could go, leaving the rest to the Tribulation Realm experts.","However, this time was different from usual. Most likely, most forces would let the Tribulation Realm experts go.","After all, there were too few emperors who defied the heavens, especially when compared to other dynasties and kingdoms.","Yue Kingdom was too small.","Just like now, half of the powerful Emperors within the Yue Kingdom were present, and Jian Wushuang didn’t see anyone who seemed to defy the heavens, unlike the Divine Generals of the Qishen Temple back then.","“Wushuang, you go too!” Wu Li’s expression was solemn, pretending to be profound.","Only then did Jian Wushuang stand up, bow respectfully, and then enter that realm.","For a moment, several streaks of light flew in. A hundred people had entered.","The powerhouses in the hall then focused their gaze on these Emperor juniors."]},{"number":5682,"title":"Chapter 5682: Clever Name","paragraphs":["Chapter 5682: Clever Name","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Ts ts, each generation seems to be worse than the last!” Pang De smacked his lips and said, “There’s not a single decent one among them. How can they compare to the Emperor of Shi Kingdom, who defies the heavens?”","Although the words were harsh, they were also true.","But now, with different perspectives, Wu Li retorted, “I think these youngsters are not bad at all. At least they are much stronger than we were back then!”","Other powerful figures from the Tribulation Realm who brought their juniors with them also chimed in agreement.","“Haha, Pang De, I remember when you were still an Emperor, your divine power was only 90,000-fold. Look at these youngsters, which one of them isn’t stronger than you!”","“They are the future!”","Pang De just shook his head with a contemptuous smile.","He had been roaming in Shi Kingdom for a long time, and his insights far surpassed those of these people.","In Shi Kingdom, the Emperor who defied the heavens, not to mention the top ones, even the ordinary geniuses could erupt their divine power to more than 100,000-fold.","Now, looking at those Emperors below, whether they could reach a hundred thousand times was still a question.","Not to mention breaking through 100,000-fold.","In the entire Yue Kingdom, it was widely acknowledged that the strongest was the Grand Princess.","But now, she was choosing her husband based on martial prowess.","It was quite ironic when you thought about it.","If you insist on fishing in such a shallow pond as Yue Kingdom, what can you catch?","Although Pang De was straightforward by nature, he didn’t say much about it.","He knew what these people were thinking.","When Muchen saw that most people had arrived, he withdrew and, after glancing at the Empress, spoke, “Now, let’s begin officially!”","Buzz!","The world of the cave began to close off.","However, the people in the main hall could still see clearly.","Jian Wushuang, who entered the cave world, didn’t notice anything special at first. As the cave sealed off, his body gradually felt heavier, but it was bearable.","According to his calculations, even if the gravity increased continuously for a quarter of an hour, it wouldn’t pose too much threat to them.","He chose a spot closer to the edge.","At this moment, they hadn’t yet felt the pressure and looked around.","“Friends, I think there’s no need for us to act. Why don’t we wait for a quarter of an hour?” said the young patriarch of one of the top ten families in Great Yue, the Jiang family.","Although he was just a young patriarch, his strength was only average, with his divine power at around 95,000-fold.","“If we don’t act, everyone can withstand this slight increase in gravity for the duration of an incense stick. What will happen then? Won’t we still have to contend?”","Jiang Tianyang’s complexion changed slightly, and his aura began to rise.","Originally, he had intended to stabilize these people first because his strength was already considered top-notch among them, and he would definitely be besieged.","Choosing the son-in-law this time, if strength really mattered that much, why bother looking for them?","It was just a pretext.","Among them, there were also those who were aware, either through their own understanding or through the reminder of their family’s strong figures, of the reasons behind the situation.","“Attack!”","Boom!","Instantly, three Emperors made their move.","Their target? The young master of the family.","These three individuals were quite formidable, their divine power soaring to around 90,000-fold in an instant.","With these three leading the charge, more and more groups of fighters emerged in succession.","Jian Wushuang didn’t stand out, so he wasn’t targeted.","Some even proposed joining forces with him to take on the strongest prodigies.","But Jian Wushuang had no intention of doing so.","Their speculations weren’t entirely off base, or rather, the speculations of those in the Tribulation Realm weren’t entirely wrong.","However, Jian Wushuang received a message from Wu Li.","“Don’t hold back too much, try to defeat everyone as much as possible!”","This selection process wasn’t as simple as it seemed on the surface.","Jian Wushuang’s figure flickered, always skirting the edges of the battlefield.","In just a moment, several people left the scene.","All were heavily injured from being besieged, taken away by strong figures in the Tribulation Realm.","In the great hall, the Empress sighed softly.","These people were still too weak.","She valued strength, even if it meant finding a son-in-law for her daughter from the royal family. They couldn’t afford to be too weak.","Background could be a weakness, but strength couldn’t be lacking too much.","This time the selection of a son-in-law wasn’t as straightforward as outsiders perceived.","Elder Muchen also understood the Empress’s intentions and discreetly communicated, “Your Majesty, I have already made arrangements within the palace. There might be no need to select from the Yue Kingdom!”","“No, we must choose from among them. Those you arranged can handle the people from the Shi Kingdom, but they are not suitable to marry into the royal family. Their backgrounds are not clean!”","“Yes!” Muchen didn’t say much more.","They waited quietly for the situation inside the cave.","At this moment, Jian Wushuang’s performance was subtle, and his strength was the most deeply hidden among these people.","Almost none of them knew Jian Wushuang, only inquiring about him after he revealed the Hundred Flowers Vine previously.","However, asking around the surrounding people yielded little information.","“Jian Wushuang, are you planning to sit back and watch the show?”","As people continued to leave, the number had now halved.","Many also made time to look at Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang stopped, feeling the increasingly terrifying gravity. He knew very well that if he didn’t act soon, these people would lose their combat effectiveness.","It was time for him to perform.","“You’d better leave now!” Jian Wushuang clenched his fists, and his aura began to erupt.","A dark red light covered his body, crimson arcs representing the power of the Beast God.","His divine power began to rise continuously.","Increased gravity was a great help to the stronger Emperors.","Jiang Tianyang escaped from the siege of several people, and he began to confront others.","He had thought the battle was almost over, and it was now a matter of endurance.","He didn’t expect Jian Wushuang to prepare to strike at this moment.","And the Emperors, who were blocking Jian Wushuang, also looked sideways.","They could feel Jian Wushuang’s divine power instantly soaring to 90,000-fold.","“His divine power should be around 97,000-fold!” Jiang Tianyang stared at Jian Wushuang, sneering at those who were specifically attacking them with stronger strength. “Hmph, this time, you’ve hit a dead end!”","Jiang Tianyang, under the peak secret technique, could briefly erupt to 98,0900-fold divine power, ranking among the top three among these Emperors.","There were two others whose divine power could reach 99,000-fold thousand.","The rest was Jian Wushuang.","He had never been able to see through Jian Wushuang. Now that Jian Wushuang was erupting with divine power, he could sense that Jian Wushuang’s strength was extremely powerful, probably not inferior to his own.","The Emperors who were preparing to besiege Jian Wushuang also stopped.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t stop.","His divine power soared all the way, if he didn’t suppress it, it would have broken through 100,000-fold long ago.","It’s important to note that his basic divine power now was close to 100,000-fold, coupled with the Beast God’s power, he could easily break through 100,000-fold, even reaching 130,000-fold.","But there was no need for that, it was just for fun!","“Ahhh!!!” Jian Wushuang, unaffected by gravity, soared into the air, his fists bursting out fiercely, and he howled to the sky.","His divine power directly broke through 100,000-fold.","Becoming the strongest Emperor on the field."]},{"number":5683,"title":"Chapter 5683 Ended","paragraphs":["Chapter 5683 Ended","“How is it possible? His divine power has actually broken through to 100,000-fold!” Jiang Tianyang couldn’t believe it.","....","The Emperors who surrounded Jian Wushuang were even more shocked, their faces turning pale.","“100,000-fold divine power!”","In Yue Kingdom, this was already considered a top-notch Emperor.","Even the strong individuals in the hall who had reached the Tribulation Realm couldn’t help but glance at Wu Li, understanding why he had offered such a powerful treasure.","So he truly had that confidence!","100,000-fold divine power was more than enough to marry into the royal family.","The Grand Princess Jinchen also stared at Jian Wushuang, somewhat surprised but still not optimistic about his strength.","The outside world only knew that her divine power could reach 100,000-fold times, but they didn’t know that after her secret method breakthrough, her explosive divine power could rival those geniuses from the Shi Kingdom.","100,000-fold was just a foundation.","But for the Emperors below who didn’t even have enough divine power to match that, Jian Wushuang’s strength was already sufficient.","Muchen was becoming more and more satisfied with Jian Wushuang.","Not only because of the effect of the treasure.","From a comprehensive perspective of strength and background, Jian Wushuang was perfect.","Although not an Emperor of Yue Kingdom, his relationship with Wu Li was significant, he had a strong backing in Yue Kingdom, his strength was not weak, and he looked very young.","He was one of the most suitable candidates.","“Wu Li, your nephew is quite impressive!” Even Pang De couldn’t help but praise.","Emperors with 100,000-fold divine power were rare.","Yue Kingdom probably didn’t even have three.","Even in the Shi Kingdom, they were considered geniuses.","Wu Li smiled on the surface, but inside, he sneered.","If Jian Wushuang truly unleashed his full power, there would be no more than ten people present who could be his opponents.","And that was including the Empress and those strong individuals at the Four Tribulation realm.","He calculated his strength and believed that Wu Li’s combat power could rank in the top ten in the main hall, so he naturally assumed that Jian Wushuang’s strength was not weaker than his and could also enter the top ten.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power erupted, directly suppressing everyone in the cave sky.","Even if they weren’t suppressed, under the influence of the weight, these people couldn’t move.","“Everyone, my apologies!” Jian Wushuang casually flicked his hand, directly shaking several Emperors out of the battlefield.","Even under such gravity, shaking these people away meant they had no chance.","They understood very well that without 100,000-fold divine power, they couldn’t even move their bodies under this gravity; they were like fish on a chopping board, only able to be slaughtered by Jian Wushuang.","It was better to voluntarily withdraw than to continue like this.","“Jian Wushuang, with such strength, I, Tianyang, admire you. I willingly withdraw!” Jiang Tianyang spoke and chose to retreat, being teleported away directly.","The others hesitated for a moment and then followed suit, withdrawing one by one.","In less than 15 minutes, only Jian Wushuang was left in the cave sky.","“Indeed, they know what’s good for them!” Jian Wushuang revealed a hint of a smile.","Compared to these Emperors, this was nothing more than child’s play.","With over 90,000-fold divine power, he was almost comparable to some newly ascended Tribulation Realm beings; if he were in the Qishen Temple, he would definitely be among the peak existences.","But compared to the entire Yue Kingdom, he was still lacking.","Even the Moro Spacetime from before probably could only match one of the continents in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Ancient Moon Spacetime, nine heavens and ten lands.","Ten ancient continents, nine great heavens.","Being able to match one of them was considered not bad.","This was one of the nine temporal rivers, the strongest in the Starry Sky.","After everyone voluntarily withdrew, Jian Wushuang became the only candidate left.","The Empress naturally closed the cave sky and released Jian Wushuang.","“Wood King, take him to the palace later. I will leave first!” The Empress was mainly here for this matter. Now that it was concluded, she was satisfied with Jian Wushuang and got up to leave with the somewhat reluctant Crown Princess Jinchen.","Once again, everyone respectfully bid farewell.","After the Empress left, the pressure in the main hall dissipated.","Muchen directly gestured for Jian Wushuang to come up and sit beside him.","Jian Wushuang obediently went to Wu Li’s side and respectfully greeted Elder Muchen with clasped fists.","“After the banquet ends, let’s rest for a moment in the mansion with Brother Wu Li. I have some questions to ask you!” Elder Muchen said calmly.","He needed to confirm Jian Wushuang’s identity and strength once again.","This naturally wasn’t a problem. Without waiting for Jian Wushuang to speak, Wu Li directly agreed.","Jian Wushuang then sat down next to Wu Li accordingly.","And the banquet continued.","During the banquet, discussions about the Sacred Assembly made everyone particularly lively.","In the past, it hadn’t been this bustling.","After all, many of the Three Tribulation realm powerhouses present here had participated in the Sacred Assembly before.","To be eligible to attend the Sacred Assembly, the weakest among them needed to be a Three Tribulation realm Universe Master.","As for the Emperor, there weren’t many requirements. After all, going there would still grant them some ancient secrets and techniques from the Ancient Wood Sect, laying the foundation for their future Tribulation Realm.","But this time was somewhat different.","The emergence of the Divine Wood King.","Surely, the Ancient Wood Sect would be in an uproar.","However, this time, nobody knew why the Divine Wood King had appeared.","So it was best to reserve some extra slots for the Tribulation Realm experts.","Jian Wushuang listened on the side, feeling somewhat worried.","At this moment, Wu Li transmitted a message, “Don’t worry. Out of the 20 spots from Yue Kingdom, at least 30 percent will be given to the Emperor. Right now, we’re just one step away from entering the imperial palace to see what the royal family is up to. Once you marry into the royal family, the spots won’t be an issue!”","“Will the emergence of the Divine Wood King pose any resistance?”","“You’ve just arrived in the Ancient Wood Continent, so you might not know. Even at his peak, the Divine Wood King couldn’t reach the pinnacle of the Eighth Tribulation realm. He was just an ordinary Eighth Tribulation realm expert. After his Dao Arena collapsed, he lost his Eighth Tribulation realm combat power. Since then, he’s been barely hanging on, maintaining a Half-Step Eighth Tribulation realm at best. The treasures within the Wanliu Willow Divine Wood are more coveted by him than us. If we were to unlock the Wanliu Divine Tree, not only would he not obstruct us, he might even beg us to help him find the treasures to restore his vitality!”","These things, Wu Li heard them from that mistress, and they were probably true.","The Ten Thousand Willows Divine Tree, that’s the core of the Ancient Wood Continent.","The Ancient Wood Sect was established after the fall of the celestial maiden, but the Wanliu Willows existed since the era of the celestial maiden.","There’s simply no comparison.","Even the Ancient Wood Sect desires to enter the depths of the Wanliu Divine Tree, but every time they can only wander on the periphery, unable to penetrate into the very core.","To truly have great opportunities, one must enter the deepest parts.","When Jian Wushuang heard this, he felt a surge of excitement in his heart.","Life power!","The Universe Master of the Eight Tribulation realm can naturally give birth to an endless stream of Life power, but the burden of the scattered Tribulation Realm is too great. The Life power consumed in one strike would probably require countless epochs of slumber to replenish.","Even powerhouses like the Divine Wood King who founded the Ancient Wood Sect couldn’t sustain it.","This made him think of Mie Sheng; could Mie Sheng also be a scattered Tribulation Realm expert?","Back then, being able to slay Dong Jun meant surpassing at least the Seven Tribulation realm.","After the destruction of Higher Heavens, Mie Sheng entered the Moro Spacetime, only retaining the strength of a Half-Step Seven Tribulation realm. Upon entering the temporal river of the Original Universe, Mie Sheng’s strength could only maintain the level of the Six Tribulation realm."]},{"number":5684,"title":"Chapter 5684: The Loss of Vitality","paragraphs":["Chapter 5684: The Loss of Vitality","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Before he left, Mie Sheng transformed into the Temple of World Annihilation.","If Mie Sheng truly had no worries, why would he enter the Temple of World Annihilation instead of directly besieging the Qishen Temple?","Perhaps he also had some kind of flaw.","Just like Zhen Ling.","Zhen Ling had the Origin Source Sea, which could sustain vitality indefinitely. Plus, when he left, he helped Zhen Ling restore the flesh of the Qishen.","Just maintaining the vitality of the flesh alone took him a very long time.","If he were truly a scattered Seven Tribulations, he would probably have spent countless epochs.","That’s not something a Six Tribulation realm could compare to.","An Eight Tribulation realm with severe vitality loss.","Jian Wushuang was speechless.","For a moment, in a daze, it was time for the banquet to disperse.","Ten minutes past midnight.","Looking up, the stars in the sky glittered brightly.","These visible lights were not stars, but universes.","Each universe represented a master of the Three Tribulations.","In this Starry Sky, Jian Wushuang saw several dazzling universes, immense and vast.","They should be universes of the Seven Tribulations.","As for the Eight Tribulation Universe Masters, they should still exist in the Moro Spacetime, but they couldn’t be seen at all.","Those old guys could either incorporate the universe into their bodies or hide it in the chaos of spacetime, making it impossible for outsiders to find.","Wu Li and Jian Wushuang stood panting, waiting for Muchen in a courtyard of the Wood King’s Mansion.","“Wushuang, lost in thought?” Wu Li looked at Jian Wushuang staring into the sky, at a loss for words.","Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “Not really, just thinking, will the formation of these universes become a constraint on the Tribulation Realm!”","“Haha, you have a lot of thoughts, brother, but there is some truth to it. The universes are born above the Ancient Wood Continent and cannot be moved unless they become the Eight Tribulation realm!” Wu Li also looked up at the stars, able to see his own universe at a glance, then continued, “I once thought the same, but now, at this stage, where is there such lofty ambition? If I can reach the Five Tribulation realm in my lifetime, I will be satisfied!”","Yeah!","The stronger one becomes, the clearer their future becomes.","For Wu Li, a Universe Master at the Half-Step Four Tribulation realm, breaking through to this level was already quite commendable.","Ever since he gained control over the universe, Wu Li had accumulated countless epochs, and it wasn’t long before he would face his next tribulation. With his current strength and foundation, he had little to worry about.","However, upon reaching the Four Tribulation realm, anxiety started creeping in.","Despite his current combat prowess, advancing through the tribulation earlier was feasible. Yet, once he succeeded in this tribulation and reached the Four Tribulation realm, he had no certainty of overcoming the fifth tribulation.","Rather than rushing to break through, he decided to accumulate more strength and experience.","At least when the opportunity of the fifth tribulation presents itself, he would attempt the fourth tribulation.","Many peak third tribulation experts shared this sentiment.","But in the end, forced tribulations became inevitable. Upon reaching the Four Tribulation realm, lacking any fortuitous encounters, they could only anxiously wait.","Eventually, they would become disheartened, falling into solitary cultivation.","Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly, but he wasn’t particularly troubled.","Controlling the universe meant his existence wasn’t confined to the Ancient Moon Spacetime; instead, the universe condensed within his own body.","That was the advantage of the Extreme Dao.","He wasn’t bound by the Rule Laws of this particular realm.","However, it wasn’t as easy for the others who accompanied him to the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","After reaching the Tribulation Realm, they were likely to establish themselves in the Ancient Moon Spacetime. Even if they returned to the Original Universe, they would ultimately find themselves back in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Establishing themselves meant becoming part of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Jian Wushuang shook his head, pushing these thoughts aside.","What mattered now was securing their spots. Time was running out for them.","The Sacred Assembly would take place in just ten years, as per the recent information Wu Li had received.","Creak!","The door to the courtyard creaked open, revealing Elder Muchen.","However, the current Elder Muchen appeared far from the spirited figure seen in the main hall, instead showing signs of aging.","“Muchen, Elder Muchen!”","“Elder Muchen!”","The two hurried forward to greet him.","Elder Muchen waved his hand casually, saying, “There are no outsiders here, no need for formalities, sit down and let’s talk!”","The three of them sat in a pavilion, and Wuli demonstrated his attentiveness by pouring tea for Muchen and Jian Wushuang.","“Cough!” Elder Muchen didn’t hesitate to take a sip of tea.","Jian Wushuang and Wuli waited for Elder Muchen to speak.","With tea drank and everyone gathered, Elder Muchen adjusted his robes and got straight to the point.","“Since we are all insiders, I won’t hide anything from you. This time, the recruitment of a son-in-law is a last resort!”","As Elder Muchen recounted the situation, Jian Wushuang and Wu Li listened in amazement.","It turned out that Princess Jincheng, since childhood, had lived with her grandfather in the Shi Kingdom and only returned to Yue Kingdom after becoming an Immortal talent.","During her mortal years, she had been engaged to a prodigy from Shi Kingdom.","However, with the rise of the Empress, the future imperial throne was likely to be Princess Jincheng’s, and the engagement was put on hold.","If it were that simple, there wouldn’t have been so many troubling times afterward.","That prodigy from Shi Kingdom was no ordinary person; he was a scion of the royal family, with a background that couldn’t be overlooked despite not being a direct heir.","For a scion of Shi Kingdom’s royal family to marry into another kingdom would bring shame upon Shi Kingdom.","Yet, both parties were unwilling to let go.","The prodigy had even chased after Princess Jincheng to Yue Kingdom and was currently in the imperial palace.","Furthermore, he had made it clear that he would agree to call off the engagement only if the Emperor who married Princess Jincheng could defeat him.","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows upon hearing this and remarked, “He’s quite persistent!”","Unfortunately, the royal family of Yue Kingdom wouldn’t allow this marriage.","Whether it was for the dignity of Shi Kingdom or the power of the royal family of Yue Kingdom, Princess Jincheng’s marriage to him was impossible.","However, since they had known each other since childhood, forcibly breaking them apart wouldn’t be easy.","“Indeed!” Elder Muchen shook his head, saying, “Blame it on our current Emperor. He insisted on sending that little girl to Shi Kingdom for training. Now that she’s grown up, he doesn’t understand the struggles of the royal family!”","One from the royal family of Shi Kingdom, the other a legitimate heir of Yue Kingdom’s royal family.","In terms of background and strength, they were a suitable match.","But marriage was out of the question.","Yue Kingdom feared inviting trouble, while Shiguo feared losing face.","The latter could be overcome, but the former was absolutely unacceptable. No matter what, they couldn’t allow a scion of Shi Kingdom’s royal family to marry into Yue Kingdom.","It was a matter that threatened the imperial power.","“Elder, just tell me what needs to be done!” Jian Wushuang seemed to understand the implication.","Wu Li also stared at Muchen.","“In fact, it’s simple. Defeat that prodigy from Shi Kingdom and make him give up!” Elder Muchen said.","Upon hearing this, Wuli felt a surge of relief.","That sounded too easy.","But Muchen didn’t know Jian Wushuang’s true strength. He was still worried and couldn’t bring himself to discourage Jian Wushuang."]},{"number":5685,"title":"Chapter 5685: Shi Jiu","paragraphs":["Chapter 5685: Shi Jiu","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“In the Shi Kingdom, there was a prodigy named Shi Jiu, with formidable strength,” Muchen expressed his concern.","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows slightly. If even Elder Muchen was acknowledging someone’s strength, it definitely warranted serious attention.","However, Wu Li seemed even more confident than Jian Wushuang.","He patted his chest assuredly, saying, “You can rest assured, Brother Muchen. Since we’re all here, let me be straightforward. My nephew may have struggled in the Outer Domain, but his strength is unquestionable!”","“Have either of you heard of the Fifth Young Master of the Shi Family?” Muchen didn’t respond to Wu Li directly but instead mentioned a prominent figure from the neighboring country.","Upon hearing this, Wu Li pondered for a moment before exclaiming, “Are you referring to Shi Xiu from the Shi Kingdom?”","“Yes, precisely!” Muchen nodded. “The prodigy from the Shi Kingdom is his grandson.”","This time, even Wu Li furrowed his brow. “His grandson? Why haven’t I heard of him?”","“I just found out myself. He has an illegitimate child, who happens to be Shi Jiu’s father! This information is known to very few, a friend of mine just told me,” Muchen shook his head with a sigh.","If it weren’t for the royal family needing a son-in-law, he would have been quite interested in the prodigy from the Shi Kingdom.","That was Shi Xiu!","In the Shi Kingdom, he was a truly influential figure and a backbone of the royal family.","The reason why the Shi Kingdom could dominate over the Sixteen Kingdoms in this era, even rivaling powerful sects like the Ancient Wood Sect, was because of this influential figure.","He was a Universe Master at the Half-Step Seven Tribulation realm.","In the future, he was the most promising figure in the Ancient Wood Continent to advance to the status of a Universe Master at the Seven Tribulations Realm.","Seeing Wu Li’s expression, Elder Muchen lifted his teacup, took a sip, thinking he had startled Wu Li.","This piece of news had indeed stunned Wu Li, who immediately sent a private message to Jian Wushuang.","“When we go to the palace later, let’s be extra cautious. His background is too significant for us to afford to offend!”","If Elder Muchen had heard this, he might have been utterly flabbergasted.","After all, this was Shi Xiu’s grandson. Although Shi Xiu had many grandsons, with the bloodline of a Half-Step Seven Tribulations Realm powerhouse like Shi Xiu, how weak could they be?","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel that Wu Li was overestimating him.","Under normal circumstances, he would be outmatched without using the power of the Beast God.","He had experienced the true divine power of the princess, with a staggering force of 130,000-fold.","For the princess of the Shi Kingdom, who was so devoted, the opponent’s divine power would probably be around 150,000-fold.","He would need to exert twice the power of the Beast God just to suppress his opponent.","To defeat them, he would need three times the power.","In the Qishen Temple, only the Tribulation Realm could allow him to exert such power.","An Emperor, becoming so formidable.","The Kingdom of Yue wouldn’t tolerate an Emperor of such strength.","“How about it, are you confident?” Elder Muchen straightforwardly asked, “Jian Wushuang, can you reach 130,000-fold divine power?”","Jian Wushuang also understood Muchen’s intentions. Immediately, he stood up and unleashed the power of the Beast God within him.","Buzz!","His base divine power, from white flames, directly transformed into dark red, soaring from less than 100,000-fold to 130,000-fold.","By utilizing the power of the Beast God, he could now reach 130,000-fold divine power.","If he used double the Beast God power, it would be 160,0000-fold.","The limit of three times would reach 200,000-fold.","This was his current peak under normal circumstances.","If he were to use the power of the Starry Sky and employ the Eternal Ancient Transformation, it wouldn’t be comparable in terms of divine power.","After all, he was a practitioner of spacetime, and he had already gained recognition from time.","If he were to use the Eternal Ancient Transformation, it would arouse suspicion from outsiders.","He refrained from using his full power if he could help it.","His peak divine strength was sufficient among the Emperors.","At the peak, he reached the standard combat power of the Three Tribulation Realm.","Throughout the ancient moon spacetime, only the Great Divine Official mentioned by Wu Li possessed the combat power of a Three Tribulation realm Universe Master.","As long as his luck wasn’t too bad, he wouldn’t encounter an Emperor as eccentric as that.","Sensing that Jian Wushuang’s divine power exceeded 130,000-fold, Muchen nodded in satisfaction, not particularly surprised.","The fact that Wu Li could produce such precious treasures meant he definitely had some strength; otherwise, the treasures would have been given away for nothing.","“Nephew, with this level of strength, I can rest assured. However, I must make something clear beforehand. I have three people prepared within the palace now, regardless of whether they win or lose, it has nothing to do with Jinchen. You can rest assured about this. However, I don’t have much confidence in those three either. The main thing depends on you!” Muchen revealed a bit of his bottom line to the two.","Wu Li chuckled, “They’re all our own nephews. It won’t be long before we become relatives by marriage!”","With the matter settled, the three didn’t linger and left the Wood King’s Mansion directly, heading for the palace.","The Kingdom of Yue, the palace.","It was high above the clouds in the royal city.","Ordinary people couldn’t even see what the palace looked like.","Jian Wushuang followed Muchen’s guidance to reach the main gate of the palace; otherwise, he wouldn’t even be able to find the door.","No wonder he couldn’t sense the powerful individuals inside the palace when he entered the royal city.","Now, outside the gate, he could feel a faint pressure.","The aura was majestic!","“Your Highness!” The guards at the gate were all formidable figures of the Tribulation Realm.","Such grandeur.","Guided by the attendants, Jian Wushuang and the others entered the imperial palace.","Only after entering did Jian Wushuang truly understand the power of the Tribulation Realm.","What they saw here resembled the peak era of the Moro Spacetime.","Although the Qishen Temple claimed to inherit the ancient Moro Spacetime, it paled in comparison to this place.","In the Eastern Palace, within the Crown Prince’s residence.","Smack!","Inside the Dongsheng Hall.","Princess Jincheng had reverted to her true appearance, the maiden Jian Wushuang had seen.","At this moment, Princess Jincheng, in front of the Empress, smashed the pillar in the hall with a single palm.","“I won’t marry anyone except him!” Princess Jincheng’s temper flared, unstoppable by anyone.","Empress Fengchen furrowed her brows, glaring at Jincheng, and angrily shouted, “You won’t marry?”","“I won’t, even if I ascend to the throne, I won’t marry anyone!”","Swish!","The Empress’s figure instantly appeared before Princess Jincheng, and with a flick of her hand, she delivered a slap because her words had touched the Empress’s limit.","The sound was crisp.","Princess Jincheng froze, staring at the eyes so similar to Empress Fengchen’s, watery and teary.","“You hit me!” Jincheng couldn’t believe it.","Her mother, though cold to others, had never treated her like this.","Empress Fengchen coldly said, “You won’t take the throne?”","She wanted to burst into laughter.","Countless eyes were fixed on the throne of Yue Kingdom.","Once seated, the royal family would have access to abundant resources. With Princess Jincheng’s potential, she would soon reach the Three Tribulation realm and command the universe.","But in the later stages, countless resources would be needed.","These resources, only the royal family could afford in Yue Kingdom, but even if they could afford it, it depended on the person.","Becoming the Imperial Emperor of Yue Kingdom naturally gave one that qualification."]},{"number":5686,"title":"Chapter 5686: It’s Not Up to You","paragraphs":["Chapter 5686: It’s Not Up to You","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Becoming the Empress meant the beginning of a journey towards becoming a powerhouse in the Four Tribulation Realm.","To sit as the fourth and aim for the fifth—this was a dream that many pursued but few achieved. How could she not understand this?","In this world, emotions mattered little. Once strength couldn’t keep up, one would be scorned. This was an eternal truth.","In the future, when one became a scattered Tribulation and the other a flourishing Universe Master, regret would be too late.","Gazing into her mother’s cold eyes, Jincheng dared not argue further.","“This matter is not up to you. But I can give you one promise: after you ascend to the throne and become a powerhouse in the Tribulation Realm, I will no longer interfere with you!” This statement gave Jincheng a glimmer of hope, albeit an excuse.","Jincheng was clever enough to grasp her mother’s intentions swiftly.","She could marry someone she didn’t like, they could live separately, and even after reaching the Four Tribulation realm, she could still seek out her Shi Jiu.","Yet, even so, she was somewhat unwilling.","When would that be?","She was only an emperor now; there was still a long way to go before reaching the Tribulation Realm.","Breaking through to the Tribulation Realm would lead to swift advancement to the Three Tribulation stage, but reaching the Four Tribulation stage wouldn’t be so easy.","“Shi Jiu, can you wait for me?” Jincheng silently prayed in her heart.","Meanwhile, just as Jian Wushuang and his companions arrived outside the hall, they noticed two others waiting there as well.","One was old, the other young.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t gauge the old man’s strength, but he seemed stronger than Wu Li, yet not by much.","He had little vitality, indicating he wasn’t a Universe Master but rather a scattered Tribulation.","Standing beside him was a young man, exuding an aura of nobility, with a firm and meticulous appearance.","It seemed that this person was the genius of the Shi Kingdom, Shi Jiu.","As the three of them steadied themselves, another three individuals arrived.","They were all Emperors, presumably the three Emperors arranged by Elder Muchen.","They were extraordinary Emperors brought in from other kingdoms.","Such matters could be easily resolved with a bit of money.","However, due to royal dignity, the Wang Clan didn’t go too overboard.","As for those within Yue Kingdom, they were persuaded to withdraw.","There were those who exceeded ten thousand times in strength, but the difference in power was too vast.","Calculating it this way, the four challengers to the prodigies of the Shi Kingdom this time, each one being from Yue Kingdom, was ironic enough when spoken aloud.","Fortunately, Wu Li had foresight and had arranged Jian Wushuang to make an appearance in Qingyun Sect early on, and under Elder Muchen’s guidance, he could now be considered a person of Yue Kingdom.","“Lord Muchen!” The three Emperors greeted Elder Muchen with respect.","After all, Elder Muchen had summoned them.","But since there were outsiders present, Elder Muchen didn’t say much, just nodded faintly.","The three of them glanced at Jian Wushuang at first, but since they didn’t notice anything remarkable about him, they paid him no further attention and instead focused on Shi Jiu himself.","He was the real adversary.","“Your Majesty, summon everyone, and follow me!”","Soon, a soft-spoken old man in a black robe and tall hat emerged from the hall and summoned everyone inside.","Entering the Dongsheng Hall, they saw the Empress, but didn’t spot Princess Jincheng’s figure.","At this moment, Princess Jincheng stood behind the screen, able to clearly see the scene inside the hall, but the people inside couldn’t perceive the presence of the princess.","Shi Jiu looked around, not finding his beloved, feeling somewhat uneasy.","He wasn’t afraid of those Emperors from Yue Kingdom, but he feared for Jincheng being threatened.","A faint telepathic message came through.","Shi Jiu received the transmission from Jinchen, and only then did his breath stabilize. At the same time, he silently responded to the transmission, “Don’t worry, I won’t let you wait!”","Princess Jinchen didn’t want Shi Jiu to risk it, so she voiced her thoughts. As long as she reached the Four Tribulation realm, no one could stop her. However, Shi Jiu was confident. Among the Emperors, he feared no one.","In the Shi Kingdom, there were a few geniuses who could threaten him, but in the Yue Kingdom, he was invincible.","This wasn’t arrogance; it was a fact.","If it weren’t for the sudden appearance of Jian Wushuang, even if they turned the Yue Kingdom upside down, they wouldn’t find an emperor who could match Shi Jiu.","“Shi brat, don’t say my Yue Kingdom won’t tolerate you. If you defeat the geniuses of my Yue Kingdom today, I won’t interfere in your matters!” The Empress spoke directly.","Elder Muchen had already explained everything about Jian Wushuang. At this moment, even the Empress had some confidence.","“With the Empress’s words as solid as a mountain, I am willing to take up the challenge!” Shi Jiu took a step forward, standing in the center of the grand hall, his gaze becoming fierce.","“Who will go first!” He looked at the four people, his aura continuously rising.","Just as Jian Wushuang was about to step forward, he was stopped by Wu Li.","“Let the other three go first. Muchen has already paid up; we can’t let them have it so easy!” Wu Li transmitted his thoughts.","Muchen also shared the same sentiment, wanting these three to test the opponent’s strength first.","The three were evenly matched in strength, coming here for this purpose, so they didn’t hesitate and one of them stepped forward.","“I’ll give it a try!” The person was clad in heavy armor. As soon as his words fell, his aura surged.","His divine power directly soared to 130,000-fold.","He had already reached the pinnacle of the One Tribulation realm.","Shi Jiu glanced sideways, the person in front of him was unfamiliar, but the eruption of 130,000-fold divine powers indicated he was not ordinary.","He, too, erupted with 130,000-fold divine power.","Jian Wushuang stared at the two, sensing that Shi Jiu hadn’t exerted his full strength, while the Emperor summoned by Elder Muchen had reached his peak.","Moreover, the vitality on this Emperor seemed somewhat weak.","He should be much older than them.","Princess Jincheng and the prodigy named Shi Jiu were probably born less than a thousand millennia ago.","A thousand millennia, in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, was a considerable amount of time, especially for Tribulation Realm powerhouses.","It was akin to a closed-door cultivation period.","In such ancient temporal rivers like the Ancient Moon Spacetime, time was measured in epochs.","For instance, the era of the Divine Spirits Era during the peak period of the Ancient Wood Continent.","The Flame God Divine Spirit within the Shi Kingdom, at the pinnacle of the Eight Tribulation realm, was renowned throughout the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Those who could establish an era were generally the masters of the Eight Tribulation realm.","The era of that Flame God hadn’t passed long ago.","The peak of the current era had yet to arrive, giving everyone a chance.","“Come on!” Shi Jiu stretched out his hand, and with a flick, silver scales appeared on his body.","The two lunged at each other, each launching their own attacks.","Just in a momentary confrontation, the armored Emperor could feel Shi Jiu’s terror. If he had taken that punch head-on, he might have been seriously injured.","Yet, he could sense that Shi Jiu hadn’t exerted even a bit more divine power.","Clearly, they both had 130,000-fold divine power, so why was there such a vast difference?","Jian Wushuang also marveled at this sight. It was his first time witnessing a showdown between the Emperor prodigy and the genius of the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","He discovered a staggering gap.","In the same cultivation realm, with equal strength, experience was more crucial.","Although Shi Jiu had elevated his divine power to match his opponent’s, he could still easily defeat him."]},{"number":5687,"title":"Chapter 5687: Shi Jiu’s Strength","paragraphs":["Chapter 5687: Shi Jiu’s Strength","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Emperor Mangjia attacked once again, pushing his aura to the extreme, relentlessly assaulting with every punch carrying the force of 130,000-fold divine power.","He continuously drove Shi Jiu back, each of his moves finding its mark.","With relentless attacks that lasted only moments, Emperor Mangjia’s aura began to wane.","Shi Jiu, who had been passively enduring the onslaught, remained unfazed.","“It’s my turn!” Shi Jiu smirked, darting forward and appearing in front of Emperor Mangjia in an instant.","With a swift motion, he raised his foot and delivered a fierce kick to Emperor Mangjia’s face.","With just one kick, Emperor Mangjia staggered back several steps, his head left unprotected, his divine body displaying visible cracks.","He couldn’t believe it—despite employing the same divine power, his relentless assault failed to harm his opponent in the slightest, while he himself was repelled and injured by a single strike.","“This can’t be!”","He couldn’t accept it!","Wiping the blood from the corner of his mouth, he once again surged his aura to its peak, forming hand seals and unleashing bursts of divine power, creating immensely powerful energy spheres.","Jian Wushuang shook his head lightly at the sight.","Relying solely on divine power had its drawbacks, primarily the excessive consumption.","Though the strength was formidable, continuing like this might exhaust him before defeating his opponent.","Emperor Mangjia’s relentless assault did have some effect.","Shi Jiu began to struggle under the onslaught, his divine power showing a slight decline.","Yet Emperor Mangjia wasn’t faring any better; his divine power had already decreased to 120,000-fold.","If it dropped further, his attacks would pose no threat to Shi Jiu.","Enduring countless waves of energy, Shi Jiu blocked with his arms, taking a half step back before erupting once more.","His entire aura suddenly changed, and he forcefully charged through the energy waves, catching Emperor Mangjia off guard, who was completely engrossed in his attack and hadn’t anticipated Shi Jiu’s countercharge.","Isn’t there a saying that goes something like, the best defense is a good offense?","Well, it doesn’t seem to apply now.","In an instant, Shi Jiu charged right up to his opponent, delivering a direct punch that caved into the chest of Emperor Mangjia.","Even Mangjia’s formidable armor showed signs of cracking.","That was a treasure of the universe.","Even a Universe Treasure showed a hint of damage, not to mention Emperor Mangjia’s divine body, which had now been completely shattered.","His divine power plummeted from 120,000-fold to less than 50,000-fold.","He almost fell into a state of unconsciousness.","Originally, Emperor Mangjia had intended to trade injuries, but he hadn’t expected to be defeated so easily.","The remaining two looked at each other, their confidence instantly shattered.","Initially, they had planned for a rotating battle strategy, with the next stepping in if the first failed.","This would gradually wear down the opponent’s divine power.","But now, it seemed that Shi Jiu’s divine power hadn’t changed at all, not even his aura fluctuated, remaining as steady as before.","It was as if he had just sipped a cup of tea with ease.","Emperor Mangjia struggled to his feet, trembling as he admitted defeat, “I have lost!”","With that, he stepped aside, while Elder Muchen’s expression turned ashen.","He never expected Shi Jiu to be this strong.","Even Princess Jincheng’s power was only a little over 130,000-fold. Even with extraordinary divine power and some secret techniques, she was only a step above these three.","But Shi Jiu’s displayed strength surpassed these three Emperors by several levels at least.","Empress Fengchen, as the strongest present at the Five Tribulations realm, the Universe Master, saw through it all.","This time, they might lose.","There was some hesitation in her heart.","If they lost, how could they salvage the situation?","Shi Jiu flexed his wrist, seemingly dissatisfied with the punch he just threw.","He stared at the remaining few individuals and spoke, “How about you all come at me together?”","His words were provocative.","After all, they were all geniuses; how could they team up?","That would be too shameful.","Elder Muchen, however, had thick skin. He spoke up directly, “Since that’s the case, let’s all go together. Young people love pushing their limits!”","After speaking, he even winked at Jian Wushuang.","But Jian Wushuang remained unmoved.","Then Elder Muchen turned to Wu Li.","Wu Li, however, felt a bit troubled. He privately messaged, “Elder Muchen, my nephew is quite young. You know how young people are, they value their face a lot. But don’t worry, no matter how strong the opponent is this time, I have absolute confidence in him!”","With words spoken thus, Elder Muchen didn’t insist further.","The remaining two Emperors nodded at each other. Money talks; they couldn’t care less about their reputation and could only grit their teeth and go at it together.","This time, the two of them were fully prepared, and with Elder Muchen’s promise, as long as they injured Shi Jiu, it counted as a great achievement. The previously promised treasures could also be increased by 50 percent.","“So, it’s just you two left?” Shi Jiu’s gaze shifted from the two individuals to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang also looked at him, a hint of a smile crossing his face as he nodded calmly.","Electric arcs flickered in Shi Jiu’s eyes; he could sense Jian Wushuang’s extraordinariness, definitely stronger than the two before him.","However, his own strength was not to be underestimated either. Even if Jian Wushuang had hidden cards, he had even stronger ones.","He was Shi Xiu’s grandson, not only with a powerful bloodline but also not lacking in formidable treasures.","Due to his father being an illegitimate child, he had suffered quite a bit since childhood. Later, because of the downfall of his enemies, Shi Xiu felt indebted to his son and compensated everything to this grandson.","Shi Jiu didn’t disappoint as the most outstanding figure of the Shi family’s current generation, and also one of the super strong figures of the rejuvenating Shi Kingdom.","With a leap, he became one of the most outstanding Emperors of the Shi family’s current generation.","Moreover, he had always retained his strength, always hiding something.","This was related to his early experiences. Before his father fell, he had instructed him to always conceal his strongest cards, to only reveal techniques that had never been used before, as those were the true trump cards.","Once unleashed, the opponent would perish.","That’s the only way to always have a trump card.","Unfortunately, he had misunderstood. Back then, it wasn’t as prosperous as it was now, there was no need for hidden cards while enjoying the cool breeze under a big tree. The more one showcased themselves, the more attention they garnered, and the more treasures they obtained.","“Shi Jiu, don’t be arrogant!”","Two Emperor geniuses made their move together, only to find that Shi Jiu didn’t even regard them, which infuriated them even more. They immediately ignited their divine bodies.","Elder Muchen had already promised them that all the treasures consumed during the confrontation would be counted on his account, so they fought without hesitation.","They didn’t spare anything, directly burning 30 percent of their divine bodies, reaching their limits.","Their divine power erupted directly to a 136,000-fold.","This was the pinnacle of the One Tribulation realm.","The peak of the Two Tribulation realm was around 180,000-fold.","The standard divine power of the Three Tribulation realm was around 200,000-fold.","Shi Jiu’s hand condensed suddenly, and as he clenched his fist, a purple thunderbolt had already formed in the palm of his hand.","His divine power remained unchanged, but the thunderbolt in his palm burst out with over 140,000-fold divine power."]},{"number":5688,"title":"Chapter 5688 There’s Still a Chance","paragraphs":["Chapter 5688 There’s Still a Chance","“What’s this?”","....","The two Emperors prodigies were greatly astonished, but before they could exchange words, a thunderous explosion erupted before them.","Shi Jiu’s eyes glimmered with thunder.","With just a glance, thunder poured down like a waterfall, engulfing the two of them.","Even the Empress couldn’t help but be moved by this scene.","The force just now seemed to exceed her expectations of the Emperors.","Could there truly be Emperors of such immense power in the world?","Muchen’s face turned ashen!","This was somewhat different from the information he had received!","How could the other party be so powerful?","The two Emperors were enveloped in thunder, unable to escape at all, already trapped to death.","“How could he be this strong!”","Neither of them dared to believe it. This thunderous cage had already erupted with a divine power of 150,000-fold, something they couldn’t possibly break through.","Meanwhile, Shi Jiu was casually manipulating the thunderous cage. With just a flick of his hand, he could easily defeat these two.","Huff!","Jian Wushuang shook his head, unwilling to watch any longer. Instead of wasting time here, he might as well act early.","Among those present, except for Wu Li, no one probably had any hope for Jian Wushuang.","Even Empress Fengchen felt hopeless.","Elder Muchen sighed, “Brother Wu Li, this time it’s my fault for the misinformation!”","He had already deemed Jian Wushuang to have no hope at all.","“Brother Muchen, the situation is uncertain. There may still be a chance!” Wu Li said confidently.","This made Elder Muchen somewhat doubtful.","His gaze towards Jian Wushuang was solemn. How could Wu Li be so confident?","Could it be that Jian Wushuang was Wu Li’s illegitimate child?","The more he looked, the more he felt the resemblance between the two!","But since Wu Li had said so, he had no choice but to believe him, directly transmitting his voice to let the two trapped in the Thunder Prison give up.","Those two also felt hopeless, not prepared to persevere much longer.","But upon hearing that Muchen still wanted to withhold treasures, they couldn’t help but feel somewhat displeased.","“Lord Muchen, my two brothers still have a move that can definitely seriously injure the other party, but the price is a bit high!”","After hearing this, Muchen was somewhat incredulous, but still nodded in agreement.","He would bear any cost.","Being able to seriously injure them was the best outcome.","Princess Jincheng behind the screen was thrilled to see this. She hadn’t expected Shi Jiu’s strength to be so formidable, actually being able to easily defeat these three Emperors.","And these two had even erupted with a 136,000-fold divine power.","Though not as strong as her, if they joined forces, she feared it would be difficult to suppress them, let alone defeat them.","Thinking of this, she understood somewhat. Perhaps Shi Jiu didn’t want to harm her, so he had been holding back his strength.","She was a very strong-willed person, quite similar to the Empress in this regard.","Indeed, Shi Jiu had been hiding things from Jincheng for this reason.","Of course, what his father had told him was even more important.","“Surrender, it’s meaningless now!” Shi Jiu controlled the prison with his palm, exerting a slight force, causing the two in the Thunder Prison to almost kneel.","They couldn’t bear it at all.","“Tsk tsk, you are indeed powerful. Clearly having the same divine power, and even inferior to the two of us, yet you can unleash such a powerful move. I admit we can’t win this time!” The two stared at Shi Jiu, indeed ready to give up, but they wouldn’t let him off so easily.","“But, don’t think you’ll have it easy either!”","As soon as the words fell, Shi Jiu’s pupils contracted, instantly sensing a threat approaching. With a forceful palm, he intended to directly defeat the two.","But it was too late!","The Thunder Prison was instantly dissolved by a black mist, and that mass of black fog rushed straight towards him.","The Empress stood up directly from her throne the moment the black fog appeared.","Her eyes were as deep as a Starry Sky, staring at the black mist, fear evident in her eyes.","She had seen and heard of this black mist before.","This was a power not belonging to this era, how could it appear here?","Others couldn’t discern the special nature of the black mist at all.","Even Jian Wushuang, feeling only the force of the black mist consuming, saw nothing particularly unique about it.","But when it assaulted Shi Jiu after dissolving the thunderous cage, a familiar aura struck Jian Wushuang, causing his expression to darken.","The power of Death!","It was an incredibly potent force of Death.","Upon touching Shi Jiu, it instantly devoured much of his vitality.","Shi Jiu’s divine power plummeted in an instant.","Fortunately, the power of Death did not belong to the two Emperors, weakening continuously.","Otherwise, it could have directly strangled Shi Jiu.","This threat was something Shi Jiu had never experienced before, too terrifying.","If an ordinary Tribulation Realm cultivator encountered such a dense black mist, it would likely leave behind a curse, rendering them unable to recover vitality for their entire life.","Fortunately, Shi Jiu was only an Emperor.","Even so, the black mist dissolved nearly half of his body, leaving only bones.","His face was the same, with horrified bones exposed to the outside world.","Jin Chen, witnessing this scene, felt extreme heartache, almost rushing out, but was stopped by the Empress.","Initially, the Empress was also ready to intervene, but at the thought of Jian Wushuang losing again, she couldn’t bring herself to do it.","In the end, she held back.","“Haha, he indeed can’t resist it. Let’s strike now!” one of the Emperors laughed.","Seizing the opportunity, the two Emperors attacked again.","Shi Jiu was now at his weakest, unable to withstand the two of them at all.","Even though the strength of the two Emperors had weakened considerably, they still overwhelmed him completely.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t bear to watch anymore. Two against one, resorting to such despicable means.","Moreover, the appearance of the power of Death made him vigilant.","On the other hand, Muchen was excited. With the tide of battle turning, Shi Jiu’s current vulnerability was akin to a blank sheet of paper. Perhaps he wouldn’t even need Jian Wushuang to intervene to win.","Judging from the current situation, it seemed to be true.","Shi Jiu’s divine power had plummeted below 100,000-fold.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t see it that way.","Even though his divine power had decreased, his divine body hadn’t shattered at all.","The divine power Origin Source could be instantly restored.","Shi Jiu took out a piece of uncut jade from his mustard seed, crushed it, and instantly his missing flesh grew back, and his divine power began to skyrocket as it recovered.","“Die!” There was a murderous intent in Shi Jiu’s eyes as he directly went for the kill, his divine power skyrocketing to 150,000-fold, defeating the two opponents with a punch each in an instant.","Moreover, a thunderbolt condensed in his palm again. This thunderbolt was not a cage but a sharp blade that pierced through the chests of the two opponents.","At this moment, Muchen directly intervened and said, “Leave these two alive!”","It was just a trial; one couldn’t kill. This was a prearranged rule.","Upon hearing Muchen’s words, not only did Shi Jiu not stop, but he also swung his blade, intending to deal with the two directly.","Just now, he had almost died at the hands of these two, and if he hadn’t had a trick up his sleeve, they probably would have crippled him even if they hadn’t tried to kill him.","Seeing that Shi Jiu was still about to attack, Muchen immediately flashed to his side and forcefully separated the three with a surge of powerful divine power.","The two Emperors were thrown off like dead dogs, falling to the ground, completely unable to move."]},{"number":5689,"title":"Chapter 5689: Jian Wushuang Steps Onto the Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 5689: Jian Wushuang Steps Onto the Stage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Empress calmed her emotions for a moment and conveyed her thoughts to Muchen. These two individuals couldn’t be let go; they needed to ascertain the origin of the black mist that had just appeared.","Although Muchen was somewhat puzzled, if the Empress said so, it meant the situation was far from simple.","He refrained from asking further questions.","On the other hand, Shi Jiu was somewhat annoyed.","The formidable Four Tribulation realm expert beside him also opened his eyes at this moment.","He didn’t look at Muchen but rather at the Empress of Yue Kingdom. Though he didn’t speak, a cold snort from him shook the hall.","“Elder Shi Han, indeed, I was rude just now!” The Empress nodded slightly, expressing her apology.","This Elder Shi Han was a prominent figure from the Shi Kingdom in the previous era.","Back then, he possessed the strength of a peak Four Tribulation realm expert.","Unfortunately, he failed to overcome the tribulation and now, having become a scattered Tribulation Realm expert, his strength was inferior to that of a typical Four Tribulation realm expert.","Even so, he would have acted just now if not for Shi Jiu’s intervention.","If he had acted, the Empress would have surely taken the opportunity to drive him away.","For the sake of Muchen, he had endured much.","“Your Majesty Fengchen, don’t forget, he is the grandson of the Fifth Lord. He carries the blood of our Shi family!” Shi Han’s voice was loud, not merely waving a big flag.","In the current Ancient Wood Continent, the Shi family held significant influence.","Moreover, the Shi Kingdom even possessed a Flame God that could suppress the existence of the Divine Wood King.","A small country like Yue Kingdom dared to treat descendants of the Shi family in such a manner.","If it weren’t for Shi Jiu’s infatuation, he would have eagerly exposed this matter, letting the Yue Kingdom know how terrifying the anger of the Shi Kingdom could be.","“Senior Shi Han, please stop talking. I, Shi Jiu, came here with determination!” Gasping for breath, Shi Jiu, first injured by the power of Death and then internally shaken by Muchen, was somewhat unstable in his divine body.","His strength had declined quite a bit now.","But it didn’t have much of an impact.","Now, only Jian Wushuang remained.","As long as he defeated Jian Wushuang, he could rightfully marry Jinchen or marry into the Yue Kingdom, and he was willing to do so.","As long as his grandfather supported him, it was enough.","Princess Jinchen behind the screen watched this scene with heartache.","The Empress’s face showed some embarrassment at the words.","Had she ever been threatened like this before?","The anger of the Shi family?","The Empress also had anger in her eyes. If she were in the Seven Tribulation realm, what would she fear from the Shi Kingdom?","What would she fear from others entering the Yue Kingdom?","Unfortunately, she wasn’t!","So she had to fight.","In this Sacred Assembly, she must secure the position of the Holy Maiden.","Then she would abdicate the throne of the Yue Kingdom, go to the Ancient Wood Sect with endless resources, and have no worries about the sixth tribulation.","After becoming a Six Tribulation realm expert, she would wholeheartedly prepare for the seventh tribulation.","With the support of the Ancient Wood Sect, she also had great confidence.","If she continued to advance, even with the combined strength of her entire clan, she wouldn’t have the confidence to reach the Seven Tribulation realm.","The Six Tribulation realm was already her limit.","Moreover, it was unstable. Otherwise, she would have already crossed the sixth tribulation.","Muchen paid no attention to the foolish Shi Han and instead turned to Jian Wushuang, saying, “It’s all up to you. Don’t feel pressured. Shi Jiu is already injured, so you still have a good chance!”","Jian Wushuang nodded lightly and took a step forward, already in front of Shi Jiu.","When the Empress looked at Jian Wushuang, she couldn’t quite see through him. Deep down, however, she hoped Jian Wushuang could defeat his opponent.","Princess Jincheng behind the screen also kept her eyes on Jian Wushuang. She always felt that Jian Wushuang resembled the mysterious strongman she had encountered on Hundred Flowers Mountain, and she was deeply worried.","“You’re very strong!” Jian Wushuang faced Shi Jiu.","No one expected that the first thing Jian Wushuang said would be to praise Shi Jiu.","Shi Jiu smiled and said casually, “Although I can’t see through you, I can feel that you’re different from the three before you!”","“It’s true, I am somewhat different!” Jian Wushuang admitted directly, without any concealment.","After saying that, to everyone’s surprise, he took out a Life-Restoring Fruit brought from the Qishen Temple from his mustard seed bag.","This was a treasure for enhancing divine bodies and also for restoring them.","In a realm dominated by divine power, it was most suitable for cultivators.","Swish!","Jian Wushuang threw it without any hesitation.","Shi Jiu was momentarily stunned but still caught it.","Not only Shi Jiu, but the others also couldn’t understand what Jian Wushuang was doing.","Emperor Mangjia, who had been easily defeated by Shi Jiu earlier, was even more astonished and asked, “What is he trying to do?”","The Empress’s eyes kept flashing, unable to understand Jian Wushuang’s intentions.","“Wu Li, what’s going on here? Could it be that the fruit is highly toxic?” Muchen speculated privately through voice transmission.","However, Wu Li just rolled his eyes, finding the prince embarrassing. He directly said, “Nothing much, perhaps my nephew feels it’s too shameful to defeat an injured Emperor!”","“Hmm...” Muchen was completely stunned.","Isn’t this too confident?","Shi Jiu’s previous burst of divine power had already exceeded 150,000-fold, and that was when he was injured. Perhaps he’s even more powerful than this, and there might be a hidden move.","Isn’t he afraid of losing?","At this moment, he couldn’t care less and directly reminded Jian Wushuang, “Newphew Wushuang, you must think it through. Whoever marries Jincheng will secure a spot in the Sacred Assembly!”","“Brother Muchen, saying such things takes the fun out of it!”","Standing on the sidelines, Shi Han sneered at the two, but he couldn’t help but look at Jian Wushuang differently for his actions.","Compared to the previous few, Jian Wushuang was clearly more pleasing to the eye.","“This fool wasted the trump card he just used!”","The two Emperors who were nearly killed by Shi Jiu looked at Jian Wushuang as if he were an idiot.","Shi Jiu held the green fruit in his hand, using Thought power to examine it and found nothing wrong. He sincerely said, “Thank you!”","Crack!","He took a bite, and green juice flowed out from the corner of his mouth.","Powerful vitality and boundless divine power surged into Shi Jiu’s body in an instant.","In just a moment, he returned to his peak state, even stronger than before.","Hum!","Shi Jiu clenched his fists slightly, exerting force, and his divine power erupted directly, accompanied by thunderous strength surging around him.","150,000-fold divine power.","“How are you feeling? Have you recovered?” Jian Wushuang inquired.","Shi Jiu immediately took out 100,000 universe crystals from his mustard seed and thanked him, saying, “Please accept this, my friend. It would be a waste for me to keep such precious treasures!”","He actually had recovery treasures of his own, but their effects were definitely not as potent as the Life-Restoring Fruit.","“Just a fruit, it’s nothing worth mentioning,” Jian Wushuang shook his head with a smile. However, since the other party insisted, he accepted it.","To avoid any awkwardness later on, if the other party felt hesitant to go all out against him.","Elder Muchen couldn’t hold back anymore. At this point, he even doubted whether Jian Wushuang had been bribed.","Just as he was about to speak up, he was pulled back by Wu Li.","As a citizen of Yue Kingdom, though not of the royal family, Wu Li felt that if Muchen continued, the dignity of Yue Kingdom would be compromised.","Although the Empress was somewhat puzzled, she still greatly appreciated Jian Wushuang’s actions.","A dispute among gentlemen should be conducted with integrity and honor."]},{"number":5690,"title":"Chapter 5690: Peak Duel (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5690: Peak Duel (1)","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If Jian Wushuang truly won, it would be like finding a treasure for her, a member of the Yue royal family.","Securing a spot in the Sacred Assembly could attract such talent. This deal was definitely not a loss.","Moreover, it would represent not just Yue, but also the Yue royal family. This was a chance for them to save face.","Behind the screen, the Crown Princess clenched her fists, feeling ecstatic. She was filled with confidence in Shi Jiu now.","“Let’s begin then!”","“Bring it on!”","Both of them surged with energy simultaneously.","Jian Wushuang unleashed the power of the Beast God, instantly boosting himself to 130,000-fold.","But that wasn’t enough. To ensure victory, he directly doubled the power of the Beast God.","At this moment, his divine power reached a terrifying 160,000-fold.","This was already at the top level among the Two Tribulation realm.","Shi Jiu’s eyes flickered. He anticipated Jian Wushuang’s strength, but he didn’t expect him to unleash 160,000-fold divine power right from the start.","Even though he was proficient in controlling divine power and could easily defeat opponents with the same divine power, Jian Wushuang was no slouch either!","Muchen’s eyes sparkled even more. Holding Wu Li’s arm, he exclaimed excitedly, “Brother Wu Li, we’re family now, and yet you still hid this from me. Nephew Wushuang can actually unleash 160,000-fold divine power!”","Jian Wushuang’s strength excited him more than anyone else.","Now, Jian Wushuang was even stronger than Shi Jiu, surpassing him by more than 10,000-fold divine power.","That was a considerable difference.","The three Emperors who had been defeated earlier were even more astonished. Wasn’t it agreed that their strengths were more or less equal?","And they also knew that within the Yue Kingdom, there was no Emperor prodigy, otherwise they wouldn’t have been approached.","How could a super genius with a divine power of 160,000-fold suddenly emerge?","With such a genius around, why bother seeking them out? It’s a blatant insult to them.","Absolutely humiliating!","Shi Han couldn’t help but feel shocked when he saw Jian Wushuang erupting with 160,000-fold divine power!","160,000-fold divine power, this was already comparable to the best batch of geniuses from the Shi Kingdom.","But he had confidence in Shi Jiu. 160,000-fold wasn’t that much. Among peers, Shi Jiu’s mastery of divine power was the most formidable Emperor he had ever seen.","Experts see the doorway, amateurs see the spectacle.","Although Jin cChen was also a super genius among the Emperors, his divine power at its peak could only reach around 140,000-fold. Seeing Jian Wushuang’s 160,000-fold divine power, he couldn’t help but feel a bit worried.","As a party involved, Shi Jiu naturally couldn’t afford to be careless.","A difference of 10,000-fold was like a chasm, so he needed to unleash his trump card once again.","“Hah!!!” Shi Jiu roared angrily, erupting once more. His divine power soared from 150,000-fold to 160,000-fold, and countless electric arcs surrounded him.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered, feeling a sharp pain.","It was much stronger than he had anticipated.","With the same divine power, he didn’t have much confidence; after all, the opponent specialized in divine power.","Although he practiced dual cultivation, he didn’t have much confidence in dealing with such a super genius specializing in divine power in his current state.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang took the initiative, utilizing the intricacies of space. In terms of speed, he could suppress Shi Jiu.","In terms of combat experience, he was not weaker than his opponent.","Shi Jiu could clearly feel the eerie speed of Jian Wushuang.","He was extra cautious when making his move, shifting his position before daring to pause.","But Jian Wushuang’s speed was more than just that.","As soon as Shi Jiu stabilized his figure, Jian Wushuang had been waiting in that position, gathering energy with one hand, his divine power erupting.","A dark red light wave, at close range, directly hit Shi Jiu from behind.","Feeling the threat, Shi Jiu attempted to leap to evade.","But Jian Wushuang followed closely, his speed far surpassing Shi Jiu’s, appearing directly above Shi Jiu’s head and unleashing a punch, forcefully smashing the airborne Shi Jiu down again.","Just as it collided with the light wave.","Boom!!!","Jian Wushuang didn’t give his opponent any chance. Regardless of who he faced, he disliked dragging things out.","With his hands crossed, his divine power erupted once again, then suddenly lifting his hands, all the divine power on his body exploded.","From his core position, an endless vortex of formidable divine power emanated.","The Empress persisted, pointing her finger and directly setting up another barrier to withstand the terrifying impact.","Otherwise, this hall would have collapsed.","Rumbling!","After the final burst of the divine power vortex, only countless dust remained.","Jian Wushuang could sense that the aura below was weakening.","Phew!","Shi Jiu’s figure emerged from the dust.","The others in the hall were all terrified!","Except for Wu Li, who found it all incredible.","Originally, reaching 130,000-fold seemed like the pinnacle.","Unexpectedly, today he encountered two super geniuses with a divine power of 160,000-fold, and their battle was so intense and fierce.","In terms of combat experience, the techniques of these two individuals were no less than those of the Universe Masters.","Shi Jiu emerged from the dust, his silver battle armor no longer shining brightly, and his hair somewhat disheveled.","But his aura kept rising continuously.","“For how many years, you’re the first to directly overpower me!” Shi Jiu’s voice trembled slightly, but his aura kept breaking through.","Soon, it soared back to 160,000-fold divine power, and it didn’t stop there.","165,000-fold, 168,000-fold, 169,000-fold!","170,000-fold!","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows slightly and said, “Your divine power should be around 180,000-fold!”","He could sense that Shi Jiu was still holding back.","“Tsk tsk, aren’t you holding back as well?” Shi Jiu smirked, not bursting forth the next moment but instead striking instantly.","This time, Shi Jiu’s speed had increased significantly. Before Jian Wushuang could evade, a punch directly hit his face like a thunderbolt.","As Jian Wushuang staggered back, Shi Jiu rushed forward again, grabbing his ankle.","Exerting all his strength, Shi Jiu flung Jian Wushuang away.","Immediately after, Shi Jiu charged forward again, delivering elbow strikes from top to bottom, causing blood to surge from Jian Wushuang’s mouth.","“Spirit!”","Shi Jiu shouted, gathering an immensely powerful divine energy wave in his hands.","“Element!”","The second word caused the divine power contained within the energy wave to rise to another level.","The pure divine power within that wave had already gathered to 180,000-fold.","“Slash!”","The final word uttered, and the divine power gathered in Shi Jiu’s hands erupted completely.","A divine power of 190,0-00-fold, condensed into a mass, rushed toward Jian Wushuang, who lost his balance.","By the time he sensed the immense threat, it was too late.","Before he could stabilize his figure, the massive light wave was already upon him.","Jian Wushuang tried to block with his hands, but with only 160,000-fold divine power, it was like an insect trying to stop a speeding carriage.","“The power of the Beast God!”","“Tripled!”","Jian Wushuang instantly supercharged, his divine power soaring to 190,000-fold.","Equivalent to the divine power of Spirit Element Slash.","Finally, leaning against the boundary, he managed to block it.","But if that massive divine power were to explode completely, he would definitely be injured."]},{"number":5691,"title":"Chapter 5691 Peak Duel (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5691 Peak Duel (2)","The two sides left almost no room for maneuver, erupting directly to their peak.","....","However, it was evident that Shi Jiu’s secret technique could reach up to 190,000-fold divine power, but his own divine power couldn’t reach that high, only maintaining around 170,000-fold.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, was different. Now, facing Shi Jiu’s peak secret technique head-on, his own divine power surged to 190,000-fold.","This was truly a solid 190,000-fold divine power!","He already had the strength of the Three Tribulation realm.","An emperor with such strength, there were only a few in the entire Ancient Wood Continent!","Even the reigning Empress couldn’t help but be amazed.","190,000-fold divine power.","She hadn’t expected Shi Jiu to be this powerful, let alone Jian Wushuang.","It seemed that no matter how strong Shi Jiu was, Jian Wushuang could still steadily suppress him.","This kind of pressure made Shi Jiu almost breathless for a moment.","The strongest secret technique was blocked.","“This is impossible!” Shi Jiu couldn’t accept it.","190,000-fold divine power.","Yet he still couldn’t defeat Jian Wushuang.","Buzz!","Jian Wushuang pushed back against the scorching energy waves with both hands, trying to counterattack.","He didn’t have as much astonishment and hesitation now.","Shi Jiu’s strength did indeed exceed his imagination.","The energy waves of 190,000-fold divine power were too outrageous for his secret technique.","Unfortunately, he had not yet obtained the true core secret technique, otherwise, he wouldn’t be in such a sorry state.","Clearly much stronger in divine power than Shi Jiu, yet in terms of controlling that power, he was inferior.","Another 20,0000-fold divine power erupted based on his divine body.","With a 170,000-fold divine power, he was actually not at a disadvantage against Shi Jiu’s 190,000-fold divine power.","Right now, Jian Wushuang was even on the defensive himself.","“Ah!!!” Jian Wushuang exerted all his strength, the Beast God Weapon was running wildly, and the Origin Source was compressed to its lowest level.","His divine power had reached close to 200,000-fold.","“Go back!”","Jian Wushuang roared angrily, enduring the scorching sensation coming from his hands, forcibly pushing back the Spirit Element Slash.","With such immense divine power, even the barrier was trembling.","The Empress had to elevate the power of the barrier once again.","Muchen and the others quickly retreated.","The battle between the two Emperors was already threatening to them.","Especially seeing Jian Wushuang’s divine power, approaching 200,000-fold, their eyes were almost bulging in shock.","Although the strongman from the Shi family was amazed at Jian Wushuang’s strength, he was more worried about Shi Jiu at this moment.","If the Spirit Element Slash was pushed back, how could Shi Jiu withstand it?","“Your Majesty, we concede!” Seeing that Shi Jiu was still preparing to resist, Shi Han couldn’t stand it anymore and directly chose to concede on behalf of Shi Jiu.","If this continued, Shi Jiu would undoubtedly die.","Even if he could withstand this backlash, he would still not be Jian Wushuang’s opponent; the gap was too great.","If it weren’t for the constraint of the barrier, Jian Wushuang could easily evade this move, and his agility would also be impressive. No matter how Shi Jiu calculated it, there was no hope of winning.","“No!” Shi Jiu was still unwilling, his hands frantically unsealing, and the purple thunder at his brow flashed wildly.","The power of prohibition!","The Empress had just intended to suppress that arrogance, but she saw Shi Jiu’s determination, and his aura was still rising continuously.","She understood that Shi Jiu still had cards up his sleeve.","So she maintained the barrier again and did not intervene.","Shi Han felt that it was too reckless, completely unnecessary.","If it wasn’t working, they could have Shi Xiu come forward personally for the marriage proposal, or even abduct the Grand Princess.","There was no need to make it like this.","“It’s too crazy! How could this possibly be the power of an Emperor?” Muchen’s hands trembled.","The three Emperors who were defeated earlier had retreated to the corner.","Their eyes were lifeless, obviously quite shaken.","130,000-fold divine power was merely the pinnacle of the One Tribulation realm.","But now, the two figures on the field could unleash the power of the Three Tribulation realms, and they still had hidden cards.","Even Wu Li, despite his confidence in Jian Wushuang, felt somewhat uneasy at this moment.","It was fortunate that he had chosen Jian Wushuang. If it were someone else, he would have despaired long ago.","“We must win!” Wu Li prayed in his heart. He had witnessed Jian Wushuang’s true strength.","Jian Wushuang had yet to draw his sword.","Nor had he unleashed the Eternal Ancient Transformation.","Once he used the power of the Starry Sky, it wouldn’t be calculated by divine power anymore.","At present, Jian Wushuang was only at the peak under normal circumstances.","Realizing that Shi Jiu still had a trick up his sleeve, Jian Wushuang was also intimidated by the opponent’s strength this time.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime, the strongest Emperor, wasn’t that High Priest?","Judging from Wu Li’s tone, the other party could suppress a Universe Master.","Mastering the universe at the Tribulation Realm is vastly different from not mastering it.","For example, the ordinary power of the Three Tribulation realms ranged from 180,000-fold to 220,000-fold.","But if one mastered the Universe, divine power could explode to the peak of 300,000-fold.","Wu Li, at the Half-Step Four Tribulation realm, had 300,000-fold divine power.","There was a gap of over 100,000-fold divine power.","The gap with the Two Tribulation realm was even greater.","So even the most extraordinary Emperor would typically only reach the threshold of the Three Tribulation realm.","Those capable of rivaling the Universe Masters, even suppressing them, are legends of their era.","But now, the aura erupting from Shi Jiu’s body has reached the same level as Jian Wushuang.","He once again thrusts the Spirit Element Slash towards Jian Wushuang.","This time, the divine power within the Spirit Element Slash explodes to 200,000-fold.","Jian Wushuang’s face turns deathly pale, but he can only grit his teeth and endure.","This time, he was indeed careless.","If he had known earlier, he would have broken through 100,000-fold divine power and first integrated the bones of Dong Jun.","In this way, the peak of the Beast God’s power would not be merely tripled but could reach an astonishing fivefold.","Then, his normal combat power would rival that of the Universe Masters.","With his current strength, quickly resolving the battle seems somewhat unlikely.","The prohibition at the center of Shi Jiu’s brow opens wide, and the divine power within him surges up all at once, now surpassing Jian Wushuang, reaching 200,000-fold.","At his brow, there is a Universe Treasure refined for him by his grandfather.","A Universe Treasure at the peak of the Six Tribulation realm.","It contains the divine power of the Half-Step Seven Tribulation realm powerhouse.","Once unleashed, its potential is boundless.","It increases with the strength of the opponent.","This kind of heaven-defying treasure is already comparable to Jian Wushuang’s Beast God Weapon.","According to Jian Wushuang’s speculation, the Beast God Weapon was refined during the peak period of the Qishen Temple and should be a Universe Treasure of the Seven Tribulation realm.","But now, although its internal Origin Source has been repaired, it has not yet returned to its peak state.","If it reaches its true peak, it will be even stronger than it is now.","“Break!” Shi Jiu clenches both hands suddenly, and the aura within the Spirit Element Slash bursts completely.","At this moment, the prohibition power within Shi Jiu’s body also reaches its peak.","Just the protective shield condensed externally possesses 200,000-fold divine power.","In the Divine Spirit Dao Arena of the Shi Kingdom.","The Half-Step Seven Tribulation realm powerhouse, Shi Xiu, sits on a mountain peak, contemplating the Dao of the Flame God, but at this moment, he suddenly opens his eyes.","According to his bloodline and the resonance of the treasure he personally refined, he senses that his very talented grandson has fallen into some kind of danger."]},{"number":5692,"title":"Chapter 5692 Peak Duel (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5692 Peak Duel (3)","Through the temporal rift, he could see the kingdom of Yue.","....","“Yue Kingdom?”","“Emperor!”","As he reached the end, astonishment flickered in Shi Xiu’s eyes.","He had thought his grandson had encountered a formidable Tribulation Realm, necessitating the opening of the prohibition.","But he hadn’t expected that the opponent his grandson had faced would also be an Emperor.","He couldn’t help but exclaim, “It seems that this Sacred Assembly is truly unprecedented!”","The Sacred Assembly of the Ancient Wood Sect, although meant for selecting a Holy Maiden, also recruited some core disciples during the selection process.","That’s why the spots were so precious.","Becoming a core disciple of the Ancient Wood Sect wasn’t easy.","Even someone like Shi Jiu, a direct descendant of the Seven Tribulation realm, needed to go through rigorous selection to become a core disciple of the Ancient Wood Sect.","But even so, how many could reach the Five Tribulation realm?","Only the Holy Maiden could achieve that.","The remaining core disciples, despite being cultivated by the Ancient Wood Sect, mostly stopped at the Three or Four Tribulation realm.","Like his grandson, or the Emperor who fought against his grandson.","Such an extraordinary Emperor would find it effortless to enter the Ancient Wood Sect.","He might even become a candidate disciple of the Ancient Moon Divine Sect.","They were among the few prodigies in the Shi Kingdom.","Shi Xiu also thought of the Divine Archer, who had risen within a mere 10,000 years.","Fan Tianfeng!","With the same 200,000-fold divine power.","Possessing unfathomable strength.","Coupled with some extraordinary Emperors from the ancient Wood Sect, this Sacred Assembly is indeed quite intriguing.","Sensing Shi Jiu’s arrival in Yue Kingdom, Shi Xiu promptly communicated with an ancient powerhouse within the royal family of Yue.","A scattered Tribulation powerhouse of the Six Tribulation realm.","Once an Imperial Emperor of a certain era in Yue Kingdom, he had led Yue Kingdom to its peak.","Among the 16 kingdoms, there are rankings.","Currently, Yue Kingdom ranks at the bottom, but in the era of that ancestor, it was among the top five.","He was also a Half-Step Seven Tribulation existence, unfortunately failing in his tribulation crossing, becoming a Scattered Tribulation.","“Shi Xiu, why do you summon me?” A venerable voice echoed through spacetime, reaching inside the kingdom of Shi.","Shi Xiu calmly replied, “I have a junior with me, in your Yue Kingdom’s imperial palace, I hope you, elder brother, spare his life.”","...","“Ts ts, such a young and tender little fellow!”","Two mighty beings exchanged words with a gap between them.","Shi Xiu lowered his posture to speak, naturally giving face to the ancient powerhouse from Yue Kingdom.","He was a Scattered Tribulation descending from the mountains, while Shi Xiu was the Universe Master ascending the mountains.","Within the Yue Kingdom’s imperial palace,","Empress Fengchen received a transmission from an ancestor within the royal family, her expression unchanged.","Naturally, she had discretion.","In today’s Yue Kingdom, she still called the shots.","Even though there were several ancestors within the royal family, she was ultimately the one in power, and those ancestors would all give her face.","If it was truly necessary to kill someone like Shi Jiu to boost Yue’s strength, no one would hesitate.","But it wasn’t necessary.","It was best to make Shi Jiu retreat willingly.","The current Empress found Jian Wushuang more and more pleasing to the eye.","Not only was his strength extraordinary, but his background also suited her taste.","As a descendant of the Wu family, he had the support of the Wu family behind him.","In the future, the Wu family would also stand together with the royal family of Yue.","It could be considered mutually beneficial.","Crack!","The barrier began to show cracks.","The Spirit Element Slash was completely shattered, countless divine powers surrounded Jian Wushuang, as if swallowing his figure whole.","Not only did this cause Jian Wushuang to break out in a cold sweat, but it also made everyone else tense.","Of course, except for Princess Jincheng.","Even Shi Han and Shi Jiu didn’t want Jian Wushuang to fall like this.","Powerful individuals always sympathize with each other.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang had previously given him the treasure to restore his divine power for a fair fight.","Even though he returned the universe crystals, with this gentlemanly gesture, it still earned him admiration. Surrounded by countless divine power, Jian Wushuang’s back was enveloped by the Candle Dragon Feather Wings, and despite the violent divine power assault, it couldn’t break through.","The defense of the Beast God Armor was impeccable.","It weakened 99 percent of the divine power attacks.","Those that landed on Jian Wushuang at most could only shatter his divine body.","It didn’t count as serious injuries.","As long as it was a conventional injury, he could instantly recover.","After the raging divine power persisted for the time it takes to burn an incense stick, it completely disappeared.","Shi Jiu floated in the air, his clothes tattered, and his silver battle armor slightly damaged.","Looking at the figure of the Beast God in the center of the divine power.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang unfurled his Candle Dragon Feather Wings.","Indeed, his divine body had ruptured.","But in the next moment, his divine body instantly recovered, his aura erupted once again, reaching 190,000-fold.","“Your secret technique is formidable!” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but exclaim.","However, Shi Jiu widened his eyes in astonishment and said, “You didn’t suffer any injuries at all?”","Not only Shi Jiu, but everyone watching the battle also felt incredulous.","Even Wu Li, this time, furrowed his brows.","The more he understood Jian Wushuang, the more he felt that something was not quite right.","Jian Wushuang’s strength seemed to exceed his expectations.","This time, he miraculously recovered from serious injuries at an astonishing speed.","“Unfortunately, just like that, you can’t threaten me at all!” Jian Wushuang flashed his figure and instantly rushed out.","In just an instant, he had already arrived in front of Shi Jiu.","With a clenched fist, he directly struck the opponent’s chest, followed by a series of melee attacks.","Facing the frenzied assault, Shi Jiu quickly stabilized.","Employing the power of restrictions, although he gained a brief boost, time was limited.","He was more anxious than Jian Wushuang.","“Spirit Element Slash!”","Shi Jiu took a half step back, once again unleashing his peak secret technique.","“The same move again? It’s getting boring!” Jian Wushuang dodged aside, gathering a massive sword blade in his hands, which descended from the sky, aiming straight for Shi Jiu’s face.","Before the hand seal could even form, Shi Jiu had to retreat to avoid it.","Jian Wushuang didn’t give him any chance at all.","After disrupting his opponent’s secret technique, he lunged forward again.","Shi Jiu hurriedly defended himself.","Now he was left with only one last move.","Dragging it out any longer would undoubtedly result in his defeat.","But using that move would entail a huge consumption of energy.","He might even end up falling into a deep slumber.","Buzz!","Shi Jiu erupted with divine power once more, directly boosting his power to 200,000-fold.","He didn’t dare to use that move lightly, so he had to fully unleash his restrictions.","He erupted with 200,000-fold divine power to counter Jian Wushuang.","Feeling the continuous surge of divine power, Jian Wushuang’s expression turned cold.","He thought he could wear down Shi Jiu, but he didn’t expect his opponent to be so resilient.","Now it had been 15 minutes, with no sign of weakening, but rather, Shi Jiu was getting stronger with each battle, now even reaching 200,000-fold divine power.","At this rate, he was at a disadvantage.","“Beast God Domain!” Jian Wushuang shouted with equal fervor.","In his normal state, he had reached his peak.","With a power of 198,000-fold!","Boom!","Jian Wushuang gathered Qi in both hands, unleashing countless violent Qi waves, directly charging towards Shi Jiu.","The Qi waves surrounded them, relentlessly attacking.","Shi Jiu allowed Jian Wushuang’s attacks to come, bearing them all."]},{"number":5693,"title":"Chapter 5693: Peak Duel (4)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5693: Peak Duel (4)","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Facing countless waves of energy, he surged upward.","A fist pounded against Jian Wushuang.","At that moment, he had completely gained the upper hand.","Jian Wushuang was no match at all at this point.","Under the relentless onslaught, Jian Wushuang completely abandoned defense.","The intense battle made the spectators gasp in shock.","They could see that Jian Wushuang’s divine power was starting to decline.","While Shi Jiu’s divine power was continuously rising.","“What’s going on?” Muchen exclaimed, “Wasn’t it Shi Jiu who activated the prohibition?”","Not only him, even Wu Li was very puzzled.","Clearly it was Shi Jiu who exerted the power of the prohibition. For such a long time, Shi Jiu hadn’t weakened due to backlash, but instead Jian Wushuang’s divine power had been continuously decreasing.","Now Jian Wushuang’s rate of recovery couldn’t keep up with the consumed divine power.","Shi Han’s eyes gleamed with excitement, he exclaimed, “The peak treasure personally refined by Fifth Lord, how could it be so simple? Jian Wushuang is going to lose!”","The three Emperors who had been defeated earlier now showed a slight recovery, staring at the two figures on the battlefield, shaking their heads in sighs.","Originally, they thought Jian Wushuang had won for sure, but they didn’t expect Shi Jiu to turn the tables.","But now, whoever wins between the two within the barrier, they can accept it.","Because their strengths have exceeded their expectations.","Even though everyone has heard of the Grand High Priest!","But they have never witnessed this before. This time, they have witnessed from start to finish, two super emperors fighting desperately.","The divine power had surged from an initial 130,000-fold to a staggering 200,000-fold.","“Is he going to lose?” Empress Fengchen also didn’t favor Jian Wushuang anymore.","She originally thought Jian Wushuang could definitely win, but now Shi Jiu was getting stronger and stronger, completely unaffected by the prohibition’s backlash.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, was getting weaker and weaker, with hardly any chance left.","Unless there’s a trump card.","The eldest princess Jinchen behind the screen was the most excited.","Clap!","She directly tore through the screen and rushed out.","Standing at the edge of the barrier, she looked excitedly at Shi Jiu.","This scene, no matter who it was, would be deeply moved!","Her beloved, risking his life for her.","For the sake of marrying her, Shi Jiu had sacrificed a lot.","Seeing this scene, the empress remembered the past.","The hindrance ceased to exist.","Because once Jian Wushuang lost, she wouldn’t have any excuses.","It was her own commitment initially, impossible to retract.","If she did, it was feared that Shi Xiu would personally intervene.","At that point, being in the wrong would lead to losing the upper hand.","Bang!","A muffled sound echoed as Jian Wushuang’s left arm shattered completely.","That was the arm integrated with the Candle Dragon’s!","And it was forcibly broken by Shi Jiu.","Blood gushed continuously from the wound.","Jian Wushuang’s divine power plummeted by about 10,000-fold.","Now, his divine power was only around 160,000-fold.","With one hand holding the arm just torn from Jian Wushuang’s body, Shi Jiu didn’t seize the opportunity to attack again. Instead, he stood still, staring at Jian Wushuang and said, “You’ve lost. If we continue, it will come to life and death!”","“Hehe...” Jian Wushuang supported his wound with one hand, emitting a sinister chuckle.","This was the first time someone had pitied him.","Admit defeat?","He had never even considered surrendering to someone of the same level.","“It’s time to end this!” Jian Wushuang forced a bitter smile.","Originally, he wanted to drag it out and see, but he found he couldn’t outlast the opponent at all.","So, there was no need to persist.","“Your strength is formidable, your foundation must be much stronger than mine. If it weren’t for the treasures my grandfather gave me, I would have lost long ago!” Shi Jiu tried to console Jian Wushuang.","But Jian Wushuang straightened up, a surge of vitality transmitted, instantly regenerating his lost arm.","However, his divine power didn’t increase.","There was no longer any necessity.","Even if he restored it to 190,000-fold, it would be meaningless.","After moving his arm slightly, Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief, feeling relaxed.","“You’re wrong about that. In fact, my divine power is nowhere near yours!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","He originally thought he was on par with the opponent in controlling divine power.","Now it seemed he had guessed wrong.","There was indeed a gap; after all, the other party had been cultivating divine power since childhood.","How could he possibly surpass the other?","This place was the Ancient Moon Spacetime, a super temporal river much more powerful than the Moro Spacetime of the past.","The Qishen Temple was nothing impressive here.","What he had witnessed was nothing more than an inheritance left behind by a Half-Step Tribulation Realm expert.","In the Ancient Moon Spacetime, even the Nine Tribulation realm had appeared.","How could it be comparable to the Qishen Temple?","In this spacetime, it wouldn’t be surprising even if an Emperor stronger than Jian Wushuang appeared.","For the thousands of years he had descended, Jian Wushuang was actually quite disappointed with the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","It wasn’t until today that he felt a hint of joy.","A sense of battle intent also arose in his heart.","In just one ancient wood continent, there emerged a super Emperor like Shi Jiu.","And it’s likely that the opponent’s strength wasn’t even the strongest among the Emperors in the Ancient Wood Continent; there were even stronger geniuses in the Shi Kingdom.","The core disciples of the Emperors in the Ancient Wood Sect were also formidable.","And this was just the Ancient Wood Continent.","He hadn’t even traversed the Nine Heavens and Ten Earths yet.","Countless Emperor geniuses shouldn’t just be heard of.","That would be inaccurate.","Just like Shi Jiu in front of him, initially everyone thought his strength was only 130,000-fold.","Now it had surged to 200,000-fold.","That High Priest who had lived through several eras probably had even deeper reserves.","It’s possible that even he wasn’t a match.","As long as they hadn’t fought before, one couldn’t be certain the other was weaker.","At first, Jian Wushuang thought he might be the first.","Now he didn’t have that confidence anymore.","But!","He had the confidence to strive for the position of the first.","Outside the barrier.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s aura sink, the expressions of the crowd changed. Although there was still a glimmer of hope in their hearts, seeing Jian Wushuang about to give up, they couldn’t help but sigh deeply.","Wu Li’s expression also turned serious, inwardly lamenting, “Brother Wushuang, it’s time to bring out your true strength!”","“It’s over, even Nephew Wushuang is giving up!”","“It’s already very good. With such strength, you guys from Yue Kingdom can definitely be absorbed into the core. Your future achievements won’t be weaker than those top talents from Shi Kingdom!”","Shi Han’s expression remained indifferent because Shi Jiu was about to defeat Jian Wushuang soon, making him naturally relaxed.","Moreover, he had a plan in mind. If Yue Kingdom didn’t absorb Jian Wushuang into its core, then he would personally guide Jian Wushuang to Shi Kingdom.","Get him to enter the core of the royal family.","In the Shi Kingdom royal family, it wasn’t only the Shi family.","There were also elders from other families.","As long as they were core figures, they enjoyed the same treatment as the strong of the Shi clan.","They could also participate in the Sacred Assembly.","This Sacred Assembly was extraordinary, and the number of spots would increase.","In a divine-level country like Shi Kingdom, how could it be the same as Yue Kingdom, with only 20 spots?","By then, they could easily secure a spot for Jian Wushuang.","Inside the barrier, Jian Wushuang never expected that after scheming with Wu Li like this, they still hadn’t secured a spot until today."]},{"number":5694,"title":"Chapter 5694: Peak Duel (5)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5694: Peak Duel (5)","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the Shi Kingdom, things didn’t seem to hold much value.","If Jian Wushuang had known, he might have felt utterly betrayed.","It all seemed unnecessarily complicated.","At this point, he was struggling to make sense of it all.","“Shi Jiu, pay attention. The Immortal Emperor possesses more than just divine power!” Jian Wushuang’s expression turned serious. As he spoke, his aura shifted drastically, becoming incredibly restrained.","Shi Jiu furrowed his brow, suddenly unable to sense Jian Wushuang’s presence.","A faint blue aura replaced the previous dark red power of the Beast God in an instant.","This aura was eternal.","It lingered within the Starry Sky, visible to all, yet wielded by none.","Because no one had ever noticed such a force.","The power of the Starry Sky.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes turned a pale blue.","Clasping his fists, he shouted, and even his hair turned blue, surrounded by arcs of pale blue lightning.","“Eternal Ancient Transformation!”","In an instant, Jian Wushuang transformed from the Emperor of divine power to the Emperor of spacetime.","The power of time, shrouded in mystery.","Within the confines of the barrier, all of time and space fell under Jian Wushuang’s control.","His transformation seemed devoid of any outward manifestation of power.","Yet, the sheer strength he exuded spoke volumes.","It was imperceptible.","Even the Empress couldn’t gauge Jian Wushuang’s true strength.","She only sensed the disappearance of his divine power, replaced by a mysterious force.","“Spacetime?” The Empress’s expression changed, marveling, “Related to the Universe Origin Source!”","Wu Li and Muchen were both Universe Masters, each with their own universe, and naturally recognized the connection between Jian Wushuang’s power and the Universe Origin Source.","“Haha, turning the tables! I knew he had more up his sleeve!” Wu Li exclaimed excitedly. “Watch, Shi Jiu is doomed to lose!”","This time, Muchen didn’t dare to be certain, merely asking out of curiosity, “Wushuang is just an Emperor, how could his aura resemble that of the Universe Origin Source?”","“Let’s not dwell on this. Who doesn’t have secrets? How else could one be so powerful?”","Muchen realized he had asked too much and decided not to press further.","He hoped Jian Wushuang could defeat Shi Jiu.","Although others noticed Jian Wushuang’s divine power fading, they didn’t discern much from it.","Not even Shi Jiu himself could perceive anything peculiar!","“Is this what you call power?” Shi Jiu asked uncertainly. “Your divine power seems unchanged!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t deny it, simply stating, “Divine power isn’t the only thing!”","“Then let me experience the power beyond divine power!” Shi Jiu’s confidence soared, brimming with combativeness.","Even the Crown Princess, standing outside the barrier, showed a look of surprise.","She had seen this faint blue aura before.","It was at Hundred Flowers Mountain.","The power emitted by that mysterious Five Tribulation realm expert.","The more she looked, the more it seemed like it.","But that mysterious expert practiced the Dao of the Sword.","Yet, there was no trace of Sword Intent on Jian Wushuang.","The Dao of the Sword and the Extreme Dao were distinct yet had a mutually merging state.","Jian Wushuang’s power was the power of the Starry Sky.","And the Dao of the Sword seemed more like a realm he cultivated with the power of the Starry Sky.","However, facing Shi Jiu, he didn’t need to resort to the Dao of the Sword at all.","The power to kill was too heavy; perhaps using the Sword Dao could instantly eliminate the opponent.","Just the Eternal Ancient Transformation was enough.","In the peak state, Jian Wushuang’s strength, converted into divine power, he didn’t know how strong it was.","But facing the Three Tribulation realm Universe Master, he had enough confidence.","That alone explained everything.","“Shi Jiu!”","Before the voice arrived, Jian Wushuang had already crossed his arms and appeared behind Shi Jiu.","This scene stunned everyone.","Even Elder Muchen couldn’t see Jian Wushuang’s speed clearly.","Only Wu Li vaguely grasped it.","The Empress on the throne wore an expression of disbelief.","It wasn’t that Jian Wushuang was exceptionally fast, but time seemed to slow down around everyone else.","Only the Empress was unaffected, allowing her to clearly witness Jian Wushuang’s tactics.","“Hmm?” Shi Jiu’s expression changed drastically as he sensed the void force behind him. Although he didn’t understand why Jian Wushuang suddenly appeared behind him, he still bravely launched an elbow strike.","Crack!","Jian Wushuang caught it with one hand, shaking his head. “Too weak,” he remarked.","Crunch!","With a slight squeeze of his hand, he crushed Shi Jiu’s arm.","With 200,000-fold divine powers at its peak, Jian Wushuang’s hand treated Shi Jiu’s arm like a mere ant.","In the Origin Source world, half of the universe illuminated, sparkling with boundless Origin Source power.","Once these powers entered the dark Starry Sky, they transformed into the power of the stars.","Jian Wushuang now was completely different from before.","Previously, he borrowed the power of the Starry Sky, but now he could gather it himself.","It was similar to mastering the power of All Things in the past.","Slowly becoming familiar with it.","However, the power of All Things now was more suitable for assisting.","The power of the Starry Sky was the strongest.","“Hah!” Jian Wushuang burst out, grabbing Shi Jiu’s neck with one hand and the shattered arm with the other, pulling forcefully.","Rip!","He tore the arm directly off.","An eye for an eye.","Shi Jiu’s face instantly turned pale, and his divine power became somewhat unstable.","He hadn’t expected to be easily overwhelmed by just a glance.","Was this the other power that Jian Wushuang had mentioned before?","It was too powerful.","He had never felt it even in the Tribulation Realm.","Outside the barrier, Princess Jincheng became worried when she saw Shi Jiu injured.","They were supposed to win.","But Jian Wushuang seemed like a completely different person now, his strength utterly incomprehensible and somewhat terrifying.","Even Wu Li couldn’t help but swallow hard.","The power before him exceeded his imagination.","His previous speculations had been somewhat conservative.","If he were to face Jian Wushuang now, he feared he wouldn’t stand much of a chance.","It was too terrifying.","His divine power seemed so feeble in the face of Jian Wushuang.","“You’ve lost!” Jian Wushuang didn’t press further, but with a single palm strike, he sent Shi Jiu flying a hundred feet away.","That last strike had pierced straight through Shi Jiu’s chest.","Even his silver battle armor had completely shattered.","Struggling to rise, Shi Jiu attempted to mimic Jian Wushuang’s posture to regenerate his arm, but then he realized abruptly that his current strength was entirely derived from forbidden techniques.","There was no surplus vitality left to replenish his physical body.","With only one arm remaining, Shi Jiu had no hope left.","His divine power couldn’t even be sustained at its peak anymore, and even at its peak, it was crushed by Jian Wushuang.","The current Jian Wushuang exuded overwhelming oppression.","Wrapped in a faint blue aura, arcs of blue lightning flickered around him.","Even his hair was blue.","Though his aura wasn’t sharp, the immense power made it impossible for his opponent to catch a breath; it was an absolute oppression, the purest form of suppression."]},{"number":5695,"title":"Chapter 5695: Peak Duel (6)","paragraphs":["Chapter 5695: Peak Duel (6)","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Too strong. Although I can’t discern the extent of his divine power, being able to easily defeat Shi Jiu, who possesses 200,000-fold divine power, means he’s probably not weaker than a Universe Master, perhaps even stronger!” Shi Han’s gaze was deep, his tone filled with despair for Shi Jiu.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang didn’t deliver the killing blow.","Without a doubt, Shi Jiu, being weaker, was doomed.","“We won!” Elder Muchen shifted from despair to excitement.","This time, it was Shi Jiu who felt hopeless!","Today, Jian Wushuang became famous in one battle, not only within the Yue Kingdom but would also be renowned throughout the entire Ancient Wood Continent.","The Heaven-Defying Emperor!","It could even be said that he was the strongest Heaven-Defying Emperor in the entire Ancient Wood Continent.","They simply couldn’t fathom which Emperor could defeat Jian Wushuang now.","Even Princess Jincheng, who harbored some hatred towards Jian Wushuang, deep down believed that Jian Wushuang was undoubtedly the strongest Emperor in the Ancient Wood Continent.","There was no one else.","As for the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime, it was too vast, and they didn’t dare to guarantee anything about it.","But after witnessing Jian Wushuang’s true strength, they also felt that Jian Wushuang could at least rank in the top ten.","The strength described by the rumored nearly invincible High Priest wasn’t much different from Jian Wushuang’s current strength!","Facing Shi Jiu with his 200,000-fold divine power, he easily overwhelmed him.","This level of combat power was no different from that of the Universe Master.","“I’ve lost!” Shi Jiu said despondently.","But his divine power was still rising.","Although he admitted defeat verbally, there was still persistence in his heart. Obviously, he wouldn’t give up easily.","Jian Wushuang landed slowly, walked up unhurriedly, hands casually crossed over his chest, and said, “Actually, you can give up now.”","“I promised her that I would give it my all, even if it meant enduring endless tribulations. I must keep this promise!” Shi Jiu turned to look at Princess Jincheng outside the barrier, his eyes full of tenderness.","But Princess Jincheng’s eyes turned red.","She really wanted Shi Jiu to give up.","Stop pushing yourself like this.","Even if Jian Wushuang didn’t kill him, continuing like this would still lead to certain death.","Even Jian Wushuang was somewhat moved, staring at Shi Jiu’s miserable appearance, reminiscent of the past.","He had been so persistent once too.","But later, he realized that such persistence was futile in this matter.","Only by transforming this kind of persistence into cultivation would there be results.","If Shi Jiu were in the Tribulation Realm, a powerhouse at the level of the Seven Tribulations realm, would he be in such a sorry state?","Who in the Yue Kingdom would dare to stop him?","Within the royal family, the ancestor who founded the Yue Kingdom was nothing more than a feeble Scattered Tribulation expert on the brink of death.","If confronted with a Universe Master at the Seven Tribulation realm, they wouldn’t dare to obstruct, fearing they might even send Jinchen over as a gift.","Though his persistence was misplaced, Jian Wushuang admired Shi Jiu.","“If only I could be as carefree as you!”","But then again...","It was a past best left unexamined!","Jian Wushuang looked up, avoiding eye contact with Shi Jiu, and pretended to be casual, saying, “I will respect you, but don’t think I’ll hold back!”","He was determined to secure a spot in the Sacred Assembly.","Using the Wanliu Divine Tree was his great opportunity.","Across the distant expanse of Starry Sky, there lay a feeble temporal river waiting for him to rescue.","He couldn’t disappoint the hopes of countless people, nor could he afford to be soft-hearted.","Shi Jiu steadied himself, his divine power rapidly increasing. It seemed he was about to use that move.","“Jian Wushuang, I admit you are strong now, stronger than I imagined. But the move I’m about to unleash will cost me my life. Brace yourself!”","Shi Jiu laughed maniacally, a blazing light bursting from his body.","In the light, his eyes glanced one last time at Princess Jinchen of the Yue Kingdom.","It was as if he was bidding farewell.","Jian Wushuang’s expression changed, angrily shouting, “Have you gone mad?”","This was going to be a fight to the death.","And he would be trading his own life for Shi Jiu’s.","In the flickering light, Shi Jiu was left with only one arm, his feet hovering in the air. With a clenched fist, he shouted loudly, “Annihilation!”","Buzz!!!","The space shattered instantly, and Jian Wushuang shielded his face with both hands, bracing himself.","He wasn’t worried about himself.","But Shi Jiu truly didn’t need to do this.","Even if he married into the royal family, he wouldn’t share a room with Jinchen. After participating in the Sacred Assembly, if he could successfully activate the Wanliu Divine Tree, he would most likely flee with Wu Li.","He would return when his strength was formidable enough.","Opening and activating the Wanliu Willow Divine Tree.","On the surface, the Ancient Wood Sect wouldn’t interfere.","But behind the scenes, countless eyes would be watching.","Opening it wasn’t easy; killing and plundering would be much simpler.","So, it was certain he’d have to lay low for a while.","Even if he didn’t hide, he’d leave the Ancient Wood Continent and head to other regions within the Nine Heavens and Ten Lands.","To find the ten disciples of Qishen Temple who had come with him initially.","Then, they would venture together.","It wasn’t that Jian Wushuang didn’t trust the people in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, but it was unnecessary.","No matter how powerful they were, they wouldn’t travel thousands of miles with him to the temporal river of the Original Universe to save it.","To practitioners in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, that place was remote, with no treasures or opportunities. Who would spend a long time wandering there?","Only those who came from Qishen Temple like them would care about their homeland’s spacetime.","They were all fighting hard!","How could Jian Wushuang dare not to?","His strongest opponent was Mie Sheng, still waiting for him.","A surging force struck, but Jian Wushuang was completely enveloped by the power of the Starry Sky, unafraid!","In his peak state, even if he fought against the Universe Master, he wouldn’t suffer.","“Ah!” Shi Jiu roared to the sky, his hand clenched into a fist, unleashing the power of prohibition, which transformed into annihilation.","Crackling!","The barrier shattered instantly. Empress Fengchen personally intervened, suppressing the violent aura.","But this left Jian Wushuang in a dire situation.","If Shi Jiu’s attack had dispersed completely, it would have been fine. But the range within the barrier was too small, coupled with the empress’s suppression, causing the burst of aura to directly crush the space.","Both Jian Wushuang and Shi Jiu fell into the chaotic flow of spacetime, a colorful world resembling countless mirrors.","“What a lunatic!” Jian Wushuang’s aura surged once again, completely resisting.","Waves of heat struck, but they couldn’t harm him in the slightest.","Jian Wushuang watched the madness consuming Shi Jiu, sighing and shaking his head.","The other’s age might have been much greater than his own, but his state of mind seemed lacking.","He was undeniably bold.","But it had never occurred to him that even if he were to risk everything to change places with him, the royal family would still arrange for someone to marry Princess Jincheng.","Wouldn’t that be benefiting someone else for nothing?","Why go to such lengths?","The terrifying force sweeping over them began to gradually weaken.","Shi Jiu’s physical body began to petrify, cracks appearing on his divine body freezing as they emerged.","His life force had been drained, and what followed would be death.","Once the divine body was done for, the remaining Origin Source wouldn’t be able to withstand such backlash.","This was a spacetime dominated by divine power.","The divine body was the strongest foundation; once it was gone, even keeping the Origin Source would be futile.","Just like Bai Junwang, without the Origin Source, having only the divine body was no different from being useless."]},{"number":5696,"title":"Chapter 5696 Ended","paragraphs":["Chapter 5696 Ended","“You... how?” Shi Jiu’s face turned ashen. He was about to perish, yet Jian Wushuang’s aura showed no sign of change. The blue electric arcs around him flickered even more intensely.","....","This time, Shi Jiu was utterly desperate.","He had fought with all his might, but he couldn’t even touch Jian Wushuang.","Fortunately, they were within the barrier. If it weren’t for the barrier, he wouldn’t have been able to go all out against Jian Wushuang.","But it was a pity!","Even within the barrier, he couldn’t do anything to Jian Wushuang.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang seemed completely unscathed.","He could no longer gauge Jian Wushuang’s true strength.","It was rumored that even the great High Priest couldn’t match Jian Wushuang.","The power of complete prohibition, erupting with the force of annihilation, could slay the Universe Masters.","And in such a confined space, even the top experts among the Universe Masters would have perished.","Yet Jian Wushuang seemed unaffected.","His aura showed no signs of weakening; instead, it grew stronger.","Such was the terror of the power of the Starry Sky.","In fact, the force of annihilation unleashed by Shi Jiu just now could threaten Jian Wushuang. However, it was like an ant compared to the power of the Starry Sky.","Moreover, his force of annihilation was released from the power of prohibition, so there wasn’t much of it, and he would suffer backlash afterward.","But Jian Wushuang was different.","The power of the Starry Sky was transformed from the Origin Source, seemingly endless.","How could they be compared?","Jian Wushuang shook his head gently. This wasn’t a fight to the death.","If it were, Shi Jiu would have died 10,000 times over already.","His body completely petrified, Shi Jiu, before losing consciousness, exerted the last bit of his divine power to leave Jian Wushuang with a final sentence!","“Take care of her for me!”","With those words, Shi Jiu’s physical and divine bodies completely turned into stone.","Only the Origin Source remained, resisting stubbornly but unable to hold out for much longer.","“Enough!”","The Empress exclaimed lightly, extending her jade-like hand. A surge of vitality flowed into Shi Jiu’s body, protecting the last remaining Origin Source within him.","With a gentle stroke of her fingers, she tore open a rift in spacetime.","“Take him back to the Shi Kingdom quickly, there might still be a chance!” The Empress turned to Shi Han and said, “If we delay any longer, even if he survives, he will be nothing but a cripple!”","Upon hearing this, Shi Han hurried over, grabbing the petrified Shi Jiu and entered the rift in spacetime directly.","“Brother Jiu!” Princess Jinchen wanted to follow, but was stopped by the Empress.","Jian Wushuang stood aside, feeling somewhat awkward!","He had never imagined that one day he would be breaking up a couple.","Fortunately, he wasn’t petty, and wouldn’t kick someone when they were down.","Even if he were to marry into the royal family and become Princess Jinchen’s Dao Companion, he wouldn’t harbor any inappropriate thoughts towards her.","The crucial point was that by then, it wouldn’t be inappropriate thoughts anymore, but a legitimate relationship.","Even so, Jian Wushuang wouldn’t touch her!","He only wanted to become stronger, to deal with the trouble of Mie Sheng, and then to follow his master’s path, to meet with Teacher Xuan Yi in the future.","To see what lay in the future world.","What was hidden within the Starry Sky?","Who was plotting within it?","Princess Jinchen knelt on the ground, crying miserably, tears streaming down her face. She lifted her little head and stared at her cold-hearted mother, crying out bitterly, “Why are you forcing me!”","“The matter is settled, forget about him!” The Empress’s voice was icy, leaving no room for negotiation.","Even she couldn’t bear to see her daughter like this.","And there stood Jian Wushuang!","Looking at his tall and straight figure, his face radiant and handsome.","Why insist on Shi Jiu?","He was indeed outstanding, with background and strength, willing to risk his life for Jinchen.","But what good would that do?","Strength is paramount!","Don’t be ridiculous, she was an experienced person, aware of what the Tribulation Realm entailed.","The pressure that the Emperor hadn’t faced yet would erupt in Tribulation Realm.","Once in a certain tribulation, she would probably regret it for the rest of her life.","A Dao Companion was just a momentary thing.","Strength was for a lifetime.","Jian Wushuang’s excellence surpassed all expectations, especially coupled with a princess from the Yue Kingdom.","If news of this battle were to spread, Jian Wushuang’s influence would likely extend far beyond the realms, overshadowing even the Yue Kingdom.","As a Yue Kingdom princess, even if she were to inherit the Imperial Emperor’s throne in the future, it wouldn’t amount to much compared to the seven major sects on the Ancient Wood Continent.","This time, they had hit the jackpot by joining forces with Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang’s background wasn’t particularly complex.","Wu Li had mentioned that Jian Wushuang couldn’t make ends meet in the Outer Domain and was on the brink of poverty before seeking refuge with the Wu family in the Yue Kingdom.","Even if Jian Wushuang reached the Fifth Tribulation realm in the future, they wouldn’t be able to interfere with the royal family of the Yue Kingdom without external intervention.","They had gained a top-notch fighter for free. Even the Empress felt like she had hit the jackpot this time.","Phew!","Jian Wushuang took a slight breath and returned to normal.","Looking at Princess Jincheng in front of him, he didn’t know what to say.","He could only turn around and slightly salute the Empress, “Your Majesty, what do you think...”","His meaning was clear: How should they conclude this matter?","“Wood King, take Jian Wushuang to settle in the capital first. We’ll discuss the rest of the matters in three days!”","Empress Fengchen also understood that it wasn’t appropriate to discuss previous agreements at this moment.","It was better to wait for her daughter to recover and then take things slowly.","The Sacred Assembly was still ten years away; they aimed to settle everything within that time frame.","Upon hearing this, Muchen quickly stepped forward, pulling Jian Wushuang along and replied, “Your Majesty, rest assured, this minister will handle it properly!”","“Nephew Wushuang, come with me!”","Jian Wushuang bid farewell with a bow and followed Muchen, preparing to leave. However, as he passed through the threshold, he turned his head to glance at the three Emperors remaining in the hall.","These three individuals were summoned by Elder Muchen.","Instead of following them now, he was left behind.","Perhaps the Empress also sensed the Death power wielded by two of the Emperors.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t in a hurry. Bringing it up now would raise suspicion. He would inquire with Elder Muchen later.","If he were detained by the Empress, he could still inquire in the future after becoming part of the family.","So, he followed Muchen and Wu Li as they left the palace together.","“Brother Muchen, there’s no need to rush. After all, he’s my nephew. I can handle it. I’ll bring him to your mansion in three days!” Wu Li politely refused Elder Muchen’s offer and took Jian Wushuang back to their previous residence.","After entering the mansion, both Wu Li and Jian Wushuang breathed a sigh of relief.","“That old guy, he hasn’t even married in yet, but he’s already thinking about moving into the Wood King’s mansion. He really underestimates our Wu family!” Wu Li’s face showed some anger.","Clearly, he was holding some grudges.","Even if it’s marrying a maid, he wouldn’t stay at someone else’s house before the wedding!","Not to mention, Jian Wushuang is an extraordinary Emperor.","This time, the royal family can enjoy it in secret!","“Brother Wu Li, why bother with worldly appearances? Once the Wanliu Divine Tree is activated, what are these royal dynasties and sects?” “Sigh, it’s just my worldly concerns. But this Yue Kingdom royal family is really not a good bunch. Be careful when you marry into it in the future!"]},{"number":5697,"title":"Chapter 5697: Make Complaints","paragraphs":["Chapter 5697: Make Complaints","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The two entered a secluded courtyard and settled beneath a willow tree, with a finely carved tea pavilion before them.","Wu Li skillfully brewed tea, while Jian Wushuang savored it slowly.","Jian Wushuang empathized with Wu Li’s backbiting about the royal family.","If their identities were swapped, and he were Shi Jiu, it would likely infuriate him.","Or perhaps if he were Princess Jinchen.","Although he found the other party overly persistent, he couldn’t imagine enduring it himself.","A poor boy encountering a young lady, one must consider social status.","With their talents and looks, one worries about others stealing their nests.","This situation was simply too convoluted.","Moreover, Shi Jiu had gone all out. If it were for the wealth of Yue Kingdom, why not contend for the throne of Shi Kingdom?","As far as he knew, the current ruler of Shi Kingdom was not Shi Xiu.","It was Shi Xiu’s elder brother, although also at the Tribulation Realm, his strength was generally underestimated.","It was highly probable that he would specialize in Scattered Tribulation in the future.","In this case, the throne was vacant.","If Shi Xiu fully supported Shi Jiu, there was great hope.","Shi Xiu’s peak combat power, if it could reach 180,000-fold, would be almost certain.","Though 190,000-fold was somewhat strained, it wasn’t his own divine power, so he didn’t calculate it.","With 180,000-fold in combat power, the Emperor would become the Universe Master, which could be considered a foregone conclusion.","Coupled with Shi Xiu’s nurturing, reaching the Four Tribulation realm would not be difficult.","Reaching the Five Tribulation realm would require some external opportunities.","Shi Jiu also bore the aura of great fortune, the pride of the heavens.","Reaching the Five Tribulation realm might not be impossible.","One could say that Shi Jiu was the seed of the Five Tribulation realm.","It’s a pity!","He wondered if he could recover before the Sacred Assembly.","Wu Li poured tea for Jian Wushuang while remarking, “To speak bluntly, if I were the Empress, seeing Shi Jiu’s performance today would have melted even a heart of stone. Yet, she just opened a backdoor and let Shi Han take Shi Jiu away, without a word of comfort!”","“Emperors are capricious; they’re often heartless,” Jian Wushuang commented.","The sentiment, applicable even in the mundane world, held true in the present.","“Indeed!” Wu Li nodded in agreement.","Jian Wushuang set down his teacup, adopting a serious tone. “Let’s focus on the important matters. There shouldn’t be any issues with the seats for the Sacred Assembly this time, right?”","“Don’t worry about that. If the royal family doesn’t grant them, we’ll call off the marriage!” Wu Li assured, thumping his chest.","In truth, Jian Wushuang was also unlucky not to notice Wu Li’s short-sightedness.","Had his true strength been revealed earlier, even Qingyun Sect would have secured him a seat.","But unraveling all his secrets within a mere millennium was no easy task.","Despite Wu Li’s shortsightedness, his strategic planning was meticulous.","Over the course of a millennium, he had crafted Jian Wushuang’s identity flawlessly.","From a destitute family to venturing through numerous epochs in the Outer Domain and returning to Yue Kingdom to seek refuge with the Wu family.","Moreover, Wu Li had deliberately arranged for traces of Jian Wushuang’s existence to remain.","Although Jian Wushuang had only been a minor steward of Qingyun Sect, his background had still been investigated.","Now, marrying into the royal family, the other party might be investigating his background at this very moment.","With Wu Li’s arrangements, Jian Wushuang had no worries.","Without a deeply rooted family to vouch for him, infiltrating the core would be difficult. Even if he were extraordinary, his ambiguous identity would raise suspicion, hindering his advancement.","Especially with powers like the Yue Kingdom’s royal family, distrust was rampant.","“There shouldn’t be any problems. But there’s one thing you need to be mindful of—I’ve heard that a certain ancient ancestor of the Yue Kingdom might awaken soon, and it might have something to do with your marriage into the family!”","“Impossible! I’m just an Emperor. Would that ancient ancestor even care?” Jian Wushuang exclaimed in disbelief.","As an Emperor marrying into a royal family, he was merely a son-in-law.","It was surprising that they would take an interest in him.","Wu Li continued, “Right now, I’m worried that he might notice something, like the fact that neither of us have any bloodline.”","That was something they couldn’t fake.","“There’s nothing to worry about. My physical body is quite special, capable of changing into All Things. Even a Seven Tribulation realm expert wouldn’t be able to detect any issues!” Jian Wushuang was confident in his own physique.","Although in the Moro Spacetime, he didn’t follow the path of cultivating the physical body.","But he still had his own methods for refining the body.","After the ten rounds of tempering, he had surpassed the peak of Moro Spacetime.","Even in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, his physical body’s perfection could easily rank in the top three among peers.","Claiming the top spot was a bit exaggerated; Jian Wushuang wasn’t as confident as Wu Li.","“Besides this, there’s nothing else to worry about. Once that old ancestor revives, he will most likely head to the Sacred Assembly. Although those in the Scattered Tribulation realm experts cannot participate in the assembly, observing would still be a good choice!” Wu Li breathed a sigh of relief, his confidence returning.","He had faith in his own arrangements.","Wasn’t success imminent now?","Secure the spot and wait for the Sacred Assembly ten years later.","Then, activate the Wanliu and ascend to the peak.","“Alright!” Jian Wushuang didn’t dwell on it further. He would take it step by step!","As for the two Emperors related to the power of Death, he didn’t mention them to Wu Li.","Though they were on the same boat, their relationship hadn’t reached that point yet.","Besides, it wasn’t Wu Li’s concern.","The matter of the power of Death was crucial as it involved the future.","He needed to pay attention to it.","He would wait until three days later to meet Elder Muchen and probe further!","The main priority was to activate the Wanliu.","The power of Death came next.","If he could gather information along the way, he wouldn’t consider it troublesome.","It’s uncertain whether this power of death is related to Mie Sheng.","If it is, then the other party’s influence is quite extensive.","Under the willow tree, three days passed quickly. During these three days, Wu Li didn’t leave. He just kept playing with the tea set and chatting with Jian Wushuang.","An old man and a young man, they discussed cultivation and legends.","When they finally talked about women, they mentioned the same name.","“Empress Fengchen!”","Both men revealed peculiar smiles, then abruptly stopped.","Just as they were about to head to the Wood King’s mansion, Elder Muchen personally arrived.","“Elder Muchen, you’re too polite. Since you’re here, come on in, and you’ve brought something!” Wu Li said, his words polite but his actions sincere, directing the steward to lead the way inside.","Jian Wushuang didn’t mind.","The treasures sent over were not simple, but unfortunately, they were all divine treasures, which he didn’t need at all.","He couldn’t even digest the bones of Dong Jun, let alone have time to absorb those divine treasures.","His progress was too slow.","To attain basic divine power and reach the level of the Three Tribulation realm, it might take forever.","He couldn’t discern the true strength of Dong Jun’s bones.","At least, it was the bones of a Seven Tribulation realm expert.","Within the skeletal remains, there was an extremely rich divine power.","Although the original body had perished, the flesh and bones remained incorruptible, only the flesh had been refined, leaving behind the bones and the internal divine power."]},{"number":5698,"title":"Chapter 5698: Propose","paragraphs":["Chapter 5698: Propose","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang only needed to integrate it into his divine body to quickly break through his divine power to over 200,000-fold.","Perhaps even more.","He had never heard of anyone absorbing an entire Seven Tribulation realm divine body before.","Nor did he know how much it would ultimately elevate him.","After settling matters of face, Elder Muchen sat in the main seat, calmly sipping his tea. With solemnity, he said, “Brother Wu Li, today, on behalf of the Chen Clan, I’ve come to propose a marriage. How would you like to arrange this union?”","“Well, as you know, I only have one nephew. He’s been lonely since childhood, and after obtaining a great opportunity in the Outer Domain and being chased by others, he sought refuge in Yue Kingdom. Surprisingly, the young man caught the eye of the Princess. Since His Majesty favors this, how could we dare to object?”","Wu Li spoke humbly, elevating Elder Muchen and the entire royal family.","Almost making Jian Wushuang sound like a beggar.","“In that case, let me propose a bride price. Rest assured, it’s 1.8 million. It will be delivered immediately! As for the wedding day, let’s set it three years from now. How does that sound?” Muchen was also generous, knowing well what Jian Wushuang desired.","Standing behind Wu Li, Jian Wushuang, besides showing respect by serving tea and water as a junior, also listened to their conversation.","When he heard the sum of 1.8 million, his expression shifted.","1.8 million, if it was in universe crystals, wasn’t it a bit too little?","Elder Muchen could easily receive tens of millions of universe crystals during a grand birthday celebration.","This time, offering only 1.8 million was truly underestimating him.","Although he wasn’t a member of the Wu family, he still found this matter outrageous.","Clearly, they looked down on him!","He was marrying into the family, sacrificing himself for the royal clan.","When Wu Li heard this, his expression also darkened slightly, just like Jian Wushuang’s.","But he understood that these were trivial matters. The most important thing was the spot in the Sacred Assembly.","One couldn’t ruin the big picture over a small matter.","“Does it matter?” Wu Li probed, “I’ve heard that the envoys from the Ancient Wood Sect have arrived recently. I wonder how many spots Yue Kingdom managed to secure this time?”","Although Muchen had mentioned it during Jian Wushuang’s confrontation with Shi Jiu, he still needed assurance.","If there were no spots, it would be better to switch allegiances now.","Upon hearing this, Muchen reached into his pocket and pulled out a token from among the mustard seeds, smiling, “Brother Wu Li, take a look at this!”","Seeing the token, Wu Li’s expression softened, and he directly took it from Elder Muchen’s hand.","Two tokens.","One gold, representing the Tribulation Realm.","One silver, representing the Emperor.","Qualifications for the Sacred Assembly.","Already obtained.","One was for Wu Li himself, and the other was for Jian Wushuang.","“This—” Wu Li held the token, his face beaming with joy, as he handed the Emperor’s token to Jian Wushuang and tucked his own into his bosom.","“Brother Muchen, you’ve given me a great surprise today!”","The qualification for the Sacred Assembly, he had actually obtained it long ago.","Under normal circumstances, the royal family wouldn’t allocate spots to them.","But today, they were given a token for the Tribulation Realm’s Sacred Assembly.","In other words, the Wu family had gained an extra spot.","How could this not make Wu Li happy?","Although there were no suitable candidates for the Tribulation Realm in the current generation of the Wu family, Wu Li could sell this token for a high price!","It was definitely worth a fortune.","What’s a mere 1.8 million universe crystals?","Muchen smiled and said, “This token was given by His Majesty, considering the face of Wushuang’s nephew. You must cherish it!”","“No problem with that!” Wu Li assured, patting his chest.","He understood Muchen’s meaning.","Muchen could give him this token, but he needed to pull in a strong ally.","Empress Fengchen would also participate in this Sacred Assembly.","She needed help.","With the marriage alliance between the Wu family and the royal family, they naturally sailed on the same boat.","This token couldn’t be given lightly; it required finding a strong ally to assist the Empress in seizing the position of the Holy Maiden.","In doing so, the price would also decrease significantly.","Still, Wu Li was quite pleased.","He had originally planned to mobilize the power of his clan to search for a token qualifying for the Tribulation Realm, but now that wasn’t necessary.","Why wouldn’t he keep some cards up his sleeve for activating the Wanliu!","This token was like a divine aid!","Elder Muchen was also delighted. This time, their royal clan had obtained many tokens, which was quite unusual.","It was also to win over Jian Wushuang to the Wu family.","“In that case, I hope Brother Wu Li will also give us a surprise when the time comes!” Elder Muchen raised an eyebrow, seemingly disappointed, and said, “This upcoming Sacred Assembly is unprecedented; we must not be careless!”","Wu Li also followed up, “Everything has its own destiny. The Ancient Wood Continent is currently silent; it’s time to liven things up a bit. In the Nine Heavens and Ten Earths, we’re already at the bottom of the countdown!”","“It’s all the same. The most powerful era in the Ancient Moon Spacetime is always in the past. The Eight Tribulation realms of that era were truly abundant. The ancestors still reminisce about the fallen era when the Celestial Maiden perished. After her fall, like spring shoots after rain, numerous Eight Tribulation realm powerhouses emerged. Unfortunately, each generation is inferior to the last!” Elder Muchen’s face carried a nostalgic expression.","Jian Wushuang listened carefully from the side.","The fallen era.","It was what happened after the Celestial Maiden created the Ancient Moon Spacetime and then fell.","After the Celestial Maiden’s fall, as a powerhouse who had completed the Nine Tribulations, the paths she scattered forged a group of powerful Eight Tribulation realm experts.","These experts established the Ancient Moon Divine Sect, among which the strongest nineteen created nineteen eight-star sects.","The legacy continued through the ages.","Among them was the once illustrious Divine Wood King.","However, its strength was at the bottom of the list.","Because resources in the Ancient Wood Continent were scarce, with only the Wanliu Willow Divine Wood being relatively rare and special, unfortunately not under the control of the Ancient Wood Sect.","Otherwise, it wouldn’t have been so poorly off, even compared to the Flame God of the Shi Kingdom.","In the current era, the Universe Masters of the Eight Tribulation realm are almost extinct.","There are probably only a few left in the entire Ancient Moon Spacetime.","Many have even left the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","For Jian Wushuang, this place was formidable.","But the Universe Masters of the Eighth Tribulation realm could see it.","The Ancient Moon Spacetime, like the strong of the Scattered Tribulation realm, has lost its vitality.","Staying here, one can only wait for death.","It’s better to venture into other temporal rivers.","The Nine Core Temporal Rivers, and the boundless Starry Sky.","That’s where they truly belong.","Tribulation Realm powerhouses shouldn’t be bound by the temporal rivers.","Of course, one must have the strength to venture out.","Someone like Jian Wushuang doesn’t need much mention, being just an Emperor.","Even for a Five Tribulation realm powerhouse, it’s very dangerous to venture into other temporal rivers.","They can only stay in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","The despair of the Scattered Tribulation realm is such that they can only go into a slumber.","Their Origin Sources are severed, their vitality lost.","For those peak powerhouses, it’s a nightmare.","Ordinary Scattered Tribulation realm strongholds can still hold on.","But the Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouses can’t endure.","Many Eighth Tribulation realm powerhouses have fallen along with the universe."]},{"number":5699,"title":"Chapter 5699 Inquiry","paragraphs":["Chapter 5699 Inquiry","Just like Qishen, Jian Wushuang also didn’t want to face the prospect of losing his Origin Source.","....","Of course, looking at it now, Qishen had another plan in mind.","However, Jian Wushuang didn’t know exactly what the other party was scheming.","If Qishen succeeded, it would probably be an unprecedented disaster.","Reviving the Scattered Tribulation!","That wasn’t something that could be accomplished simply by injecting Life power.","What was needed was the source, not just infinite Life power.","Jian Wushuang deeply understood this point.","In the future, when he had enough strength to return to Qishen Temple, he must explore Qishen’s scheme.","“Well, I won’t disturb you anymore. But Nephew Wushuang, come with me for a moment. I have some things to arrange!” Elder Muchen stood up, preparing to leave with Jian Wushuang.","Wu Li also had no objections. After sending the two out, he returned to the mansion with a sense of satisfaction, using a hidden teleportation array to leave the capital directly and return to the Wu family.","Because his trump card was hidden there!","On Jian Wushuang’s side, he followed Elder Muchen to the Wood King’s Mansion.","The two found a quaint and elegant courtyard, with maidservants serving, and outside the pavilion, there was a tranquil lake.","“Nephew Wushuang, just say whatever you need to say!” Elder Muchen waved his hand to dismiss the maidservant, then continued, “We’re practically family now. If there’s anything you want to hide from Wu Li, you can tell me anytime!”","Jian Wushuang smiled with narrowed eyes.","In the mansion of the Wu family, he communicated with Elder Muchen and asked him to take him away from the Wu mansion.","At such a critical moment, leaving alone might arouse suspicion from Wu Li, so he asked Elder Muchen to take him out and also tried to get closer to him.","He wanted to inquire about the two Emperors related to the power of Death.","“This time, thanks to Elder Muchen, I have something in mind, I want to discuss it with that uncle of mine...” Jian Wushuang’s careful weaving of words captivated Elder Muchen.","At the end of Jian Wushuang’s recounting, Elder Muchen reacted immediately.","“What?” he exclaimed.","“You encountered that kind of power in the Outer Domain?” Elder Muchen couldn’t believe it.","Since both of those Emperors were brought by him, Jian Wushuang decided to reveal the matter after withholding it, and explained the situation to Elder Muchen.","Elder Muchen also understood what that kind of power represented, hence his astonishment.","“So, Elder Muchen also knows!” Jian Wushuang’s heart stirred, realizing there were things he didn’t know.","Now, it remained to be seen if he could explode with more information this time.","Elder Muchen settled back down, reclining in his chair, recalling the words of Emperor Fengchen, and without any concealment, he recounted everything.","He had thought Jian Wushuang already knew, so he spoke openly.","Jian Wushuang, however, exclaimed in amazement, “Indeed, my speculation was correct. There must be someone manipulating behind these two!”","From Elder Muchen, Jian Wushuang learned about the secret of the power of Death in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","This secret was known to very few people, not even some in the Tribulation Realm knew about it.","Only the leaders of some major forces were aware of it.","Emperor Fengchen also learned about it from the ancestor of the royal family of Yue Kingdom.","The power of Death in the Ancient Moon Spacetime was not called the power of Death.","It was called the power of Annihilation.","When the Celestial Maiden fell, there was an instance of the power of Annihilation.","That time marked the peak of the Tribulation Realm in the Ancient Moon Spacetime, and it was the closest they came to death.","The power of Annihilation appeared.","The Nine Heavens and Ten Lands fell into a dire situation.","Among the Ten Lands, three continents became ruins.","Only eight major sects remained, along with some hidden realms, while the rest were all destroyed, leaving only rubble behind.","In the Nine Heavens, cracks began to appear everywhere.","Both in scope and heritage, they suffered significant impacts.","Many people didn’t know why these ruins appeared, thinking it was always like that.","In reality, it was the emergence of the power of Annihilation.","Subsequent occurrences had happened before, but none were as terrifying, with much less destruction.","It wasn’t until now that the power of power of Annihilation completely disappeared, although occasionally, people would discover remnants of Death power in the ruins of some fallen spacetimes, but it was only remnants.","Some people sought to grasp this power, only to find that once tainted, it would devour the vitality within them, requiring countless Life power to expel.","Afterward, no one dared to touch this power again.","Especially for those who had survived tribulations, their vitality was already limited, making it incredibly difficult to recover. Once exposed to the Death power, there was a risk of falling into a deep slumber or even extinction.","Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly; if Mie Sheng were to arrive here, he would probably laugh himself awake from dreaming.","He controlled the existence of Death power, even though his strength was only at the Half-Step Seven Tribulation realm, he could still threaten those stronger than him at the Eighth Tribulation realm.","Apart from the Universe Masters, everyone feared the power of Death.","Even the Universe Masters didn’t want to be tainted by this power.","This also made Jian Wushuang curious. If it was indeed Mie Sheng’s doing, then Mie Sheng had existed for too long.","From the era of the Ancient Moon Spacetime’s downfall, to the later Moro Spacetime, and even the spacetime of the Original Universe.","The span was too vast.","Adding to that, there was Dong Jun.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t even begin to calculate.","If it were true, then Mie Sheng must have been incredibly powerful.","Having evolved to the present, still only at the Six Tribulation realm.","Moreover, there was hope for improvement, perhaps not much different from the Universe Master.","Because he inherently represented Death. As long as he devoured Jian Wushuang, the fusion of Death and Life, it might reach a new level, surpassing the existence of the Nine Tribulation realm.","Thinking of this, Jian Wushuang shook his head vigorously.","Absolutely impossible.","If it were true, then it would be the end for the spacetime of the Original Universe.","By then, everyone would perish!","The power of Mie Sheng was a disaster in the Starry Sky!","He must figure out where these two Emperors obtained the power of Death, otherwise, he would not feel comfortable staying in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","He couldn’t afford to let Mie Sheng find him again, or there would be nowhere to hide.","After all, he came to the Ancient Moon Spacetime to escape from Mie Sheng.","“Elder Muchen, how does His Majesty intend to deal with these two?” Jian Wushuang probed.","Elder Muchen sighed, “They are talents I found from the Yongheng Kingdom, all geniuses within the Yongheng Kingdom. It’s impossible to deal with them. The overall strength of the Yongheng Kingdom is much stronger than Yue Kingdom. The Sacred Assembly is about to arrive, His Majesty won’t offend them at this time!”","“The Yongheng Kingdom!” Jian Wushuang nodded.","It was a kingdom comparable to the Shi Kingdom, and the strong of the Yongheng Clan were notorious lunatics.","Although the two Emperors were not of the Yongheng Clan, they were core disciples of the Yongheng Kingdom, also geniuses.","They couldn’t be detained for too long, or it would arouse their suspicion. They would probably be released in a few days.","Empress Fengchen went to contend for the position of Holy Maiden, and cooperation with the Yongheng Kingdom would be inevitable.","Offending them at this time might cause trouble for her.","Although there was no suitable candidate for Holy Maiden in the Yongheng Kingdom, they could still influence the situation."]},{"number":5700,"title":"Chapter 5700 Tracking","paragraphs":["Chapter 5700 Tracking","“If the other party fully supports the Empress, they will also lean towards her.”","....","The Yue Kingdom still had its limits.","“Well then, let’s discuss this later!” Jian Wushuang said on the surface, but deep down, he didn’t give up. Instead, he instructed Elder Muchen to make sure to inform him before the other party left the Yue Kingdom.","Thinking that Jian Wushuang was going to inquire about matters in the Outer Domain with those two, Elder Muchen didn’t think much about it and just saw Jian Wushuang off.","When Jian Wushuang returned to the Wu family mansion, he didn’t sense Wu Li’s presence, which surprised him.","Alone in the room for a while, a familiar presence appeared again, and soon he found him.","“Wushuang, you’re back so soon. That Muchen guy, really, why couldn’t things be discussed at the Wu family mansion!” Wu Li entered the room with a somewhat gloomy expression, then continued, “He still doesn’t consider me one of his own!”","Jian Wushuang smiled helplessly. “Brother Wu Li, you’ve made quite a profit this time. Don’t take advantage and act coy, or you might get on Muchen’s bad side if he finds out!”","“Haha, it’s just you and me here. How could he find out!” Wu Li looked meaningfully at Jian Wushuang, as if saying they were in the same boat.","But understanding Jian Wushuang’s point, he got straight to the point, “Indeed, we made a small profit this time. That token alone can be sold for this amount. However, the people we brought also require unconditional help from the Yue Kingdom, so the price is much lower. Otherwise, it could have been sold for a higher price!”","“300 million!” Jian Wushuang was astonished.","Even that was selling cheap. If they had bought it outright, it might have skyrocketed to a billion.","...","Jian Wushuang ultimately obtained 200 million universe crystals out of the 300 million.","He hadn’t expected Wu Li to be so generous.","He had thought they would split it evenly, but Wu Li had directly given him 200 million.","These 200 million universe crystals were the greatest gain he had made since arriving in the Ancient Moon Spacetime.","A whopping 200 million universe crystals!","If he were in the Qishen Temple, he wouldn’t even know how long it would take to acquire them.","However, the treasures he obtained in the Qishen Temple were beyond what universe crystals could measure.","Like the Beast God Weapon and Dong Jun’s skeletal remains.","These two treasures were beyond what universe crystals could quantify.","In the Ancient Moon Spacetime, they were also top-tier treasures.","The Beast God Weapon was a treasure of the Seven Tribulation realm, crafted by Qishen himself.","The nine Beast God Weapons represented the pinnacle of the entire Moro Spacetime.","Jian Wushuang only obtained one of them, the Candle Dragon.","The whereabouts of the other eight are still unknown.","Dong Jun’s skeletal remains.","At the very least, they were remains of the Seven Tribulation realm, possibly even stronger.","In the Ancient Moon Spacetime, Seven Tribulation realm entities were not uncommon; there had been several in the history of the Yue Kingdom alone.","However, in the present era, there wasn’t a single Universe Master of the Seven Tribulation realm in the Yue Kingdom.","Not even one universe master of the Six Tribulation realm.","The strongest Universe Master of the current era was the Empress of the Yue Kingdom.","As for the Scattered Tribulation, it’s not worth mentioning; too much vitality has been lost, making it impossible to compare with Dong Jun’s skeletal remains.","If Dong Jun’s skeletal remains were revealed, the commotion it would cause would likely be more terrifying than that caused by Seven Tribulation Treasures.","After all, there were many treasures of the Seven Tribulation.","But there weren’t many skeletal remains of Universe Masters of the Seven Tribulation realm.","Most people only got a piece of bone and cherished it as a treasure.","In addition to these two treasures, Jian Wushuang possessed an even more powerful supreme treasure.","The Skysight Heavenly Chessboard!","The Temporal Treasure left to him by Teacher Xuan Yi.","Back then, there weren’t many Temporal Treasures in Moro Spacetime.","Qishen Temple should have one, and Mie Sheng as well, he had one too.","When the Higher Heavens were broken, Qishen obtained a Temporal Treasure, and as for Mie Sheng, he probably obtained it even earlier.","Lastly, there was the Skysight Heavenly Chessboard left by the First True King, a Temporal Treasure arranged by Teacher Xuan Yi.","After Jian Wushuang obtained it, he had yet to truly activate it.","The chess manual left by the First True King was of little use, he could only copy the Origin Source from it.","Until now, Jian Wushuang hadn’t figured out its purpose.","Some of the highest-level Origin Sources were of no use to him, and he had consumed a lot during the confrontation with Mie Sheng, swallowing up what was left.","Now, he was copying some Cosmic Origin Sources at the level of the Three Tribulation realm.","It was called copying, but in fact, he was slowly devouring them.","These Origin Sources currently served two purposes.","One was direct consumption, and the other was to inject vitality and manipulate chess pieces.","After becoming an Emperor, he could manipulate the highest-level chess pieces and devour the Origin Sources of cosmic tribulations.","Only when he reached the Tribulation Realm could he manipulate even stronger chess pieces.","Such as those with character titles.","Each one was the Origin Source of a powerful being above the Three Tribulation realm.","If he could inject vitality to restore their strength, it would be a great help to him.","As for the chess pieces with general titles, he couldn’t even copy them.","Let alone manipulate them.","Those chess pieces were probably Origin Sources of cosmic tribulations of Seven Tribulation or above.","Lastly, there were the chess pieces with divine titles.","Those were the most powerful Origin Sources, with even more concentrated Spacetime power above.","Unfortunately, the current Jian Wushuang could only watch helplessly.","He still needed to quickly enhance his Origin Source.","To light up an entire universe as soon as possible.","As he entered the Tribulation Realm, he aimed to swiftly ascend to the peak of the Three Tribulation realm.","He directly created a universe.","This was much more powerful compared to the Universe Masters who refined universes.","Because of this, his Dao Arena was in turmoil.","The universe crystals sent by Wu Li could accelerate his cultivation speed.","Moreover, he didn’t hesitate to accept the treasures sent by Elder Muchen and asked Wu Li to exchange them for Origin Source treasures.","Although Wu Li was somewhat surprised, he didn’t dwell on it.","He knew Jian Wushuang’s divine power was extraordinary, probably already at the peak of an Emperor, now wanting to cultivate the Origin Source.","Preparing the groundwork for future entry into the Tribulation Realm.","Taking advantage of this opportunity, Jian Wushuang proposed going out for a stroll. With some universe crystals on hand, he intended to visit other kingdoms to purchase some treasures suitable for himself, preparing for future participation in the Sacred Assembly.","“Do you need me to accompany you?” Wu Li politely asked.","Jian Wushuang shook his head, replying, “No need, just buying some treasures!”","After all, there were still three years before he married into the royal family.","It was normal for him to go out and purchase a batch of cultivation treasures.","Wu Li was just being polite; he had important matters to attend to as well.","So, he didn’t ask further.","Then the two returned to their respective cultivations.","Jian Wushuang didn’t dare to waste a moment; he had made little progress in the past 10,000 years.","He thought the matter of the Sacred Assembly would take a long time, but he didn’t expect it to come so quickly.","Now he could only rely on the speed of time flow to cultivate.","Several days outside equated to several years for Jian Wushuang.","A few days later, Jian Wushuang received a message from Elder Muchen.","The two Emperors had already left the imperial palace.","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes and quietly left the Wu family residence.","As soon as he left, Wu Li sensed it.","Realizing he left quietly, Wu Li thought carefully; he must have gone to buy treasures, which was normal."]}]);
